(8728,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A deal is a deal. I sure hope you know what you are getting yourself into, $N. This is an awful lot of trouble to go through to do some fishing.',0),
(8729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $N. I will be able to reform the Scepter of the Shifting Sands soon.',0),
(8730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vaelastrasz\'s soul is at ease, champion. The Aspects all watch your progress with great interest. Know that you have powerful allies.$B$BI was commanded to grant you something to aid you in this struggle. Use it well...',0),
(8731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can tell that Krug has little use for paperwork. He signed this in silithid blood!$B$BVery well, $N. I\'ve prepared a set of tasks that should make good use of your skills as a $c.$B$BWith the continued efforts of you and people like you, our enemy will soon be crushed!',0),
(8732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I suppose that little skirmish will pass as field duty nowadays. Take these back to Cenarion Hold, I\'m sure they\'ll have a cushy job ready for you.$B$BOff you go!',0),
(8733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The wisp is silent except for a low humming sound. Oddly enough, it is able to communicate with you through thoughts.',0),
(8734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would be impossible to pull Eranikus from the Dream should he refuse. His intentions, however, require him to enter our world. He seeks to destroy the living manifestation of Malfurion. To do this successfully would mean an end to one of the most powerful allies of the Dream. The Nightmare would wholly consume all that would remain should Malfurion fall...',0),
(8735,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you prepared? Is the world prepared for what we are about to invoke? I do not know... I am bound by duty to Malfurion. Duty and honor...',0),
(8736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He is redeemed, $n. He now returns to the Dream to right what he alone has done wrong. Eranikus will be a powerful ally to Malfurion and my father.$b$bThese armaments are for you, $n; given to me by Ysera herself. You would do well to make use of them in your battles against the Qiraji.',0),
(8737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, $N. Here\'s your next assignment.',0),
(8738,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I\'ll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.',0),
(8739,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are greatly appreciated, $N. I\'ll read these scouting reports right away, feel free to go over your next assignment.',0),
(8740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $N. The twilight marauders were inflicting an unacceptable number of casualties on our patrols. Here\'s your next assignment.',0),
(8741,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your deeds will be known to all, champion. They will sing your praises from Orgrimmar to the far reaches of the South Seas. All will know of the champion of the Bronze Flight, $n.',0),
(8742,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A thousand years has passed and just as it was fated, one stands before me. One who shall lead their people to a new age.$B$BThe Old God trembles, $N. Oh yes, it fears your faith. Shatter the prophecy of C\'Thun.$B$BIt knows you come, champion - and with you comes the might of Kalimdor. You have only to let me know when you are prepared and I shall grant you the Scepter of the Shifting Sands.',0),
(8743,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'From the ground near the gong springs a special crystal. Perhaps favor from the Brood.',0),
(8744,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The tag on this present reads:$b$bTo $n,$b$bMay your feast of Great-Winter be merry and bright!',19342),
(8745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, champion. I am Jonathan, keeper of the sacred gong and eternal watcher of the Bronze Flight.$B$BI have been empowered by the Timeless One himself to grant you an item of your choosing from his timeless treasure trove. May it aid you in your battles against C\'Thun.',0),
(8746,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it!  Huzzah!$B$BMetzen flew back into Great-father Winter\'s stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago!  The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would.  You\'ve saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster.  Thank you, $N.$B$BListen... because of what you\'ve done here, I want you to have this.  It\'s something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you\'ll get a kick out of it.  Happy Winter Veil!',0),
(8747,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$b$bThe signet ring of the defender will offer superior protection against the forces of evil.$b$bBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.',12340),
(8748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the protector!',0),
(8749,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the protector!',0),
(8750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the protector!',0),
(8751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rise, Protector of Kalimdor! Rise and be recognized!',0),
(8752,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$b$bThe signet ring of the conqueror will greatly enhance your physical attacks.$b$bBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.',12340),
(8753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the conqueror!',0),
(8754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the conqueror!',0),
(8755,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the conqueror!',0),
(8756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rise, Qiraji Conqueror! Rise and be recognized!',0),
(8757,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive, little one. You have gone through much trouble to gain the favor of the Bronze Flight. Your dedication is noted.$b$bThe signet ring of the invoker will greatly enhance your magical and natural abilities.$b$bBe warned, once you have chosen your path, you will have no recourse should you change your mind.',12340),
(8758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!',0),
(8759,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!',0),
(8760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your rise amongst the rank of the Brood is most impressive, $n. May you never stray from the path of the invoker!',0),
(8761,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rise, Grand Invoker! Rise and be recognized!',0),
(8762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it!  Huzzah!$B$BMetzen flew back into Greatfather Winter\'s stables - yes Metzen can really fly - just a little while ago!  The dust worked like a charm; I knew it would.  You\'ve saved the Feast of Winter Veil as well as Smokywood Pastures from disaster.  Thank you, $N.$B$BListen... because of what you\'ve done here, I want you to have this.  It\'s something VERY special; if you have a mount, I think you\'ll get a kick out of it.  Happy Winter Veil!',0),
(8763,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working. It is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it. A door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!',0),
(8764,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Be well, $n. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you.',0),
(8765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Be well, $n. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you.',0),
(8766,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Be well, $n. If you change your mind, I shall be here to assist you.',0),
(8767,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:$b$bTo a very special $r $c.',19342),
(8768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This festively-wrapped present has your name on it.$b$bWait, did it just move?',19342),
(8769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Have a joyous Feast of Great-Winter from your friends at Smokywood Pastures.',19342),
(8770,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your diligence is as noteworthy as always.',0),
(8771,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Ashi has been noted.',0),
(8772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Zora has been noted.',0),
(8773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve heard good things about your part in the Hive\'Zora attack. Keep up the good work and victory will soon be ours.',0),
(8774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.',0),
(8775,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.',0),
(8776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.',0),
(8777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $N. Your part in the attack on Hive\'Regal has been noted.',0),
(8778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes!  These will come in handy! Much obliged, $N!',0),
(8779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why, yes... these will be of tremendous aid!  These materials are awfully hard to come by in the desert, $n.  Thank you.',0),
(8780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, I\'ll hand these out to the lads.',0),
(8781,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, excellent!  I won\'t have to hear complaints about dull blades anymore.  Thank you, $n.',0),
(8782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, we were in need of these.  Your work is appreciated, $n.',0),
(8783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes.  These materials are of excellent quality.  Thank you, $n.',0),
(8784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An exceptional find, $N. Simply marvelous! This will definitely give us some insight into our enemy\'s twisted minds.',0),
(8785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes. Just what I needed! I\'ll make a special concoction with this. The silithid won\'t like it one bit!',0),
(8786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. We were in short supply of these, $N.',0),
(8787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes... I will distribute these to the troops, $N. The Orgrimmar Legion thanks you!',0),
(8788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:$b$bTo a very special $r $c.',0),
(8789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Infused with Elementium, these weapons will cut through the Qiraji and their God with incredible ease.',0),
(8790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Use the item well, $N. Let them feel the pain that they so dearly wish to inflict upon others.',0),
(8791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I offer you my highest commendation and your choice of an item of power, $N. You have done the people of Kalimdor a great service.',0),
(8792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throm\'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $n, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$b$bSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.',0),
(8793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throm\'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $n, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$b$bSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.',0),
(8794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throm\'ka, $c! Good to see so many of the Horde, such as yourself, $n, coming out to lend your support in laying the groundwork for the upcoming Ahn\'Qiraj War. The effort here will ensure that we are victorious against the Silithid and their evil masters hidden away inside Ahn\'Qiraj.$b$bSo now that you are here, be sure to speak with the various collectors and offer your assistance in gathering those materials that you are suited to.',0),
(8795,1,1,1,0,0,1000,1000,0,NULL,0),
(8798,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Say! You know what?! You\'re an engineer too! So, since you helped me teach my friends a lesson, I\'m going to teach you how to make your very own mechanical yeti! Now the fun can go on forever and ever, and you can scare whoever you want! Provided that you can scare up the components to make it that is. $B$BWhat do you say, $N? Do you want to learn the secret to making a mechanical yeti?',0),
(8799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The machine lets off a little rumble and a small amount of steam as it starts working. It is not too long thereafter until it stops, heralded by another small jet of steam erupting from it. A door hatch opens, revealing a batch of preserved holly!',0),
(8800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kaldon sent you? Very well, let\'s see what we can do for you.',0),
(8801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will leave this place on our own, Lady $N - once we are certain that the evil within has been wholly destroyed. Your journey of legend is almost at an end.',0),
(8802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Master has left these for you, champion. From the timeless cache: A collection of artifacts spanning thousands of years - the choice is yours.',0),
(8803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The note on this present reads:$b$bTo $n,$b$bIn hoping this will help you spread warm tidings and holiday cheer to all of Azeroth.$b$bFrom Greatfather Winter',19342),
(8808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, we were in need of these.  Your work is appreciated, $n.',0),
(8809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes.  These materials are of excellent quality.  Thank you, $n.',0),
(8810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just in time.  These supplies will save lives, $n.  Your work is appreciated.  Here\'s your next assignment.',0),
