(9015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve recovered part of the medallion, $N?',0),
(9016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This curse was bestowed upon us but for a mere medallion. Lord Valthalak certainly knows how to hold a grudge.$B$BWe\'ll endeavor to find the remaining pieces - hopefully before I meet an untimely demise. But before that, let us see about your reward.',0),
