(9050,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Exellent $N !$B , you got everything just as i asked and now i can make a Redemption Wristguards.',0),
(9051,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $N.  You are brave and wise.$B$BTell me, how did the devilsaur react to the toxin?',0),
(9052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ingredients at last!$B$BWith the Un\'Goro soil I have collected, the toxin is easily concocted...',0),
(9053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At last, the toxin can be created in full. I dare not require you to inflict it upon the creature again, as I have asked too much already.$B$BYou have my thanks and respect. May you be well in your travels, $N.',0),
