(9075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The wristguards are ready, $N.$B$B<Rimblat bows.>',0),
(9076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You defeated him after all!  Undoubtedly my men softened him up for you.$B$BI jest, $c.  You\'ve done well.  You\'ll make a name for yourself if you keep your nose clean. ',0),
