(24828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to prove yourself, $N.  Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge.',0),
(24829,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true champion of our cause, $n. None can claim to be more dedicated to the struggle than you.$B$BThe enemy speaks of your name only in whispers, for they know you\'re a force to be reckoned with.$B$BAccept this humble gift as a reward for your many triumphs.',0),
