(24831,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true champion of our cause, $n. None can claim to be more dedicated to the struggle than you.$B$BYou are a bastion of wisdom and our allies speak of you with the greatest reverence. Many of them owe you their own lives.$B$BAccept this humble gift as a reward for your many triumphs.',0),
(24832,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to prove yourself, $n. Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge.',0),
(24833,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true champion of our cause, $n. None can claim to be more dedicated to the struggle than you.$B$BIt is rumored that the minions of the Scourge fear you more than they do the Lich King himself. You are vengeance incarnate.$B$BAccept this humble gift as a reward for your many triumphs.',0),
(24834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to prove yourself, $n. Accept this, not as a gift, but as a tool for the fight against the Scourge.',0),
(24835,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a true champion of our cause, $n. None can claim to be more dedicated to the struggle than you.$B$BYou are a source of inspiration to our allies and your unshakeable valor gives pause to even the most seasoned of our enemy\'s generals.$B$BAccept this humble gift as a reward for your many triumphs.',0),
