(29015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at the size of that thing! We\'re going to be rich! Let\'s see, according to the rates I\'ve seen on gems going into Undermine, I should be able to figure out your cut - fifty percent, don\'t worry!$B$BNow let\'s see... I think this should do about right. Pleasure doing business with you, $n.',0),
