(31374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You arrived just in time!',0),
(31375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, have you come to join the Order?',0),
(31376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $C.',0),
(31377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time, $C.',0),
(31378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C.',0),
(31379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $C.',0),
(31380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, ты хочешь испытать свои силы? Отлично, |3-6($R).',19342),
(31381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you wish to test your skills? Very good, $R.',0),
(31382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C! We need your help.',0),
(31383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C! We need your help.',0),
(31384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R. You look capable. Glad to know we have a decent $C on our side.',0),
(31385,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R. You look capable. Glad to know we have a decent $C on our side.',0),
(31386,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R.',0),
(31387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes. $n. Your name has traveled to us from the east.$B$BWe have seen your efforts in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Already you have earned the esteem of the Golden Lotus.$B$BYes, we are interested to learn more about you.',0),
(31388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R.',0),
(31389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes. $n. Your name has traveled to us from the east.$B$BWe have seen your efforts in the Vale of Eternal Blossoms. Already you have earned the esteem of the Golden Lotus.$B$BYes, we are interested to learn more about you.',0),
(31390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Dread Wastes is a very dangerous place.',0),
(31391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Dread Wastes is a very dangerous place.',0),
(31392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$c, it\'s good to have you here! The Pandarens speak of a legendary place, the Eternal Blossom. According to the locals, it has great healing power.\r\n\r\nBut the Chief of the Horde has done something terrible to the bone.\r\n\r\nWe need to get there now!',0),
(31393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую, $c! Мы добились аудиенции у Белого Тигра. Недавно наш вождь вторгся в Вечноцветущий дол, и мы просим, чтобы для оказания помощи в восстановлении туда впустили и Альянс и Орду.\r\n\r\nЭто священное место. Скорее всего, именно оно привиделось моей жене Лезе, и поэтому мой народ оказался в Пандарии. Мы обязаны спасти Вечноцветущий дол!\r\n\r\nКак думаешь, нас пропустят?',0),
(31394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодец, $n!\r\n\r\nБелый Тигр разрешил нам сопроводить пандаренов в Вечноцветущий дол. Там уже появился аванпост Альянса. Можно начинать работу над восстановлением!',0),
(31395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Молодец, $n!\r\n\r\nБелый Тигр разрешил нам сопроводить пандаренов в Вечноцветущий дол.\r\n\r\nТам, где потерпел неудачу принц Альянса, удача улыбнулась посланнику Орды.\r\n\r\nТам уже появился аванпост Орды. Можно начинать работу над восстановлением.',0),
(31398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were wise to bring this to us. This is a piece of another paragon\'s encasing amber.$B$BThe damage suggests the paragon may be in trouble.$B$BI will speak with the council to decide what should be done next.',0),
(31439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems my work will begin immediately. You have come to a dangerous place, Wakener.',0),
(31440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BWith the destruction of the tomes I\'ll go to my final rest knowing that those books will never again haunt a living soul.',0),
(31441,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You will see more of this. War is never pretty.$B$BThe empresses\' corruption is far reaching and hard to detect.$B$BThere is much work to be done. We need to start repairing the damage Kor\'ik did.',0),
(31442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$B$BWith the destruction of the tomes I\'ll go to my final rest knowing that those books will never again haunt a living soul.',0),
(31443,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that a flying tiger gourami?$b$bThis little fish is a rare mutation of the tiger gourami that can fly, and are consequently caught in any freshwater here in Pandaria.$b$bLocal legend states that good luck comes to the person who eats it, and local tradition states that only royalty can eat them.  To be caught breaking this \"tradition\" is a death sentence.$b$bWith that in mind, I\'ll make sure it gets to the right person.',18414),
(31444,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s not what I think it is, is it?  Oh wow, a spinefish alpha, one of Pandaria\'s deadliest predators.$b$bSpinefish are malformed abominations created by the sha presence, and these big ones are simply terrifying.  An alpha will often eat other spinefish, even though there isn\'t a single part of them that\'s edible.$b$bLuckily for both of us, they are very interesting to alchemists.\n\n',18414),
(31446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that a mimic octopus?  A buddy of mine caught one of these off the coast of Zandalar a few years back.  He barely made it back alive, actually.  Pesky trolls, but great fishing!$b$bAnyhow, they aren\'t as rare as you might think because they use camouflage to hide amongst rocks and plants; only a very skilled fisherman has any hope of catching this elusive, and delicious, morsel.\n\n',18414),
(31447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold my true form.$B$BI owe you a debt, one which I can never repay. But, I thank you for lifting the curse off of my family.$B$BKel\'Thuzad, the Lich King, and now Darkmaster Gandling -- all are dead.$B$BPerhaps now I too can find some semblance of peace.',0),
(31448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold my true form.$B$BI owe you a debt, one which I can never repay. But, I thank you for lifting the curse off of my family.$B$BKel\'Thuzad, the Lich King, and now Darkmaster Gandling -- all are dead.$B$BPerhaps now I too can find some semblance of peace.',0),
(31450,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And so it is done... here we are, in our new home.',19831),
(31451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My son! They took my son... Can you help me?',0),
(31452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My son! They took my son... Can you help me?',0),
(31453,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you? Can you fight? If so, we can use your help.',0),
(31454,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course, I must ask your discretion regarding what we just talked about.$B$BWe wouldn\'t want to alarm anyone who is, shall we say, less capable than yourself.',0),
(31455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you? Can you fight? If so, we can use your help.',0),
(31456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha? Who the heck are you? What are you doin\' here?$B$BOh, you wanna help?',0),
(31457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wha? Who the heck are you? What are you doin\' here?\n\nOh, you wanna help?',19116),
(31458,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work! This should allow us the time to repair the damage Kor\'ik caused.$B$BYou may have just shifted the tide of war in our favor.',0),
(31459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.',19116),
(31460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, hello. Nice to see you again.',0),
(31465,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This venom is in its advanced stages, but doesn\'t seem to be losing it\'s potency...$B$BThis is very curious. The Klaxxi will want to know immediately. Thank you, Wakener.',0),
(31467,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Strength and good health! This is the Way of the Grill.',0),
(31468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous. That did not take long at all.$B$BWord of your many achievements has been the talk of the Vale!$B$BVery well, I will take you under my wing.',0),
(31470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done.',0),
(31471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work.',0),
(31472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good stuff. Now, let\'s get to your lesson.',0),
(31473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My friend - you do not disappoint!$B$BWe will put these to good use. ',0),
(31474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Intellect is a gift you must hone with time.',0),
(31475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine ingredients.',0),
(31476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Spirits are lifted by good food.',0),
(31477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stamina and endurance are needed for mastering anything. To slave over a hot oven takes patience, but the results are very much worth the effort.',0),
(31478,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We can work with these.',0),
(31479,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a fine example of good ginseng. Would you like to learn how to make tea with it?',0),
(31480,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. This is delicious.',0),
(31481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done it!$B$BSome put their faith in magic or steel. But in my experience, fear is the most powerful weapon one can wield. Use it properly, and your enemies cannot bring themselves to fight you. ',0),
(31482,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have earned this, $n! Use it well.$B$BPlease understand, I mean to pay off my father\'s debts. I will stop at NOTHING to defend this world. In the future, if you are ever uncertain, you are welcome to question my means. But never question my motives. The safety of this world is my primary concern.$B$BNow then, let\'s talk about current events.',0),
(31483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re here!$B$B<Wrathion claps his hands and rubs them together, excitedly.>$B$BOh $n. Things are about to get exciting.',0),
(31486,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My, that\'s so thoughtful. I love hearing from my old students.',19342),
(31487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let this be a reminder - the kunchong should be feared and respected.',0),
(31488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My people have done their job and brought you to me. Wonderful. ',0),
(31489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My people have done their job and brought you to me. Wonderful. ',0),
(31490,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличное начало, $n!$b$bСкоро от Алого ордена останется лишь безобразная строчка в анналах истории.',19342),
(31492,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! You made it. Usually I get stopped by one of those gusts of wind.',0),
(31493,273,274,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'О да!$B$B<Рыцарь в капюшоне радостно потирает руки при виде кодекса.>$B$BТеперь у меня есть перечень всех имен крестоносцев Алого ордена!$B$BА то, знаешь... мало ли, вдруг с кем-то из них еще не рассчитались. Не люблю быть должной.',19342),
(31494,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I could see them rising up from the clutches. Beautiful!',0),
(31495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great start, $n!$B$BIt won\'t be long now before the Scarlet Crusade is nothing more than an ugly footnote in the annals of history.',0),
(31496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes, hand it over! Quickly now! My forelegs are trembling with anticipation.',0),
(31497,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes!$B$B<The Hooded Crusader rubs her hands together gleefully at the sight of the codex.>$B$BAnd now, I have a checklist with the name of every Scarlet Crusader on it!$B$BYou know... just in case any of them are unaccounted for. I don\'t like loose ends.',0),
(31502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, these are in fine shape.',0),
(31503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My enhancements are tools for experienced warriors. Not toys for these fool children!',0),
(31504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You weren\'t exposed to the pheromones were you? That could lead to... well, perhaps I shouldn\'t worry you with the details.',0),
(31505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One by one, her champions fall.',0),
(31506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ingenious devices, really. I have a feeling they will prove useful.',0),
(31507,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The kyparite ignited, did it? Fascinating!$B$BNot exactly what I was hoping for, but it\'s something.',0),
(31508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well look at that, you actually got it done. I half expected to be scooping your remains out of the muck with a jar.',0),
(31509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This species is interesting, but the risks associated with keeping it around for study are too high.',0),
(31510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It must drive her further into paranoia and madness, losing contact with Zan\'vess.$B$BGood. Let her suffer.',0),
(31511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming so quickly.$B$BFor thousands of years, the Golden Lotus has kept the Vale safe from those who would seek its power.$B$BUnfortunately, that time is past, and we need your help.',0),
(31512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming so quickly.$B$BFor thousands of years, the Golden Lotus has kept the Vale safe from those who would seek its power.$B$BUnfortunately, that time is past, and we need your help.',0),
(31513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The second sword of the anointed soars in the air just before the wet statue. Steam rises from the sword.$B$B< You somehow feel that the Will of Providence is waiting for you. >',19342),
(31514,396,396,2,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда Вайтмейн больше нет, Алому ордену настанет конец. Теперь осталось убрать мусор.$B$BСпасибо тебе, $n. Не только от меня, но от всех, кто противостоял их злобе и ненависти.$B$BИ позволь поблагодарить за новые мечи. Они послужат мне верой и правдой в Некроситете, когда я буду сражаться с темным магистром Гандлингом.$B$BДо скорой встречи.',19342),
(31515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The second anointed blade floats just in front of the wet statue. Steam rises from the sword.>$B$B<You get the uncanny feeling that the Hand of Providence has been waiting for you.>',0),
(31516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Whitemane gone for good, the Scarlet Crusade is finished. It\'s just a matter of sweeping up the refuse.$B$BThank you, $n. Not just for myself, but for everyone opposed to mindless hatred and bigotry.$B$BAnd, thank you for these two new blades. Anointed anew in her blood, they should serve me well as I take the fight to Scholomance and deal with Darkmaster Gandling.$B$BI bid you adieu for now.',0),
(31517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I commend your victory and thank you for dealing with that ruffian.',0),
(31519,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my sincerest thanks, $n. Without fine Stormstout brews to lighten the drudgery of the day, the world would be a dull place indeed.',0),
(31520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my gratitude, $n. You\'ve displayed great valor today, and the speed at which you completed the challenge surely will impress your friends and intimidate your foes.',0),
(31521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have been a great student. Now you should share your knowledge with others. I hope you will speak with the Stock Master and take on an apprentice as soon as you can.',0),
(31522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many blessings upon you, $n. Driving hatred from this world so quickly deserves rich reward.',0),
(31523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, $n. Your martial prowess is second to none, and your alacrity is sure to strike fear in the hearts of your enemies.',0),
(31524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a blow well struck, $n. I\'ve never seen a $C fell a giant with such speed.',0),
(31525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, that was amazing. Ner\'onok is a master tactician, and you schooled him handily.',0),
(31526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re a stalwart $C. Your friends and guild mates will surely notice the speed and ferocity with which you conquered the Scarlet Monastery.',0),
(31527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Just the thought of him burning up that beautiful library makes me shudder. Your friends will appreciate the speed with which you dispatched him.',0),
(31528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. May the skeletons of the dead remain peaceful now that Gandling no longer seeks to disturb their slumber.',0),
(31529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The targets are eliminated? Well done, $C.',0),
(31531,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you would carry out the mission without any problems. Well done, $n.',0),
(31532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n! I feel at ease knowing the Valley safer now, because of you.',0),
(31534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got them! This is wonderful, $n!$B$BI\'ll get started on the brew as soon as I can.',0),
(31535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your help is very much appreciated. This will make a great difference for some of our students.',0),
(31536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. Now these ingredients will stay fresh until we\'re ready to cook.',0),
(31537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Правда? Они прямо так и сказали? Ну надо же!',26124),
(31538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You aren\'t pulling my leg are ya, $n? If he really said that, well... I guess... I guess it means I can do it, after all!$B$BThank you, $n. You\'ve really helped me gain confidence in myself.',0),
(31539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... This is beyond my wildest expectations. This will be treasured and preserved for generations to come.',0),
(31540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine craftsmanship. The monks will appreciate these.',0),
(31541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful. This will be cherished.',0),
(31542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where did you... How did you... This is perfect!',0),
(31543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine painting.',0),
(31544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine work to honor a fine man.',0),
(31548,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n! You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),
(31549,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now those look like some healthy pets, $n. Remember, you can heal and revive your entire collection of pets at any time by visiting a stable master.',0),
(31550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что ж, прекрасный выбор. Рано или поздно ты соберешь отличную коллекцию!$b$bПомни, любого питомца, с которым можно драться, можно и поймать, так что не упускай такую возможность, если она вдруг появится.',19342),
(31551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... an excellent choice. You\'re on your way to building up a great team!$B$BRemember, any pet you can fight, you can catch, so go ahead and try to get as many as you can during your adventures.',0),
