(31588,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n! Ты управляешься с питомцами даже лучше, чем я думал!',24015),
(31589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now I see, $n, that your pets are perfectly healthy. Remember that you can cure or revive all your pets anytime by contacting the stable keeper.',24015),
(31590,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что ж, прекрасный выбор. Рано или поздно ты соберешь отличную коллекцию!$b$bПомни, любого питомца, с которым можно драться, можно и поймать, так что не упускай такую возможность, если она вдруг появится.',23937),
(31591,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n! You\'re better with those pets than I thought!',0),
(31592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now those look like some healthy pets, $n. Remember, you can heal and revive your entire collection of pets at any time by visiting a stable master.',0),
(31593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... an excellent choice. You\'re on your way to building up a great team!$B$BRemember, any pet you can fight, you can catch, so go ahead and try to get as many as you can during your adventures.',0),
(31598,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting. You were wise to spot the importance of this, Wakener. Organic kyparite is highly valuable to us.$B$BHere, a reward. In fair trade.',0),
(31599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I recognize those mandibles. Karanosh ate my brother, you know.$B$BOf course, I have millions of brothers.$B$B<Zikk cackles.>',0),
(31603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As long as these shards blanket the land, our home will be a place of fear and death.',0),
(31605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<From the looks of it, this mantid was just recently broken out of his chamber. He lets out a hacking cough.>$B$B...Diss-ec...tor... has... returned...',0),
(31606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at you! Many parts and pieces... yes... and all of them so good at killing. Fascinating.$B$BI must pick your brain some time. Muhahah.',0),
(31609,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The siege is broken, for now.',0),
(31611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I may have underestimated how safe it is to brew these days.',0),
(31612,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kil\'ruk gives you a strange glance.>$B$BThe Klaxxi\'va may never accept you fully. Their xenophobic minds are closed to the possibility of a useful $R.$B$BI, for one, have been proud to fight by your side, $C. Your presence, and your assistance, do us great honor.',0),
(31613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you put my Volatile Greenstone Brew to good use. Well done, $C!',0),
(31656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),
(31660,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their eggs should have basked in the warmth of the sun and the song of a million wings for ten more years.$B$BThe Empress will pay for her crimes.',0),
(31661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you have any idea what this is? It\'s amber!$B$BBut it is polluted with fear.$B$BI would not expect an outsider like you to understand the consequences of this.',0),
(31669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait until they try these cabbages. Then they\'ll know I\'m the real deal.',0),
(31670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t wait to get my paws on those carrots. Thank you, $n. See you again tomorrow?',0),
(31671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can already smell those scallions from over here. Can\'t wait to pick \'em and sell \'em tomorrow. Thanks!',0),
(31672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And now, we play the waiting game...$B$BSorry, that sounded a little creepy. Forget I said that.',0),
(31673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'d like to see any crocolisks attack my farm now!$B$BHa HA!',0),
(31674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! That\'ll show Hillpaw.',0),
(31675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at that dirt. Practically sparkling.$B$BGrandpa would be proud.',0),
(31676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have a common enemy in the mogu. And perhaps others.$B$BWe shall see.',0),
(31677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gurthan was a coward who trained beasts to do the fighting for him and, in the face of death, chose to suspend his spirit in that urn.$B$BNow we can have the pleasure of killing him as many times as we like.$B$BWell done.',0),
(31680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Klaxxi are pleased with our work, outsider. You have proven to be more resourceful than we thought.',0),
(31681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even this raw amber will be of use. We can\'t afford to be picky in times like these.$B$BThe Klaxxi\'va will be glad I thought of this. I will tell them you helped!',0),
(31682,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What... what sort of creature are you?$B$BHow have you awoken me?',0),
(31685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Pandaria, $C. I have a selection of equipment that you may find useful on your journey.',0),
(31687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mantid are relentless. Fortunately for us, you have a dedication that surpasses even theirs.$B$BIt is good to have you walk these roads, $C.',0),
(31688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Leng told me of your heroics. He is in your debt, as am I.',0),
(31689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In disciplined hands, the spear is the perfect weapon. Only the weak would augment it with sorcery.$B$BAnd we have no need for the weak.',0),
(31690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a weapon of great beauty and power. If you are certain you wish to part with it, I would be happy to take it from you.',0),
(31691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a weapon of great beauty and power. If you are certain you wish to part with it, I would be happy to take it from you.',0),
(31692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a weapon of great beauty and power. If you are certain you wish to part with it, I would be happy to take it from you.',0),
(31693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ouch, you really are a good pet trainer! I guess you\'re the exception.',0),
(31695,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Townlong Steppes. If you insist on wandering in to the darkest places of Pandaria then far be it from me to not put you to good use.',0),
(31698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have carried out the task to the letter, $n.',0),
(31699,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have put the sprites in their place, $n. They should cause no more trouble for a while.',0),
(31700,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you and Ningna have been up to some mischief. Unfortunately, this type of behavior is not condoned by the Order--$B$BWait, where did you find those shoes? I\'ve been looking for that pair of moleskin riding boots for ages!$B$BWell... I suppose I will let this slide... this time. Hmph.',0),
(31701,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You are proving to be quite a reliable student.',0),
(31702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you have vanquished the beast. Quite a promising student, you are.',0),
(31703,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good riddance. With everything that is worrying us these days, it is good to have one less problem to worry about.',0),
(31704,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hatchling plays contentedly, oblivious to your efforts. Sigh... sometimes, the life of a serpent trainer is quite thankless.',0),
(31705,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The poisonous wasp is dead? Good. Where so many other students failed, you have succeeded, $n.',0),
(31706,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Instructor Skythorn updated me on the situation at The Widow\'s Wail. You have done well.',0),
(31707,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done a great deed today, $n. This is the duty of the Order of the Cloud Serpent - to protect the people of The Jade Forest.',0),
(31708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Your serpent sniffs the mushrooms and makes a horrible face. It tries to escape, but you hold it gently and coax it to eat the spongy morsels.>',0),
(31709,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for bringing me this report, $n. Big Bao is quite right to be concerned.$B$BThe sha is a subtle and deadly enemy. We must work to expel their dark energy from this land.',0),
(31710,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your serpent nudges your hand affectionately, then proceeds to devour the treats!',0),
(31711,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. I \"doubt\" that this enemy is truly gone. Until we can be sure, we must stay vigilant.',0),
(31712,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hozen presence is quite troubling. You did well to follow Instructor Skythorn\'s instructions.',0),
(31713,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank the Stormstouts! You are my hero!',0),
(31714,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, these hatchlings look quite tired. They have been through a great ordeal, but thanks to you, they are safe now.',0),
(31715,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The leader is dead, then? Good. Perhaps now the hozen will leave the villagers in peace.',0),
(31716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The hatchling plays contentedly, oblivious to your efforts. Sigh... sometimes, the life of a serpent trainer is quite thankless.',0),
(31717,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. The sword that is hammered and folded produces a keen blade.',0),
(31718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Both of you persevered to the end. Well done, my student.',0),
(31719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fight against Ningna will quickly reveal one\'s strengths and weaknesses. Well done.',0),
(31720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your focus was excellent, $n. Well done.',0),
(31721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are remarkable, $n. When I see such promising students as yourself, I know that The Order will pass into good hands.',0),
(31724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, I can\'t argue with results like those. You\'ve got a real gift, $n.',0),
(31725,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re mean! Why didn\'t you let me win? Everyone always lets me win!',0),
(31726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not only do you not fear me or my home, you have defeated me honorably. I\'m impressed.',0),
(31727,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the bugs have taken an interest in us have they? Well if they want somethin\' from us they\'ll have to come and earn it themselves!$B$BYou work for what you get here. That means you too!',0),
(31728,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I demand a do-over ...hic! That washn\'t fair! There was two of ye!',19116),
(31729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a show! A most excellent skirmish indeed.',19116),
(31730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they want us to leave do they? What a selfish request! We\'re only taking amber from one tree.$B$BWell, I\'m not going anywhere! I have brew to make.$B$BIf you help us maybe we can all come to a mutually beneficial agreement. I give them some brew, they stop trying to kill us.',0),
(31732,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A proper welcome for the Horde to this new land!',19342),
(31733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\'Bout time you showed up, $Gladdy:lassie;! Let\'s do some damage!',19342),
(31734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With those wagons out of commission, we can turn our attention to the commander.',19342),
(31735,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ll catch up with him again. I\'m sure of it.',19342),
(31736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When the mist fell, we knew it would only be a matter of time before visitors arrived.$B$BWe could not have predicted it would be like this.',19342),
(31737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you took responsibility for your actions. Left unchecked, negative emotions can quickly overwhelm an individual here, just as they started to overwhelm the one you call \"Rell.\"',19342),
(31738,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our orchard is one of our village\'s greatest treasures. For saving our harvest, we are truly grateful.',19342),
(31739,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you two have been busy. Thank you for recovering our kegs.',19342),
(31740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well to help the Brewers and bring this news to me.$B$BFrom what you have told me, it sounds as if Koukou was possessed by some dark energy. Could it be...?$B$BNo. That is impossible.',19342),
(31741,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One heck of a bloody mess y\'made down there, kid.$b$bNice work.',19342),
(31742,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s some fine and fancy killin\', $c.$b$bNow, with those two all done \'n\' taken care of, all that\'s left is the big fella in the hall behind me.',19342),
(31743,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Me lads up in the sky bring the heat, don\'t they? Ha ha ha!',19342),
(31744,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, I seen the wee ones, too. Busted a few out on m\'way up here.$b$bYe\'ve done good, $glad:lass;. Those cubs might have some nasty nightmares, but they\'ll grow up some day, thanks to you.',19342),
(31745,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $c. I can see why you came so highly recommended.',19342),
(31752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am pleased to offer this gift to you, $r $c.  According to my calibrations, it will invoke feelings of enjoyment and gratitude.$b$bHave a nice day.',22522),
(31754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a bit more quiet out now. My ringing ears appreciate your hard work.$B$BThanks!',0),
(31755,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My heart rests a little easier knowing what you\'ve done. Thank you, my dear.',0),
(31756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a lot brighter out! And not just thanks to your sunny smile.$B$BWay to go!',0),
(31757,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirits still come, but our guards can hold them back. The Shao-Tien cannot keep this up for ever.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),
(31758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a good man, helping that silly rogue out more than he deserves.',0),
(31760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How went the diplomacy? I hope you didn\'t go easy on them.',0),
(31762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glorious. They will learn to fear us.',0),
(31765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Superior Horde firepower at its finest!$B$B...and you did okay too I guess.',0),
(31766,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you are!$B$BI was starting to worry we\'d have to charge in and have all the fun without you.',0),
(31767,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C! We have them on their heels!',0),
(31768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha! Good work, $n.$B$BLeave \'em nothing!',0),
(31769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An air base - they had a hidden airbase here this entire time! Had I know I would\'ve kept more men on the guns, I would\'ve - Uaaghh -$B$B<The color drains from Nazgrim\'s face, and his body begins to exude a mysterious dark energy.>',0),
(31770,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your strife has brought devastation to our little village!\r\n\r\nWe are not interested in your war, but we will not drive the wounded away.',26124),
(31771,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you took responsibility for your actions. Left unchecked, negative emotions can quickly overwhelm an individual here, just as they started to overwhelm the one you call \"Nazgrim.\"',0),
(31772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s not as much as I would have hoped, but it will have to do. I guess there is no sense in cryin\' over spilled brew.',0),
(31773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so your conflict at the ruins is beginning to pollute the local wildlife? This is very troubling - I have never seen a reaction so intense.$B$BThank you for protecting the village, but it is a tragedy that those poor animals had to die.',0),
(31774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zin\'June is seriously injured, but he feels you\'re in a friendly mood. >\r\n\r\nDamn monkeys! Those things are all over the place!',0),
