(31937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pest repellers! You\'re a genius, $n! We can finally stop using that ancient bug sprayer.$B$B$B$BAw yeah, Thunder King! That\'s what I\'m talking about!$B$BI\'ll get this installed right away - those bugs won\'t know what hit \'em!',0),
(31938,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An Earth-Slasher master plow! I... I never thought I\'d get to use one of these. Do you have any idea how much time this will save us?!$B$BI heard if you push the Earth-Slasher through twenty yards of solid rock, you end up with a sandbox and a citation from the Shado-Pan for causing an earthquake scare!$B$BThis is going to be AWESOME.',0),
(31941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well planted, $n.$B$BNow we play the waiting game...',0),
(31942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was close. We almost missed melon time.',0),
(31943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, witchberries! I can\'t wait!$B$BBut I\'m gonna have to.',0),
(31944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Your training is now complete. Feel free to return in the future to spar with the masters here to practice what you have learned.',0),
(31945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, I\'ll be! I\'ve certainly seen larger scallions, but this will do quite nicely. You\'ve just saved our hides, $n!',0),
(31946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoa, these carrots look crunchy and juicy, $n! Mung-Mung did not know you had such a green thumb.',0),
(31947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was expecting cabbages, but not cabbages of this quality! Oh my!$B$BA perfectly round head, large waxy leaves, a perfect gradient of emerald color...$B$B<Farmer Fung takes a bite out of the cabbage.>$B$BMmm, and sweet, crisp flavor! These is a beautiful cabbage, $n. My yaks will certainly be spoiled by this tasty treat.',0),
(31948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Found the falls, did you? Oh yes, I see you found the water. Wonderful!',0),
(31949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nana Mudclaw scrutinizes a dark witchberry, then pops it into her mouth. Her face lights up.>$B$BLands alive! I haven\'t tasted such a sweet, juicy witchberry in years! Why, the only person who could grow berries like these was... Old Yoon, yer friend\'s grandpa.$B$B<Nana Mudclaw blushes.>$B$BOh that man was such a scamp! I still remember the summer days when we were young, eating these berries by the bushel without a care in the world.$B$BThank you for reminding me of an old friend, $n.',0),
(31951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have emerged victorious. Continue your training and find challenges in other trainers like yourself. The journey is never truly complete.',0),
(31953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are very strong. Will you lend your skills to my efforts?',0),
(31954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Next time you lose. I\'m gonna beatcha!',0),
(31955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow! I\'m not the only one that\'s been training!',0),
(31956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine. Victory is yours once more. Begone, I have much preparation to do before we meet again.',0),
(31957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In all my time as a grand master I\'ve never faced one as determined as you. The others were right about you. You are a force to be reckoned with.',0),
(31958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are stronger and your skills more refined. Your journey continues.',0),
(31967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'CataclysmКлянусь клинком Вождя, ты сражаешься как орк! Думаю, ты $gготов:готова; отправляться дальше.Теперь ты не можешь проиграть.ВарзокДумаешь, пришло время для следующего поединка?Варзок',26365),
(31970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),
(31971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By defeating me, I grow stronger. I urge you to be wary during our next encounter.',0),
(31972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even in defeat I feel closer to my pets. Thank you for a worthy skirmish.',0),
(31973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No, no, I just messed up. How about another go?',0),
(31974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight with the wrath of my masters. Perhaps you and I aren\'t so different.',0),
(31975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see...where to send you next...',0),
(31976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see...where to send you next...',0),
(31977,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),
(31978,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, it\'s not as much as I would have hoped, but it will have to do. I guess there is no sense in cryin\' over spilled brew.',0),
(31980,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),
(31981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You really beat Grand Master Antari? Wow! I\'m going to have to find you some really tough tamers to fight!',0),
(31982,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),
(31983,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),
(31984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Payne asked you to court me for him, didn\'t he? When is he ever going to learn?',0),
(31985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I take it you met Obalis? He\'s a wonderful fellow, once you get past his rough exterior.',0),
(31986,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26365),
(31989,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $n. It is time for the final step of your training.',0),
(31991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are indeed superior. If you would pardon me, I must consult the lake for guidance in my defeat.',0),
(31998,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my gratitude, $n. You\'ve displayed great valor today, and the speed at which you completed the challenge surely will impress your friends and intimidate your foes.',0),
(31999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы победили в схватке с Альянсом, но мы не продвинемся дальше, пока не разберемся с этими бормочущими обезьянами в окрестностях.\r\n\r\nСледующая наша цель – хозены.',0),
(32000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my sincerest thanks, $n. Without fine Stormstout brews to lighten the drudgery of the day, the world would be a dull place indeed.',0),
(32001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many blessings upon you, $n. Driving hatred from this world so quickly deserves rich reward.',0),
(32002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, $n. Your martial prowess is second to none, and your alacrity is sure to strike fear in the hearts of your enemies.',0),
(32003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a blow well struck, $n. I\'ve never seen a $C fell a giant with such speed.',0),
(32004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, that was amazing. Ner\'onok is a master tactician, and you schooled him handily.',0),
(32005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re a stalwart $C. Your friends and guild mates will surely notice the speed and ferocity with which you conquered the Scarlet Monastery.',0),
(32006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Just the thought of him burning up that beautiful library makes me shudder. Your friends will appreciate the speed with which you dispatched him.',0),
(32007,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. May the skeletons of the dead remain peaceful now that Gandling no longer seeks to disturb their slumber.',0),
(32008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'re $n. Splendid! Let\'s get to work then, shall we?',0),
(32009,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you must be $n. Nice to meet you. I\'m Varzok.$b$bFrom now on, come to me.',24015),
(32010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Vale is safer now, thanks to you. Now, you must help the Celestials.',0),
(32011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Vale is safer now, thanks to you. Now, you must help the Celestials.',0),
(32016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),
(32017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),
(32018,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! You were sent by Bolo? The \"Keg Mender,\" right? From the Drunken Hozen?$b$bHow is his eye healing? Is his friend still hung over?$b$bAhh... that was an enjoyable evening.',19342),
(32019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You come from the Temple of the Jade Serpent? Rain-Zhu sends his thanks?$B$BAi yah... really, that was nothing. I could have defeated that saurok without spilling my beer.$B$BIn fact, I believe I did.',0),
