(32165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You lay the meat out atop the trap, then turn your eyes toward the jungle...',0),
(32166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You spread out the decaying fish, prepare the crate, then turn your eyes toward the beach...',0),
(32169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought, $n.',0),
(32172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought, $n.',0),
(32175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I must say, good show!',0),
(32181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It only took one to capture the beast, but it will take many more to truly defeat it.$B$BSpeak to me again when you have gathered enough allies. We shall test the grace of the crane against the might of the Horde.',0),
(32182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It only took one to capture the beast, but it will take many more to truly defeat it.$B$BSpeak to me again when you have gathered enough allies. We shall test the ferocity of the tiger against the might of the Horde.',0),
(32183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It only took one to capture the beast, but it will take many more to truly defeat it.$B$BSpeak to me again when you have gathered enough allies. We shall test the resilience of the crab against the might of the Horde.',0),
(32184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might have taken just one $R to capture this beast, but it will take many more to put it down.$B$BGather up some friends, then come and speak with me again. We\'ll pit the grace of the crane against the glory of the Alliance!',0),
(32185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might have taken just one $R to capture this beast, but it will take many more to put it down.$B$BGather up some friends, then come and speak with me again. We\'ll pit the power of the tiger against the glory of the Alliance!',0),
(32186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It might have taken just one $R to capture this beast, but it will take many more to put it down.$B$BGather up some friends, then come and speak with me again. We\'ll pit the stamina of the crab against the glory of the Alliance!',0),
(32189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'AUGHM... nomf... -slurp- mmmf...$B$B<Barnaby looks up from the table, revealing a tangled beard dotted with melon seeds. Juices rush down his chin as he greets you.>$B$BMmf... -cough- A customer! Hello! Name\'s Fletcher. Barnaby Fletcher - nice to meet you!$B$B<He wipes a hand on his robe before extending it, still visibly sticky and flecked with pulp.>',0),
(32190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. We are an archaeological expedition, sent to excavate these ruins. We had no idea that this area was crawling with dangerous mogu.',0),
(32191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Well done! With the guardians gone, we should be able to excavate these ruins safely.',0),
(32192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We blood elves have served the Horde faithfully. Lately, I wonder what we have to gain from Garrosh\'s leadership.',0),
(32193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These artifacts must be several thousand years old. Have ye ever seen the like?',0),
(32194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. I knew that you could get the job done.',0),
(32197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have standards ya know! I\'m a chef, not a magician!$B$BThe only mystery here is how Duke thinks he\'ll pull this over on everyone else!',0),
(32198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you would be!$B$BHere\'s the catch - the shards, in their current state, are unstable. But the soil in this valley is renowned for its magical properties! I am sure if you were to \"plant\" the shard, a very interesting reaction would take place.$B$BIt could stabilize, leaving you with a functioning portal! Or... it might tear open a magical rift that spits out transdimensional horrors!$B$BMy gut tells me it will be a little of both, but there\'s only one way to know for sure.$B$BHere, take a sample!',0),
(32199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This meat is disgusting! It\'s going to take every spice I have to cover that smell up.$B$BOnly the best for the Boss-Lady!$B$B<Sezik grins and winks at you.>',0),
(32200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Much blood was spilled this day. It is on my hands, $n, not yours.',0),
(32201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. You have dealt the mogu a blow that they shall not easily forget.',0),
(32204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One day, this island will belong to the Horde. I can only hope that it will be free of saurok before then.$B$B<Aethas sneers.>$B$BAt least they attack the Alliance, too.',0),
(32206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s impressive how easily you were able to cut them down.$B$BPerhaps, it\'s you they should not underestimate. Thank you for your assistance, $C.',0),
(32207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A trained Zandalari beastcaller with a mount unleashed on the battlefield can kill twenty times their number. Your preemptive attack has saved many lives. Thank you!',0),
(32212,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! You have done it, champion!$B$BWe will be as a tide that sweeps over this island, bringing with it a new destiny for our people. And you, hero, are at its forefront.',0),
(32213,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, Violet Rise runs red with the blood of our enemies? Well done, $n.$B$BThis will be an ongoing battle I fear. We must continue to show our strength here.',0),
(32214,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very nice, $n! I knew it! I knew there were Alliance sneaking around down there!$B$BNo one messes with a Bilgewater rig and gets away with it!',0),
(32215,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could feel the magic of their altars dissipating even here, $C.',0),
(32216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It what?! It killed its master? Wonderful. These skyscreamers have more fight in them than I realized. Thank you for helping free the beast, $R - it is one less threat to the Horde, and one more for the Zandalari.',0),
(32217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The tide of blood is slowed, at least for a time. Thank you for your efforts in stalling the sacrifices, $C.',0),
(32218,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their dead shall rise no more, thanks to you, $n. Excellent work.',0),
(32219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that you left the quilen in a thousand tiny pieces. You have contributed much to our war effort.',0),
(32220,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You have lightened my heart of a heavy burden through your heroic actions.$B$BI will remember your efforts on this day.',0),
(32221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work down there, $n! That should keep \'em outta our hair for awhile!',0),
(32222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! This brings us one step closer to pushing them out of Pandaria!',0),
(32223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a good day when another Lion\'s Landing leader falls, $C! Good work!',0),
(32224,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful work, $C. This will help our offensive a great deal.',0),
(32225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to exceed my expectations, $C. Well done.',0),
(32226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, you\'ve just confirmed my theory! Thank you, $C.',0),
(32227,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have returned, $R. It is my hope that these young skyscreamers have the lives they deserve without dealing with the harsh treatment of the trolls.',0),
(32228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are not one to be trifled with. I am sure to have further use of your services.$B$BCome back to me in a day\'s time, $C.',0),
(32230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When I give you a task, it gets handled.$B$BWell done, $C.',0),
(32232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I was correct to be concerned. It\'s a good thing you were there to stop them before that guardian was fully infused.$B$BGood work, $C.',0),
(32233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C!$B$BThese weapons are terrifying on their own, nevermind the magic they are infused with.',0),
(32234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $C. Excellent work.',0),
(32235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! Simple mechanical toys are no match for a well aimed bottle of grog.',0),
(32236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s what I like to hear! I bet those spiders will think twice before messing with a Bilgewater operation again!',0),
(32237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I was being followed! Those dirty rotten sneaks!$B$BI\'m going to have to start planting some real nice surprises for those cowards. Surprises that will really knock \'em out!',0),
(32238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n! I saw the fireworks from here!$B$BWho knew being a genius was this easy? I don\'t even have to try anymore.',0),
(32242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warchief sent you? What does he say?',0),
(32243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, look at this thing!',0),
(32244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this is remarkable! This is just the kind of artifact that we came here to find!',0),
(32246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have impeccable timing, $C. King Wrynn is just about to land, and the full might of our fleet will follow soon after.',0),
(32247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m satisfied with this site, it\'s time to bring in our fleet.',0),
(32248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you again, $n.$B$BWe have a delicate situation on our hands here. We need to plan our next moves carefully.',0),
(32249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are just in time. The Warchief is about to land. Once this site passes his inspection, the fleet will follow.',0),
(32250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. Our presence here will not be denied!',0),
(32251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good ta see ya, mon. I be needin\' true allies at my side for dis mission.',0),
(32252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can only imagine what horrors you witnessed, $n. Your bravery was put to the test this day, and you did not fail the Horde in your task.',0),
(32254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The archmage listens carefully to your report.>$B$BI understand. Thank you for your aid, $C.',0),
(32255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s more like it.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),
(32256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do you have to report?',0),
(32257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... very interesting. This tablet will yield many secrets, indeed.',0),
(32262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those you have rescued today would no doubt thank you, if they had the strength.$B$BOur task here will be ongoing. I refuse to leave anyone behind!',0),
(32264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have desired this book for many years, $R. It\'s power is too immense to describe. You have done me a great service.',0),
(32265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. This artifact will be put to better use in our hands than in the hands of the Kirin Tor.',0),
(32266,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This task will be ongoing, but you have done as a great service, $R.',0),
(32268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am sure the use of even these smaller mana bombs has Jaina squirming with rage. Serves her right.$B$BDalaran was my home before her grandparents were born. What right did she have to expel me from my home?',0),
(32269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. With your help we were able to successfully sneak several spies behind enemy lines.',0),
(32274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know the true price of bloodshed. I know the cost of war.$B$BIt would be simpler to blindly massacre our attackers until they yield. But is it right?',0),
(32275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I shall continue my unrest until the threat is subdued, but your aid brings us closer to that goal. I thank you, $n.',0),
(32276,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help, we\'re one giant step closer to our goal.',0),
(32277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incredible work. This presents us with a monumental opportunity.',0),
(32278,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work! With that blasted warship out of commission, the bombardments on our forces along the coast will cease.$B$BTaran Zhu has informed me that the Shado-Pan will keep vigil over Stormsea Landing, freeing up Sunreaver resources to press the siege elsewhere. Taoshi will be there. I am sure she will be glad to work with you again.$B$BWe are all grateful for your contributions, $n. Thank you.',0),
(32279,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Shan Bu\'s fall will weaken the Mogu and your heroism will surely be remembered.',0),
(32282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We lost three good soldiers when we first arrived on this island. Killed in their sleep by compies that had snuck into their tent. Some nights I still hear the screams.',0),
(32283,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. These beasts are strong enough. We don\'t need them infused with an angry spirit now do we?',0),
(32284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! You received my note. Very good. Vol\'jin is near death, and I will need your help healing his wounds.',0),
(32285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are appreciated.',0),
(32287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. Thank you for the help.',0),
(32288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that the wards have been fully armed, we can focus our attention elsewhere. Nothing will be slipping past us now!',0),
(32292,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),
(32293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to have a man I can trust close at hand.',0),
(32294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a good $C to have around, that\'s for certain. Thank you.',0),
(32295,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот кодекс – книга невероятной силы, написанная на древнем, прадемоническом языке. У вас возникла мысль показать ее одному из наставников чернокнижников в ближайшей столице.',19342),
(32296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not entirely unsuccessful. Still, we\'ll do better next time.$B$BThanks for providing us with that key. The raid would not have gone off without you.',0),
(32297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Few things in this world and beyond are more entertaining than watching a rampaging ancient beast tearing through an enemy\'s settlement.$B$BIf times were not so dire I would consider selling tickets to such an event.',0),
(32298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very interesting results. I am sure there is a mage somewhere that cares about the specifics. I, on the other hand, am just glad to hear the sound of trolls being assaulted by their own beasts.',0),
(32299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jobs like this make me glad that I left most of my nose in the tomb.',0),
(32300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. The real irony is had these been normal bombs we would have had a much harder time detecting them. Some gnomish devilry could have spelled the end of our operation here.',0),
(32301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have put a good dent in the Sunreaver forces here. Like vermin, there will always be more. We must be at the ready at all times.',0),
(32302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the constructs have fallen? Good!$B$BWe will remind Jaina and the Kirin Tor at every turn that the Sunreavers are not to be taken lightly.',0),
(32303,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish I could be there to see the look on Proudmoore\'s face as she mourns the loss of her death machine!$B$BWe can be certain she will build another, but we have at least set her back.',0),
(32304,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your presence on the battlefield cannot be ignored. I would like to give you something extra for your efforts, $C.',0),
(32305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! It will take them days to rebuild those foci.',0),
(32307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Garon is still in shock, but she\'s with us now. She wants revenge on her former lord. I\'m going to forgive her for hitting me.',19342),
(32309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are ready to learn more...',0),
(32310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь тебе пора узнать кое-что еще...',19342),
(32315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. We have much work to do here.',0),
(32316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you and my son have been hard at work. Thank you for taking the initiative to aid our cause here in the Vale.',0),
(32317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебе удалось найти все четыре фрагмента камня души… Теперь осталось лишь соединить их…',19342),
(32318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good. These should work nicely.',0),
(32319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Thrall stares at the stone you have handed him.>$B$BVol\'jin\'s hearthstone? My friend, has it come to this?',0),
(32320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin has saved my life many times in the past. To see my own Kor\'kron used against his people cuts deeper than I can put into words.',0),
(32321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You come asking for the Monkey King?$B$BLet us see how well you ookin\' sing.$B$BWho are you, so tiny and boring?$B$BYour cause is silly! You leave me snoring.$B$BThree riddles I will ask,$B$BThese riddles are a task,$B$BFinish each without pause,$B$BAnd we shall see if I help your cause.',0),
(32324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Камень души Джубеки привел вас к Черному храму. Осталось только найти путь внутрь...',19342),
(32325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; для этого мира больше, чем можешь себе представить, $gчернокнижник:чернокнижница;. Даже немного жаль, что Канретад закончил таким образом. С другой стороны, это было неизбежно.',19342),
(32326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! So glad Nazgrim selected you.$B$BIt\'s taken a great deal of the Horde\'s effort to get you here through Jaina\'s traps. Maintaining our illusion this close to Darnassus is considerably expensive.$B$BFurthermore, the Sunreavers of Dalaran are risking their neutrality by assisting the Horde with this operation.$B$BIn other words, we expect only the best from you.',0),
(32327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well executed, $R! I knew we could count on you.$B$BNow to get off this wretched tree.',0),
(32328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found the bell! And Fanlyr teleported it to Silvermoon for study, as instructed? The Horde will put this to good use.$B$BYou have done the Horde a great service today. Lok\'tar, friend!',0),
(32329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warchief \"demands\" progress? His impatience is growing more destructive with each command.$B$BAs it stands, we could use your expertise.',0),
(32330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This reckless use of my people by Garrosh is becoming intolerable. If you had not been here to assist I dread to think what might have happened.',0),
(32331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you friend. While I have learned much about diplomacy I think Jaina is too familiar with my tactics.$B$BI could use a friendly hand in resolving this conflict.',0),
(32332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Amber! Fresh and untamed. Did you kill to get it? But of course.$B$BThough free, the untamed amber is a dangerous thing, and many might die because of it.$B$BMercy comes in many forms, like spikes and mantid and really ookin\' spooky storms.',0),
(32333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Metal Brew is strong and lasting, a brew to be shared with friends after a battle.$B$BEmperor Shaohao and his Monkey King had many a round in our day. Many battles, and many good friends.',0),
(32334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why engage in duelery? Why engage in foolery?$B$BYou ask the Monkey King for an artifact of power, I have to make sure when the time comes you will not cower. One tough dooker you think you might ookin be, but against mogu, many will turn and flee.',0),
(32335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like it is going to take us a few days to track all of these \"minions\" down.$B$BThank you for your help, $n. Meet me in Lion\'s Landing in a few days and we will embark to track down these objects.',0),
(32336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Artifacts not make people great. Artifacts allow people to be more of themselves. Good becomes gooder. Bad becomes badder. And Chief Ingoo Ingoo became worser.',0),
(32337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What virmen do not understand, they worship, fight or flee.$B$BI should send them a few statues of me.',0),
(32338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Woot woot!',0),
(32340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You collected everything you could carry. It\'s time to pull the fishing rods before Akama comes back.',19342),
(32342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, yes. Hmm. Hand that over. Carefully.',0),
(32343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What treasures! With any luck, the spirits will return and we will be able to sample their essence further.',0),
(32344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, yes. I received word from one of our researchers that they are no longer troubled by that anomaly. Well done.',0),
(32345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good work. As much as it may seem trivial in comparison to our larger research goals, it is important that we maintain appearances, $n.',0),
(32346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright! We\'ll be back up and runnin\' in no time!',0),
(32347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! That should send \'em runnin\' back to Silvermoon with their tail \'tween their legs!',0),
(32348,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, what a fine day. Alliance fools defeated, and our research is moving ahead quite nicely.',0),
(32351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $C. You were sent from Domination Point? Very well. We have much to discuss.',0),
(32352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You bested my defenders? Finally, one who can control his hatred and violence!$B$BI need more men like you.',0),
(32355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you made it, my friend. I could really use your help with what is to come. My father would prefer I remain in the safe custody of his legion.$B$BBut if there is one thing Pandaria has taught me, it is a few people in the right place at the right time can make a bigger difference than the greatest of armies.',0),
(32362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, hero. I hear the wisdom in Jaina\'s words.$B$BLet\'s hope her faith in the Sunreavers is justified.',0),
(32363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n.',0),
(32368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did you see, $C?',0),
(32370,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You do a doubletake when the Pandaren suddenly speaks with Connelly\'s voice.>$B$B\'Bout time, laddie! I\'ve been waitin\' fer ya to show up.$B$BThese Pandaren are good people but can\'t mix a martini fer nothin\'.',0),
(32371,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Back so fast, rookie? So what did ye learn?',0),
(32372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The orcs have changed. My Horde has changed. Do I kill my fellow orcs until it is once again \"my\" Horde? Do I have any right to try force the Horde to be what it once was?$B$BThese are troubling times. But for now, I must see to Vol\'jin\'s people.',0),
(32373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am curious to see how King Wrynn rises to the occasion.$B$BI am even more curious to see what YOU are capable of. Let\'s find out...',0),
(32374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous! Even in the midst of the chaos of battle you\'ve proven that an individual can have an impact. The Horde has learned that their actions in Pandaria will not be unopposed.$B$BI believe it is time for a more substantial challenge...',0),
(32376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. You have come. $B$BAgain, I apologize for the cryptic note - but Garrosh is increasingly distrustful of us. I do not want this operation disturbed by hasty action on his part.',0),
(32377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Agent Connelly\'s voice comes over the radio.>$B$BEy, you\'re good! I knew those Kor\'kron wouldn\'t be a problem fer ya. Couldn\'t\'ve done much better meself.',0),
(32378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. We should be ready to make our move.',0),
(32379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. There\'s quite a bit to pore through here... $B$BI will have the Reliquary investigate these. Surely we can use them to discern more of the secrets of these Korune mogu.',0),
(32380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Following Connelly has been interesting to say the least. The man is a master of disguise!$B$BTalking him into joining you won\'t be the hard part, $C. Figuring out which of these lively individuals is him will be next to impossble.',0),
(32381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have a keen eye, $C! I think you are ready to meet Connelly.',0),
(32382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve arrived just in time. From the intel I\'ve gathered, Garrosh is hot on the trail of some sort of ancient mogu artifact of power.$B$BIf we can figure out what he\'s after, we can stop him from getting it!$B$BWe have to act fast to gather as much information as possible.',0),
(32383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! Everyone always underestimates the little guys and it is always a grave mistake!',0),
(32384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We managed to capture our quarry. $B$BIn truth, though, I am not sure what our next move should be. I will contact the leaders of our allies and see if they have ideas - I don\'t know that our arcane talents are going to pry the secrets of our mogu captive.',0),
(32388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion grins.>$B$BYou were being tested, $C. I knew you were capable of great things by yourself.$B$BBut you have proven to me that you have the makings of a leader, cobbling together support among a group of strangers in the midst of a battlefield.$B$BThe Alliance is fortunate to have you.',0),
(32389,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion hungrily listens to tales of your exploits on the battlefield, his eyes gleaming bright red.>$B$BOhh... oh! Incredible! In the very eye of battle, one\'s true heart is revealed.$B$BYou do not disappoint, $n.$B$BNeither does your Alliance.',0),
(32390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A strange device sits within an ornate silk-lined chest. It appears as though it can be fastened to your sha-touched weapon as an additional upgrade. The empty socket is disconcerting; you feel as though it is staring back at you. A single, hollow, judgmental eye...>',0),
(32391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Alliance beat us here. How could this happen?',0),
(32392,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Darnassus, is it?$B$BThe Alliance believes they have won the day. Now, when their arrogance is at its greatest, is our opportunity to pluck the prize from their fingers.',0),
(32393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We blasted the doors open moments ago, $C. You arrived just in time to join us for the excavation.',0),
(32394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic work, $n. I could not even imagine the atrocity that Garrosh would commit if this bell were to fall into his hands.$B$BToday, we have secured a safe future for the Alliance. I will see to it that the bell makes it safely to Darnassus.$B$BI will extoll your deeds to the King.',0),
(32397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Phew! That was a close one! I never doubted you for a minute though.$B$BNow let me take a look at that journal...',0),
(32398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was wondering when you would arrive, $n.',0),
(32399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They may have destroyed the Divine Bell, but I have taken the life of the Alliance\'s prodigal son!$B$BIt is nothing less than my own father would have expected of me.$B$BThis victory may have come at a high cost, but it is of little consequence.$B$BI will find other ways to destroy my enemies, and bring glory to the Horde!',0),
(32400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! Just the $C I was hoping to see. You couldn\'t have arrived at a better time.',0),
(32401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Anduin looks like a crumpled doll. He lays as still as a stone, and the only movement comes from the frigid air ruffling his fair, golden hair.>$B$B<You sit quietly for a while, until the cold settles into your bones. The bell is destroyed, but the silence is deafening.>$B$B<Out of the corner of your eye, you see the slightest flicker from the boy\'s hand. You lean in close. He breathes - but just barely! Anduin is alive!>',0),
(32402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good... you\'ve arrived. It\'s not a good day to be Horde in Dalaran.$B$BJaina\'s called for the exile of all the Sunreavers. You and I are going to save as many as we can - including Archmage Aethas Sunreaver himself - and then get out of here as fast as possible.',0),
(32403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s press on.',0),
(32404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So much bloodshed! In a place of peace!$B$BJaina has gone too far this time.',0),
(32405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The first stage of our mission is complete. That was the easy part.$B$B<Rommath takes a deep, measured breath, then continues...>',0),
(32406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, let\'s move quickly.',0),
(32408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will continue saving Sunreavers for a while longer. Aethas\' location may become clearer as we press on.',0),
(32409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for that, $n.$B$BIt unsettles me to have to fight directly with the high elves of the Silver Covenant... but I never tire of slaying Alliance.',0),
(32410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Well done.',0),
(32411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. They should be waiting for us in Silvermoon when we return.',0),
(32412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is this... $n? What\'s going on here?',0),
(32413,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nazgrim listens as you recount the day\'s events.>$B$BWe take the bell... and the Alliance takes Dalaran. That escalated quickly.$B$BWar is coming, $n. Be on your toes.',0),
(32414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Bell is gone...$B$BAt the scene of the crime, we found traces of arcane magic... I may be able to use my skills to track the thieves.',0),
(32416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will instruct you from here on out.$B$BJaina will be going down into the city to enforce our new rules.',0),
(32417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s nice to have those rats out of here for good. Well done, hero.',0),
(32418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While I can\'t say I agree completely with Jaina\'s methods, I do understand her motives.$B$BSometimes, you have to fight back.',0),
(32419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a bloody day, $n, and this is bloody work.$B$BBut do not forget what the Sunreavers did to bring this on: They used neutral Kirin Tor resources to aid the Horde in their fight against the Alliance.$B$BDo not hesitate to believe that they would do the same to us, given the chance.',0),
(32420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suppose it wasn\'t enough for him to be a coward and a backstabber... he had to be a greedy thief as well.$B$BHmph. The Horde and the Sunreavers aren\'t all that different. They deserve one another.',0),
(32421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, the Sunreavers have to answer to us. Jail or death - their fate is in their own hands.',0),
(32423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t fault you for following orders. In fact, I can\'t really fault Jaina for acting on her own behalf, for once.$B$BBut still... we aren\'t playing a game here. We are dealing with war, with people\'s lives, with the future of the Alliance itself.$B$BAt the very least, we now have the Kirin Tor on our side. Today will be remembered by all as a victory for the Alliance.',0),
(32426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the SI: 7 needs a reminder in what the word retirement means?$B$BI suppose they wouldn\'t be comin\' to me if the situation weren\'t dire.$B$BI\'ll help, but I\'ll need a few days to gather some intel.',0),
(32427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Like all great leaders, Garrosh has greatly extended himself. Just what is he ultimately capable of?$B$BMore importantly, what YOU are capable of? Fresh bloodshed along the coast gives us an opportunity to find out...',0),
(32428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t belive you took out those spirits!',0),
(32429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous! Even in the midst of the chaos of battle you\'ve proven that an individual can have an impact. The Alliance buckles under Horde might, although their King refuses to break.$B$BI believe it is time for a more substantial challenge...',0),
(32430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion grins.>$B$BYou were being tested, $C. I knew you were capable of great things by yourself.$B$BBut you have proven to me that you have the makings of a leader, cobbling together support among a group of strangers in the midst of a battlefield.$B$BThe Horde is fortunate to have you.',0),
(32431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion hungrily listens to tales of your exploits on the battlefield, his eyes gleaming bright red.>$B$BOhh... oh! Incredible! In the very eye of battle, one\'s true heart is revealed.$B$BYou do not disappoint, $n.$B$BNeither does this Horde of yours.',0),
(32432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<A strange device sits within an ornate silk-lined chest. It appears as though it can be fastened to your sha-touched weapon as an additional upgrade. The empty socket is disconcerting; you feel as though it is staring back at you. A single, hollow, judgmental eye...>',0),
(32434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),
(32435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurry up and turn those in if you want to get second place! I have been standing around here for HOURS with nothing to eat!  Hand those suckers over!',0),
(32436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hurry up and turn those in if you want to be awarded the third and final prize! I have been standing around here for HOURS with nothing to eat!  Hand those suckers over!',0),
(32439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),
(32440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),
(32441,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will get you next time!',0),
(32442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наши защитники справились с первой волной атакующих, но флагман будет здесь с минуты на минуту!',23420),
(32446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Goblin construction leaves somethin\' to be desired, but it\'ll have to do. Good work, $n!',0),
(32448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, very good. This is the last thing we needed.',0),
(32449,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have a lot of work to do, $C. Who knows what has already been uncovered in Ogudei!',0),
(32450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now things can get interesting! I have a few plans for Lion\'s Landing...',0),
(32451,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The battle is already underway, $C. Let\'s get you out there!',0),
(32452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s about time we dealt with this nuisance. Those Bilgewater runts need to be taught a lesson!',0),
(32455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hesitate to guess what would have happened if you had not been there with the young Prince, $n.$B$BToday, you put an end to Garrosh\'s plans.$B$BYou have undoubtedly saved thousands of lives, and most importantly, you brought Anduin back to us.$B$BWe are doing everything we can for the boy, but we can only wait and see.$B$BI believe he has the fight in him. I must believe it...',0),
(32457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Sunreavers and the Kirin-Tor are mounting an assault on the Thunder King\'s base of operations! My new friend here and I were just discussing the ramifications of their attack.$B$BYou and I can stand to benefit from the situation, $n. I have a few ideas...',0),
(32460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve decided.$B$BCertain members of the Kirin-Tor have put their allegiance to the Horde above the order, and I will NOT tolerate it. This is nothing short of a betrayal.$B$B<Jaina\'s eyes flare with rage.>$B$BCome with me, $n. We\'re going to clean up Dalaran.',0),
(32461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, have you come to join the Order?',0),
(32468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Count me surprised to hear from you again, you must be tougher than I thought. You\'ve earned my respect, kid, here\'s your lens upgrade kit. Now get out there and take some S.E.L.F.I.E.S!',0),
(32469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew from the moment we met that you were an adventurer, just like me! Here\'s your lens upgrade kit, now get out there and take some S.E.L.F.I.E.S!',0),
(32470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! I\'ve just gotta put this box here, and jam this part in here... and done!$B$BHere\'s your new S.E.L.F.I.E. cam, enjoy!',0),
(32471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re all set, kid. You\'ve got a face the camera will love, now get out there and get shooting!',0),
(32474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion nods slowly.>$B$BYes, $n. I saw your deeds, and I was most impressed.$B$BYou are truly an instrument of change.',0),
(32476,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion nods slowly.>$B$BYes, $n. I saw your deeds, and I was most impressed.$B$BYou are truly an instrument of change.',0),
(32485,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Those perimeter wards should keep out all manner of filth.$B$BWith Violet Rise protected we can focus on more pressing matters.',0),
(32489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(32491,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Left standing, those piles of discarded food are the perfect breeding ground for disease.$B$BWere I still in the disease-spreading business, I\'d consider using them myself.',0),
(32493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! This will aid my studies greatly, as well as advance our cause here.',0),
(32494,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Getting these masks was no easy task, $C. I am grateful for your service.',0),
(32495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that this piece of filth is slain. You have done us all a great favor, $n.',0),
(32496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Horde\'s Vale of Eternal Blossoms bonfire!',0),
(32497,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Dread Wastes flame.',0),
(32498,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Jade Forest flame.',0),
(32499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Krasarang Wilds flame.',0),
(32500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Kun-Lai Summit flame.',0),
(32501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Townlong Steppes flame.',0),
(32502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Valley of the Four Winds flame.',0),
(32503,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Desecrate the Alliance\'s Vale of Eternal Blossoms bonfire!',0),
(32505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! To feel whole again! You have my gratitude, servant. Take this stone and use it wisely. Should you encounter his majesty the Thunder King in your travels, do not tell him where you received it, or you will be standing in a statue next to me for the remainder of eternity.',0),
(32506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! I\'ll pass him off to our caretaker. Thank you.',0),
(32509,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Vale of Eternal Blossoms flame.',0),
(32510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honor the Vale of Eternal Blossoms flame.',0),
(32517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A good defense is just as effective as a strong offense. One less enemy to worry about.$B$BWell done.',0),
(32520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive indeed. Thank you for doing this for me, $n.',0),
(32521,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have our gratitude, $n.',0),
(32522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less threat at our doorstep. Thank you, $n.',0),
(32523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you were the one Lor\'themar sent. These beasts are more than we can handle on our own. Time to spook the livestock.',0),
(32524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These Zandalari are even more dangerous than we anticipated.$B$BDo not make the mistake of underestimating them, for that may be the last mistake you make.',0),
(32525,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their dead shall rise no more, thanks to you, $n. Excellent work.',0),
(32526,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You have lightened my heart of a heavy burden through your heroic actions.$B$BI will remember your efforts on this day.',0),
(32527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. You have dealt the mogu a blow that they shall not easily forget.',0),
(32528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, you\'ve just confirmed my theory! Thank you, $C.',0),
(32529,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You continue to exceed my expectations, $C. Well done.',0),
(32530,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that this piece of filth is slain. You have done us all a great favor, $n.',0),
(32531,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A good defense is just as effective as a strong offense. One less enemy to worry about.$B$BWell done.',0),
(32532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful work, $C. This will help our offensive a great deal.',0),
(32533,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that you left the quilen in a thousand tiny pieces. They are little more than a nuisance to my work here on the island.',0),
(32535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One day, this island will belong to the Alliance. I can only hope that it will be free of saurok before then.$B$B<Modera sneers.>$B$BAt least they attack the Horde, too.',0),
(32536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The archmage listens carefully to your report.>$B$BI understand. Thank you for your aid, $C.',0),
(32537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s more like it.$B$BThank you, $C.',0),
(32538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$C, the destruction of those altars will force the trolls to halt their most heinous of sacrifices. You have the thanks of everyone here.',0),
(32539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without the offerings, they will need to collect more before their sacrifices can proceed. Thank you, $C.',0),
(32540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Most who witness such rituals never return, and those that do tend to be shaken. You, $n, seem little moved by your incredible deeds. I am impressed.',0),
(32541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $R. The hatchlings you frightened will live a better life without their captors.',0),
(32542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With a few of their more threatening kin slain, perhaps the Zandalari will show reluctance next time they decide to trifle with us.',0),
(32543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your help against the Zandalari is appreciated. I realize it seems we cannot stem the tide, but your efforts make a difference.',0),
(32544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope that creature has the intelligence necessary to know who saved it. It seems to me that it would be a dangerous foe if provoked.',0),
(32545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know the true price of bloodshed. I know the cost of war.$B$BIt would be simpler to blindly massacre our attackers until they yield. But is it right?',0),
(32546,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Looking at you, I\'m suddenly quite proud of Dalaran\'s state-of-the-art plumbing system.',0),
(32547,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(32548,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Left standing, those piles of discarded food are the perfect breeding ground for disease.$B$BWere I still in the disease-spreading business, I\'d consider using them myself.',0),
(32550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These trolls have been using dark magics to achieve their goals. No patience, no honor. You have done the world a good service in reducing their numbers today.',0),
(32551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We lost three good soldiers when we first arrived on this island. Killed in their sleep by compies that had snuck into their tent. Some nights I still hear the screams.',0),
(32552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. These beasts are strong enough. We don\'t need them infused with an angry spirit now do we?',0),
(32553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Few things in this world and beyond are more entertaining than watching a rampaging ancient beast tearing through an enemy\'s settlement.$B$BIf times were not so dire I would consider selling tickets to such an event.',0),
(32554,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very interesting results. I am sure there is a mage somewhere that cares about the specifics. I, on the other hand, am just glad to hear the sound of trolls being assaulted by their own beasts.',0),
(32555,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is very interesting, $C. The crystal hums with the rage of its captive inhabitants. Even after the passage of time their devotion has not decreased.$B$BI will need to study this further.',0),
(32556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are excellent finds! Studying them will take time, but there is much to be gained in understanding the Zandalari.',0),
(32557,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C! These weapons are impressive. Now we have a few less things to worry about in the field of battle.',0),
(32558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a shame really that these masks must be destroyed. I would have liked to study this ancient magic, but it is better that they be destroyed than become the tools of the Horde.$B$BGood work, $C.',0),
(32559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s fortunate that you were able to intervene, $C. Who knows what damage that golem would have caused had he not been stopped.',0),
(32560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. The more Zandalari we destroy, the less chance their magic will fall into Horde hands.',0),
(32561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re dependable, $n. I like that.',0),
(32562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate what you\'ve done for us this day, $n.',0),
(32563,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That\'s a worry off my mind.',0),
(32564,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yet again you prove yourself. We would be fortunate if all amongst us could aspire to your talents.',0),
(32565,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive. You have our gratitude.',0),
(32567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today, we hunt the hunters!',0),
(32568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Zandalari here are not to be under-estimated, $C. Powerful magic overwhelms this space.$B$BWe must be diligent in our efforts.',0),
(32571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! I\'ll pass him off to our caretaker. Thank you.',0),
(32572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts are appreciated, $C.',0),
(32573,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $C. Thank you for the help.',0),
(32574,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are not one to be trifled with. I am sure to have further use of your services.$B$BCome back to me in a day\'s time, $C.',0),
(32575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When I give you a task, it gets handled.$B$BWell done, $C.',0),
(32576,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re dependable, $n. I like that.',0),
(32577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate what you\'ve done for us this day, $n.',0),
(32578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to have a man I can trust close at hand.',0),
(32579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive indeed. Thank you for doing this for me, $n.',0),
(32580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have our gratitude, $n.',0),
(32581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One less threat at our doorstep. Thank you, $n.',0),
(32582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a good $C to have around, that\'s for certain. Thank you.',0),
(32583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yet again you prove yourself. We would be fortunate if all amongst us could aspire to your talents.',0),
(32584,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That\'s a worry off my mind.',0),
(32585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are impressive. You have our gratitude.',0),
(32587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),
(32589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $C. This is a dark magic indeed. We have much to learn here if we are to succeed.$B$BNow, we have only to hope that we can reanimate this creature.',0),
(32590,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion introduces you both.>$B$BPrince Anduin, this is $n, possibly the most powerful $C in Pandaria.$B$BOh - do you already know of each other? Interesting.',0),
(32591,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion inspects the treasures you brought him.>$B$BWell done. The trillium will need additional refinement, of course, but these samples are pure.$B$BI will need to study these artifacts for a time but I believe I can use the knowledge contained here to craft something of great value to us both.',0),
(32592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My Shado-Pan associates have spoken highly of your deeds. You have earned quite the name for yourself here in Pandaria!$B$BIt is settled. When the materials are ready, you will be my champion. You will be my instrument, my standard-bearer, my voice of change across this world.$B$BWe will do marvelous things together.',0),
(32593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold! The Lightning Lance! A conduit that can channel and control the very same power that the Thunder King used to found an empire.$B$BIt is dormant... but you\'re about to change that. If you\'re worthy.',0),
(32594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! The lance seethes with power and potential!$B$BOh my friend, you have earned a great reward...',0),
(32595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Crown of Heaven! Use this to augment any piece of headgear.$B$BIt will also act as a third eye - I will be able to follow your progress as we embark on the next stage of our journey.',0),
(32596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to your work, $n, we\'ve reconstructed an ancient narrative. The mogu were once creatures of stone, enacting the will of the Titans. But then their master fell silent, and they succumbed to the curse of the flesh. Eventually Lei Shen came along, imprisoned the keeper Ra, and took his power. Ah, what an empire he built!$B$BArmed with this knowledge, it\'s time to act...',0),
(32597,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion squeezes the black heart in his hand, his eyes burning brightly.>$B$BYou did it... you did it! The black heart of the Thunder King!',0),
(32599,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have just secured our advantage, $n. Your work here will be remembered.$B$BGarrosh will be made to pay for his actions!',0),
(32600,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No wonder the Zandalari have come. They are in need of a new home, and I am sure their mogu allies have promised them much.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),
(32601,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What we know of Lei Shen are dark legends that have been remembered over the vast span of time. I often wondered if these legends had exaggerated the power of Lei Shen. But your research would suggest they may have greatly underestimated the Thunder King. These are dark days indeed.$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),
(32602,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your research is most distressing. But it sheds light on a truth we have long sought: \"Where did the mogu come from? And why were they such tyrants?\"$B$BWe will add this knowledge to your collection. If you wish me to narrate this for you, simply point at the correct volume in your Private Collection.',0),
(32603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them all? Amazing! So the stories ARE true! Perhaps you will write the next great Pandaren fable based on your own incredible journey!',0),
(32604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bow to you who continues to walk in the footfalls of the great Pandaren fables.',0),
(32605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Masterfully done, $C.',0),
(32606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Masterfully done, $C.',0),
(32607,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Casualties are down significantly with that warship out of commission, and we continue to press the siege on Lei Shen.$B$BFantastic work out there today, hero.$B$BPlease, take this - you have earned it.',0),
(32608,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this? A necklace? What are you trying to- ahh, I see... A relic from the Thunder King\'s vault! Fascinating... Powerful, too.$B$BThe Kirin Tor will keep it safe. In return, please accept this.',0),
(32613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что у тебя есть для Ку\'мы?',0),
(32614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Give! Give them to me!',0),
(32615,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто ты? Зачем ты здесь снова? Хе-хе-хе...',0),
(32616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Qu\'ma giggles madly and points at you. >',0),
(32617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Qu\'ma starts dancing on her hut. >',0),
(32618,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Katie Hunter can be found here in camp.',0),
(32621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While the language is incomprehensible, the diagrams in this book yield their knowledge to your skilled blacksmith\'s eye. It is clear that, by manipulating the properties of ghost iron, you can create a material of great power, perhaps powerful enough to recreate and increase the power of weapons long lost to the mists of time.',0),
(32627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. This artifact will be put to better use in our hands than in the hands of the Sunreavers.',0),
(32628,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It pains me to resort to such weaponry, but the Sunreavers must be taught the price of their actions.',0),
(32631,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your presence on the battlefield cannot be ignored. I would like to give you something extra for your efforts, $C.',0),
(32632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $R. The problem with constructs is they can always be rebuilt.$B$BI imagine it will not take the Sunreavers long to build a new death machine.',0),
(32633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes! This is it. You\'ve done well, $R.',0),
(32634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $R! I was able to get a few of my scouts behind their lines before the perimeter wards were repaired.',0),
(32635,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе за проявленные усилия, $n. Если бы ты не обезвредил эти мана-бомбы, случилась бы катастрофа.',24015),
(32636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have saved many today, $n. I cannot imagine the horror of being frozen and helpless among so many enemies.',0),
(32637,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they\'ve constructed objects that infuse their forces with additional power? This will have to be watched closely.$B$BThank you for your efforts today.',0),
(32638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve made excellent progress today, $C. Rest assured however, our work here is nowhere close to done.',0),
(32639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. As long as we keep the construct numbers in check, we will ensure our success here.',0),
(32640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yours skills as a $C are unquestionable. You\'ve aided the cause greatly this day. You have my thanks.$B$BAnd now for that reward I promised you...',0),
(32641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yours skills as a $C are unquestionable. You\'ve aided the cause greatly this day. You have my thanks.$B$BAnd now for that reward I promised you...',0),
(32643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Red Blossom Leeks into the crate! A Dominance Offensive representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! You have done it, champion!$B$BNow, the Thunder King will taste the full force of the Kirin Tor!',0),
(32646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Witchberries into the crate! An Operation: Shieldwall representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the White Turnips into the crate! A Golden Lotus representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gently place the Green Cabbages into the crate! A Shado-Pan representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incredible work. This presents us with a monumental opportunity.',0),
(32654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your help, we\'re one giant step closer to our goal.',0),
(32655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. That warship won\'t be raining fire on us again any time soon.$B$BTaran Zhu has informed me that the Shado-Pan will keep vigil over Stormsea Landing, freeing up Kirin Tor resources to press the siege elsewhere. Taoshi will be there. I am sure she will be glad to work with you again.$B$BWe are all grateful for your contributions, $n. Thank you.',0),
(32656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it, $C! Shan Bu is dead once and for all, and we\'ve learned that Lor\'themar may not be all that he seems.',0),
(32657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Striped Melons into the crate! Now the August Celestials\' order is ready to go!',0),
(32659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the Mogu Pumpkins into the crate! A Klaxxi representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Torallius is right over there.',0),
(32662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Veron Amberstill is standing just outside the gates to the Ranch.',0),
(32663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! Milli\'s right over there!',0),
(32664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Lelanai right here.',0),
(32665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Old Whitenose here.',0),
(32667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Turtlemaster Odai here.',0),
(32668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Winaestra just outside.',0),
(32669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Ogunaro over there.',0),
(32670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Harb Clawhoof over there.',0),
(32671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Zjolnir over there.',0),
(32672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Zachariah Post here.',0),
(32673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t forget to buy your mount while you are here! You can buy one from Kall Worthaton over there.',0),
(32674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good to see you. You look like you are ready to take to the skies!$B$BRemember, you can buy a flying mount from Drakma, just behind me.',0),
(32675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good to see you. You look like you are ready to take to the skies!\n\nRemember, you can buy a flying mount from Tannec Stonebeak over there.',19116),
(32676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This so-called \"Thunder King\" is surrounded and cut off from his allies. No tyrant is strong enough to stand alone.$B$BYour efforts have not gone unnoticed. Take this, with my thanks.',0),
(32677,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, I know a powerful artifact when I see one. You were wise to bring this here. I will see that Aethas examines it right away - perhaps we can put it to work in our favor.$B$BIn the meantime, take this in trade.',0),
(32678,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must move quickly, $n! The others have gone ahead of us, but I will brief you in the flight over.',0),
(32679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must move quickly, $n! The others have gone ahead of us, but I will brief you in the flight over.',0),
(32680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have arrived just in time, $R. It is crucial we gain control of these shores before the Kirin Tor.$B$BThere is much to explain.',0),
(32681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have arrived just in time, $n. This land needs to be controlled by the Kirin Tor for everyone\'s safety. This will not be an easy task.',0),
(32682,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Why I just knew you could convince him, $n. You\'ve set my heart at ease, knowing the Tillers will be in good hands.',0),
(32683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. You are ready to become a zen master blacksmith.',0),
(32684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Have you come to learn how to fish? You\'re talking to the right person. First, here - have some fish!',0),
(32685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me see... Yes, these are nice. Good job! Here, have some more.',0),
(32686,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will aid lorewalkers and archaeologists in understanding the history of Pandaria.',0),
