(32706,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n.',0),
(32707,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect. I will show you how to use these stones, and then you can spring the ambush.',0),
(32708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very impressive.$B$BShould you find more stones, you should continue this ruse. It is sure to be quite some time before they catch on to our ploy.',0),
(32709,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n.',0),
(32710,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Слизь, бывшая плотью Мясо\'рока, утекает в сточные воды. Судя по всему, он либо мертв, либо получил серьезные повреждения, от которых никогда не оправится.',20338),
(32713,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Скальный ужас крошил все на куски, но вам удалось увернуться от осколков и не задохнуться в облаке пыли.',19865),
(32718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),
(32719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',0),
(32722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),
(32724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work. What you did today brings us one step closer to our ultimate goal.',0),
(32726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. You are ready to become a zen master blacksmith.',0),
(32728,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, good, come... there is work to be done.',0),
(32729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One more to join the Zandalari hunt? Good. Very good.',0),
(32730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have good timing. I am quite in need of your assistance.',0),
(32731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, good, come... there is work to be done.',0),
(32732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have good timing. I am quite in need of your assistance.',0),
(32733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One more to join the Zandalari hunt? Good. Very good.',0),
(32783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So my brother would not dare come himself?',19342),
(32791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Thunderlord think their numbers will save them.$b$bWe will show them that their numbers count for nothing when hunted by a pack of Frostwolves.',19342),
(32792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hrmph. The burning smell of Thunderlord. This pleases me, $c.',19342),
(32794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For many years I hunted all sorts of prey alongside my father. This hunt shall honor his memory as well as avenge his death at the hands of these traitorous, honorless Thunderlords.',19342),
(32795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today is a good day.',19342),
(32796,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ga\'nar is coming. Good. We need his forces if we are to press the advantage.$b$bI can only hope his bloodlust has quelled enough for him to listen to reason.',19342),
(32804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have shown honor to our clan. This act shall be remembered.',19342),
(32805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have the four blessings of the celestials, and you have proven yourself by completing one of their challenges! I knew I saw great potential in you.',0),
(32806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, King Wrynn and the Dark Iron dwarves saved the city, and the bitterly divided Council of Three Hammers gained a new unity under the Alliance banner. How interesting!$B$BBut what is happening within the Horde?',0),
(32807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whaaaat? The remains of an Old God are buried beneath Pandaria? No wonder the land is so haunted!$B$BThe warchief\'s pursuit of those dormant powers are fraying apart the very Horde he leads. His vision is narrow, but very, very dangerous. I must inform the Shado-Pan immediately.',0),
(32808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! I cannot tell you how relieved I am to have some backup!$B$BKing Wrynn himself sent us to gather intel on Garrosh\'s activities and Orgrimmar\'s defenses, but... things are looking grim.$B$BWe need your help.',0),
(32809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see... the warchief is moving tons of supplies through the Barrens... And what\'s this about the Darkspear? The trolls are in open rebellion?! Garrosh certainly has his hands full.$B$BI think I know how we can use this intel. It\'s a crazy idea, but it just might work...',0),
(32810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zen\'tabra narrows her eyes at you.>$B$BWhy de Alliance seek de Darkspear? We fightin\' de \"Warchief,\" sure, but dat don\'t mean we friends. I never trust de Alliance, an\' I ain\'t \'bout ta start now.$B$BStill, dat funny mechanical cat ya have saved me life... so I give you dis. I let ya speak wit\' Vol\'jin.$B$BLet him decide if ya words be venom or honey.$B$BDon\'t be tryin\' nothin\', $C. Ya lift a finger against Vol\'jin, ya life be forfeit.',0),
(32811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Vol\'jin motions to his guards to allow you to come forward and speak.>$B$BDe Barrens be splattered wit\' blood, $R. Ya done right by me.$B$BTell de Alliance ta rally its fleet. When de time comes, de Darkspear an\' de other rebels will try ta hold de harbor for ya. Hellscream made too many enemies ta fight \'em all off at once, hah!$B$B$B$BYa have me thanks, $R. Dis rebellion only gonna get so far wit\'out ya.',0),
(32812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ki\'ta Arrowtusk beckons you over.>$B$BI been waiting for ya, hero. Dis be a time of reckoning.',0),
(32813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'De \"Warchief\" thought we\'d scatter once he sent in de Kor\'kron. Hah. He shoulda sent ev\'ryting he got.$B$BTime ta make \'im pay!',0),
(32814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Razor Hill. We did it, $n! Look to de north - you can almost see Orgrimmar from here.$B$BHellscream gonna figure out who did dis. Hah hah. He gonna be one angry orc.$B$BNext stop is de capital. We gonna need a lot more help. An\' more supplies...',0),
(32815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Huff> Oh, hello- <puff> hello there, young man.$B$BQuite the squall we\'re having up here today, isn\'t it?',0),
(32816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We made it, $C! Thank you so much. Please, help yourself to some of my old knick-knacks.$B$BBut... I am afraid I have not been completely honest with you...',0),
(32819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Sen\'jin is buzzing with activity. Vol\'jin motions for you to approach, a dark sadistic grin spreading across his tired face.>$B$BYa done good, $n. Blood in de Barrens. Hellscream got to be feelin\' that.$B$BNo doubt he gonna come for us, but we gonna be ready...',0),
(32836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great fighting out there! Even if he was just a little guy.$B$BYou\'ve earned every bit of this.',0),
(32838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32839,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты так... так величественно $gпарил:парила; по воздуху! Превосходно!',20490),
(32840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not sure how to feel. I wanted you to win, but then again... I also kinda wanted to see you explode.$B$BNo hard feelings! I just like seeing explosions.',0),
(32842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations!$B$BAlso, how embarrassing would it have been if you got eaten by a beached shark?',0),
(32844,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You left quite a mess behind you, but you did it. Well done, $R!',0),
(32846,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32847,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aww... poor Mecha-Bruce.$B$BI\'ll give you your reward. But I don\'t have to be happy about it.',0),
(32848,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32849,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never thought I\'d say this, but successfully beating up a couple penguins is the sign of a true, tried-and-tested brawler. You\'ve earned your reward.',0),
(32850,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so you\'re $gfound: found it; my treasure. It\'s perfect.$b$bAs a reward, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare call cards.',19342),
(32851,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя, $n, настоящий талант к уничтожению роботов.',20490),
(32852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You ran around that arena so quickly, I got dizzy for a moment.$B$BWell done!',0),
(32854,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I would normally shame someone for fighting a blind person, but in this case, I have to commend you.$B$BBrilliant brawling, $n!',0),
(32856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well! Even if you did get a little lucky...',0),
(32858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you\'ve found one of my treasures. Well done, adventurer.$B$BIn return, I will allow you to purchase one of my rare challenge cards.',0),
(32859,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at you! You went into that arena and beat Ty\'thar at his own game.$B$BHere. You deserve this.',0),
(32861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can custom-tailor the cloak to your preferred abilities. Choose wisely!$B$BThe cloak contains only a fraction of its potential power. I\'m already hatching a plan to augment it...',0),
(32862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ki\'ta Arrowtusk chuckles to himself.> I see you made a whole lotta Kor\'kron heads roll for dese supplies.$B$BWell mon, Vol\'jin was right to commend you. Dese supplies will be lastin\' us an entire week.',0),
(32863,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve heard stories about some of your matches circulating around, apparently they were quite a sight to behold! I think you\'ve earned this reward. Congratulations, trainer, and keep up the good work.',0),
(32867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Vol\'jin nods at you.>$B$B$C. Looks like ya just chose a side.$B$BI hope ya ready ta fight.',0),
(32868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bow to you who continues to walk in the footfalls of the great Pandaren fables.',0),
(32869,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bow to you who continues to walk in the footfalls of the great Pandaren fables.',0),
(32870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready for your next adventure, $C?$B$BOur campaign is nearing its conclusion...',0),
(32871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The troll does not have a strong grasp of the common tongue, and his throat is still bandaged from a knife wound. But the meaning of his words is clear.>$B$BWhat de Alliance want wit\' ol\' Vol\'jin, hmm? Zen\'tabra says we got a common enemy. That don\'t make us friends.$B$BBut... Maybe we can work together dis once. You want to strangle de Warchief, hm? Shut \'im out?$B$B<Vol\'jin smiles disarmingly, his grin slow and savage.>',0),
(32872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ki\'ta Arrowtusk chuckles to himself.> I see you made a whole lotta Kor\'kron heads roll for dese supplies.$B$BWell mon, Vol\'jin was right to commend you. Dese supplies will be lastin\' us an entire week.',0),
(32892,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Welcome my friend. I am very glad that I was able to get your attention. Great deeds are at work that require a hero such as yourself.',0),
(32895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It be good to see dat some Alliance have a sense of loyalty.',0),
(32896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, it be good to see your face again, $n.',0),
(32900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n, you did it! Before I forget, here\'s the special surprise I promised -- I hope you like it.$B$BNow tell me all about the adventure. Did you face certain death? Meet any friends? I wish I had more friends like you.',0),
(32901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n, you did it! Before I forget, here\'s the special surprise I promised -- I hope you like it.$B$BNow tell me all about the adventure. Did you face certain death? Meet any friends? I wish I had more friends like you.',0),
(32929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine headcount, commander.',19342),
(32943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the scallions into the crate! A Sunreaver Onslaught representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throw the juicycrunch carrots into the crate! A Kirin Tor Offensive representative will be along shortly for pick-up.',0),
(32974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The dirt here looks overturned. Perhaps something is buried beneath.>',0),
(32975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Another pile of dirt! Could there be something buried here?>',0),
(32976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The ancient chest has not been disturbed for a long time.>',0),
(32979,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Опять ты? Ну надо же, и все-то тебе нипочем – и Громоборцы, и огры. Ха!',19342),
(32980,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы пришли, чтобы просить помощи у стихий. Теперь я понимаю, что это мы должны помочь им.$b$bИдем, $p. Хочу, чтобы ты $gувидел:увидела; то же, что и я.',19342),
(32981,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Strag was the puppet of the Iron Wolf. She would do nothing unless ordered to by him.$b$bThis made us weak, changing us from a force to be feared to a target.$b$bIf this is what the Thunderlord have become then I will have no part of them.',19342),
(32983,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, |3-6($c).$b$bКогда придет время спасать Экзурота, помощь детей нам пригодится.',19342),
(32984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это древняя магия, она была здесь еще до пришествия орков. С ней нелегко будет справиться.',19342),
(32985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Крон повержен, и я наконец-то могу пробиться сквозь магию, которая сдерживает Экзурота. Но, возможно, что уже слишком поздно. Магнароны и горены вытянули из него слишком много силы.$b$BБоюсь, сейчас мы можем лишь дать этому духу спокойно умереть.',19342),
(32989,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$p! They told me you\'d be heading this way. You are late to the party! We are just cleaning up now.',19342),
(32990,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re back! But where is Karg?',19342),
(32991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for finding the others. Karg and his captor are one step ahead of us, but they\'re limping.',19342),
(32992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lokra\'s gaze remains fixed on her dying frost wolf.>$B$BWe had them... We had them, Asha. You were so fast. So beautiful.$B$BI failed you, Asha. I am sorry.',19342),
(32993,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Help me out of these chains. We have work to do.',19342),
(32994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See how their machines fail them! There is no better weapon than pure orc muscle!',19342),
(33010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for protecting my family, $p.',19342),
(33013,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Thunderlord apprentices toil under the watchful eye of Blackrock orcs.$B$BUsing lava pools as natural forges, they craft components for a type of weapon never before seen by the Frostwolves: cannons.>',19342),
(33018,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, hello there. I am Lin Chao-Wei.$B$BHave you come here to try my family\'s famous noodle soup?',0),
(33020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You recognize the name, Lin, on the scroll. A few characters down you see the character for \"Recipe.\"$B$BThis must be it!$B$BYour only worry is that the sha energies that manifested themselves in the tales of the pandaren may have corrupted the scroll as well.$B$BThere is only one way to find out....',0),
(33021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, $n. What is it you have there?',0),
(33022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n! With all this grain I think we\'re ready to start.$B$BFor now I think you should try making noodle soup. Try using this recipe I\'ve written down for you. It\'ll make for excellent practice.',0),
(33024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. With this we can make a truly unique soup broth.$B$BI\'ve managed to get some updated schematics for your noodle cart. With this broth, you\'re definitely going to want to upgrade your operation.$B$BNext up: finding the secret ingredient of the Lin secret ingredient noodle soup!',0),
(33026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ooh, these will do nicely, $n.$B$BNow for the final step: the Lin secret ingredient soup\'s secret ingredient.$B$BThat\'s a mouthful!',0),
(33027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. All those people came by to taste your noodle soup and YOU made them so happy!$B$BDon\'t you see? The secret ingredient is in you!$B$BNow go out there and make the world happy with this latest noodle cart!',0),
(33059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have seen enough. Ner\'zhul must be stopped.',19342),
(33062,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As soon as we have enough blessed water from the priestess\'s moonwell, we\'ll break the demon\'s will and use it as a proxy to see into Gul\'var.$B$BThat way, they won\'t know it\'s us scrying upon them.$B$BBut first, we need to weaken their shrouding magic.',19342),
(33066,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now all that\'s left to do is to fashion them together into something strong enough to ensnare Gul\'dan.$B$BLuckily, we can do that right here.',19342),
(33070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to hear that the children are safe. They will remember your heroic deeds for their entire lives.',19342),
(33072,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n. There is much to be done.',19342),
(33075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, stranger! The Prophet spoke of new allies arriving on our shores.$B$BI hear it is thanks to you that my sister is safe.$B$BI owe you a great debt, friend.',19342),
(33076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My trust in you is well placed, young $c.$B$BThis task would have been troublesome for many of my students, and yet you finished it with ease.',19342),
(33077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank you child, thank you, thank you.$B$BThe nights in the swamp are cold. It means a lot to this old woman to have some comfort from her aching bones.',19342),
(33078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my, I see, I see! These writings will give me much insight into the Shadowmoon clan\'s culture.$B$BThank you, $n.',19342),
(33080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it, $n! Boy, am I glad to see you.',19342),
(33081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could never have done it without you, $n. Your words unlocked something within me which I have not felt before.$B$BCall it what you wish - resolve, conviction, faith. I will not soon forget this, $c.',19342),
(33082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will find new traditions. My people will become something... new.',19342),
(33083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shadowmoon are not simple opponents. Your fighting skill is truly comparable to none.',19342),
(33084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant, just brilliant! Ay\'ve never seen such a haul in my entire life!$B$BGet tha wagons ready. We\'re eatin\' well tonight!',19342),
(33087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready for your next adventure?',0),
(33088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re here! How long have I been waiting for you?$B$B<Wrathion appears momentarily confused.>$B$BI feel like I just arrived... but maybe I\'ve been here for weeks... This island plays with one\'s head.$B$BKairoz has been trying to explain it to me, but sometimes I think bronze dragons speak in riddles.',0),
(33098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful, these are exactly what I need.$B$B<Wrathion holds one of the coins up, admiring it in the glow of the unmoving sun.>$B$BI will deconstruct their mysterious power, and use their timelessness to enhance your cloak. You will be most pleased with the result.',0),
(33100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An impressive display of martial skill, $C! You have truly walked the path of the emperor, and demonstrated the very traits pandaren value most.',0),
(33104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Step forward, my champion.$B$BThis is your hour.',0),
(33105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Wrathion is FURIOUS. News of Hellscream\'s defeat and King Wrynn\'s gesture of peace must\'ve already reached the black dragon\'s ears.>',0),
(33111,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Unfortunate that the ancient guardians of the woods fell to such corruption.$B$BAt least now, its long nightmare has ended. Not to mention its sacrifice is our gain.',19342),
(33112,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gul\'dan is there! We must move quickly to capture him.',19342),
(33113,396,6,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Thank you, $n. The White Lady will be pleased.$B$BNow, I shall go about the business of preparing the moonwell water for use in the archmage\'s plan.$B$BBut first, I wonder if you\'d be willing to help me again. The warden brought back very disturbing stories about the creatures in the woods.',19342),
(33114,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve forged the soul trap. There\'s no time to waste, $n.$B$BWe must capture Gul\'dan.',19342),
(33115,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that the veil has been lifted from the woods, we can make use of the demon.$B$BWe will convince it to turn its eye upon Gul\'var and show us what the Shadow Council is planning.',19342),
(33116,2,1,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Unfortunate, but not surprising. At least we were able to defeat one of the inner council members.$B$BAll is not lost, $n. We know what the Shadow Council is up to and where they\'re heading.$B$BWe\'ll regroup in Talador. Together, we\'ll put an end to Teron\'gor and his plans for Auchindoun.$B$BDid you hear that?',19342),
(33119,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you, outsider? I saw you freeing some of my kin...',19342),
(33120,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grim business. I wish that it could have gone differently.$B$BThank you for your dedication, $n. Be comforted in the fact that Elune understands.',19342),
(33125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Устроив погребение должным образом, ты $gвосстановил:восстановила; честь клана, $n.',20574),
(33132,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The wolf is dead? *(coughing): Fine.',20574),
(33133,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пусть звезды улыбаются тебе, $n.',19342),
(33134,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the stars smile upon you, $n.',18414),
(33135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every world is better off without those demon-loving scum.',0),
(33136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, I can see the look in your eyes. I have heard of your deeds in the tournament. You are ready to choose a companion!$B$BThis one time I will gift you these two additional coins. Use them wisely, as you will only be able to earn one coin each week from this point forward.',0),
(33137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A true leader stands before me. It is my honor to grant you this coin, $n.',0),
(33138,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наш прекрасный Вечноцветущий дол. Так много разрушений и жестокости. Но... я чувствую, что есть надежда.',19865),
(33146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work $n! Everyone always loves it when they hear that you\'ll be making noodle soup. People come from all over Pandaria just to try a taste.',0),
(33147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see that? Even now, he keeps fluttering.',19865),
(33156,3,1,273,0,0,2,2,0,'',22624),
(33160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! Well met, $n!$B$BI was told you would be coming, but had not expected you so soon.$B$B...or has it been a long while? It is difficult to tell, here.$B$BSo! Shall we begin?',0),
(33161,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22624),
(33168,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quickly, place the heart in the forge. We\'ll use its infernal heat to forge the trap.',19342),
(33211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is the great burden of the Historian - should Azeroth\'s timeways come under attack, we must reconstruct history exactly as it happened, or the consequences could be dire. As we spread our stories and knowledge, so do we create a stronger future for us all.',18414),
(33222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You cheated! I know it!',0),
(33228,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',24461),
(33229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The eyes of the gnome woman reflect light with a copper glow. She\'s not who she seems.$b$b$n! I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time. The bronze dragons need your help again.',19116),
(33230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The eyes of the gnome woman reflect light with a copper glow. She\'s not who she seems.$b$b$n! I\'ve been waiting for you for a long time. The bronze dragons need your help again.',19243),
(33231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see Chronormu has made good on her promise! You are right on time.',0),
(33232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see Chronormu has made good on her promise! You are right on time.',0),
(33234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого, да она правда мясистая! Представляю, какой суп я из нее приготовлю! Вот, держи за нее несколько вневременных монет.',0),
(33235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Оно такое… мягкое! Немного соевого соуса и масла… Вот, держи свою плату!',0),
(33236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Таких друзей – за бока и в музей! Ха-ха, это я так шучу. Дам тебе несколько монет, раз уж ты не ворчливый!',0),
(33238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'На этом окороке такие интересные полоски. Интересно, как они повлияют на вкус блюда. Все же я сначала немного отобью это мясо. Да, это ему не повредит. Вот, возьми небольшую плату за твои труды!',0),
(33239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Никогда раньше не видел таких яиц. Где ты его достал? Оно такое прекрасное! Даже и не знаю, смогу ли я решиться его разбить. Шучу, шучу. Из него получится замечательный омлет. Держи свои монеты!',0),
(33248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Proving Grounds, $C. I am Trial Master Rotun.$B$BHere, you may test your skill at performing several different combat roles: dealing damage, absorbing damage, and healing. I shall administer and judge these trials.$B$B$B$BAre you ready to begin?',0),
(33249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Proving Grounds, $C. I am Trial Master Rotun.$B$BHere, you may test your skill at performing several different combat roles: dealing damage, absorbing damage, and healing. I shall administer and judge these trials.$B$B$B$BAre you ready to begin?',0),
(33250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is astounding, an egg like this hasn\'t been seen on Pandaria for thousands of years. I believe some of our more ancient scrolls will detail how best to handle it, though many are written in Mogu. I had best get to translating, then!',0),
(33252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small tag on this present reads:$B$BHappy holidays, $n!',0),
(33255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, to destroy these orcs once and for all.',19342),
(33256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did it, $n. Without your heroic efforts, the Temple of Karabor would have been lost to the Iron Horde.$B$BProphet Velen would be proud of us.',19342),
(33263,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the Light. <Cough> I didn\'t think I would get out of here alive.',19342),
(33269,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every world is better off without those demon-loving scum.',19342),
(33271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Something is moving under all of these roots.>',19342),
(33331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The podlings are vicious creatures. The critters of this forest would surely have gone extinct if you didn\'t intervene.',19342),
(33332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you have it! Excellent!$B$BA cursory glance indicates that my presumptions were not far-fetched. Though the pages are worn and waterlogged, most of the entries are still legible. It appears that our friend, explorer Harrington, was quite verbose in cataloguing the creatures and treasures he found on his journey through the island.$B$BWell, are you simply going to stand there? This tome is a veritable trove of mysteries, and we have barely scratched the surface! Adventure awaits!',0);
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` VALUES
(33333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am happy that you have discovered some riches for your efforts, though we are no closer to unraveling this mystery than before. Take solace in the knowledge that many such bounties are surely scattered throughout the island, eagerly awaiting your exploration skills and combat prowess.$B$BOh, one last thing, my young adventurer - do not forget to look to the skies now and again.',0),
(33334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An interesting story of combat and bravery, though I fear that we learned little from your endeavors save that you are quite the adventurer. It seems that we find ourselves at an impasse with each twist and turn of this tale. Time is a fickle mistress.$B$BYou may wish to spend some time honing your skills here, before the sun sets.',0),
(33335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In my pride, I sought to keep Pandaria a secret, and once again I have found myself learning great lessons from this land. I am glad to be able to share my stories with my people, once again, in that they may learn as I have, and learn from my mistakes. Perhaps you, too, can still learn a thing or two from the lessons of Pandaria.',0),
(33336,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22624),
(33337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How very intriguing. I will have to make some additional modifications, and perhaps locate a more proper catalyst. Thank you for performing this experiment, I trust that you did not experience any adverse effects? Should you feel up to the task, I may have use of your services again shortly.',0),
(33338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Give me a moment to grind the stones and add them to the hourglass, and we shall see what new events unfold.$B$BIt\'s really quite convenient, I\'ve a particular affinity for specific moments, rather than lengthy chains of events.$B$BThe timeways tell me that we will have need of its power many times in the near future.',0),
(33340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The island gives in abundance, in nutriment and in answers. You only need look around to find what you seek.',0),
(33341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have experienced the power and wisdom of the Celestials. Let it flow through you now, and remain in your heart for all time.',0),
(33342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your accomplishments are many, and your bravery cannot be questioned. The Ordon have been driven back for the moment, but do not underestimate them. To restore harmony to the isle, we must continue to be vigilant.',0),
(33343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The emissaries of Ordos have been silenced, for a time.$B$BKnow that anger, violence, and hatred will never cease. Wherever there is the darkness within one\'s spirit, you will find these Sha awaiting you. They may become manifest in many forms: a warlord hungering for power, a dagger in your back in the night, a young prince following a dark path, and even your own battle against forces not aligned with your own.$B$BLearn from the lessons of these emotions, lest you lose yourself to the darkness.',0),
(33344,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ogres appear to be in disarray and many of my people are now free.',19342),
(33354,1,4,0,0,0,4,0,0,'Наконец-то этот монстр убит! Спасибо тебе.',19702),
(33358,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work $n! Everyone always loves it when they hear that you\'ll be making noodle soup. People come from all over Pandaria just to try a taste.',0),
(33359,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello again, $n. You\'re just in time.$B$BWe\'ve tracked the Shadow Council to a nearby village. I suspect that Gul\'dan is with them.',19342),
(33374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let this be your daily lesson, and let it hone your strength, wisdom, and fortitude.',0),
(33375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A tale of true heroism, and a powerful moment in history. But not quite what we are after, I am afraid.$B$BNot much time remains - I shall double my efforts.',0),
(33376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Was that... me? How very interesting.$B$BNow we are beginning to see the shadows between worlds. Was this the future of our world, or simply one possibility? Regardless, our newfound ability to see more deeply into the timeways will allow us to push forward towards the answers we seek.$B$BAllow me some time to continue my research. And be vigilant, hero, for the timeways are as infinite as our enemies.',0),
(33377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stormwind... destroyed?$B$BI realize that this vision may come as a shock to you. I know little more than you at this time. I will do my best to search for answers, you have my word.',0),
(33378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, it seems that our little prince has a role to play yet. We should not speak further of this, lest we alter the future ourselves.$B$BThe woods have ears, hero. Keep silent, we will find our answers in time.',0),
(33379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Soridormi, the prime consort of Nozdormu, dead? And I was there as well?$B$BWe cannot know what this means, or what will come to pass, or even if this vision takes place in our timeway. You must speak of this vision to no one, lest we alter the course of time and cause great danger to us all. All we can do now is complete the Vision of Time - it will show us what the future truly holds.',0),
(33408,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many were killed or wounded on their way here.',19342),
(33410,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This room shook when the monster fell. Your deeds shall not go unremembered.',19342),
(33412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Igrimar winces as you show her Durotan\'s orders.>$b$bDon\'t look at me like that... ungh... I\'ve survived worse.',19342),
(33419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My prayers have been answered, hero. I will tell everyone back at the village of your deeds.',19342),
(33427,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно, командир. Я посмотрю, какие силы мы можем направить туда для дальнейшей зачистки.',19342),
(33444,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorens are just monsters. They were created to eat this world. You\'ve done a good job...',19342),
(33450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well in this, but do not become proud. This land has dangers far greater than what you have seen here.',19342),
(33454,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done the Frostwolf Clan a service, traveler. I shall be sure to tell Durotan of your deeds.',19342),
(33461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice! Thanks so much! I can use these to make a delicious wolf meat, frog leg, mushroom stew.',19342),
(33462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With a quick tap of a hammer and a snip of the rings, the Thunderlord Grapple is as good as new.',19342),
(33467,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive work.',19342),
(33468,547,397,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Durotan\'s trust in you is well-placed, $n. You have mine as well.',19342),
(33469,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wolf Home is saved, but I sense a stronger enemy just over the horizon.',19342),
(33470,397,0,0,0,1000,0,0,0,'This Iron Tide threatens to sweep over all of Draenor.$B$BThe pool has shown you a possible future. This vision of the Frostwolf clan\'s destruction must not be allowed to come to pass.$B$BYou must stop it, $n.',19342),
(33473,397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grim news indeed, $n.$B$BFor saving Wolf Home, I would name you wolf-$g brother:sister;.$B$BNow we must defend Frostfire Ridge from the Thunderlord clan and the Iron Horde.',19342),
(33483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my sincere gratitude, $n.',19342),
(33484,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found Mulverick?\n\nIt shouldn\'t be long before those ogres clear out after you defeated their master.',19342),
(33493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lokra has always lacked the patience and control of her older sister. She approaches problems head-first, and relies on her raw talents to succeed.$B$BSeeing the way her and Karg look at each other, I am not surprised she chased him all the way to Grom\'gar. What surprises me is that they made it back.$B$BAs usual, I expect we have you to thank for that. You continue to honor us with your deeds.',19342),
(33513,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа – но это только полдела. Теперь, когда вестник смерти Черношип лишился поддержки, пришло время покончить с ним.',23877),
(33514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы молодцы, $n! Теперь, когда филактерия Амненнара находится под защитой рода красных драконов, мы наконец можем вздохнуть спокойно.',19342),
(33526,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are no ordinary enemies, yet you did not show any signs of weakness.',19342),
(33527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We called you outsider, $r, but you have shown the strength and heart of a Frostwolf.',19342),
(33530,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If this Teron\'gor gains control of Auchindoun, the results would be catastrophic!$B$BWe must stop him before his power grows!',19342),
(33533,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Gorgrond, commander. We just arrived too.',20574),
(33543,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha! Curious. What are you?',19342),
(33544,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ripfist\'s dying wish has been satisfied. Goren corpses litter the ground, and these corpses have not gone unnoticed by the nearby goren.',19342),
(33546,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gol\'kosh has completed his mission, then.',19342),
(33548,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are more than fancy facewear. With a mask and some proper incentive, we can make anyone a Laughing Skull.',19342),
(33563,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These puppets of the magnaron will pay for the skulls they claimed today.$b$bFor now, I shall wear this eye across my waist so this fool you have slain may watch as I slowly slaughter his brethren until my dying breath.',19342),
(33578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed him? Oh, oh thank you!$B$BBut what was that he said about an artifact?',19342),
(33579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was worried my little act wouldn\'t fool you, but you played your role perfectly.$B$BIn fact, I would like to ask for your help again.',19342),
(33580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mark my words, $r: Aruuna and Veil Shadar were only the beginning.',19342),
(33581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes. Excellent work, these are some of my favorites.$B$BKnowledge is power, and now I can leave for the spires feeling well-armed.',19342),
(33582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Speaking of fortune, count yourself lucky that I was not among the defenders in Aruuna, for you\'d have seen both ends of your guts before you laid eyes on the Fire-Sage.$B$BAh, sometimes I miss those days.$B$BHere is your coin.',19342),
(33586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I felt that this day would come. The draenei prophet is not wrong to seek me, traveler.$B$BThough we do not speak often, he and I have a deep mutual respect for one another.$B$BI know the trouble that his people are suffering, and I no longer believe the Shadowmoon are following our ancestor\'s path.$B$BFor those reasons, I will help you.',19342),
(33593,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That didn\'t seem to do much, commander, except to give away our position to every creature in Gorgrond.$b$bWait, did you hear something?',19342),
(33622,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Again we meet...',19342),
(33633,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You feed the hungry boar the nopales. He devours them whole and smacks his lips.$b$bRooter jumps up onto you and licks your face with his disgusting tongue.$b$bIt looks like you have made a new friend.',19243),
(33657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have accomplished great things. We could not have captured this citadel without you.',19342),
(33660,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they started storing their herbs in personal stashes instead of their storage dens, good to know.$b$bYou have helped me a great deal $p.',19342),
(33661,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are good strong hearts! You have done well $c and I will hold my end of the bargain.',19342),
(33662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Надо спешить, пока растения не поняли, что путь свободен.',19342),
(33663,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, but we need to move quickly before the plants realize the way is open...',19342),
(33685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So that is why the saberon have barricaded themselves up there. They are good hunting $p, and I want to get in there!$b$bI have an idea about that...',19342),
(33689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They just keep coming back! I would hate to lose this hunting ground. We shall find a way to clear this growth, I swear it.',19342),
(33694,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marrow sent you? Our village destroyed? I would have been back already if it wasn\'t for these cursed plant beasts!',19342),
(33695,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have... you have brought me the bloom. At last my purpose can be fulfilled!',19342),
(33706,15,1,0,0,0,2,0,0,'At last it is done.  Dionor has left and his spawn shall follow him in due time.$b$bI grow weary of this conflict and the desire to return to the Overgrowth has left me.$b$bPerhaps I will travel beyond these lands and see what other surprises you little beasts have to share...',19342),
(33720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A prototype Iron Shredder, huh?! I bet we can get this thing working... they didn\'t have ME to fix it!',19342),
(33721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I always love a good explosion.',19342),
(33722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will have fewer enemies to deal with at our backs. Lok\'tar.',19342),
(33724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lots of detail... almost as if a goblin wrote it!',19342),
(33728,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orgrim seems to be up to no good.',19342),
(33729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'-- ENEMIES ELIMINATED --',19342),
(33730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gazlowe has been invaluable in securing Talador. Now, it is up to us.',19342),
(33731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I cannot believe Orgrim is truly dead. Blackhand has carved a hole in my heart, and I intend to destroy him when the opportunity presents itself.',19342),
(33734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.',19342),
(33735,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe we can use these at Archenon Siegeyard.',19342),
(33736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is a relief to know that their weapons of war cannot be used against us.',19342),
(33740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their deaths will not bring back Aruuna, but it does give me comfort to know that some among us can stand against them.',19342),
(33754,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orgrim leads these orcs? Why has he pledged himself to the Iron Horde?',19342),
(33756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, and nice time!',0),
(33761,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My notes! In the chaos, I completely forgot about them!$B$BThis is my life\'s work, $p. I cannot thank you enough.',19342),
(33765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The forests are clear of Shadowmoon enemies? Good. I knew that you would not fail.',19342),
(33784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I now understand how you were able to rescue my clan from the clutches of slavery. Such power!',19342),
(33785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Karg scoops up a handful of snow and cleans the gore from his axe.>$B$BYou fight well.',19342),
(33786,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander! Am I glad to see you.$b$bWe have a situation here.',19342),
(33787,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bang-up job, $n! The base is just about ready.',19342),
(33788,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gidwin is looking much better. Thank you, $n.$b$bWe have just enough elixir here to help the others.',19342),
(33793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew I could trust this task to you, $n.',19342),
(33794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are taking care of the survivors now. We owe their lives to you. Thank you, $n.',19342),
(33795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. My acolytes will study these in great detail. With any luck, we will be able to use this knowledge to defeat the Shadowmoon.',19342),
(33807,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Frostwolf clan cannot be held like beasts.$B$BYou fight with honor, $n.',19342),
(33808,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, that was fast! Ok, let\'s get to it!',19342),
(33813,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Squiggy is okay!',19342),
(33814,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, welcome, commander! Just the person I wished to see.',19342),
(33815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for returning with my people, and I welcome you as an honored guest.',19342),
(33816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you choose to continue to help our clan, the other Shamanstones will sense your closeness to the Frostwolves and might bless you with more gifts.',19342),
(33826,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nerok and I are the only surviving prisoners, but we cannot leave just yet.',19342),
(33828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Iron Horde combines the strengths of every clan. We must continue looking for ways to sever those connections if we hope to defeat them.',19342),
(33833,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ivory death is slain? Impressive, traveler.$B$BThanks to you, we are all safer with Kuu\'rat gone. I will share news of this deed with the other villagers.',19342),
(33834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By the elders of Karabor... that thing is huge!$B$BOur trade routes will be safe once again. Well... as safe as you can be running through the northern forests.$B$BWell done, $c!',19342),
(33836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, adventurer! We can rest more easily knowing that this beast has been put to its end.',19342),
(33837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Prophet Velen is gone, and yet there is no time to mourn.$B$BWe will honor Velen\'s passing once the Iron Horde have fled from these hills.$B$BNow, champion, is the time to fight!',19342),
(33838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect timing. The steel of the blade is still malleable. A few more strikes and my work shall be complete.',19342),
(33868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The shaman grins at the harsh, windblown shore.>$b$bWelcome to the home of my people, $n.',19342),
(33871,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я – провидица Малунэ, великая хранительница воспоминаний. Наконец-то мне выпала честь встретиться с тобой.',19116),
(33872,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. With this dust and Aruunem berries I will craft the draught of the dead.',19342),
(33873,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you did not eat any berries. I\'m not sure what I would do if you were to die.',19342),
(33874,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Some memories are better left forgotten. Thank you, $n.$B$BI will return you to our world.',19342),
(33882,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе! Теперь мы сможем отправиться в безопасное место.',19342),
(33884,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Невероятно! В одиночку одолеть Шер\'хаана... Твоей храбрости нет предела!$b$bТеперь можно никого не бояться! Разве что жутких орков, гигантских птиц, бегемотов, птицелюдей, пауков, пожара...$b$bЗнаешь, пожалуй, не стоит мне тут жить одному...',19342),
(33898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got the fire in you alright.',19342),
(33905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful. That should slow down the attack.$B$BOur forces should be able to retake the forest quickly.',19342),
(33915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n. Уверен, что теперь-то Орак дважды подумает, прежде чем куда-то уходить в одиночку.',20574),
(33917,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We can take it from here. Light\'s blessings to you, $c.',19342),
(33918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good. We don\'t be needin\' a gronn bearin\' down on us before we get our defenses all established.',19342),
(33919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gutsmash is dead? I\'ll drink to that. You\'re alright, $n.',19342),
(33920,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Soulbinder Nyami\'s lips curl into a smile.>$B$BWell done. Only two pieces remain. I\'ve already dispatched my soulbinders to track them down.',19342),
(33928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Incineratus examines the core as you explain the circumstances behind its acquisition>$b$bIndeed, slag elementals should not exist upon the plateau. The plateau has grown unstable, causing the elemental spirits there to devolve and mutate.$b$bSo long as an earthen fury is absent from the throne, the imbalance in the elements will worsen.$b$bGordawg must return to the Throne of Elements if balance is to be maintained.',19342),
(33929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shivertail snuggles up to his mother. He is clearly happy to be reunited with most of his pack.',19342),
(33931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha!',0),
(33944,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $gдобрый путник:добрая странница;! Поверить не могу, что Шер\'хаан утащил моего Рики.$b$bТы $gтакой храбрый:такая храбрая;!',19342),
(33955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You scared the baby.',20574),
(33958,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just as I suspected. Thank you, $n. With Sha\'tari back in our possession there is only one piece of the Heart left to retrieve.',19342),
(33967,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bless you, $n. There have been enough innocent lives taken today.',19342),
(33969,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We were wise to not underestimate the threat of a land turned against us.',19342),
(33970,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just as I suspected. Thank you, $n. With Sha\'tari back in our possession there is only one piece of the Heart left to retrieve.',19342),
(33971,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bless you, $n. There have been enough innocent lives taken today.',19342),
(33972,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Mehlar smiles.>$B$BIt would seem that the tide of this war is shifting in our favor.',19342),
(33973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. Now that I know it is out of the hands of the Iron Horde, I can die peacefully.',19342),
(33976,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! I will take Auch\'naaru to Auchindoun. The Shadow Council has no place in our lands.',19342),
(33988,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The souls of the citizens of Telmor will no longer be used to empower the Shadow Council leader.',19342),
(34012,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Marauder Sasha nods and weaves two necklaces>',20574),
(34013,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With these, we can account for our fallen and rebuild. We will persevere.',19342),
(34019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your aid in retaking Teluuna Observatory has not gone unnoticed, hero. I grow increasingly impressed at your prowess in battle.$B$BPerhaps you could share some of your knowledge with my disciples. They could learn much from a seasoned adventurer such as yourself.$B$BI have something for you, as a thanks for what you\'ve done even in the short time you\'ve been here. Perhaps it will help you get this garrison of yours on its feet.',19342),
(34026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ach! $GSir:Miss; $p, ye\'ve arrived just in time!',19342),
(34027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I KNEW somethin\' was wrong! IN YER FACE, Alexston!$B$BAh, excuse me.$B$BNow, where have I seen machines like this before?$B$BOh yeah! The Dark Iron!',19342),
(34028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mmf! Mm- mff!!$B$B<You remove his gag.>$B$BTHEY GOT THAELIN!!',19342),
(34029,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Close enough!',19342),
(34030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$p! Oh, yer a sight for sore eyes!$B$BThe prototype mole machine was able to track me here all the way from the shop? I even impress myself sometimes.$B$BNow that I know Hansel is safe, I can enact the brilliant escape plan I\'ve been working on. Glad to have ye here for this!',19342),
(34031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For the record, the mines don\'t have any voice commands.$B$BI learned that lesson awhile back...',19342),
(34032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, there she is.$B$BThank you, $p. Let\'s get out of here, shall we?',19342),
(34033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I guess it\'s safe to say my old workshop is compromised. We\'ll have to find a new place to set up shop...',19342),
(34034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Gazlowe\'s face brightens as you hand over the bulging bag of coins.>$B$BHeyyy! Now we\'re talking!$B$BI usually prefer not to get my hands dirty, but for that kind of cash you could get me to field-strip a kor\'kron outhouse.$B$BGlad to have some muscle here to back me up - and since I\'m such a nice guy, here\'s a little somethin\' for your troubles.',19342),
(34035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya know... this thing is actually pretty impressive.$B$BThe drive system seems... familiar...',19342),
(34039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Gazlowe fishes around in his pouch before producing a single gold piece.>$B$BErr... looks like I\'m a little short. Personal bodyguard fees really add up!$B$BI\'ll give you a proper cut when we get back to your garrison. Come on, you know I\'m good for it!',19342),
(34040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s Darkanvil\'s signature! I knew I\'d seen that work somewhere before.$B$BThaelin Darkanvil is a Dark Iron dwarf who came to Draenor with the Alliance forces, and a damn brilliant engineer. We have what you might call a friendly rivalry.$B$BBut why\'s Thaelin making weapons for the Iron Horde?',19342),
(34041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not a bad haul. Here\'s yer cut!',19342),
(34042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry, Thaelin can handle himself. That was my good deed for the year - don\'t tell nobody!$B$BHey... you think I can write off that fuel as a business expense?',19342),
(34043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you\'ve arrived. Rulkan\'s message said that you would not be long.',19342),
(34048,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There, my beauties are safely out of the hands of the Iron Horde. No more orcs poppin\' out of the ground!$B$BThere\'s just one more thing I need to do before I can leave with a clear conscience.',19342),
(34054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We saved everyone we could, $n. We were too late for the others... including my sister.$b$bProphet Velen is right. When it is asked of us, we ALL must fight. I promise this: I will never again let my loved ones suffer.$b$bNer\'zhul is close to calling down the Dark Star. We are the only ones who can stop him.',19342),
(34066,66,0,0,0,500,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, |3-6($c).$b$bПеред тем, как продолжить наступление, надо найти припасы, которые помогли бы нам в бою.',20574),
(34067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rope? What am I supposed to do with it? Tie a noose and tell Thunderbirds to hang themselves? Wait... and I have an idea. Yeah, I think I can find a way to use that rope. Great.',19342),
(34069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хм, да, эти копья очень хороши.$b$bНеплохо! Я знаю, что можно с ними сделать!',20574),
(34070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошая работа, $n! Наездники больше не угрожают нам. Но не спеши убирать оружие, для тебя еще найдется дело.',20574),
(34072,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фу, ну и вонища! Нет-нет, не нужно мне их показывать – я охотно поверю тебе на слово.$b$bТеперь давай сматываться отсюда, пока меня не засек очередной патруль Громоборцев.',20574),
(34073,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошая работа, $n, мне удалось во время неразберихи пробраться в лагерь.$b$bОсталась лишь одна задача.',20574),
(34075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n.$b$bКонечно, жаль, что нельзя воскресить его, чтобы убить снова, ну да ладно.$b$bНадеюсь, дух моей малышки теперь спокоен.',20574),
(34078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Told you I was good for it!',19342),
(34087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orgrim leads the Iron Horde in Talador... Now we know the face of our enemy.',19342),
(34088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Iron Horde has no consideration for the wonders of the forest. In death, they will know respect.',19342),
(34089,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe we can use these explosives against the Iron Horde.',19342),
(34090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing like a good explosion to warm the heart.',19342),
(34091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A prototype Iron Shredder, huh?! I bet we can get this thing working... they didn\'t have Thaelin Darkanvil to fix it!',19342),
(34092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You radiate the power of the Ango\'rosh!$B$B<Restalaan smiles.>$B$BIt is time to take this battle to Teron\'gor\'s doorstep.',19342),
(34093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hrm, yes these spears look pretty good. Outstanding $n! I know just what to use these for!',0),
(34094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wondered why the manual was so big... they write with really big letters!',19342),
(34095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They will be unable to use those weapons against us when we attack Tuurem.',19342),
(34096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a lot of orcs, eh? Glad I\'m here tinkerin\' away instead of in the thick of it.',19342),
(34097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'-- ENEMIES ELIMINATED --',19342),
(34098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The screams of our enemies washed over me. The people of Tuurem are avenged.',19342),
(34099,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maraad is dead... but we must carry on. I will not let his sacrifice be for nothing.',19342),
(34102,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n! $b$bЗнамена клана Северного Волка, реющие над трупами наших врагов, наполняют мое сердце гордостью!$b$bПусть навеки запомнят гнев Северных Волков!',20574),
(34103,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have no idea how you managed to track down the creature so close to the Horde base, but well done $Gsir:madame;.',19342),
(34104,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander! The peasants will be singing songs about your generosity tomorrow.',19342),
(34105,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All hail your glory, commander.',19342),
(34106,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you\'d kill her. No Iron Horde is safe from your wrath.',19342),
(34107,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that what I think it is? You are too kind, commander!',19342),
(34108,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Praise to $n! For the Horde!',19342),
(34122,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Liadrin smiles.>$B$BI knew they\'d see it our way.',19342),
(34123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you. Our clan has faced many challenges, but the sheer size of the army coming toward us is beyond anything we have attempted to face.$b$bWe need your experience.',19342),
(34124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This was a costly victory, and a very painful lesson. We chose to refuse the Iron Horde and live as we always have, but I see now they will never respect such neutrality.$b$bI am not about to wait for the Iron Horde to martial their forces. We will fight with you, and bring the Iron Horde to its knees.$b$bCommander, the Frostwolves stand ready!',19342),
(34144,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Already I can feel the Light triumphing over darkness. We\'ve done it!',19342),
(34154,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Teron\'gor and Gul\'dan... they slaughtered everyone...$B$B...and then they just... disappeared... into the shadows...$B$BHow did they know where to go?',19342),
(34157,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have to hurry... Teron\'gor just left!',19342),
(34163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without the shadow orbs, the main Auchenai force will be able to march on Gul\'rok safely.',19342),
(34164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you... kill a couple more for me on your way out, if you can...',19342),
(34192,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice job, $n! Let\'s get this mining operation started!',19342),
(34193,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n! We will get started planting the garden right away.',19342),
(34194,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Time to see what you can do.',19342),
(34209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n. The archmage and I are in need of your assistance.',19342),
(34216,2,6,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Wolf-$g brother:sister;, already word has traveled to us of your actions at Wor\'gol. You have the eternal respect of the Frostwolf.$B$BNow, who are these strangers that you have brought to us and what is this urgent matter?',19342),
(34227,1,1,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Так грустно, что есть те, кто способен поразить Скверной столь благородных созданий.$B$BТы снова $gпомог:помогла; им, $n. Они не забудут этого.$B$BТеперь пора заняться Советом Теней.',20574),
(34228,274,273,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Этих тварей не было видно давным-давно.$B$BДумаю, их внезапное появление и землетрясения связаны между собой.',20574),
(34229,273,274,25,0,0,3000,3000,0,'Мы слышали о странных бледнокожих орках, которых ты $gвидел:видела;. Они похожи на воителей из Награнда. Хотя нет, этого не может быть...$B$BЧто до огра, его зовут Чо\'Галл. Убей его, если сможешь. Он разрушает все на своем пути.',20574),
(34230,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that’s what you need. We use the magic of the Council of Shadows against themselves.',20574),
(34234,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. The shards are at last together!',19342),
(34240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s not safe here. The Shadow Council has already taken the city!',19342),
(34242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s not safe here. The Shadow Council has already taken the city!',19342),
(34264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rope? What am I supposed to do with it? Tie a noose and tell Thunderbirds to hang themselves? Wait... and I have an idea. Yeah, I think I can find a way to use that rope. Great.',20574),
(34271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gordawg was a mighty ally. The elements will mourn the loss of the fury, but death was the only answer. Gordawg would not have wished to stay a slave to evil.$b$bThough Gordawg is no more, the heart of a fury is eternal and unbreakable. In time, this brightly glowing heart will take shape into a new earthen fury.$b$bSuch is the cycle of life upon the Elemental Plateau.',19342),
(34277,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надо было убить их еще у Темного портала, и пес с ними, с последствиями.',20574),
(34278,274,25,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Чтобы отомстить за их злодеяния, этого недостаточно.$B$B$n, когда найдешь их лагерь, посыпь землю солью.',20574),
(34279,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blouse never wins before. $b$bBlouse follow the little one, Blouse wants to learn to fight.',20574),
(34280,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gul\'dan is there! To catch him, you must act very quickly!',20574),
(34281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With that ball o\' stone gone I be feelin\' better already!',0),
(34284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well I be a son of a gnome! Am I glad to see you! I was hoping fer a rescue but didn\'t expect da boss tae be here himself!',0),
(34285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank ye, looks like everything\'s still in good shape. Just give me a moment to put this on.',0),
(34286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Secluded cave across the lava, check.$B$BCreepy piles o\' bones, check.$B$BOkay, this looks like the place. We\'re gonna have to watch ourselves, I\'ll bet Borgal isn\'t here alone.',0),
(34287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, I am glad that the spirits have been released from their torment.',0),
(34288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, I can feel that the magic in these is strong.',0),
(34289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was one hell of a battle! Bloody fine job there la... um commander. $B$BOrlana really helped us out there. I\'ll ask around, maybe a priest can think of something we can do for her. $B$BAt any rate, we still have this artifact to deal with. I think you better hold onto it for safe keeping before any power crazed lunatics comes looking for it.',0),
(34291,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сердце? Как мило.$B$BПоспешим. С его помощью мы должны уничтожить кристаллы Скверны и добраться до Гул\'дана.',20574),
(34292,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы должны покончить с ними сейчас. Нельзя рисковать, ведь они могут стать еще сильнее.',20574),
(34293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Necessary business. We don\'t dare risk letting them grow more powerful.',0),
(34294,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The barrier\'s been destroyed. Time to capture Gul\'dan.',20574),
(34295,2,1,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'Неприятно, но ничего удивительного. По крайней мере, нам удалось победить одного из членов Совета.$b$bНо не все потеряно, $n. Нам известны планы Совета Теней и то, куда они направляются.$b$bВ Таладоре мы соберем силы. Вместе мы сможем уничтожить Терон\'крова и не позволим ему захватить Аукиндон.$b$bТы это $gслышал:слышала;?..',20574),
(34309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oi dere mon! Glad to see a friendly face but I not expect da commander ta come out here for me himself!',0),
(34314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah now, dat be feeling much better!',0),
(34315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah dat be me stuff! Give me a moment ta put me stuff on mon. Then, I gonna take me an ogre ear for every bone I had ta pop back in place.',0),
(34316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This be da place. We gonna need ta be careful, Borgal an\' da artifact be in there.',0),
(34318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, I can feel that the magic in these is strong.',0),
(34319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat was a battle for da ages mon! Bwu\'ja be glad ye are here commanda, else I\'d likely be back in da spirit world permanently.$B$BDat Soulgrinda be a nasty piece o\' mojo. Ye be the best one to hold onto it.$B$BDat spirit, she helped us out a lot mon. I hope she find da peace she be seeking now.',0),
(34321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you flesh creature. In the lava the ashes will mix and the cycle shall continue as it has ever since the beginning.',19342),
(34325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The lava already burns bright with the return of my people\'s freedom!$B$BWe will have our revenge upon the ogres for everything they have done to us, this I assure you. But for now, we shall rest.',0),
(34326,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our enemy has been pushed back and Auchindoun\'s defenses restored thanks to your help, but we are not yet done here.',19342),
(34335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Привет, |3-6($c). Это про тебя говорила Чолуна?$B$B<Тизали оглядывает вас с головы до ног и одобрительно кивает.>$B$BХорошо.',19342),
(34336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я и не сомневалась, что ты отлично справишься с этой работой, $n. Результаты меня очень порадовали.',19342),
(34337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так вот он какой! Ну давай посмотрим, что скрывается в этих глубинах.',19342),
(34338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чудом $Gспасся:спаслась;, $n. Отличная работа.',19342),
(34339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ух ты, как интересно! Получается, что горены едят... вообще все подряд!',19342),
(34340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну ничего себе! Потрясающе! Эта кальдера не просто горячая – там все кипит! Спасибо тебе, $n.',19342),
(34341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Мы будем хранить артефакт здесь, в твоем гарнизоне.',19342),
(34344,1,11,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Dem centipedes creep you out boss-mon? Touchin\' ya with their teeny tiny legs? I ain\'t thought of a thing that makes me skin crawl more, except maybe mah sister\'s voice. Hee hee.',19342),
(34345,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha! Ya brought \'em! I hope ya not offended I asked such a lowly task of ya. We needed the leaves, and I needed to settle a bet.',19342),
(34346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, now these be some fine trap making props. Ya know how to make a shadow huntah proud.',19342),
(34347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приказы напрямую от вождя клана Пылающего Клинка!$B$BО ней такое рассказывают... жестокая натура, беспощадный клинок...$B$BОчень хорошо, что ты сразу $gпринес:принесла; приказы мне, $n.',19342),
(34348,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now dat be a mighty fine haul. We gonna be keepin\' all the folks at the garrison warm.$b$bIt seemed like a simple task but ya tackled it like a boss-mon. If ya need a shadow hunter in your ranks, I be willin\' to serve.',19342),
(34351,71,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Light bless you, hero! We need to hold out as long as we can so Nyami can track down the remaining power shards. This pylon will help take the load off of our soulpriests.',19342),
(34352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You have markedly reduced the number of goblins in the Dark Tide Nest. >',20886),
(34353,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And you\'re $gexcellent hunter:excellent hunter;, $n. But our work on this island is not yet complete.',20886),
(34354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done a good thing here today. Don\'t let the blood on your axe blind you.$B$BYou have given these rylaks the peace they deserve.',0),
(34355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потеряв машины, эти слабаки быстрее сдадут свои позиции на острове.$b$bТы хорошо $gпотрудился:потрудилась;, $n.',20886),
(34362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blast it, he\'s given us the slip!$B$BTa make things worse the portal looks like it\'s closed from this side. We\'re gonna have to find a way to track Borgal down or we might be stuck in wherever this is.',0),
(34364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m under orders to obey your orders, commander.',19342),
(34365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудесно, $n. Ты $gбесценный союзник:бесценная союзница;.',19342),
(34375,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should be plenty of wood for now.',19342),
(34378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Right! I think we\'ve got this well in hand now. And hardly an explosion to be found!',19342),
(34379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope you are finding your land agreeable.',19342),
(34380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The clan is prepared. It is time for us to advance on Bladespire Citadel!',19342),
(34381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat ogre, he done give us de slip!$B$B<Bwu\'ja looks around.>$B$BDis place, it be da spirit world! First time I ever walk here in da flesh.$B$BLooks like our path back be blocked and our prey be gone. We gonna have ta go find dat ogre ta get outta dis place.',0),
(34392,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The portal is weakened, but it remains open.$b$bOnly one option remains, $n.',19342),
(34393,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gul\'dan... free. This was not the victory I\'d planned for.$b$bGul\'dan may be loose due to our actions, but I gladly bargain his freedom against the lives of the innocents on the other side of this portal. You made a wise decision, $n.',19342),
(34397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Со смертью их лидеров эта операция обречена на провал.',19342),
(34398,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks to me like we ended up in the right place.',19342),
(34399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Vindicators welcome you, $n.',19342),
(34400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. These moths are typically peaceful creatures and are deserving of mercy.',19342),
(34401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will do nicely, $n. All we need now is a suitable crystal...',19342),
(34402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This land should serve our needs well. I leave it to you to decide how to best use it, commander.',19342),
(34403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n. Собранные тобой чародейские сущности как раз подойдут. Теперь нам нужен лишь подходящий для настройки кристалл...',22810),
(34404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The crystals in this mine are most certainly unique. Thorough study of the samples you have provided should reveal why this is the case.',19342),
(34406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, что $gпомог:помогла; шахтерам выбраться в безопасное место, $n.',22810),
(34407,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I only hope we are enough.',19342),
(34409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $C. You\'re the commander from the garrison?$B$B$B$BGood.',0),
(34410,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Never in my years have I seen anything like this, $n. You have done well today.',0),
(34414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Give me a moment and I will prepare the focusing crystal.',19342),
(34415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Печально, что столь могучее существо пришлось уничтожить, но Ан\'дур был угрозой для всех в Иорунской шахте. Сердце кристаллического гиганта поможет нам восстановить мир.',22810),
(34418,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your valor will give our men reprieve as they work to contain the threat completely. Well done.',19342),
(34420,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the Dark Portal disabled, we have a new mission: stay alive.$b$bWe must keep pressing on, even if only to honor those who stayed behind to secure our retreat.',19342),
(34421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n.$b$bGiven, they are injured, half-starved, and poorly-equipped... but there is no blade so sharp as a vengeful spirit, no armor so thick as a righteous cause.',19342),
(34422,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Out of the frying pan, into the woods.$b$bTake a breath, then get ready, $n. There\'s not much time to rest.',19342),
(34423,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Khadgar looks concerned.>$b$bNo - we cannot wait for Ariok. He knew what he was getting into.$b$bHis sacrifice cannot go to waste. We must keep moving.',19342),
(34425,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will hold this position for now. We must allow these freed prisoners a moment to breathe.$b$bIt is not an ideal position. We will be moving again shortly.',19342),
(34427,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I owe my life to you, stranger. I offer you and your company my support. Together, we may make it out of this jungle alive.',19342),
(34429,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re still alive? Good.$b$bThat cave-in will only hold them for so long. We have to keep moving.',19342),
(34431,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done.$b$bBe ready to move. We may have had the element of surprise within this cave, but our advantage is fleeting.',19342),
(34432,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight exceptionally well, $n... better than I could ever hope to.$b$bWith those orcs out of the way, Khadgar and Maraad should now be able to safely guide the rest of our group through the cave.',19342),
(34434,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Up there - that is Keli\'dan the Breaker. No doubt he\'s been alerted to our presence, and he\'s attempting to tell his warlord about our little jailbreak.$b$bWe have to take him out, $n.',19342),
(34436,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine job in the cave, but this is no time to rest.$b$bWe have momentum. We must stay in motion.',19342),
(34437,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my thanks, $n. Durotan, our chieftain, will be happy to hear that Ga\'nar lives.',19342),
(34439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s a good thing you got to high ground.$b$bLook at the dam!',19342),
(34442,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The orc\'s lips and wrists quiver with restrained fury.>$b$bWho are you?$b$bWait, what\'s that you say? Drek\'Thar is here?',19342),
(34445,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Takin\' away Gul\'dan was one thing, but blowin\' up the whole damned portal? That\'s my kind of solution.$b$bNow, I think we\'d better get out of here before that army gets to us.',19342),
(34446,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Against all odds, here we stand. Still alive, an entire army on our heels.$b$bOur ship is waiting. Shall we depart?',19342),
(34447,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один мудрый старейшина моего ордена как-то сказал: \"Истинное могущество складывается из силы, позволяющей действовать, и мудрости, позволяющей не действовать попусту\". Пусть эти слова и память о Келинаре навсегда останутся с тобой, $n.',20574),
(34448,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один мудрый старейшина моего ордена как-то сказал: \"Истинное могущество складывается из силы, позволяющей действовать, и мудрости, позволяющей не действовать попусту\". Пусть эти слова и память о Келинаре навсегда останутся с тобой, $n.',22810),
(34450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня мы с тобой многого добились, $n. Жду не дождусь того дня, когда мы сможем поохотиться снова.',19342),
(34451,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is still much to be done before we can leave Auchindoun with peace of mind, champion.',19342),
(34452,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have our work cut out for us, champion. The Legion\'s stench fills the air.',19342),
(34455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Устройство рассыпается у вас в руках.$b$bУдар по больному обязательно заставит Железную Орду задуматься о своей тактике управления рилаками.',19342),
(34458,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look like you can fight. We need to get out of here!',19342),
(34461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will be a mighty fine barracks, I think. I am sure Warmaster Zog will complain about how it needs to be bigger, and with more spikes. He likes spikes...',19342),
(34462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done commander. Olin spoke to me of your bravery and has already offered to serve under your command.$b$bIf I may advise you in this matter, I would suggest accepting his service. We could make use of a tauren with his skill sets in a land like this.',19342),
(34463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah. Now what do you have there? This ring is going to require some extra research.$b$bIt seems like someone was trying to travel through time but in a very backward fashion.',19342),
(34464,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These boots are fantastic! You did the right thing bringing these to me.$B$BThey are actually trying to replace the space they occupy with a different timeline.$B$BThis will definitely require more study.',0),
(34465,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a hat. Look how it moves in time back and forth! It\'s like it\'s being juggled by someone who\'s in the past, present, and future at the same time! I\'d love to try it on, but I\'m afraid to leave this reality by accident forever.',19342),
(34466,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хм... Кажется, этот посох мне знаком. Может быть...$b$bТы молодчина, что $gпринес:принесла; его мне. Я изучу его более тщательно!',19342),
(34469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, I am glad that the spirits have been released from their torment.',0),
(34472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n? Is that you? Fantastic! And they said it couldn\'t be done.$B$BThey said traversing the worlds in this way was the domain of the bronze dragonflight. Well, guess who\'s temporally laughing now!',0),
(34478,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I owe my life to you, stranger. I offer you and your company my support. Together, we may make it out of this jungle alive.',19342),
(34508,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is no time for pleasantries. The raid\'s leader is just ahead.',19342),
(34512,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Pyxni examines the saberon claws.>$b$bWe\'re gonna make a killing selling these as good luck charms to all the wannabe gladiators here at the arena!$b$bFrom now on, the saberon will think twice about messing with the Steamwheedle Cartel!',19342),
(34513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fought your way into Sabermaw, killed Razorpaw...and lived?$b$bThat\'s incredible news!$b$bThe roads will be much safer now that he\'s dead! That means more money for me!$b$bAs promised, here\'s your reward!',19342),
(34514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You recovered the merchandise? Fantastic!$b$b<Pyxni rummages through the bags.>$b$bIt\'s all here too! I knew I could count on you! Here, take this reward.$b$bYou\'ve earned it!',19342),
(34515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got all of the captured traders out of Sabermaw? Fantastic!$b$bNow they owe me and I ain\'t one to let a debt go uncollected! As for you, take this reward for your trouble!',19342),
(34516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did a great job, $n. I couldn\'t have asked for a better sidekick!$b$bAnyway, now that I\'ve got my treasure back...$b$bI\'ve got to do...$b$b...things and...stuff.$b$bBye!',19342),
(34558,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. This will do nicely.',19342),
(34563,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are the commander of this fort, yes?$b$bMy master wanted to join your fight to reclaim our home but he grew ill and... I\'m sorry, he was a great draenei and I will carry on his memory.$b$bYour new building would give me the means to see out my master\'s vision and honor his passing.$b$bIf you would allow me to do this then I would serve you.',19342),
(34564,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Teron\'gor and Gul\'dan... they slaughtered everyone...$B$B...and then they just... disappeared... into the shadows...$B$BHow did they know where to go?',19342),
(34566,1,11,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Your will be done.$B$BFor the Horde!',19342),
(34569,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re the one in charge around here, right? I\'ve heard the guards talk about your exploits and if I wasn\'t looking at you now I\'d swear they were lying.$b$bI\'ve only ever wanted to make the finest blades and put them in the hands of the strongest of fighters. I can tell already that you\'re exactly the type I want to carry my weapons.$b$bIf you can give me a chance I swear you will not be disappointed.',19116),
(34571,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These look pretty good. Ared would have loved to get his hands on these.$b$b<Miall wipes away a tear.>$b$b I\'m sorry, this is making me too emotional, these will do just fine.',19342),
(34572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Теперь они вынуждены будут сосредоточить все усилия на обороне базы. Надеюсь, со временем здесь все нормализуется.',20574),
(34573,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This won\'t be as good as some of the stuff we had back at the forge in Shattrath, but it will do.',19342),
(34575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The prophet welcomes you with a curious look, then a warm nod.>$b$bSo it begins.',19342),
(34576,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In the forges of the Black Mountain clan, we had better materials, but that will do too.',24742),
(34577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здоровые куски, и в них почти нет пустой породы.$b$bТо, что нужно.',24742),
(34578,1,273,0,0,0,1100,0,0,'I crafted a few things before we left that we may need: some smoke grenades, a grappling hook, even was able to get Thaelin to throw together a rocket pack.$b$bI\'m sure we\'ll find a use for everything.',19342),
(34579,66,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Спасибо, босс, это именно то, что нужно.$b$bКстати... Газ горенов довольно трудно добывать. Возможно, не стоит вырезать этих тварей подчистую до тех пор, пока мы не сможем хранить его в достаточных количествах.$b$bЭто просто так, мысли вслух.',24742),
(34582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will have to do.',19342),
(34583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So this is Draenor? A bit darker than expected. Still, after building Stormwind, this project should be a walk in the park.$B$BWell then, are you ready to begin, commander?',19342),
(34584,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect.$b$bNot only will this lumber do the job, it will look fantastic!',19342),
(34585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The base is significantly more secure with that giant dead.$b$bYou have made quite an impression on the peacekeepers.',19342),
(34586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The garrison is really starting to take shape.',19342),
(34587,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How is the construction of the barracks coming along?',19342),
(34592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nasty beasts they got here on Draenor.',19342),
(34593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad you are here. I almost got killed up there at the top. Oh what are these papers? This is much worse than I imagined!',19342),
(34596,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That Felbreaker sounded tough! Good thing there\'s only a small number of them.$B$BNice job stopping Reglakk, but I\'m sure he\'s safely back in Highmaul. The ogre capital will have to be dealt with sooner rather than later.',19342),
(34597,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent job thinking on your feet.  The less research these ogres do, the better!',19342),
(34598,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Greezlex lifts his head to look up at you from the ground.>$b$b...No! Don\'t take me... I... wait...$b$bYou aren\'t a saberon... did Pyxni send you?$b$b',19342),
(34609,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это не совсем то, чему нас учили в Даларане, но все равно должно сработать!',22810),
(34612,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this is just what you need! An excellent parchment comes out of this bark.',22810),
(34616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This place is just full of surprises... terrifying surprises.',19342),
(34619,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно! Теперь у нас достаточно энергии!',22810),
(34624,2,1,0,0,0,300,0,0,'Thank you, this is just what I needed.$b$bGoren gas is rather difficult to come by but thankfully we can make this supply go a long way.',19342),
(34631,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so you built a magical sanctuary! That\'s great! $B$BI take it you\'ve had trouble connecting it to the power line network?',22810),
(34632,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so you\'ve built an Arcane Sanctum! Splendid!$B$BTroubles connecting to the ley line network, I take it?',19342),
(34634,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These pustules are sizzling with energy. They\'ll do nicely.',19342),
(34635,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such clean breaks on each piece! Fantastic.',19342),
(34636,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. This ought to be just what we need.',19342),
(34646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Luuka is a little shaken up, but he is safe, and that\'s all that really matters.$B$BLook... commander, I owe you my life. All of us do honestly.$B$BI would be honored to serve as your agent here in Draenor. If you have need of me, you need only say the word.',19342),
(34653,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The arakkoa merchant looks you up and down.>$B$BWell-equipped, aren\'t we? Azik is betting you are someone of importance to your people.$B$BCome closer, friend. Speak with me for just a moment.',19342),
(34655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Azik must have seen something in you. I will trust his judgment, for n-$B$B<Reshad is interrupted as a warm gust of wind surges through the hut.>$B$BOh dear... they\'ve arrived.',19342),
(34656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who would expect to find these treasures draped over straw dolls, left to bake in the sun? Sometimes the best place to hide precious things is in plain sight.',19342),
(34657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Azik was right to guide you to me. If you were coming to help Skettis, we needed to meet.$B$BAnd if you were coming to attack us, well, I\'d be dead either way, wouldn\'t I?$B$B<Reshad lets out a cawing laugh and stuffs another scroll into his robes.>$B$BThere, that\'s nearly everything.',19342),
(34658,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, there\'s my name at the top of the list. And a few Talonpriests from the Shadowglade as well.$B$BThey fear the return of Terokk, as they should.',19342),
(34659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will point you in the right direction, but I cannot guarantee you\'ll survive the trip.$B$BKah-hah haha!',19342),
(34662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whoa! I couldn\'t tell if that was Porkchop squealing in there or if you had Crushmaul crying like a little baby!$b$bYou\'ve got talent, kid!$b$bHere\'s your cut of the profit, but why stop there? Together we can make a mountain of gold!',19342),
(34663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n! Raketalon has actually been defeated!$b$bI\'d never have believed it if I hadn\'t seen it with my very own two eyes. You\'ve got a fire in your belly and dollar signs in your eyes, kid!$b$bHere\'s your cut of the profit, but don\'t stop now! You\'re on a roll!',19342),
(34664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Watching you fight in the arena is like witnessing an artist create a masterpiece!$b$bWell, a masterpiece of blood and shattered bones... but hey, everyone\'s got to be good at something right?$b$bHere\'s your cut of the profit! That fight was so good I actually thought about giving you a bonus!',19342),
(34665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I ain\'t ever seen anybody dismantle a shredder quite like that before!$b$bYou\'ve made me a lot of money, $n! Only the best gladiators survive this long in the arena; and yet, even with that in mind, there\'s still something different about you...$b$bIt\'s your eyes...they look as if they\'ve stared death in the face a thousand times and never even blinked.$b$bTake your cut of the profit and rest up, the biggest fight is still ahead!',19342),
(34666,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Long live the champ! I knew you could do it!$b$bCould you hear the roar of the crowd in there? It shook the arena like thunder!$b$bThis is only the beginning! The Highmaul Coliseum awaits, and as the champion of the Ring of Trials you\'ll be expected to make an appearance!',19342),
(34672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, that was something! The ancient gods will now think twice whether it\'s worth trying to get out of their holes again.',23877),
(34673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat was amazin\', $n! De Old Gods be thinkin\' twice before tryin\' to take anudder bite outta you, mon.',0),
(34674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They came at us... from... nowhere.$B$B<The lieutenant nearly passes out.>',0),
(34675,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander $n. It\'s good to see you. We have much to discuss.$B$BThe situation in Nagrand is rapidly deteriorating. We\'ve lost Telaar.$B$BTo make matters worse, Grommash has named Garrosh Hellscream the new warlord of the Warsong clan.',19342),
(34676,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I won\'t waste any of your time, $Gsir:madame;. Let us discuss strategy.',19342),
(34678,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For me? Really you shouldn\'t have.$B$BOkay, this should do it.$B$BI hope.',19342),
(34681,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your will be done. I require your advisement, commander.',19342),
(34682,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve been expecting you, commander.$B$BThe situation is grim, but doable with your help.',19342),
(34683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n. I recognized your scent, friend. We have been waiting for your arrival to begin our task.',19342),
(34685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислал Калаам? Хвала Свету! Я знал, что могу на него рассчитывать!',20574),
(34692,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a good start, but we will need more champions to deal with the trials that lay ahead.',19342),
(34696,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ll have to catch up later. We have bigger problems!',19342),
(34697,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислал орк из Веселого Черепа? Это было бы смешно, если бы на его месте был орк из любого другого клана.$b$bЯ – Кас\'дракор, герой клана Северного Волка и лучший воин арены Каменного Молота.$b$bИ все же мне приходится просить тебя о помощи.',19342),
(34698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один твой поступок по чести своей превосходит все, что я видел за много лет.$b$bКогда мы закончим это дело, я принесу клятву верности твоим войскам и обучу их всему, что знаю сам.',20574),
(34699,153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $Gстранный воин:странная воительница;. Теперь-то мы можем разрубить вождя Кор\'галла пополам!',20574),
(34700,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пока я или мой сын живы, твое доброе дело не будет забыто. Я очень благодарен тебе, $gгерой:героиня;. У тебя теперь есть новый преданный друг.',20574),
(34701,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will not allow a single demon to step foot inside Auchindoun. You will help me ensure that does not happen.',19342),
(34702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я смотреть за тобой издали. Ты хорошо драться. Из тебя выходить славный боец.',20574),
(34703,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот топор за все время своего существования причинил достаточно боли и страданий. От него нужно избавиться.',20574),
(34704,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты не $gпохож на охотника:похожа на охотницу; за головами из клана Каменного Молота.$b$bНам удалось вырваться из тисков их гнусной арены, но дорогой ценой. Позади осталось немало наших павших друзей – и слишком много живых огров.$b$bНам сейчас очень не помешает помощь новичка, чье лицо незнакомо ограм.',20574),
(34706,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lady Liadrin was indeed wise in choosing you. I will let Vol\'jin know of your victory immediately.',19342),
(34707,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will gather any remaining survivors so we can rebuild what we have lost.$B$BThank you.',19342),
(34709,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aeun sent you? Help has arrived!',19342),
(34710,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aeun sent you? Help has arrived!',19342),
(34711,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С помощью этого кристалла мы наконец подключим твою башню к сети силовых линий.$B$BЯ также немного подкорректировала чертеж, чтобы его легче было прочитать. Теперь строить следующее здание будет намного легче.',22810),
(34712,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With this crystal, we can connect your tower to the ley line network at last!$B$BI also made some modifications to your blueprint that should make it much easier to build another tower in your garrison.',19342),
(34716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Please forgive me. I\'m in no condition to stand, commander.',19342),
(34717,273,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That bit of justice is sure to have lifted the spirits of my rangari.$B$BLosing Telaar and many of our friends has taken a heavy toll.$B$BThank you, commander.',19342),
(34718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khan! No!... he just received his promotion. His whole life ahead of him and now, nothing.$B$BThank you for getting the others out. Light be... nevermind.',19342),
(34719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for this kindness, $n. Perhaps I can still salvage some scrap of honor.',19342),
(34720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That bit of justice is sure to have lifted the spirits of my rangari.$B$BLosing Telaar and many of our friends has taken a heavy toll.$B$BThank you, commander.',0),
(34721,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я – провидица Малунэ, великая хранительница воспоминаний. Наконец-то мне выпала честь встретиться с тобой.',20574),
(34722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did well against a coordinated Thunderlord attack, $n.',0),
(34729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done me a great service. This blade is as much yours as it is mine.$b$bI offer you this blood oath: I shall serve your cause and lend my knowledge of blades and mining to your forces.$b$BWill you accept it?',19342),
(34730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander $n, Your mastery over the battlefield is astounding. If my people are to survive the coming conflict we will need more of our own people skilled in such warfare.$B$BIf you will have me, I would like to join your forces for a time. I wish to learn from you so that I might teach others in my clan.$B$BWill you accept my axe?',0),
(34731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My sista have other duties, but I have leave of ol\' Vol\'jin to extend my services to you.$b$bYa proved your worth, and did a task that needed doing.$b$bI be followin\' ya, boss-mon, if ya be willing.',19342),
(34732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, hero, I owe you both my life and my honor. I ask that you allow me to repay this debt by serving under your command.$b$bYou will find that I am a fearsome hunter. I have also mastered the art of riding the rylaks, which few among the Frostwolves can claim.$b$bWill you accept my service?',19342),
(34733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пусть-ка лучше себя спросят: это они поймали Дагга или Дагг их поймал?$b$bА $gгерой:героиня; берет и раскрывает всем, где Дагг прячется! Но Дагг думает, ты $gособенный:особенная;. Дагг командует этими ребятами и хочет к тебе присоединиться.$b$bДагг в этом уверен.',19342),
(34736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Eh dere, boss-mon! Watch ya step. Da ground be cracklin\' and breakin\' everywhere.',19342),
(34737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done.$b$bBe ready to move. We may have had the element of surprise within this cave, but our advantage is fleeting.',19342),
(34739,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight exceptionally well, $n... better than I could ever hope to.$b$bWith those orcs out of the way, Khadgar and Maraad should now be able to safely guide the rest of our group through the cave.',19342),
(34740,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Up there - that is Keli\'dan the Breaker. No doubt he\'s been alerted to our presence, and he\'s attempting to tell his warlord about our little jailbreak.$b$bWe have to take him out, $n.',19342),
(34741,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine job in the cave, but this is no time to rest.$b$bWe have momentum. We must stay in motion.',19342),
(34746,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect! You retrieved the blueprints.$B$BThere\'s only one thing left to do.',19342),
(34747,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У меня больше нет клана. Пылающий Клинок для меня больше не существует. Возможно, когда-нибудь я создам собственный клан.$B$BА пока что ты окажешь мне честь, если позволишь сражаться под твоим командованием. Ты $gосвободил:освободила; меня и храбро $Gсражался:сражалась;.$B$BМы могли бы многому друг у друга научиться. Что скажешь?',20574),
(34751,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! That\'s what it takes. It\'s a pleasure doing business with you, even though you\'re |3-6($c).$B$B$When we put this in here...',20574),
(34756,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How very noble of you to act as bait on my behalf. I will not forget this.',19342),
(34758,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Time to see what you can do.',19342),
(34761,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those look perfect! By all that is mechanical, this had better work.$B$BNow let\'s just insert these here...',19342),
(34765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Little known fact, old gronn grottos make for great farming soil.',19342),
(34766,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I never doubted you for a moment. You are truly a commander of the people.$B$BLok\'tar ogar!',19342),
(34769,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a momentous occasion, commander. I\'ll have Thaelin and his people get to work right away.$B$BYou\'ll see; this decision is going to be critical in our efforts against the Warsong.',19342),
(34770,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am without a clan. The Burning Blade are dead to me. Perhaps someday I will create a clan of my own.$B$BIn the meantime, it would be an honor to fight at your side. You freed me and fought well.$B$BThere is much we could learn from each other. What do you say?',19342),
(34773,71,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh thank goodness, I knew ye would come through!$B$BAt your service, as always.',19342),
(34774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You will accept this gift, and you will like it.  To do otherwise will automatically engage my organic incineration weapons.  Thank you.',22522),
(34775,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As additional missions come to my attention I will make them available here.',19342),
(34776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I am truly in your debt.$B$BWhen I fulfill my duties to Lady Liadrin I will come find you.',19342),
(34777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my eternal gratitude, hero. I will find a way to repay you someday.',19342),
(34778,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it!$b$bBut... one of our wagons didn\'t. Have you seen Maraad? He\'s still out there somewhere.',19342),
(34779,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am keeping the sickles. They remind me of a lesson so many of us draenei forget - that the Light lives in every farmer as much as in any priest.$b$bYou fight well, and I am pleased to call you friend. Your laborers will be safe here in Elodor. If you are not convinced, speak to Exarch Hataaru here. His devices secure all the draenei strongholds.',19342),
(34780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The console thrums with energy and lights up as you draw near, as though sensing your presence. Simply touching the main panel brings the defense crystal to life outside.$b$bIf this is the kind of technology Hataaru was able to cobble together from spare parts, you can only imagine the splendor of the world he came from.',19342),
(34781,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saved the town! The controls shut down as you approach, but many of the indicators are still blinking frantically. Something seems wrong.$b$bHataaru yells out to get your attention outside...',19342),
(34782,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Exarch Othaar is a towering, intimidating figure. His eyes bore into you, determining if you are friend or foe.>$b$bSo, you are $n, esteemed $c of this \"Alliance\" that has appeared on our shores. On behalf of the Exarch Council, I welcome you to Elodor.',19342),
(34783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n! You have only just arrived but already your name is the talk of Elodor.$b$bI will gladly support your cause for the Exarch Council - it has always been my opinion that the draenei need to get out and be proactive in our world instead of hiding behind our walls.$b$bBut first, I need your help with something...',19342),
(34784,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Careful with those... hand them here. Wonderful!$b$bI will have my rangari bury these around the perimeter of Elodor. If the Shadowmoon orcs dare attack us again, they are in for a nasty surprise!$b$bDraenor is a hostile world, but if we take the time to learn and understand it, we can turn it to our advantage.$b$bI will finish up here and meet with the Exarch Council shortly. I will be sure to back your proposal.',19342),
(34785,66,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n! I suspected I would see you again soon.$b$bI am willing to speak on your behalf at the Exarch Council, but an emergency situation has come up...',19342),
(34786,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The artificer withdraws a loop and peers intently at the scales you\'ve brought him.>$b$bUnreal. The crystalline matrix is flawless, as if produced from one of our forges on Argus.$b$bI wish we could hook up these creatures to our machinery... but I suspect the Exarch would take issue with that.$b$bThank you for your help!',19342),
(34787,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, my Alliance friend from Tanaan! I have not forgotten my debt to you.$b$bI will do everything in my power to convince the council to support you in every way possible. However...$b$b<The Exarch lowers his voice.>$b$bI have grave concerns about our safety here.',19342),
(34788,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An excellent choice! We\'ll send your pick directly to your garrison to help with any missions you encounter.$b$bNow, about those supplies you requested...',19342),
(34789,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One of the five Exarchs is dead. Another is a traitor. Dark times.$b$bWe will end this here and now. Can I count on you for one final task?',19342),
(34790,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Would you look at that - the entire tentacle is barbed. Uggh. No wonder the wounds they inflict tend to get infected. We could learn something from this. I wonder if rangari explorers should start equipping themselves with whips?$b$bThank you, $n. This Alliance that you come from must be quite the collection of heroes!',19342),
(34791,5,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dead! Exarch Hataaru is dead! His body was discovered moments ago, stabbed in the back. The weapon that killed him was fel in origin. Tell me everything you know.$b$b<Maladaar nods as you describe what you found.>$b$bYes. The traitors wanted to capture Hataaru\'s soul. Someone wants something he knows, dead or alive... We must act at once.',19342),
(34792,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Exarch listens to your tale, his face contorting into concern, grief, and finally anger.>$b$bSo Othaar has lost his way. \"Socrethar\" he calls himself now. At last we have our answer. I fear my capture at the hands of the Iron Horde was his doing. There may be other traitors amongst us - I must hurry back to Auchindoun and make sure we are safe.$b$bIn the meantime, I believe the Exarchs owe you a decision...',19342),
(34794,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они напали... словно из ниоткуда.$B$B<Каменный страж вот-вот потеряет сознание.>',19342),
(34795,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander $n. It\'s good to see you. We have much to discuss.$B$BThe situation in Nagrand is rapidly deteriorating. The Warsong clan is on the move.$B$BTo make matters worse, Grommash has named Garrosh their new warlord.$B$B<Thrall shakes his head sadly, but remains resolute.>',19342),
(34801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, stranger.',19342),
(34802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе! У меня слов нет, чтобы выразить мою благодарность.',22810),
(34803,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For $n! For the Horde!',19342),
(34804,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Victory! For the Alliance!',19342),
(34805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blasted things. Nothing more than flying rats if you ask me!',19342),
(34806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You\'ve drastically reduced the podling numbers.$b$bHopefully they won\'t be growing back anytime soon.>',19342),
(34808,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew it was a mistake to bring these guys with me from the Valley of Trials.',19342),
(34809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Gold-O-Matic 9000 crunches and grinds through the elemental remains.>$b$bchakk-chackk-chak-chak, chak-a-chak-akk-chk-chk-chk.',19342),
(34810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see that there\'s still an interest out there in real archaeology!$b$bThere\'s a lot of misconceptions out there about how archaeology is really done, but have no fear! The great and famous Gazmolf Futzwangler is here to educate you.',19342),
(34811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n!$b$bThat bunch of good-for-nothing\'s came crying when they found out someone else was making their money! I don\'t think Thazwix, or his cronies, will be much trouble from here on out.$b$bAs promised, here\'s the pay I owe you for a job well done!',19342),
(34814,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am Magister Krelas. Pyromaniac.$B$BPleasure.',19342),
(34815,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рада встрече.$B$BЯ – магистр Серена. Ледяной маг высочайшего уровня!',22810),
(34818,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you?$B$BDon\'t you know death by sight, $c?',19342),
(34819,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got them all? I just know this is going to work.',19342),
(34820,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is one of the pack mules Shelly and her crew took to Gloomshade Grove.',19342),
(34822,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey... now that is some nice salvage. Say what you will about the Iron Horde, but they got some serious raw materials to work with.',19342),
(34823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, boss-mon. The Bladespire ogres been pullin\' back their raiding parties. But ya can bet dey be comin\' back, and in larger numbers. The threat from their citadel must be dealt with soon.',19342),
(34824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, that\'s the stuff. Lumber, stone, peons, more peons. It\'s like we are building you a stronghold or something.',19342),
(34826,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A great victory over the Burning Blade!$B$BThis new Warlord Azuka Bladefury sounds formidable. We will have to keep an eye on her and her blademasters.',19342),
(34827,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hm, not what I was expecting when I heard that Iskar was sending help.$B$BNo matter. You\'ll have to do.',19342),
(34828,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... something\'s not right. She\'s been tampered with.$B$BSomeone else has used my orb to enter the realm of shadows.',19342),
(34829,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Blood for blood, as it should be.',19342),
(34830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, you are not stabbing me yet.$B$BThat is a good sign.',19342),
(34836,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lunarblossoms! You are too kind! I can\'t wait to give these to Kat\'la.',19342),
(34837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I crafted a few things before we left that we may need: some bombs, a grappling hook, even was able to get one of the goblins to get a spare rocket pack.$B$BI\'m sure we\'ll find a use for everything.',0),
(34838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The hatchling springs immediately to flight, then looks at you expectantly and cheeps.>',19342),
(34840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that we\'re inside we have much to do.',0),
(34847,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aka\'Magosh, $c. I knew that void witch was no good.',19342),
(34849,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you can defeat Luhk, then perhaps there\'s some hope for you after all.',19342),
(34850,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t expect you to understand the importance of what you\'ve done.$B$BPerhaps one day you will.',19342),
(34855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now with the viziers gone the whole Gordunni enchantment trade with the Iron Horde will come crashing down!$B$BWe can now turn our attention to dealing with Morkurk.',0),
(34858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. With this another stain on my honor has been removed.',0),
(34860,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright, that should be the last one we need. $B$BNothing feels as good as knowing you are stronger than your enemy!',0),
(34861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander, it is an honor to serve you.',19342),
(34866,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it. Good.$B$BGetting in here was nothing compared to what\'s to come.',19342),
(34867,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorgrond is no place for armies, commander. We step into the lands of ancient legends.',20574),
(34868,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The garrison blueprints. Outstanding.$B$BThere\'s only one thing left to do.',19342),
(34869,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It sure doesn\'t smell like chicken!$B$BOkay, okay, hand it over. I\'ll feed them and then everyone will be happy and I can turn a tidy - er, um... they\'ll feel better.$B$BYeah.',19342),
(34870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fine work commander! Your combat skills are clearly second to none. I am honored to be your armorer!$B$BLet\'s get back to the outpost so we can take stock of our new inventory. I saved a few flares to call us in a ride back.',0),
(34874,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your forces burn with passion for your cause.$B$BNot easy against such towering foes. Well done.',19342),
(34875,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь пора подумать об искусственном нексусе для твоей башни.',22810),
(34876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... I\'m sure one of these toads is my husband.',19342),
(34877,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent.  I doubt they will rebuild it after we\'ve completed all of our objectives here.$b$bThis place will return to being a failing outpost for the Gorian Empire.',19342),
(34878,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My apologies for teleporting away. It\'s cheating, I know.$B$BI merely wanted to put a fire under your feet to get here quickly!',19342),
(34879,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Before we take on Morkurk we have some business to attend to in the fortress proper.',19342),
(34881,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well.$b$bAlthough the Elemental Plateau is no longer stable, the cycle of rebirth will soon take place and the elements will be born anew.',19342),
(34882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He was a big boy, wasn\'t he? The fiends will make quite a feast of him.',19342),
(34883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. With this much dust we can delve deep enough to reach the Talon King\'s refuge.',19342),
(34884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see. Well, at least the gavel is safe.$B$BAs you may have guessed, it is another of the Talon King\'s relics.',19342),
(34885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shame about Skizzik\'s aviary. That\'s where Percy came from. Skizzik wasn\'t interested in the \"runts\" after he started breeding the big ones full-time.$B$BTo be honest, I never liked those monstrous things.',19342),
(34886,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You hold the handful of grubs out, steel yourself, and prepare to chew them up as a mama bird would.$B$BThankfully, Ikky snatches them from your hand before you can proceed.$B$BApparently kaliri don\'t do that.>',19342),
(34887,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, these will definitely be useful! Trust me.',19342),
(34888,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that they\'re out of the way, Morkurk is exposed.',19342),
(34889,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s nothing Morkurk can do to stop us now.$B$BWell done indeed!',19342),
(34890,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s what we were after.$B$BLet\'s get out of here!',19342),
(34891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $n.$b$bBy linking with each of the four elemental pillars you have attuned your life energy with each of the elements on Draenor.$b$bYou are now ready to undertake the Ritual of Binding.$b$bSpeak to me when your work upon the Elemental Plateau is finished, and we shall begin.',19342),
(34893,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Each of the guardians you put to rest were once mighty and noble elemental spirits.$b$bIn time each shall be reborn anew through the cycle of rebirth, but Gordawg must be found and balance restored lest the plateau become unstable yet again.',19342),
(34894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a fine Ember Blossom that you have brought to me. I know the danger you faced to retrieve it and I thank you.',19342),
(34897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо за отчет, $n. За этими южными пустошами нужно постоянно приглядывать.',20779),
(34898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ikky cheeps at you excitedly.$B$BIt seems you\'ve made a new friend.>',19342),
(34899,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a momentous occasion, commander. Thazz\'ril and his peons will get to work right away.$B$BYou\'ll see; this decision is going to be critical in our efforts against the Warsong.',19342),
(34900,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, $n! Mama, papa, and family. It brings a tear to my eye.$B$BHere, take this runty one. Now that I have the whole herd, this one\'s just an extra mouth to feed and won\'t fetch anything at market.',19342),
(34908,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не будем тратить время впустую. Крепость Гордал стоит на вершине этого холма – осталось совсем немного.',22810),
(34909,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не лучшие экземпляры, но, по-моему, польза от них будет.',22810),
(34910,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда мы с ними разобрались, Моркурк остался без защиты.',22810),
(34911,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уничтожив стражей, мы обеспечили себе победу. Прекрасно!',22810),
(34912,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, Моркурк ничего не смог нам противопоставить, а?',22810),
(34913,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Свиток массовой телепортации готов, но прямо сейчас он не сработает. Чтобы закрепить успех, мы должны принять определенные меры.',22810),
(34914,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad dat Aggra send ya, Commanda.$B$BDey situation is grim, an\' it\'s \'bout ta get grimma.',19342),
(34915,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, dat was fun. We workin\' nicely togetha, you an\' me, $n.',19342),
(34916,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dey movin\' onta a betta place. Samedi be sendin\' dem on all dey missions now.$B$BDank ya, $n.',19342),
(34917,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Soon de shield gonna cover all of Telaar. Den we all be trapped inside togetha.$B$BDen we go kill de packleader.',19342),
(34918,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sorry to hear about Kajassa\'s shadow hunters, but we couldn\'t afford to let the Warsong have Telaar.$B$BWith the death of Kargora and her pack, we\'re one step closer to the invasion of the Warsong\'s home, Grommashar.$B$BOne step close to justice.',19342),
(34921,1,5,1,273,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you come to learn the truth of things.$b$bWe will need to test your dedication first, yes!',19342),
(34922,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! The copies of the ritual!$b$bPraise the Raven Mother!$b$bHand them to me but only one at a time. We must not risk summoning the light.',19342),
(34923,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to you, we had time to rest and continue the rituals. You will be shadowed by the ancestor of the ravens.',22810),
(34924,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There was a terrible fate in the clutches of the Bloody Claw. But now it\'s over, and we\'ll take care of them. Thank you!',22810),
(34925,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ga\'nar works his neck out of the shackle.>$b$bMuch better.',19342),
(34932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Challe, that iniquitous wretch!$b$bIf only I had proof of her treachery long ago, I would have ripped the villainous heart from her chest and crushed it beneath my foot!$b$bYou have brought me the truth as I asked, for that you have my thanks.',19342),
(34938,4,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the news is that today the $gstranger defeated: the stranger defeated; the worst enemy of the pack! $b$bGlory to the Raven Ancestor!',22810),
(34939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это станет достойным подношением Прародительнице воронов! Да возрадуется она останкам наших врагов!',22810),
(34941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gar\'rok was a loyal keeper and a true friend. He will be missed, but so is the cycle of life on this world.$b$bIn time we will call a new keeper of the elements, and he will serve us as Gar\'rok did before him.',19342),
(34942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. Ishaal and Zellek have already begun the rites.',19342),
(34943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kalandrios sent you to me? I am honored.$b$bThe furies are wise, they know the burdens of my heart.$b$bYou may not know, but you have been sent to grant a last request to a dying shaman.$b$bFor this, I am grateful.',19342),
(34947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These orders appear to have come from Orgrim Doomhammer.',0),
(34948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, эти приказы поступили от Оргрима Молота Рока.',19342),
(34949,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve had quite the journey in getting your tower burning bright. If it\'s agreeable to you, I\'d like to join your campaign.',19342),
(34950,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An infernal machine.',19342),
(34951,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто ты?$B$BНеужели ты не знаешь, как выглядит смерть, |3-6($c)?',20574),
(34952,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; для нас большое дело, $gмальчик:девочка;, а мы добро помним.$B$BДавай через часок отпразднуем, выпьем по кружечке. Я угощаю.',20574),
(34953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You done us a solid with them Burning Blade, lad, and we\'re not the forgettin\' kind.$B$BLet\'s celebrate o\'er a pint in an hour. Drinks are on me.',0),
(34954,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Раз уж ты $Gсмог:смогла; победить Лухка, значит, из тебя еще выйдет толк.',20574),
(34955,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не думаю, что сейчас ты осознаешь важность содеянного.$B$BНо, может быть, такой день когда-нибудь придет.',20574),
(34956,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, ты здесь. Хорошо.$B$BДобраться сюда было нелегко, но это ничто по сравнению с тем, что нам предстоит.',20574),
(34957,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы одержали над Пылающим Клинком славную победу!$B$BИх новый предводитель, Азука Ярость Клинка, очень опасна. ',20574),
(34958,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mmm... yes... simple enough.$b$b<The dwarf flips through the pages and no longer seems to notice your presence.>',19342),
(34959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They will not use that machine to kill any more draenei. Thank you, $n.',19342),
(34960,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now this is some handy stuff. This weather has been cutting through our supplies of rope so quick we need something we can use to provide an alternative. Looks like you scored the jackpot.',19342),
(34962,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done great work with Durotan, Draka, and Gazlowe.',19342),
(34963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done great work with Maraad, Yrel, and Thaelin.',19342),
(34964,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throm-Ka, $n. All is not right in Nagrand, it is good that you are here.',19342),
(34965,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I fear that this disturbance is more dire than I had anticipated.$b$bWhatever it is...it threatens to unravel the elemental bonds that hold this world together.',19342),
(34971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The outpost is now fully up and running and we have enough material to outfit an army - your army!',0),
(34972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It took a lot of hard work but we have made a beautiful arsenal here.$B$BSir, I\'ve been able to outfit your soldiers here with new equipment but I\'d like to do more.$B$BI\'d be deeply honored if you would let me work for you in your main garrison.',0),
(34976,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that we\'re inside we have much to do.',19342),
(34977,1,11,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Alright, that should be the last one we need. $b$bIt isn\'t the same as retaking Shattrath, but knowing the Iron Horde won\'t be getting these supplies gives me a bit of satisfaction.',19342),
(34978,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. With this a great dishonor on the legacy of Shattrath has been removed.',19342),
(34979,1,11,0,0,0,600,0,0,'Now with the viziers gone the whole Gordunni enchantment trade with the Iron Horde will come crashing down!$b$bWe can now turn our attention to dealing with Morkurk.',19342),
(34980,1,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Fine work commander! Your combat skills are clearly second to none. I am honored to be your armorer!$b$bLet\'s get back to the outpost so we can take stock of our new inventory. I saved a few flares to call us in a ride back.',19342),
(34981,1,4,0,0,0,700,0,0,'The outpost is now fully up and running and we have enough material to outfit an army - your army!',19342),
(34982,1,2,0,0,0,500,0,0,'It took a lot of hard work but we have made a beautiful artillery tower here.$b$bSir, I\'ve been able to outfit your soldiers here with new equipment but I\'d like to do more.$b$bI\'d be deeply honored if you would let me work for you in your main garrison.',19342),
(34987,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Woo hoo hoo haaaaa!',19342),
(34991,94,1,0,0,0,100,0,0,'Tillik! Dear friend I\'m so glad you have returned! All of the acolytes missed your witty banter after the evening chants.$b$b<Iktis looks back towards you.>$b$bYes, now your great test is done. You have fulfilled the requirements of The Parchment of Dust!',19342),
(34993,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Оснащение твоей башни обернулось неплохим приключением. Если ты не против, мне бы хотелось принять участие в твоей кампании.',22810),
(34994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... How am I going to package this?$b$bI have an idea!$b$b<Beezil writes Youngroot on a label and slaps it onto a bottle of adder oil.>$b$b< He throws the Youngroot in the bushes behind him.>$b$bPerfect!',19342),
(34995,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s what I\'m talking about! Great work out there, $n.',19342),
(34996,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This new is disturbing to say the least. I\'m shocked the infestation has spread so quickly.',19342),
(34997,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You can sleep easy tonight knowing you have destroyed so many slumberblooms... just not quite as easy.',19342),
(34998,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kurekk gazes at the orb.>$B$BIs that... what I think it is?$B$BWe must get this to the Talon Altar.',19342),
(34999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, excellent. Go ahead and drop those directly into the cauldron.',19342),
(35000,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They have suffered a fate worse than death, but at least they are free.',19342),
(35001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As the orb meets the altar, the nearby candles flare up.>',19342),
(35002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Heaping the wings into the bowl, you hear a faint rustling of feathers from somewhere overhead.>',19342),
(35003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah... I feel their grasp slipping.$B$BThank you, mortal.',19342),
(35004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Weapons and zealotry do not make one strong.$B$BThey turned to Sethe because they were too weak to face death.',19342),
(35005,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n.$b$bDon\'t put away your weapon yet - now\'s when the REAL work begins.',19342),
(35006,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can never repay you for all you have done here today, $n.$b$bI am truly in your debt.',19342),
(35007,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At last, our prayers to the Raven Mother have been answered!',19342),
(35009,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты много $Gсделал:сделала;, чтобы помочь моему гнездышку забытых. Эти бедняги не совсем в своем уме, и на них охотятся их же собратья. Ужасно.$B$BИх летающие сородичи – у вас они зовутся Приверженцами – желают уничтожить забытых и превратить моих детей в рабов.$B$BЭтого я допустить не могу!',22810),
(35010,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In the whispers of the Raven Mother, blessed she be, it was foretold in the Scroll of Order that upon calling for a sign that we would receive one within thirty minutes or less.$b$bThis is most fortunate, for we have already begun our preparations for her arrival and we have need of your assistance.',19342),
(35011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A bracelet? Interesting... rather plain looking...',19342),
(35012,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sethe has died twice, but his curse lives on. It seems we will never be rid of it.',19342),
(35013,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That bracelet... I made it for father long ago.$B$BBefore the fall...',19342),
(35014,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, you made it. I need your help.',19342),
(35015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was close.$b$bIf that genesaur would have grown any larger we would have needed an army to destroy it.$b$bThank you for all your help.',19342),
(35016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This red slime covers everything, even the skulls of my hunters!  I\'ll make a Skulltaker of you yet though, great work!',19342),
(35017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah!  If he was that strong he\'d still be alive.  Still it is good you did him honor.  Did you take his skull by any chance?',19342),
(35019,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n.$b$bDon\'t put away your weapon yet - now\'s when the REAL work begins.',19342),
(35021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this?  Let me check if it has a skull...',19342),
(35022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that the flame of the spirit torch is upon the pyres, the spirits of my ancestors have been insulated from the call of the void within Oshu\'gun.$b$bHowever, more must still be done if the spirits here are to rest peacefully.',19342),
(35023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do not mourn the twisted echoes of the dead, they are merely the distorted reflections of once noble spirits.$b$bInstead, mourn the loss of those souls consumed by the dark void that grows within Oshu\'gun.',19342),
(35024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Golmash was a mighty warrior in life.$b$bFew orcs have been as honored by their clans and feared by their enemies as the great Giantslayer... the father of the Hellscream name. With the mighty spirit of Golmash Hellscream finally put to rest, the ancestral grounds may once again be a place of peace and reverence.$b$bYou have our thanks, $n.',19342),
(35025,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, I owe you one.$B$BToday, the arrogant Iron Horde made a dangerous enemy.',19342),
(35026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<No drinking water greedily. >',20574),
(35027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You take too long. Something calls to us deeper in there. Whatever it is, I will have its skull or die trying.',19342),
(35029,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, they smell... wonderful. These will help me find the power of this marsh and take it for my own.',19342),
(35030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will aid me greatly.  I must consume them and take their power.  We are close to the end $p, I can feel it.',19342),
(35031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are so close I can almost touch it!  We will have to go deeper, much deeper!',19342),
(35032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You hear Prophet Velen\'s voice in your mind.>$B$BGood work, $n! The barriers are down. We are on our way.',19342),
(35033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have chosen a very unfortunate time to visit our camp, my friend.',19342),
(35035,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Смотри, как они горят!',19342),
(35036,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот полуорк подпалил мне пальцы на ногах!',19342),
(35037,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они хотят подчинить себе гроннов? Похоже, ситуация более опасная, чем кажется на первый взгляд.',20574),
(35038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes ... We do not need their bones, but we need their crystals.',19342),
(35040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grulkor was crazy to think he could harness the power of those mushrooms, but then, most Laughing Skull are crazy.$b$bStill, not a complete waste of time.',19342),
(35041,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, что ты еще не $gрастерял:растеряла; находчивости. Ты ведь... не $gрастерял:растеряла; находчивости?',19342),
(35045,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a beautiful and well equipped structure. Thank you for allowing me to work here.$b$bI am positive with this place I can carry on my master\'s legacy. You will not regret this!',19342),
(35050,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rangari are stout survivalists. I knew they would not go down without a fight.$b$bThank you, $p, for your help in this. You have done us a great honor.',19342),
(35055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, that\'s one down, and about a dozen others to go. We best get a base goin\'. Sounds like we might be here a while.',19342),
(35058,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah. I see you have found a creation of Draenor alchemy.',19342),
(35059,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рада видеть тебя, командор. Когда до меня дошли вести об уничтожении вашего каравана...$B$BСкажем так, мне подумалось самое худшее.$B$BЕсть ли новости с Телаарской станции?',20574),
(35060,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир $n.$B$B<Урук Гроза Врагов смотрит на вас и усмехается.>$B$BУсловия капитуляции? Хм... дай-ка подумать...',20574),
(35061,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Too bad it happened. Well, at least you managed to get out of this trap alive ;.',20574),
(35062,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you had not gone; to the Loc\'rat, our warriors would have suffered a sad fate. I am sorry to hear there was a trap waiting for you. I think you\'ve won; a worthy reputation.',20574),
(35063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, that is one thing ta pick. Tell you what, you get this building up and running at full steam and I\'ll see if I can\'t adapt these blueprints to work for the space in your garrison.',19342),
(35065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I dread to think what the botani had intended to do with the corpses of our fallen.',19342),
(35066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(35067,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, командор. Я уж думал, что нам конец.',20574),
(35068,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It’s a pity that it happened, but I understand perfectly the orcs of the War Song clan. I would not give up in their place either.',20574),
(35069,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это ошейник той самой твари? Ее вой слышно было даже здесь!',20574),
(35070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. I will send in some peacekeepers to quell any remaining problems.$b$bExarch Naielle may be right - perhaps I am too aggressive in adapting our technology to this world. Still, I will never quit. Our civilization must move forward!',19342),
(35071,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(35072,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Это как раз то, что надо, $n! Спасибо большое!',19342),
(35073,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Как раз то, что нужно, $n! Спасибо!',19342),
(35074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(35075,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Это как раз то, что надо, $n! Спасибо большое!',19342),
(35077,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey good job out there! I couldn\'t have done it any better myself.',19342),
(35079,1,4,0,0,0,100,0,0,'Hey you got the dispensers going again.$b$bNice job $Gpal:babe;!',19342),
(35080,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my gosh, this is way worse than I thought it was gonna be. I\'m really going to need a hand with getting these survivors out of here.$b$bGood thing I have you on the payroll.',19342),
(35081,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s how ye do it! As soon as my crew gets here we can start work.$b$bHere\'s your pay. Thanks for doing the job.',19342),
(35082,1,1,0,0,0,100,0,0,'Good work, $n.$b$bOnce Gazwitz gets his team up here we can get the crewmen back to the Gearworks.',19342),
(35083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark shamanism is a dangerous practice, $n.$b$bIt is true that the void can be a source of terrible power, but it is the kind of power that comes at a price.$b$bThese woods are safer now that you have put an end to the rituals.',19342),
(35084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The gift of shamanism is not one to be taken lightly. When the gift is abused, the elements will rise up in indignation and smite the shaman.',19342),
(35085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shamanstone appears to be working, even from within the Twisting Nether.$b$bThere is much that needs to be done, $n. The monsters of the void are gathering upon Oshu\'gun and must be stopped, else they invade our realm.',19342),
(35086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The void lord must be stopped. Thanks to your effort, the tide of void creatures has waned... but if we are to defeat Invalidus we must act swiftly.',19342),
(35087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If those portals were to fully expand and open, the path would have been clear for the horrors of the Twisting Nether to march upon Nagrand.$b$bThe Warsong have been careless in their mad pursuit of power and glory.',19342),
(35088,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Invalidus destroyed and the Warsong rituals halted, the threat of the Twisting Nether has subsided.',19342),
(35089,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yea that\'s the stuff!$b$bNow I just need to connect the spark plugs and patch up a few holes and it\'ll be nearly in working order!',19342),
(35090,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work $n!$b$bGive me some time and I\'ll have this thing ready to roll out!',19342),
(35091,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n.$b$bThe less of those spore beasts around the safer we all are.',19342),
(35093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We saved everyone we could, $n. We were too late for the others... including my sister.$B$BProphet Velen is right. When it is asked of us, we ALL must fight. I promise this: I will never again let my loved ones suffer.$B$BNer\'zhul is close to calling down the Dark Star. We are the only ones who can stop him.',0),
(35095,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you, commander. When I\'d heard about your garrison caravan being destroyed....$B$BWell, let\'s just say that I feared the worst.$B$BWhat word from Wor\'var?',19342),
(35096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander $n.$B$B<Uruk Foecleaver looks at you and grins.>$B$BTerms of surrender? Hmm... let me think.',19342),
(35097,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Unfortunate, but you made it out of the trap alive and Lok-rath is dealt with.',19342),
(35098,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you hadn\'t gone to Lok-rath, our forces would have been decimated.$B$BI\'m sorry to hear they laid a trap you. You have a reputation now.',19342),
(35099,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. I thought we were done for sure.',19342),
(35100,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Regrettable, but I understand the pride of the Warsong. I would never surrender.',19342),
(35101,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the beast\'s collar? I heard its howls all the way over here!',19342),
(35102,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have a lot of basic arms here but I\'ll get them improved in no time.$b$bThanks for giving me this chance.',19116),
(35103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My apprentice... Inside... (She dies in your arms.)',19342),
(35104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What... happened? Where is my master?',0),
(35106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My heart is furious with you for stealing my kill, but my mind knows that I did not have the strength to avenge my master myself. I will forgive you, if you allow me to pay my debt of honor.',0),
(35128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не всякий справится в одиночку с огроном.',20574),
(35129,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Результаты его исследований у нас... Посмотрим, что в них говорится о стратегии врага.',19342),
(35136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n. Когда придет время, мы сможем использовать этот артефакт против Железной Орды.',19342),
(35137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда у нас есть учителя, мы сможем обучить твоих солдат рубить не только дрова. Хе-хе.',20574),
(35139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Теперь мы точно знаем, где находится артефакт.',20574),
(35140,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе.$B$B<Воздаятельница Ирель подзывает вас к себе, чтобы вы могли тайно переговорить.>',20574),
(35141,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, $n... Давай не будем спешить. Я уже понял, что у тебя в переноске.$B$BЭто же была просто безобидная шутка.$B$BПожалуйста, не надо!$B$BОстановись!$B$BНе открывай!!!',20574),
(35142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The peons will clean this mess, Commander. Rubble and holes everywhere. The rest of us will look for hiding goren so that we may apologize to them for butchering their warleader.',0),
(35143,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A great victory over the Burning Blade!$B$BThis Flamebender Ka\'graz sounds formidable. We shall have to keep an eye on her and her blademasters.',0),
(35144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The pale have been taught by Cho\'gall to enslave the elemental spirits of this land. When an elemental is enthralled in this manner, it cannot be reversed even by a Farseer such as myself.',19342),
(35145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have encountered evil in many places, $n. Even deep within my own soul, I have seen dark shadows of what could be.$b$bHowever, the evil within the hearts of the Pale defies explanation. It is dark, loathing, and miserable in a way I have never encountered.',19342),
(35146,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your timely arrival to rescue me from the podlings was most appreciated!$b$bThis research station has seen better days... my equipment and belongings were damaged in the ambush.$b$bHowever, with your aid, I\'m sure we\'ll be up and running again in no time!',19342),
(35147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Sallee Silverclamp examines the fragments you\'ve retrieved>$b$bThese will do nicely! Great work, kiddo!',19342),
(35148,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m afraid we have some trouble.',19342),
(35150,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m honored you\'re here to help, wolf-$g brother:sister;. Things here are worse than we thought.',19342),
(35151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine choice. It will need more work before such a structure could be built in your garrison, but this is a start.',19342),
(35152,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кас\'дракор идет сюда?! Ха! Однажды я видел, как дюжина орков Веселого Черепа схватила его сына, и он зарубил их всех.$b$bЧистое воплощение насилия.',19342),
(35154,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice job, $n! Let\'s get this mining operation started!',19342),
(35155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great! They are pretty scared now. Its hard to do research when you are afraid of being stabbed in the back at any time!',19342),
(35156,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Burning magical paper smells pretty bad!  Good thinking $p, keeping these ogres dumb is a solid plan!',19342),
(35157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally some help! I barely got out alive!$b$bYou have some ogre orders? Let me see...$b$bWell that\'s not good news.',19342),
(35158,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We stopped him for the time being, but I think we\'ll have to come up with a more permanent solution. No doubt he\'s back in Highmaul plotting new versions of Breakers.$B$BI think a visit to ogre capital is far overdue.',19342),
(35159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, hopefully they will give up on making a portal here.',19342),
(35166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow... with all these supplies, we should be back on track.$b$bWe are blessed to have you protecting us, commander.',19342),
(35167,18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Skytooth! My mama and papa....$B$B<The little girl continues to cry over the corpses of her family.>',19342),
(35168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),
(35169,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s over. The Song of War clan is defeated. Garroche Hell\'s Creek is finally dead. But somehow I think Gromash will want revenge sooner or later.',19342),
(35170,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. You really are the greatest $c like everyone says!',19342),
(35171,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s over. The Warsong are broken. Garrosh Hellscream is finally dead.$B$BIt\'s just a matter of time before Grommash seeks vengeance.',19342),
(35172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We look forward to serving you again.',0),
(35174,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is unnerving to say the least.$b$bThose things must have come from underground.$b$bHopefully we have seen the last of them.',19342),
(35176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did what? You are a life saver, commander.$b$bWith those tasks out of the way my job will be much easier.',19342),
(35185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $c. Khadgar told me to expect you.',19342),
(35186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $c. Khadgar told me to expect you.',19342),
(35187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, my friend. I have managed to earn a bit of favor with the Sargerei, but they still guard their secrets closely.$B$BOnly the strongest will be accepted in the ranks of the Sargerei.$B$BSoulpriest Zamaya is the leader of our operations here. To secure our objectives, you must first win her trust.',19342),
(35188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I expect no less from an initiate.',19243),
(35189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... Socrethar is purely mad, but his reasoning is logical. No wonder so many draenei are turning to his cause.',19243),
(35190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad.',19243),
(35191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good. Our mission continues, undetected.',19243),
(35194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Mysteriously, Anchorite Laanda is gone. Did something happen here?>',19243),
(35195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Anchorite Laanda looks pale. He is not going to make it.>$B$B$n... thank you for all that you have done.',19243),
(35196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... Socrethar\'s ambitions begin with Shattrath and Auchindoun, but they do not end there.$B$BThank you for bringing this information to me, $n.$B$BI will relay it to Archmage Khadgar immediately.',19243),
(35197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see... Socrethar\'s ambitions begin with Shattrath and Auchindoun, but they do not end there.$B$BThank you for bringing this information to me, $n.$B$BI will relay it to Archmage Khadgar immediately.',0),
(35202,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, yes. Zach is one step closer to performing a miracle.',19342),
(35204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep this up and we\'ll make a survivalist out of you yet.',19342),
(35205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Normally I\'m not a violent dwarf, but I ain\'t about to sit by and get turned into a bush. And I ain\'t about to let others do the same.',19342),
(35206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander. At every turn you seem to demonstrate an efficiency with war that even our most seasoned exarchs might fight to be challenging.',19342),
(35207,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Me mother always told me to eat me vegetables. I dunna think this is what she had in mind.',19342),
(35208,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! It was terrible! They made me eat an\' eat an\' eat.$b$bDon\' get me wrong, I enjoy a good meal but these plant people had me eatin\' nuthin\' but fruit.$b$bI canno\' take it anymore.',19342),
(35209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are carrying something of great power on you. I could feel it as you approached.',19342),
(35210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти туннели горенов оказались полезными.',20574),
(35211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work!$b$bOk I need to just finish setting up the ignition mechanism and we\'ll be all set.',19342),
(35212,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah good! Ya made it.$b$bThe lasses here insisted on comin\' with, though they don\'t seem to like each other much.',19342),
(35213,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The plant people fattened up my friends with fruit an\' honey an\' mead. Seems they were fattenin\' them up for sure.',19342),
(35214,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for doing what I could not.$b$bWhile it is the right thing to do, it is hard to loose the arrow when your target was once a friend.',19342),
(35215,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They mulched my friends? Those pointy branch wavers with their wee beady eyes! Thank ya for avenging ma friends.$b$bWe best be findin\' the others before they get turned into plant food.',19342),
(35216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I may not know much about farmin\' but I do know a power source when I see it. These seeds are packin\' quite a punch.$b$bWay to think on yer feet and grab \'em, Commander.',19342),
(35217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! I admit I love the taste of those pears as well, but it is a small price to pay to destroy our enemy.',0),
(35218,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These orders are written with terrible handwriting.',24742),
(35225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Co... Commander? Well ain\'t you a sight for sore eyes?$b$bI didn\'t think anyone friendly was comin\' for me.$b$bWe found an artifact that seemed pretty handy against the locals in the area but then those acid-mouthed roly polies showed up and started eatin\' everything.$b$bHelp me up an\' we can git to it.',19342),
(35226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Orgrim will not stop this foolishness, so we must stop him.',19342),
(35227,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another successful negotiation.',19342),
(35229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You give me blackrock orcs, troggs, er evil leper gnomes an\' we\'d be fine. But these acid munchin\' beasts are the end of us.',19342),
(35231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The situation here is dire, $n, but I sensed that we would meet again.$b$bI do not hear the call of the void as loudly as the others, for I am not long dead and my body rests far from this place.$b$bWith time though, that will change.$b$bIf you are here to help, listen closely for time is short.',19342),
(35232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It has been many years since I have set foot within these woods.$b$bI was last here for the Kosh\'harg many years ago when this place was shared amongst all clans. Those days have past and now only the Warsong banner flies here.',19342),
(35233,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'While I hope we don\' need to fire the big gun, I kinda hope we can fire the big gun.',19342),
(35234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That artifact was useful until it ran out of juice. Hopefully you got some seeds and water for it.',19342),
(35235,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a challenge.',19342),
(35238,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wenbot-8000. New host received: $n. Orders received: Massage enemies |3-1($n)... ...to death.',20574),
(35239,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Battle-Bot 8000 owner acquired: $n.$B$BCurrent directive: Massage $n\'s enemies... to death.',19342),
(35240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n.$b$bGiven, they are injured, half-starved, and poorly-equipped... but there is no blade so sharp as a vengeful spirit, no armor so thick as a righteous cause.',19342),
(35241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I admire your sense of duty, $n. Even when your own survival hangs in the balance, you still find time to bring closure to a grieving widow. Well done.',19342),
(35242,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I admire your sense of righteousness, $n. Even when your own survival hangs in the balance, you still find time to avenge a grieving widow. Well done.',19342),
(35243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was bidden to find my way to you, and to swear my service. Whatever you need of me, I will offer. I take a particular pleasure in turning things to ashes.\n\nThe dark lady sends her regards.',19342),
(35245,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lithic actually spoke to you? Or, some shade of her at least... $B$BFascinating!',19342),
(35247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirits of my ancestors have betrayed me! Their skulls must be having fun now.',19342),
(35248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как же я люблю убивать всякую нечисть. И кости тоже люблю.',19342),
(35249,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look like you can fight. We need to get out of here!',19342),
(35251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This camp of yours could be fruitful, but it rests upon the footstep of Grom\'gar. The Thunderlords are not likely to be welcome neighbors.',0),
(35254,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Already I can feel the Light triumphing over darkness. We\'ve done it!',19342),
(35255,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, Commander. Many of the orcs have tried to master the power of the genesaur but I have never heard of any of them reaching this level of success.$b$bThis should provide us a substantial advantage in the days ahead.',19342),
(35257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, you\'ve arrived just in time.',19342),
(35258,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. With these we can begin to understand.',19342),
(35259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The core of this slumbering construct begins to hum softly.>',19342),
(35260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Deception is the ultimate power. Remember this, $p.',19342),
(35261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Apexis interface slides into place with a satisfying click. Seems this is the seat for taking full command of the turret.$B$BRifling through the cushions, you find a few spare coins, which you pocket.>',19342),
(35262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander, your skills at survival are to be commended but they have many blind spots.$b$bYou need a rangari like myself to help your forces or Draenor is going to eat you up like a goren with a rock.$b$bWill you accept my offer?',19342),
(35264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),
(35265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Farseer Drek\'Thar listens closely as you speak of your vision.>$b$bI see... these are truly dark days. Cho\'gall has invaded the heart of Oshu\'gun, draining the naaru of its life. He seeks to destroy the naaru, birthing a dark, void god in its place.$b$bCho\'gall must be stopped. Come, we must travel to the sacred mountain before it is too late.',19342),
(35271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Blood Guard Ehanes looks over the attack plans.>$b$bHmm... I see. You have done well to retrieve these attack plans. With the plans in our hands, we will be more than prepared to counter the assault when it comes.',19342),
(35272,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank da spirits you showed up. Dey hear my prayers.',19342),
(35273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, well done. Even with my condition, I could sense the carnage from here.$B$BIt must have been quite a show, kah-hah-haww.',19342),
(35274,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, uh... could we maybe forget this little incident happened, commander?$B$BBodrick and the other agents would never let me live this down.',19342),
(35275,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our lives for your will, commander.',19342),
(35276,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope everything is to your liking. It\'s been one hell of a job.',19342),
(35277,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your will be done.$B$BFor the Horde!',19342),
(35285,1,4,0,0,0,100,0,0,'I have good news and bad news.$b$bThe good news is my uncle\'s alive! The bad news is his leg is injured and we\'re surrounded by infected! With my hotrod wrecked we can\'t get him out of here.',19342),
(35286,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Praise the Light you\'re here. I thought we were going to have to wait until a courier could reach you for a decision on this.',19342),
(35293,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What in the king\'s name happened here?',19342),
(35295,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Everyone be dead, mon. What did dis?',19342),
(35298,1,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you did fantastic work.$b$bEveryone here at the Gearworks owes you big time for what you\'ve done for us.$b$bHere, I want to give you little something. Think of it as a personal token of my gratitude.',19342),
(35317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well, $n.$b$bBy defeating the void god Decimatus, the destruction of this great valley has been avoided. The threat of the pale has subsided for now as well.$b$bThe loss of Gordawg will be felt throughout Nagrand, but someday a new earthen fury will take seat upon the Throne of Elements and balance will be restored.',19342),
(35322,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, friend.',19342),
(35329,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, friend.',19342),
(35330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Vindicator Nobundo listens closely as you speak of your vision.>$b$bThese are grave images of which you speak, $n! If Cho\'gall continues bleeding the naaru of its Light, K\'ure will die and in the naaru\'s place a void god will emerge. Void gods are terrible creatures that live only to destroy!$b$bWe must travel to Oshu\'gun immediately and put a stop to the threat of Cho\'gall!',19342),
(35331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am not sure what to make of this.$b$bThe elements are no longer in balance? The great fury Gordawg is missing and must be found?$b$bThe furies appear noble, and deep within my soul their words ring true.$b$bI believe we aid should them in their cause.',19342),
(35332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, что ты $gдобрался:добралась; сюда в добром здравии.$B$BИдем, нам многое предстоит сделать.',20574),
(35333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see a fire within your eyes and a wind upon your step, $n.$b$bIf what Kalandrios speaks is true, you have attuned your life energy with each of the elemental forces on Draenor.$b$bThe voice says that you are now ready to undertake the Ritual of Binding.$b$bReturn to me when your work upon the plateau is finished and we will speak further.',19342),
(35337,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twelve couples, huh? Not bad, commander. $B$BAlthough ... just the same amount I managed to get. Yes ... about a dozen pairs of ears. Yeah ...',20574),
(35338,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twenty-four, huh? Great. $B$BI have fifty.$B$BNow I\'ll send someone for meat - why is it good to disappear?',20574),
(35339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re... dead?',19342),
(35341,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have proven yourself more powerful than my previous leaders. My service is yours.',19342),
(35342,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О! Я вижу, тебе в руки попало творение дренорских алхимиков.',19342),
(35343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прошу. Помоги. Мне надо найти отца.',19342),
(35344,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;. Видимо, остроклыкам не понравилось, что я охочусь на ту же жертву.',19342),
(35345,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; это ради нашей семьи? После того, как $gспас:спасла; нашего отца? От всего сердца благодарю тебя, $n.$b$bХочешь обучиться дренорской алхимии? Я научу тебя всему, чему только сумею.',19342),
(35350,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magnificent trophy, commander. We\'re all proud of you.',20574),
(35353,18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will convince the others of our fate. There\'s no denying it anymore.',19342),
(35356,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это же моя стрела! Откуда она у тебя?',20574),
(35357,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Ты $gдобился:добилась; успеха там, где это не удалось мне.$B$BВозможно, среди чужаков действительно есть хорошие охотники.',20574),
(35372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These woods are sacred to the orcs and to my people as well.$b$bBeneath the great mountain of Oshu\'gun lies the heart of Nagrand, the Genedar. This great dimensional vessel rescued my people from annihilation and brought us to this world.',19342),
(35374,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twelve pairs, huh? That\'s pretty good, commander.$B$BUm, no, I think that\'s about how many I managed to bag. Yeah... about a dozen pairs of ears. Yep....',19342),
(35375,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magnificent kill, commander. You\'ve done us all proud.',19342),
(35376,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twenty-four, huh? That\'s fine work.$B$BI brought back fifty.$B$BI\'ll send someone out for the meat. Waste not, want not.',19342),
(35377,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s MY axe! Where\'d you get it?',19342),
(35378,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. You succeeded where I did not.$B$BPerhaps you outsiders aren\'t such bad hunters after all.',19342),
(35380,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If today was any other day I\'d have you court-martialed for being out of uniform.',19342),
(35386,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Captain Washburn examines the attack plans, squinting at the lettering and holding the pages upside down.>$b$bHmm... I see... yes... indeed!$b$bThese are obviously attack plans, as you yourself have stated, but they are most likely written by kobold pyromancers.$b$bStrange though, I haven\'t seen any kobold pyromancers since my days in Azeroth. No matter! I assure you that the outpost is well armed and mostly fireproof!$b$bIf we are attacked, the outpost shan\'t fall. You have my word, commander!',19342),
(35393,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The situation here is dire, $n, but I sensed that we would meet again.$b$bI do not hear the call of the void as loudly as the others, for I am not long dead and my body rests far from this place.$b$bWith time though, that will change.$b$bIf you are here to help, listen closely for time is short.',19342),
(35395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gordawg was a mighty ally. The elements will mourn the loss of the fury, but death was the only answer. Gordawg would not have wished to stay a slave to evil.$b$bThough Gordawg is no more, the heart of a fury is eternal and unbreakable. In time, this brightly glowing heart will take shape into a new earthen fury.$b$bSuch is the cycle of life upon the Elemental Plateau.',19342),
(35396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The fate of K\'ure could not have been prevented.$b$bCho\'gall accelerated the naaru\'s transition into a void god in hopes of bringing destruction upon Draenor. Cho\'gall must be dealt with, but for now let us honor the memory of the great naaru K\'ure.$b$bK\'ure was truly the savior of my people, a friend to the virtuous, and a teacher of prophets.$b$bMay the great naaru ever live within our hearts.',19342),
(35397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Pale are wretched creatures that hate the Light and plot against the innocent. Without Greyseer to lead them, they will be disorganized and in chaos for a time.$b$bShould a new leader arise from within their ranks, we shall smite them down once more.',19342),
(35398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done well to free the elemental spirits from their bonds. If Cho\'gall and the pale seek an army of elemental slaves, they must not be allowed to succeed.',19342),
(35399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dead? All dead? Dead and mulched and forgotten. No Chag with his missing nose or Meka with her love for chewing faces.$b$bAnd Torg, my beloved Torg. A son we had together. A son that is still missing.$b$bThe botani will pay for this. They will burn for this.',19342),
(35400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These creatures... were not what I expected to see. I always knew Gorgrond to be a dangerous place, but I never could have guessed at how vile.$b$bThank you, commander, for your compassion in this.',19342),
(35402,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It isn\'t enough to kill the botani. They will always have greater numbers.$b$bYou must cut them deep and hard, where it hurts them the most.$b$bLike slaying their most sacred leader.',19342),
(35406,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seeds. So simple to look at but in each the potential for untold amounts of destruction. Much like my son.$b$bYou were wise to take these.',19342),
(35407,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought. For the Alliance!',19342),
(35408,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, soldier.',19342),
(35416,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно, командир. Многие орки пытались завладеть силой генезотавров, но, по-моему, никому еще не удалось этого добиться.$b$bЭто даст нам значительное преимущество, когда мы в следующий раз сойдемся с Железной Ордой.',20574),
(35429,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah... yes, yes, yes. Fresh pollen. With a dash of a few secret ingredients you can feed an army with the food you could grow from this, if you know the secret ways.',19342),
(35430,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The botani took my dad. They took my friends. And now they are making me eat fruit!$b$bWhy are they so mean?!$b$bDid you kill them all?$b$bI think you should kill them.',19342),
(35432,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I had thought the Laughing Skull were planning something. Now I think I am beginning to understand.$b$bThey match savagery with savagery.',19342),
(35433,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They are lucky you are the one that killed them. I would have tried to carve pictures in their dead wood bodies.',19342),
(35434,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Waters of Utrophis. I have never held or smelled or tasted it before. But I have heard many stories, many legends.$b$bI was expecting something more grand.',19342),
(35444,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming to our aid.',19342),
(35450,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, Prelate Luari sent you, did she? Such a sweet woman, always looking out for others.',0),
(35459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming to assist us.',0),
(35460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good form, champion. I\'m sure your presence on the field was inspiring for our troops.',19342),
(35462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will take the Iron Horde quite a while to get those demolishers operational again. Excellent work, $n.',19342),
(35463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed how many scouts? No wonder we have been unable to execute our plans...',19342),
(35464,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The prisoners are shaken up, but they are free. Their families are in your debt, $n.',19342),
(35482,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'From one commander to another... thank you.$B$BWe\'ve been through a lot together, haven\'t we, $n? Vashj\'ir... the Jade Forest... Lion\'s Landing...$B$BI am truly honored that I could end my journey by your side.',19342),
(35486,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s take a look at these battleplans.',19342),
(35487,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was stinky.',19342),
(35488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s important that our enemies understand what happens when you attack the Alliance. I\'m glad you could be there to show them.',19342),
(35492,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Iron Horde will learn to fear us, as they should.',19342),
(35494,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. These mementos will forever remind us of the day we lost so many of our loved ones.',19342),
(35495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Toothsmash is dead? Good, I\'m sure it will take the Iron Horde a while to find another ogre smart enough to help them with their efforts.',19342),
(35496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish I could be there to watch their faces as they suffer. I hope they all die a slow horrible death.',19342),
(35500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was an honor fighting alongside of you, $n.',19342),
(35501,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The rounds of doomshot fit into the weapon loader with ease.',19342),
(35505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frenna didn\'t make it out of Tangleheart.',19342),
(35506,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got it! You should be able to use this mole machine one way back to your outpost.',19342),
(35507,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Goren, goren, gone!',19342),
(35508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, nice job commander!',19342),
(35509,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The genesaur is coming!',19342),
(35510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was an honor to fight by your side today, commander.',19342),
(35511,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander, you go where you will and kill any who would stand in your way.$b$bI find this fun.$b$bI wish to join your... \"followers\"... as the lady wolf keeps calling them.$b$bMy home is crushed, my family mulched, and this place has lost its charm.$b$bLet me join you.',19342),
(35524,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saw \'em burn off their own leaves? That\'d be like me cutting off my cute-as-a-button pigtails!',19342),
(35527,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Big baddy botani busted? Works for me!',19342),
(35536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found my Cutter! I shall gladly cut a thousand throats in your honor.',19342),
(35537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, boss-mon.\n\nI know you\'ll probably be wantin\' to get things settled here first, but there\'s been some word of an uprisin\' in Spires of Arak. There might be some allies to be made if we get involved.\n\nThought ya might want to know.',19342),
(35549,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will never forget Admiral Taylor\'s sacrifices for the greater good.',19342),
(35550,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ukambe gave me the report, commander. You truly are the champion of the Horde.',19342),
(35552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A flesh-bound book lies on an unholy altar. Your skin crawls. Maladaar was right!',19342),
(35554,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, commander.\n\nI know you\'ll probably want to get things settled here first, but there\'s been some word of an uprising in Spires of Arak. If we act fast, we might be able to make some new allies against the Iron Horde.\n\nI\'ll have the scouts keep an ear out for any more news. That\'s it for now, sir.',19342),
(35556,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Gorgrond, Commander. We only just arrived ourselves.',19342),
(35557,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorgrond is no place for armies, Commander. We are now stepping into the domain of legends.',19342),
(35596,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Zlatogriv is quite stretching, stretching after being in a tight cage. He looks around, then looks at you carefully, as if waiting for some kind of reaction. Then he nods gratefully to you, showing that he will join you... at least for a while... >',20574),
(35611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for returning to us, $p. I must admit we are sorely in need of your help.',19342),
(35614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have heard of you, traveler. Your people have come to defeat the Iron Horde.$B$BFrom what I have just seen, your combat skills are as impressive as they say.$b$bI, too, wish to see the Iron Horde gone from this land. I will lend you the strength of my hammer, and you may also find my knowledge of crystalworking to be useful.$B$BWhat do you say?',19342),
(35617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have spoken with the rest of my caravan, and we\'ve agreed to rest our wagon for a while while I pledge my service to your garrison.$B$BI think I could be of great use to you. What do you say?',19342),
(35619,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, you\'re from that Alliance base right?$b$bGlad you made the trip because we really could use your help!',19342),
(35620,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эй, ты ведь с базы Орды, да?$B$BХорошо, что ты здесь – нам твоя помощь придется очень кстати!',20574),
(35625,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Draenor... even the sound of this place makes me sick.$B$BMy husband is gone. I cannot go home while his memory lingers.$B$BPlease, let me join you and fight for you. Send me to the frontlines, wherever killing is needed.$B$BWith every enemy that I face, perhaps the pain will lessen.',19342),
(35631,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Prophet Velen spoke highly of you, and I can see that your weapons are keen and your intent is just.$B$BI sense great potential within you. If you will allow it, I would warm my hands by your fire for a while.$B$BI would like to follow you and learn from your people. In return, I shall fight for you.$B$BWhat do you say, traveler?',19342),
(35632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work back there! That\'s how real archaeology is done!$b$bIt\'s a good thing you came to me to learn the trade, kid. You\'ve got talent and I\'d hate to see it wasted on a putz like Harrison Jones!',19342),
(35633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for doing this $p.  Hopefully they can be cleaned of these foul spores that coat everything here.',19342),
(35634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will take some time, but this may be the key to our victory.',19342),
(35636,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Reshad presses the feather into the tome before sliding it into his robes.>$B$BWe have one more stop before the wayshrine...',19342),
(35638,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(35639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Vindicator Maraad know of your bravery.',0),
(35640,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for avenging my fallen friends. We will get to the bottom of this I swear!',19342),
(35642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve seen these around on corpses and the beasts, but not as big.  Let me see it...',19342),
(35644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps we shouldn\'t have wasted time on them, this place... drains me. Still it was a good deed you have done.',19342),
(35645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sadly, I\'m growing used to the smell of these spores. In fact, they smell quite pleasant now. Perhaps if I eat these it will speed up our work here...',19342),
(35647,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... I must consume these like the mushrooms. It will help me locate the source, I swear!',19342),
(35650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those ancients are crazy! Hard to believe they\'d burn off their own leaves.',19342),
(35651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya took out the big nasty did ya? Yer sure to be causin\' some real trouble out there!',19342),
(35652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sap? Who called me a sap?! Oh...',19342),
(35654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Couldn\'t say what those spores were for, but I feel better knowin\' they\'re gone.',19342),
(35656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is unfortunate... I had hoped... Still we are closer now, we are on the right track to finishing this.$b$bNone too soon either, the screaming beasts are really getting to me...',19342),
(35659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That is terrible news. I will warn off all scouts from venturing to the Crimson Fen from now on.  Thank you and I am glad you were not affected by the spores...',19342),
(35663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did a great job, kid!$b$bI hope you learned something about teamwork today. Here\'s your cut, minus my teaching fee... the Steamwheedle Preservation Society service charge... and gratuity of course!',19342),
(35664,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Ancients won\'t slip into your outpost for long.',20574),
(35665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, друг. Я перед тобой в долгу.$B$BСегодня заносчивая Железная Орда нажила себе опасного врага.',20574),
(35666,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'D\'kaan sent you? He\'s not likely to enjoy the report I have to give him.',19342),
(35667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marrow sent you, eh? Well we leave when I\'m done here.',19342),
(35668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Reshad gazes into the inky orb.>$B$BAmazing. To think Terokk used this very orb to commune with Anzu. One could become quite the darkweaver with an implement such as this.$B$BCome, let\'s get it safely to the Veil.',19342),
(35669,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The peons will sing songs of your glory, commander. Lok\'tar ogar!',19342),
(35670,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad we can count on you, commander.',19342),
(35671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We owe you a great debt for delivering Reshad safely to us, $p.$B$BHowever, our struggle has only just begun.',19342),
(35672,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A thousand thanks to you, commander. I will call for more supply runs immediately.',19342),
(35674,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander. For the Alliance!',19342),
(35675,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I didn\'t think anyone could actually kill the beast. Thank you, commander!',19342),
(35676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By Muradin\'sh beard... you actually killed the beasht. Praishe be to ye, commander ...hic!',19342),
(35679,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you, $n. Your aid will be invaluable in this critical hour.',0),
(35680,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you, $n. Your aid will be invaluable in this critical hour.',0),
(35683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. These insignias will surely bring Socrethar out of hiding.',0),
(35684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. These insignias will surely bring Socrethar out of hiding.',0),
(35685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, it is done. Othaar... my old friend... be at peace now.',0),
(35686,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти существа рвутся в бой друг с другом с неукротимой яростью.',20574),
(35687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, it is done. This creature of darkness shall torment us no longer. Shattrath is free of his taint.',0),
(35689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(35690,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),
(35691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Vindicator Maraad know of your bravery.',0),
(35693,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя настоящий талант к битве.',20574),
(35697,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe we can come to an arrangement, savior of Skettis. But first...',19342),
(35699,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think we can make a deal, savior; Skettisa. But first...',19342),
(35702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да... Теперь, когда в наших руках такая сила, орки ничего не смогут нам противопоставить...',20574),
(35704,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы с Перси хотим подарить тебе кое-что в знак нашей благодарности. Это мелочь, но, прошу, прими нашу скромную награду.',22810),
(35705,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know what you\'re doin\' all the way out here, but mind helpin\' a gal out since you\'re stopping by?',19342),
(35706,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a real doll. Let\'s get out of here.',19342),
(35707,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey! Looky what I found here.',19342),
(35708,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cheers! I found a goblin skulkin\' about here. Think I\'ll keep \'er around. Says she knows things about lumberjackin\'.',19342),
(35713,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого! Да ты $Gвооружен:вооружена; до зубов! Ух, что за доспех! Слушай, не поможешь усталому гному в беде?',19342),
(35716,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я навеки твой должник! А теперь поехали на место раскопок.',19342),
(35718,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, Mixxy sent you? What a relief. I\'m not even armed!',19342),
(35719,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, наконец-то. У меня ведь и оружия-то нет!',19342),
(35730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо. Теперь ее раны закрылись.',20574),
(35733,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As you place the gavel at the base of the effigy, Reshad speaks over your shoulder.>',19342),
(35734,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was but one of many such tales.$B$BNo arakkoa living or dead has ever compared to the Talon King.',19342),
(35736,2,0,0,0,400,0,0,0,'Excellent work. Your service is always appreciated, $n.',19342),
(35737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. Your service is always appreciated, $n.',0),
(35738,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That ought to do it! Nice work.',19342),
(35739,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого, сколько ты угля $Gпритащил:притащила;. Отлично!',19342),
(35744,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Da prisoners be shaken up, but they are free. We be in your debt, $n.',19342),
(35745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aka\'Magosh, champion. I\'m sure your presence on the field was inspiring for the troops.',19342),
(35746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will take the Iron Horde quite a while to get those demolishers operational again. Throm-Ka, $n.',19342),
(35747,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... I can work with this.',19342),
(35748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed how many scouts? No wonder we have been unable to execute our plans...',19342),
(35750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s take a look at these battleplans.',19342),
(35751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Iron Horde will learn to fear us, as they should.',19342),
(35760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Toothsmash is dead? Good, I\'m sure it will take the Iron Horde a while to find another ogre smart enough to help them with their efforts.',19342),
(35761,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Throm-Ka, $n. These mementos will forever remind us of our champions.',19342),
(35762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s important that our enemies understand what happens when you attack the true Horde. I\'m glad you could be there to show them.',19342),
(35763,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was an honor fighting alongside of you, $n.',19342),
(35764,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish I could be there to watch their faces as they suffer. I hope they all die a slow horrible death.',19342),
(35766,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, I\'ll be. Ghosts. Who knew?',19342),
(35782,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не шутишь? Во дела! Чего только не бывает на свете!',19342),
(35786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With every victory, or claim here grows more strong.',0),
(35787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without each battle, or sovereignty here grows, Commander.',0),
(35788,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our foes cringe, Commander. Hah! They\'ll lick their wounds for days before even dreaming of another fight.',0),
(35797,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfection. Let\'s get it hooked up!',19342),
(35807,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Раньше разведчикам приходилось шастать между котлов, спасаясь от гроннов и одновременно рискуя попасть в раскаленные когти паровых элементалей. После смерти Эрозиана они вздохнут свободно!',19342),
(35808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One minute you are skirting the cauldrons avoiding the Gronn, the next a blast a steam followed by burning hot claws. Erosian\'s death should make our scouts lives a lot easier!',0),
(35809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have defeated yet another deadly beast in Gorgrond.$B$BDessicus cared little on who he preyed upon, they all went into his salt pools forever. You have saved many lives $n!',0),
(35810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $Gпобедил:победила; в Горгронде еще одного жуткого зверя.$B$BИссушитель убивал всех без разбора – и сбрасывал в соляные озера. Ты $Gспас:спасла; много жизней, $p!',19243),
(35811,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кажется, земля теперь трясется меньше. Его ярость наносила этому миру неописуемый ущерб. Хорошо, что он пал от твоей руки.',19243),
(35812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thought I felt less quakes in the earth. His fury caused untold damage to this world, it is good that he has fallen to you.',19342),
(35813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve heard tales of the Crimson Fen from the rangari; no one has yet returned from there. If this was the reason then we can all breathe safer now.',19342),
(35814,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Funny Skulls told me about Crimson Top - no one has ever returned from there. If the travelers died because of it, then we can all breathe a sigh of relief now.',19342),
(35815,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нам здесь и так приходится нелегко, а тут еще этот Чарл донимал разведчиков – мало им гроннов!$b$bХвала тебе, $p!',19243),
(35816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our purpose here was hard enough without a giant beast like Charl harassing our scouts and aggravating the Gronn.$B$BYou have saved the rangari a great deal of punishment with this kill $n!',0),
(35817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The calls of that giant bird could never be ignored.$B$BYou could never be sure if it was far away or if there would be a sudden shadow followed by your immediate death. Well done!',0),
(35818,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The calls of that giant bird could never be ignored.$B$BYou could never be sure if it was far away or if there would be a sudden shadow followed by your immediate death. Well done!',0),
(35819,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Funny Skulls have always avoided this place, because Kargaks, for all its sizes, was quite fast. They\'ll be glad to know that their eaten brothers have been avenged.',19342),
(35820,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done us all a great favor $p.$b$bThe existence of that slippery hydra wasn\'t even truly known despite our losses in the area.',19342),
(35828,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Теперь он у меня живо забегает.',22810),
(35834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A good start. The growth from a genesaur is pure chaos and must be culled whenever possible.',19342),
(35835,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, пора испробовать эту штуковину!',19342),
(35837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Judging by the marks on her body, the agent put up an impressive fight.>',0),
(35838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad I found you, $n. I\'ve been hiding out since the Warsong orcs ambushed our camp at the Hidden Camp.$B$BYou should have seen the fight that Jeanine put up. Even after they began torturing her, she never gave up that there were two of us.$B$BShe had a will of steel, that one.',0),
(35839,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is remarkable, $n. We now have direct proof of Grommash\'s intentions.$B$BPerhaps now, we can stay a step ahead of the Iron Horde. Great work!',0),
(35840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n.',0),
(35841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have heard many reports about Vor\'gash. It is a relief to know he will trouble us no more.',0),
(35842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я про Вор\'гаша многое знаю. Теперь уж он нам не опасен. Здорово.',19342),
(35843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Down by the brutal wounds on his body, the dark hunter fought to the last. >',19342),
(35844,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been looking for you, commander. I knew you were coming, but the orchid hurt fast before she could warn me.$B$BWell, though I\'d save you. Poor Zasta. He wasn\'t even expecting it.',19342),
(35845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So we have a certificate of Hell\'s Creek\'s designs.Maybe now we can get ahead of the Iron Horde. Okay, great.',19342),
(35846,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, $n. Прям вот очень хорошо.',19342),
(35861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These savages have no honor, it is time we deal with the Iron Horde presence on this island.',19243),
(35867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы рады любой помощи.',20886),
(35868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),
(35869,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Vindicator Maraad know of your bravery.',0),
(35870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nothing greedily swallows meat. >',20574),
(35871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(35872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),
(35873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $C! I will let Grand Marshal Tremblade know of your bravery.',0),
(35876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У этих дикарей нет чести. Пора нам разобраться с Железной Ордой.',20886),
(35878,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фантастика! Приключение, прямо как в старые добрые времена!',19342),
(35879,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s what I\'m talking about. You\'re tough as nails.',19342),
(35880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я вижу судьбы своих врагов в костях. Все они умрут!',19342),
(35882,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s how you get out of a gladiator pit! You\'re interesting... There\'s so much blood on your weapon, you can tell the shades. Now I\'ll follow you.',19342),
(35883,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For years ogres made me fight, kill and greet them standing in the arena. With every greeting, my soul was bleeding. I will never have to greet an ogre again. You have helped; I will win my freedom, and I will use it to serve under your banner. Today I greet you, commander.',20574),
(35884,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Against all odds, here we stand. Still alive, an entire army on our heels.$b$bOur ship is waiting. Shall we depart?',19342),
(35895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Since that day, the sages have remained in power in Skyreach, now calling themselves the Adherents of Rukhmar and claiming to be the heralds of Her will.',19342),
(35896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Shattered Hand is in shambles and the Avatar of Terokk now walks among us.$B$BWhen I promised you power back in Skettis, did you expect that it would come without any strings attached? Ha!',19342),
(35897,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You carefully hang the bangle upon the effigy\'s arm.>',19342),
(35905,4,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander! Zipfizzle arrived with your laborers in tow just moments ago. We\'ve got a huge surplus of food, now, and promises of more where that came from.$b$bApparently the draenei threw in some other resources as well. Very good work, sir. What should we build next?',19342),
(35907,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Трупы свежие. Убийцы, наверное, еще рядом.',20574),
(35915,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, these corpses are definitely fresh. They can\'t have gone far.',19342),
(35921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey there, bub. Lucy sent you? Good kid.$B$BYeah... you look like you\'ll do nicely.',0),
(35922,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здравствуй, $Gдружище:подруга;. Тебя Люси прислала? Хорошая девочка.$B$BДа... ты как раз подойдешь.',24461),
(35924,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что там у тебя? Дай посмотреть.',20574),
(35925,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это жуткая новость, $n.',20574),
(35926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that? Let me have a look.',19342),
(35927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Перевозить мозги не так-то просто. Они скользкие до ужаса.',20490),
(35928,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a good start. I\'ll throw these in the pot.$B$BBring me more.',19342),
(35933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This folded letter, bearing the mark of Grommash Hellscream, looks promising...',19342),
(35934,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Ниша уже почти здорова.',20574),
(35935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Iron Horde is a threat to us all. We must finish it off completely. For the Horde!',19342),
(35937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мда, ни сережек, ничего. Пусть тебе улыбнется удача, |3-6($C), – в другой раз!',20490),
(35938,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha, yea, just some nose trivia for you there. This pointy trophy proves you slayed a Goblin out there. Good job, here\'s a lil\' something for your hard work.',0),
(35939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Конечно же не $gвидел:видела;! Ну, то есть... Как можно бесшумно красться на копытах?!',20490),
(35940,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jeez... somebody didn\'t brush, eh? Hah, here take this reward $n.',0),
(35941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh man, <coughs> ... get that thing sealed into my bucket quick.',0),
(35942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m kidding! I\'m kidding! We all know you\'re a model $C of Stormshield, $n. Here, take this as a reward.',0),
(35944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы приятно удивлены твоей ловкости в охоте на горенов. Они безжалостны и свирепы и с легкостью могут разделаться с тем, кто не готов к встрече с ними.',19865),
(35945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ох... Нога онемела... какая боль... Меня зовут Греблин Убыстрямс, я археолог.$b$bЧем могу помочь?',19342),
(35947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Gardoul Poisonous Knife may consider himself dead.',20574),
(35948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы приятно удивлены твоей ловкостью в охоте на горенов. Они безжалостны и свирепы и с легкостью могут разделаться с тем, кто не готов к встрече с ними.',19342),
(35959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gardul Venomshiv, eh? He\'s good as dead.',19342),
(35970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Что у тебя?$b$bОжерелье? Неплохо... Еще одно, чудесно. Огромный камень в виде головы огра?$b$b<Греблин озадаченно смотрит на вас.>$b$bСерьезно? Камень в форме идиота? Ну да ладно. Ожерелья неплохие.$b$bВ общем, достойный улов. ',19342),
(35972,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, это гораздо лучше.$b$bБудут знать, как кидаться камнями. Э-э... Ну, то есть знали бы, если были бы живы.',19342),
(35973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кольцо у тебя? Отлично! За это добро Археологическое общество Хитрой Шестеренки выручит отличные деньги.$b$bНикси будет довольна.',19342),
(35985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re looking for what now? I mean, yeah sure... whatever. Just get me down alright?',0),
(35988,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Archmage looks damp and uncomfortable.>$b$bI apologize for the conditions here, $n. I had no choice. I summoned this tower at the optimal confluence of arcane energies. My hope is to finish my work here before all my books get musty.$b$bSo then! Let\'s get to it.',19342),
(35989,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your ring is finished. This is but the first step - with more time together we\'ll be able to create a ring of legendary power. But first things first!$b$bGul\'dan could be hiding anywhere, but if we can locate any of his lieutenants I think I know a way to flush him out. Let\'s begin by gathering the magical reagents I\'ll need.',19342),
(35990,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kadgar rolls the fire sphere in the palms of his hand. >$b$bYou know how to use it, $n? $b$bWell, I don\'t know. Okay, let\'s improvise, sometimes there\'s nothing else.',20779),
(35991,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Замечательно. Давно хотел посмотреть на такое вблизи... Давай откроем.$b$bХм...$b$bЧто ж, творческим их подход не назовешь, но определенное своеобразное очарование в гоблинской работе есть – этого не отнять. Удивительно, как эта штука не взрывается. Хотя, может, и взрывается. По крайней мере, теперь я понимаю, для чего они используют \"самофланж\".$b$bВсе получится. Отлично, $n!',20779),
(35992,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого, еще живое! Ты чувствуешь?$b$bЯ обязательно верну его в землю Дренора, когда мы закончим. Надеюсь, Круг Кенария не допустит его превращения в еще одно оскверненное чудовище.$b$bОтличная работа, $n. Это было весьма непростое задание.',20779),
(35993,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня большой день, $n. Мы уничтожили одного из главных приспешников Гул\'дана и еще на один шаг приблизились к тому, чтобы найти его самого.',20779),
(35994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gul\'dan resists my magic, $n! Hiding, scoundrel! $b$bWell, nothing, we’ll find it on him. I know how to increase the strength and range of my spell ...',20779),
(35995,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The upper magician is choking. >$b$b Give me...> one minute. Uh...$b$b.That was just unbelievable, $n! Perhaps you\'re $g-largest:greatest:c; |3-6($c), shoulder to shoulder with $gwhich..:who:c; I have had the honor of fighting.',20779),
(35997,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Фолиант скверноломов пуст? Дай-ка я посмотрю. А печать короля-чародея у тебя? Ну конечно: смотри, проводишь печатью по странице, и появляется рунный текст. Ого... Это книга не для новичков.$b$bМне нужно время, чтобы полностью расшифровать твою находку, $n, но, похоже, первые страницы посвящены природе Скверны. То, что мне нужно! Отличная работа!',20886),
(35998,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Cadgar lifts several stones to light, so thin threads of secret energy begin to wriggle from stone to stone. >$b$bI don\'t think it would ever occur to me to underestimate ogres again, $n. Take a couple who can think for themselves, and they blind a formidable army of others.',20886),
(36000,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, Chromie agreed to help track down our bronze fugitive. $b$bShe may look miniature, but believe me, she\'s a hundred times older than you.',20779),
(36004,6,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как самочувствие? Хочешь что-нибудь выпить?$b$bХотелось бы сказать, что теперь дела пойдут легче, но все только начинается. Мне придется попросить тебя отправиться в самое сердце империи огров... Ты $gготов:готова;?',20779),
(36005,6,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Колотая рана! Его ранили кинжалом!$b$bЧто за преступная беспечность... Надо было выставить часовых, надо было...$b$bВпрочем, что теперь говорить. Надо действовать, и быстро.',20886),
(36006,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кирин-Тор выслал помощь незамедлительно. Джайна явилась вовремя. Но если бы ты не $gнашел:нашла; Гарону, верховный маг бы точно скончался. Спасибо тебе, $n!',20886),
(36007,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как ощущения?$b$bТвое кольцо – теперь один из самых мощных артефактов в этом мире. И это хорошо. Потому что мы собираемся нанести удар прямо в сердце врага...',20886),
(36009,274,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Watch out! Put it down carefully. I\'ll take it from here.$b$bThe Heart of Rage is not a toy.',20886),
(36010,274,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Посмотрим, что у нас тут... как интересно! Этот рунический язык чем-то похож на диалект игнан калимаг, на котором разговаривают огненные элементали Азерота. Полный перевод может занять целые годы.$b$bНо части на орочьем – да, эти я могу расшифровать. Чтобы научиться не только обрабатывать сталь, но и подчинять саму силу элементаля.$b$bГул\'дан силен, но если мы продолжим раскрывать тайны Дренора, то сумеем ответить на любой его удар...',20886),
(36012,5,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gнашел:нашла; ее! Мне доводилось слышать рассказы об этих могущественных сферах. Как же мне хотелось изучить их во время долгого изгнания в Запределье. И вот, теперь сфера у меня в руках. Покажи-ка…$b$b<Кадгар с благоговением открывает ваш рюкзак и заглядывает внутрь. Его лицо долгое время остается неподвижным. Наконец он произносит:>$b$b...Не знаю, чего я ожидал.',20886),
(36013,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Скрижали у тебя в руках. Отлично! Должно быть, на их сборку ушла уйма времени и сил. Повезло мне с тобой.$b$bНе будем откладывать. Покажи мне свое кольцо. Ага… Я справлюсь. Используем скрижали и сделаем тебя сильнее.',20886),
(36014,6,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,'Что у нас тут? Надо же, легенды все-таки не врут. Чернорук принес свою руку в жертву стихиям. И теперь, после его смерти, ее не отличить от камня. Хотя…$b$b<Кадгар произносит несколько заклинаний из Фолианта укрощения огня. Отрубленная рука медленно сжимает пальцы в кулак.>$b$bХ-м-м-м. Ага. Скажу тебе честно, $n. Это было чертовски жутко.',20338),
(36016,274,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kadgar is very upset. >$b$bI\'m sorry, commander. I already thought we\'d lost you.$b$bThis ring will serve you faith and truth. I\'ve never seen such a mighty and perfect artifact. Perhaps it can still be perfected, but... I don\'t know what the cost is.$b$bUse it wisely!',20886),
(36017,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Магия Гул\'дана глубоко проникла в разум Гароны. Чем больше времени я провожу с ней, тем более мне очевидно, что мы ДОЛЖНЫ освободить ее от этой власти.$B$BЯ ни за что не отступлюсь, $n.',20886),
(36018,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что ж, мои изыскания прошли неплохо. Думаю, теперь мы готовы к следующему шагу. Не факт, что он тебе понравится...',19865),
(36022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s great.',20574),
(36023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They got what\'s comin\' to \'em.',19342),
(36024,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),
(36025,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),
(36026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. You deserve this reward, friend.',0),
(36027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n. It is wonderful to \"see\" you. As you are no doubt aware the state of Outland in our own timeline is constantly degrading.$B$BI wish to extend my remote services to your cause so that I might better investigate Draenor in the time before it was ripped asunder.$B$BThis projection may seem translucent, but I can assure you it acts as a perfect conduit for my own powers.$B$BWill you accept my service?',0),
(36028,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы не дадим ему уйти.',20574),
(36029,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We won\'t let him get away.',19342),
(36030,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(36031,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.<table class=\"iconlist\"><tr><th><ul><li><var></var></li></ul></th><td>Collect: <a href=\"/currency=944\">Artifact Fragment</a>(2500)</td></tr></table>',0),
(36032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),
(36033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'IT\'S SO PRETTTTY. WILL FIT NICE ON MY SPIKE OUTSIDE MY HUT. HAHAHA. HERE, TAKE THIS REWARD AND GET BACK OUT THERE.',0),
(36034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'УХ! А ВОТ ЭТОТ ДЛИННЫЙ. АХ-ХА-ХА! ТАК, ВОТ ТЕБЕ ЗА ТРУДЫ.',20779),
(36037,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This jungle will kill me and I will not return to cower at the mercy of Mar\'gok!$b$bI am a veteran of several wars and campaigned on two continents now. If you have a war worth joining, I will serve for a time.$b$bAt least until I can kill the Sorcerer-King!',19342),
(36038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'WHATEVER, WHO LIKES PANDAS ANYHOW! <Laughs> TAKE THIS REWARD AND GET BACK OUT THERE!',0),
(36040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'WAIT, YOU JUST BROUGHT ME THEIR HAIR? UGH. I SAID I WANTED THEIR HEAD! UGHHH! <Stomps Feet> BUT I GUESS THIS IS ENOUGH TO PROVE YOU FOUGHT ONE IN BATTLE, SO TAKE YOUR REWARD. AND NEXT TIME, THEIR HEAD!',0),
(36041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A TAIL! WELL, YOU SHOULDN\'T HAVE! I\'LL CHERISH IT FOREVER!',0),
(36042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ОТЛИЧНАЯ РАБОТА! ПРИТАЩИ ЕЩЕ, И Я ПРИГОТОВЛЮ ТЕБЕ ТАРЕЛКУ МОЕГО ЛЮБИМОГО БУЛЬОНА ИЗ ЧЕЛОВЕЧЬИХ КОСТЕЙ! ХА-ХА-ХА!',20779),
(36047,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Можем возвращаться на заставу.',20574),
(36048,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect work. I called in a ride for ye back to the outpost when yer ready.',19342),
(36054,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Простой обмен с очень непростыми результатами. В этом и заключается искусство вести дела.',19243),
(36055,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course you agree.',19342),
(36056,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чувствуешь себя в безопасности, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;?',20886),
(36057,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A bloody price to pay just to play with luck.  Let\'s hope it was worth it.',19342),
(36059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight well.',19342),
(36062,1,2,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Ya know, I\'ve been thinking.$b$bWith uncle Krixel back that now frees me up to take some time off from running the Gearworks for a bit.$b$bIf you have the room in your garrison I\'d be glad to come join you, I could even teach you some tricks I\'ve learned to keep your accounts in order and the books cooked!',19342),
(36063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы рады любой помощи.',20779),
(36064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. Once we\'ve collected enough artifacts we\'ll summon the Mage portals back to Warspear within Ashran.',0),
(36065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must of taken great effort to get back to us. Once we\'ve collected enough artifacts we\'ll summon the Mage portals back to Warspear within Ashran.',0),
(36066,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Every little bit helps.',0),
(36067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),
(36068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $C. We won\'t let you down.',0),
(36075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сложно поверить, что есть существо более жестокое, чем огр, но огрон определенно подходит под это определение. Сражение с пойманным огроном на арене – уже непростая задача, но сражение с диким огроном в его собственном логове гораздо опаснее. Слава тебе, герой!',19865),
(36076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы приятно удивлены твоей ловкости в охоте на горенов. Они безжалостны и свирепы и с легкостью могут разделаться с тем, кто не готов к встрече с ними.',19342),
(36078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The gladiator has seen you rip the scales off the back of a small throne, and it is unlikely that he parted with her willingly. It is more of a stone than scales, and the monsters themselves are half stone. It\'s not easy to get a trophy like that!',19865),
(36080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gladiator saw you tear this off the back of a gronnling, which I am sure did not part with it easily. It is more like a stone than a true scale though as these brutes are part stone it seems. Not an easy trophy to collect!',0),
(36081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С глазами гронны по доброй воле не расстаются. Твой гладиатор рассказал про то, как ты $gпобедил:победила; в тяжелом бою. Этот трофей – доказательство твоих способностей. Молодчина! ',19342),
(36083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gronn\'s eye is not something they part with alive. Your gladiator described a fight hard won and this trophy is a testament to your abilities. Well done!',0),
(36084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С ботани шутки плохи. Они невероятно хитрые, да еще и сильные, особенно на своей земле. Этот цветок – настоящее доказательство твоего воинского искусства! ',19865),
(36085,5,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично!$B$BНастало время для следующей фазы нашего плана.',22810),
(36086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The botani are nothing to be trifled with. They are incredibly cunning and their powers are strong on their home land. Taking one of their blooms is an true example of your fighting skill!',0),
(36090,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The infested appear to be mere husks animated by plant life. They are slow but very strong. Slaying even one is a strong demonstration of your own skill!',0),
(36091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sometimes we don\'t get turned into mulch for the jungle. Sometimes we get back up, filled with plants. The Infested are hard to kill. Slaying even one is a strong demonstration of your own skill!',0),
(36092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ancients here tend to be guardians and tenders, but that does not make them any less dangerous. An enraged ancient is something to be behold. Taking a branch from one is a worthy deed!',0),
(36094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ancients here tend to be guardians and tenders, but that does not make them any less dangerous. An enraged ancient is something to be behold. Taking a branch from one is a worthy deed!',0),
(36095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sorry to hear Springslip didn\'t make it. He was a good agent.$B$BThis news of Azuka gaining even more power is troubling to say the least.',0),
(36096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even the insects of Gorgrond are larger and meaner than other parts of the world I have been to! Killing them, which you have obviously done, takes a great deal of strength and skill.',0),
(36097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even the insects of Gorgrond are larger and meaner than other parts of the world I have been to! Killing them, which you have obviously done, takes a great deal of strength and skill.',0),
(36098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you can see, the venom Gorgrond wasps have is extremely powerful. To face one is to possibly face your own death. I would refrain from harvesting more of these, one enough to prove your strength here!',0),
(36100,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations!',19342),
(36101,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you can see, the venom Gorgrond wasps have is extremely powerful. To face one is to possibly face your own death. I would refrain from harvesting more of these, one enough to prove your strength here!',0),
(36103,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gruesome trophy from a gruesome beast. To be frozen and eaten slowly is not a death I would choose. The world is better with less of these basilisks in it!',0),
(36104,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gruesome trophy from a gruesome beast. To be frozen and eaten slowly is not a death I would choose. The world is better with less of these basilisks in it!',0),
(36105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have seen no elementals elsewhere in Draenor that compare in ferocity to those in Gorgrond. I wonder what caused them to be so angry. That crystal was hard-won I am sure!',0),
(36106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have seen no elementals elsewhere in Draenor that compare in ferocity to those in Gorgrond. I wonder what caused them to be so angry. That crystal was hard-won I am sure!',0),
(36107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe I speak for all of us when I say you are among the fiercest predators in Gorgrond! You have faced and slain Gorgrond\'s most dangerous creatures on their home ground and lived to bring something of them back here.$B$BThe gladiators have come together found something that will show the world your might! Bask in the glory champion!',0),
(36108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe I speak for all of us when I say you are among the fiercest predators in Gorgrond! You have faced and slain Gorgrond\'s most dangerous creatures on their home ground and lived to bring something of them back here.$B$BThe gladiators have come together found something that will show the world your might! Bask in the glory champion!',0),
(36117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чего там рыщешь, а? Хотя, собственно, какая разница... Просто помоги мне спуститься, ладно?',19342),
(36119,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve just now showed up? Well, better late than never.',19342),
(36123,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic. You can always bring me back tokens you find on Horde corpses for a bonus reward.',19342),
(36125,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work, $n. You\'re a natural.',19342),
(36127,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, you see, $gis a real seeker: a real seeker; adventure, $n! Come to me anytime you want to look at Ashran with my eyes without leaving the Barrier of the Winds.',20886),
(36130,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes yes, it\'s the real Harrison Jones. Why is he such a celebrity all of a sudden?',19342),
(36131,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you are both a fisherman and a warrior.  I will do what I can to help you.',19342),
(36132,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at all the bait ideas in this thing! Great job $n!',19342),
(36133,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе! Если найдешь еще фрагменты артефакта, принеси их мне или тем, кто в них нуждается. Так ты приблизишь час победы.',20886),
(36134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve never seen a magnaron of that size before. This is bad, $n.',0),
(36136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve never seen a magnaron of that size before. This is bad, $n.',0),
(36137,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Из тебя выйдет прекрасный надзиратель, командир! Не давай спуску этим батракам!$b$bТеперь ты $gпостиг:постигла; основы заготовки леса и поиска древесины. Применим же эти знания на благо нашего гарнизона.',20886),
(36138,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s how it\'s done, commander!$B$BWe\'re now fully operational. Any time you have enough timber to place a work order, come on back to me and we\'ll get started.$B$BThis garrison ain\'t gonna build itself!',19342),
(36141,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad traveler, not bad at all.',19342),
(36142,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You didn\'t believe me about those timber lords, did you? Well now you know.$B$BIt looks like this group will serve you well, $g sir:ma\'am;. Medium sized trees across Draenor are now at your mercy. That means more timber per tree!',19342),
(36157,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ring! You\'ve got it. Feel how it\'s still warm to the touch? The power of Draenor\'s sun is locked into the metal. This is perfect, $n. It is exactly the base material we need to fashion into something amazing.$b$bWhile I prepare your treasure, let\'s talk about our next steps...',19342),
(36158,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудесно, просто чудесно! Эти кристаллы пойдут на отделку твоего кольца, когда мы разберемся еще с парочкой заданий.',20779),
(36160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander! The Burning Blade attacked just a few moments ago, they are looking for the Heart of Gorgorek. $B$BThankfully, Lieutenant Thorn was here to protect us.$B$BWhat? You found a rose? Shh, hand it to me quickly. I\'ll hold onto this until the time to confess my love is right.',0),
(36161,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The assassin appeared out of nowhere.$B$BBaros took the blade that was meant for my heart. I ripped out the throat of our attacker... but I was too late.$B$BBaros gave me this flower before he passed.$B$B<Thorn holds up the rose. A tear rolls down her cheek.>',0),
(36162,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Today was not a good day.',0),
(36163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n.',0),
(36164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see that you and Yrel have stared into the eyes of the most primal of the elementals, and not waivered from your path.$B$BIt pleases me to say that your courage is not lacking.$B$BWell done.',0),
(36165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By Muradin\'s beard... what a headache...',19342),
(36166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I swear by the spirits, by the spirits... how my head hurts...',20574),
(36167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News of your deeds precedes you. Rangari Saardar already sent word of your excellent work.$B$BThanks to the both of you, $n.',0),
(36168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems you have been successful in your journey.$B$BHow do I know this? If you had not passed the challenge of the ancestors, you would not have returned at all.',0),
(36169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, champion. Well done.',0),
(36171,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We beat back nature, Commander. May I be excused? I\'d like to get all this sap out of my armor.',0),
(36176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another competitor for the competition? How wonderful! Garaal will be pleased!',19342),
(36177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, $n! You did it!$B$BThe other competitors are nowhere to be found!$B$BGaraal will be most pleased. With such an abundance of supplies to work with he and the other craftsmen will have no trouble staying busy.$B$BI\'ll start tanning these immediately. They\'ll be ready for delivery in just a moment.',19342),
(36179,1,4,0,0,0,100,0,0,'Lemmy\'s gun broke down again I take it?$b$bGood job covering for \'em out there. I could use more workers like you!',19342),
(36182,604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is fantastic! This sample indicates massive timber reserves in the large timber found across Draenor. And now with the Tree Murderer 9000 at your disposal you\'ll be able to chop those towering monstrosities down with ease.',19342),
(36183,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'From one commander to another... thank you.$B$BWe\'ve faced off on the field of battle so many times. Vashj\'ir... the Jade Forest... Lion\'s Landing...$B$BI am glad I could end my journey with such a worthy adversary.',19342),
(36185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $n.$B$BFanara mentioned the competition was fierce this year.$B$BMy, my. These goods should keep me busy for an entire season!$B$BAs the victor of the competition one usually becomes my apprentice, however, your skills are surely in need of no apprenticeship.$B$BPerhaps a trade is in order.$B$BI\'ll keep your delivery and share the goods with our local craftsmen and in return, I\'ll share some of our knowledge with you.',19342),
(36189,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Из тебя выйдет прекрасный надсмотрщик! Не давай спуску этим дровосекам!$b$bТеперь ты знаешь основы заготовки леса и поиска древесины. Применим же эти знания на благо твоего гарнизона.',22810),
(36192,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так-то, командир!$b$bТеперь мы работаем на полную мощность. Когда у вас будет достаточно древесины для размещения заказа, возвращайся ко мне, и мы приступим.$b$bГарнизон сам себя не построит!',19243),
(36193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the Light! All of the rangari who were missing have returned accounted for. Thank you, hero.',0),
(36194,1,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И это они еще даже не старались.$b$bУверен, помощь боевых дровосеков окажется незаменимой, командир. Средние деревья по всему Дренору отныне беззащитны перед тобой. А с каждого такого дерева мы получим еще больше древесины!',19243),
(36195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is fantastic! This sample indicates massive timber reserves in the large timber found across Draenor. And now with the Wood Annihilator XXI the Third, Jr. at your disposal you\'ll be able to chop those towering monstrosities down with ease.$B$BGet off my back, I didn\'t name it.',0),
(36196,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты только $gявился:явилась;? Что ж, лучше поздно, чем никогда.',20779),
(36197,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, this Zurg is really evil, right?',20779),
(36198,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе! Если найдешь еще фрагменты артефакта, принеси их мне или тем, кто в них нуждается. Так ты приблизишь час победы.',20779),
(36199,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad traveler, not bad at all.',19342),
(36201,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you are both a fisherman and a warrior.  I will do what I can to help you.',19342),
(36202,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at all the bait ideas in this thing! Great job $n!',19342),
(36205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My father\'s hammer, where did you find this!?',0),
(36206,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С этим разобрались. Как только они прибыли на Дренор, Гаррош убил своего спасителя.$b$bНо он не довел дело до конца. Дух дракона все еще не упокоен.$b$bНадеюсь, ты $gготов:готова; к сражению.',20779),
(36207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where did you find this hammer!?',0),
(36208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Некоторые делают из кристаллов горенов оружие. Правда, оставшаяся на таком кристалле кислота смертельно опасна даже для того, кто им вооружен.',20574),
(36209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поиски увенчались успехом?',20574),
(36210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Эти панцири – как раз то, что нужно.',20574),
(36219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I won\'t waste your time, champ. I\'ve got a once in a lifetime opportunity for you.',0),
(36220,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you\'ve killed; Lug\'dola, you\'re definitely in the test arena. $B$BI don\'t even care if you\'re gsmall:small; and not ogre.',19342),
(36221,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You? Fightin\' ta be da Blood Champion? Hmm.',19342),
(36222,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it, mon! I never thought I\'d be seein\' such a fight!',19342),
(36223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что ж, записи у нас. Посмотрим, что из них удастся узнать о вражеской стратегии.',20574),
(36226,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the spirit of a real researcher, $n.',20779),
(36227,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ALL FIVE? PFF. TAKE YOUR REWARD AND GO BACK.',20779),
(36228,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'YES YES! <Sniffs armor parts> MM-M ... BLOOD! FRESH!',20779),
(36230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, thank you for avenging my death.',0),
(36236,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кажется, вам досталась особенная портновская книга.$B$BОна принадлежит Амике, лучшей портнихе в деревне Эмбаари.',19865),
(36238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This entire time... I have been so consumed with my own grief.$B$BI never once stopped to consider how much my father was suffering at the hands of our enemies.$B$BThank you so much, $C, for helping him to return to me. Please, allow me to repair his hammer.$B$BIn exchange for everything you have done for us, I will teach you whatever you wish to know.',0),
(36239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, my. One of my satchels! Where did you find this? I lost it weeks ago.$B$BI\'ve been so busy training I forgot to collect herbs for Master Ardule. I need your help $n, if you are willing, but I must warn you - the herbs can be quite dangerous!$B$BHand me the satchel and I\'ll restore the protective inscription to guard you from harmful toxins.',0),
(36240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was fast, $n! And such a generous delivery!$B$BI\'ve secured the ink in a vial for you, but please be careful.',0),
(36241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My, $n. Your delivery...$B$BI don\'t know how to thank you enough.$B$BThis is a substantial amount of ink. You\'ve helped ensure our history for generations to come.$B$BPerhaps I can repay you with a taste of the very knowledge you\'ve helped preserve?',0),
(36242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew it was only a matter of time before Azuka would make her move.',0),
(36248,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Azuka\'s reign of terror continues... we need a new plan.',0),
(36255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting, an Arakkoa recently visited the garrison looking for an armor piece with a powerful enchantment like this. His name was Delath.$B$BThe enchantment on this bracer is beyond my skill, but perhaps this Delath can give you the necessary insight to replicate it.',0),
(36256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do I also detect that you have in your possession an artifact of our land? $B$BCan I see it?$B$BOne of Oru\'kai\'s bracers... Thank you!',0),
(36257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I thought I was going to be stuck here forever.',0),
(36260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... This is it, after so many years. Soon, I will have all of the Armaments of Oru\'kai.$B$BReturn my ring as well and I will fulfill the promise I made to that squeamish orc. $B$BTake this book. If you have any skill, you can use it to decipher and learn Draenor\'s enchantments. $B$BOf course, you will need a proper workplace as well. Here are plans; hopefully you can follow them.$B$BNow, be gone, and steer clear of the other armaments, for they are mine.',0),
(36262,470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это что, моя портновская книга? Точно! Какое счастье, она цела! Как я могу тебя отблагодарить?',20779),
(36266,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И вновь ты $gоказал:оказала; мне большую услугу.$b$bНачнем же.',20886),
(36269,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно! Ткань и магия идеально сбалансированы и стабильны.\n\nРада признать, что ты $gовладел:овладела; основами моего портновского искусства. Я восхищаюсь твоим мастерством и неутомимым желанием учиться чему-то новому.\n\nДавай я дам тебе еще несколько отрезов и материалов. Надеюсь, они пригодятся тебе в путешествии.',20886),
(36271,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great, commander! Before you know it, we\'ll have your skin or fur ready for you. Now that you know how to use the trap, you can hunt with it whenever you want. Really, our stable isn\'t rubber, so before you catch any new creatures, make sure there\'s room!',20886),
(36272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, commander! We\'ll get to grillin\' up those steaks right away. I can already smell them!',0),
(36273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n.$b$bI\'m surprised we made it out of Spiteleaf Thicket alive! I can still hear the sound of their maniacal laughter as they swarmed us....',19342),
(36274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That must have been quite a fight, commander!$B$BThe materials we obtain from beasts of this magnitude will last us for quite a while.',0),
(36275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! I see you have my research with you... and what\'s this? You also have my supply bag and the anti-fungal boots!$b$bSpectacular! I now have the tools I need to continue my research into the Zangar fungal strain....',19342),
(36280,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не стану тратить твое время. Такая возможность выпадает только раз в жизни.',19342),
(36281,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I won\'t waste your time, champ. I\'ve got a once in a lifetime opportunity for you.',0),
(36282,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не стану тратить твое время. Такая возможность выпадает только раз в жизни.',19116),
(36284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the spore samples for my research! Excellent!$b$bThe Zangar Shore is a dangerous place... what with the risk of fungal mutation and all.$b$bOh... I didn\'t mention that part before? I was sure I did!$b$bNo matter! You look hardy enough, I\'m sure your genes are impervious to foreign fungal strains that your body has never before encountered!',19342),
(36285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you\'ve retrieved Dirgemire\'s fungal brain!$b$bNot only is the fungal structure perfectly intact, as a specimen it is exquisite! I will need only a moment to begin the examination...',19342),
(36286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my! What do we have here, commander?$B$B<Inspecting the transponder.>$B$BA little damaged, slightly bent and burnt to a crisp, but this is my lucky day!$B$BWe\'ve been testing a new device and this transponder carries invaluable information! I\'ll have Bixx extract the coordinates for mapping.$B$BJust a few more parts and I should be able to teleport anything across this entire valley! And I do mean anything!$B$BThat\'ll surely help our reinforcements stand against the Iron Horde!',19342),
(36287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Those supplies were just what I needed! I think I\'m finally figuring out how to work with all these Draenor parts. I\'d be happy to show you, commander. I should be able to fix it in a jiffy.$B$BOh... and remember, deep breaths!',19342),
(36289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ll need to keep an eye on this Azuka Bladefury character. Sounds dangerous.',0),
(36290,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We best be keepin\' an eye on dis Azuka Bladefury. She be bad news.',19342),
(36292,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad you made it, $n. It\'s time to start pushing back on this Iron Horde invasion.',19342),
(36296,66,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For tens of thousands of years we Botani have clashed against the mightiest forces of this world, but none have had your unbridled ferocity and resilience.$B$BI... I concede to your battle prowess. I will aid you in your campaign for dominance of my world.$B$BIf you will accept me.',19342),
(36301,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was chased by ogres and had to leave my bag behind. It looks like almost everything is here, except for... oh, no!',0),
(36307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad you made it, $n. It\'s time to start pushing back on this Iron Horde invasion.',19342),
(36308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Интересно. Недавно в гарнизон заглядывал араккоа по имени Делат и искал деталь доспеха, на которую наложены как раз такие мощные чары.\n\nЭти заклятья мне неподвластны. Возможно, как раз Делат сможет подсказать тебе, как их воспроизвести.',19865),
(36309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... this is my satchel... but how?$B$BDid you see a boy - a young boy near this? You must tell me where you found it!$B$BI tried to fight them, but the looters... they were too strong! They almost killed me!$B$BPlease, please....$B$BI\'d give anything to have my only son back! I cannot fail him....',0),
(36310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я не ошибаюсь, у тебя в руках артефакт наших земель? \n\nПозволь мне взглянуть на него.\n\nОдин из браслетов Ору\'кая… Благодарю!',19116),
(36311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My boy!$B$B<A tear falls down his cheek, clearing a path down to the skin where soot once rested.>$B$BYou... no words can explain how grateful I am.$B$BI can only repay what I have to offer, which isn\'t much in terms of valued goods. Most of my work goes straight to our soldiers. I do, however, carry the wisdom of my people and my craft.$B$BIt would be an honor if you allowed me to share some of this wisdom with you.$B$BMay the light guide you, $n.',0),
(36313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе. Я думала, что застряла здесь навсегда.',19116),
(36314,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Please, allow me to take a closer look.',0),
(36315,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да, наконец-то. После стольких лет! Скоро я соберу все артефакты Ору\'кая.\n\nВерни мое кольцо, и я исполню обещание, данное этой привередливой дренейке. \n\nВозьми эту книгу. Если ты хоть что-нибудь умеешь, то она поможет тебе расшифровывать и изучить чары Дренора. \n\nТебе также понадобится подходящее рабочее место. Вот чертежи, надеюсь, ты в состоянии следовать им.\n\nА теперь исчезни. И держись подальше от остального оружия – оно мое.',19116),
(36316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There may now be hope for a brighter future. I can only hope that some of the people in the Celestial Way have come to their senses.',20886),
(36341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your feats seem to know no limits, $n. Today, our garrison forces have struck a terrible blow to Warchief Hellscream and the Iron Horde.$B$BHowever, he is not defeated so easily. If anything, his hunger for vengeance will grow.$B$BWe must destroy the root of his operations in Tanaan Jungle, but first, there is much preparation to be done.$B$BUntil then, bask in the glow of our momentous victory.',0),
(36342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your feats seem to know no limits, $n. Today, you and your garrison forces have struck a terrible blow to Warchief Hellscream and the Iron Horde.$B$BHowever, he is not defeated so easily. If anything, his hunger for vengeance will grow.$B$BWe must destroy the root of his operations in Tanaan Jungle, but first, there is much preparation to be done.$B$BUntil then, bask in the glow of our momentous victory.',0),
(36344,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ловушка выдержала! Уже чувствую запах мяса. Отличный будет пир для наших воинов!',19342),
(36345,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень хорошо. Кожа или мех скоро будут готовы.$B$BТеперь ты умеешь обращаться с ловушкой и сможешь использовать ее в любое время. Правда, хлев у нас не резиновый. Не советую брать от земли больше, чем необходимо.',19243),
(36346,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thunder and lightning! I bet it was a hell of a massacre!$B$BThat much material will last us long enough. ',19342),
(36352,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$R, how can I repay you for returning this pendant to me?',0),
(36353,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, we\'ve been through hell and back together more times than I can count. You\'re the Alliance\'s best chance at defeating the Iron Horde, and you know it.$B$BHow do you feel about me joining your garrison? We can bring the fight to orcish scum together, just like old times.',19342),
(36368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frenna didn\'t make it out of Tangleheart.',19342),
(36376,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We sent them packing, Commander!',0),
(36378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This diamond is marvelous! I shiver at the mere thought of the massive creature this must have come from...',0),
(36379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Poor Pazerp... this news is unsettling to say the least. The Iron Horde seems to have an unending supply of troops.',19342),
(36380,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help $n, please take this pendant along with a copy of my research.$B$BI hope these will prove useful in helping you to better understand the secrets of Draenic gems.$B$BUntil we meet again, friend.',0),
(36382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis not good. Them Iron Horde be causin\' a lot of da trouble round here. We need ta find a way ta deal wit dim.',19342),
(36384,1,5,0,0,0,3000,0,0,'The serum did what!??!$b$bI must have used too much growth hormone. Possibly... the mixture just needs to be shaken prior to dosage?',19342),
(36385,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So what you\'re saying is that this here book is actually a container to hold the remains of targets on a hit list? And the assassination was being perpetrated by another... tree?$B$BThis world is crazy.$B$BNow let\'s see what happens when we put all the pieces into place.',19342),
(36404,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n! We will get started planting the garden right away.',19342),
(36408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What have you got here...$B$BOnly a keen eye would be able to spot the potential of this drained crystal. You may not be familiar with draenei crystals yet, but your familiarity with gems certainly shows.$B$BTell you what... if you would assist me in the troubles we\'re having with our local defense crystals I\'d gladly share some of my own expertise in jewelcrafting with you.',0),
(36409,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve found it! This crystal is overflowing with energy. This is definitely what we were looking for.$B$BI fear even thinking about what kind of ritual this orc was planning to undergo with the power from this crystal.$B$BYou\'ve done a great thing for us, $C. As promised, I would like to show you my appreciation by teaching you how to work with some of our native gems and crystals. I trust you will put the knowledge to good use.',0),
(36412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were a blaze amongst our foes, Commander. It looks like we\'ll see another dawn in Draenor.',0),
(36414,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing like a little righteous bloodshed, to shake the chill from these old bones.',0),
(36417,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This looks to be all of the cloth, but it appears that they tried to rip and pull the magic out by physical force. I think I see teeth marks...',0),
(36419,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There, you\'re on the path to becoming a true Hexweave tailor.$B$BDo not share the secrets I\'ve shown you here with anyone.',0),
(36423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Let\'s see if your pets like their new space!',0),
(36425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Strangely satisfying.>',19342),
(36427,603,5,603,273,0,0,0,0,'\"The brothers united once more,\" he said.$B$B\"A world full of untold riches to plunder,\" he said.$B$B\"Wealth beyond imaging,\" he said!$B$BAnd then he proceeded to drop a log on top of me.$B$B\"There can only be one CEO of Barov Industries,\" he said.$B$BAt least we can agree on that...',19342),
(36428,4,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yea! Great work, $n!$b$bI\'ve already heard from the survivors and they\'re glad for this second chance at life.$b$bYou made a real difference today!',19342),
(36429,603,5,603,273,0,0,0,0,'Он говорил: \"Братья вновь объединились\".$B$BОн говорил: \"Мир полон сокровищ, которые можно присвоить себе\".$B$B\"Несметных богатств\", – так он говорил!$B$BА потом сбросил на меня бревно.$B$B\"В \"Баров Индастриз\" может быть только один генеральный директор\", – сказал он.$B$BНу, хоть в этим мы с ним сходимся...',19342),
(36432,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'D\'kaan worried about me? He is more worried I will be chased back to the camp with one of those giant beasts in tow. Still I could use your help here...',19342),
(36434,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, there y\'are!$b$bPenny Clobberbottom reportin\' for duty, commander.',19342),
(36435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have been studying these orcish texts feverishly since our arrival here. Allow me a moment to translate this for you.$B$BHmmm... The notes appear to contain a list of names.',0),
(36436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have slain quite a few as well but they continue to spring up here.$b$bWe will need another solution...',19243),
(36437,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the normal ebb and flow of battle has been disrupted by the saberon. I do not think it wise to leave things as such.$b$bWe should see about infiltrating the saberon and setting things right.',19243),
(36438,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, you have strong friends, $p! You need to hurry until the plants have realized that the path is clear.',20574),
(36439,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your machine is brutish but effective, well done $p. We must make haste before the plants realize the way is open.',19243),
(36440,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many are finding bolt-holes to weather your storm, friend. That should keep them out of our way.',19243),
(36441,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A good catch discovering those herbs $p. We cannot allow them to continue using these. Who knows what it might set off.',19243),
(36442,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have... you have brought me the bloom. At last my purpose can be fulfilled!',19243),
(36443,15,1,0,0,0,2,0,0,'At last it is done.  Dionor has left and his spawn shall follow him in due time.$b$bI grow weary of this conflict and the desire to return to the Overgrowth has left me.$b$bPerhaps I will travel beyond these lands and see what other surprises you little beasts have to share...',19243),
(36448,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Weldon holds Alexi\'s head up to his face and begins speaking.>$B$BYou no-good, backstabbing son-of-a-goat! Your greed is only surpassed by my own!$B$BAs for you my peasant friend, you have served me well. Here are your just rewards!',19116),
(36449,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alexi holds Weldon\'s head up to his face and begins speaking.>$B$BYou no-good, backstabbing son-of-a-goat! Your greed is only surpassed by my own!$B$BAs for you my peasant friend, you have served me well. Here are your just rewards!',19342),
(36457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You know the trick to fooling a bunch of Orcs? Every once in a while you\'ve got to be holding all the cards!',0),
(36460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps this little creature will earn her keep after all.',19342),
(36469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice job, brudda. I hope your pets be likin\' dere new home.',0),
(36471,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Next time I won\'t go so easy on you!',0),
(36474,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My husband sent you, didn\'t he?$b$bNormally I would laugh at that, but seeing these horrors, Kaz and I could use all the help we can get.',19342),
(36475,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, this is it, THIS IS IT! Just give me a moment while I look through these.$B$BHmm... I think there are a few things here that you may find very useful. Here, take these plans with you.$B$BDon\'t worry about me, commander. I\'m just gonna take another look around before I sneak out of here.',0),
(36477,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, I see that you\'ve found my lovelies. Beautiful, aren\'t they? It\'s a shame that the process drives them so... insane.$B$BThe ring is yours to keep, of course. Can you hear them whisper? Marvelous.',0),
(36481,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, great flying out there, ace! Here\'s your prize!',19243),
(36482,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yay! Burn the bad guy! Burn him a lot!',19342),
(36483,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you could do it, kid.',0),
(36488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow. Those... \"dwarves\"... sure do know how to make both botani AND goren mad.',19342),
(36494,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, mon.',19342),
(36495,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'C возвращением, $n.',22810),
(36498,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The situation here is dire, $n. We have much to discuss.',19342),
(36499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The situation here is dire, $n. We have much to discuss.',19342),
(36502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне доводилось видеть растения, имитирующие гидр, но чтобы имитация была лучше оригинала? Такое только в Горгронде возможно. Отличная работа, $p.',19116),
(36503,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In these parts even plants turn into bloodthirsty monsters. Biogor was one of the most dangerous; it was motionless, like a plant, waiting in an ambush until the victim came too close. This monster deserved to die...',19342),
(36505,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Славный плащ! Жаль только, что у нас больше нет ресурсов, чтобы делать такие.',20886),
(36508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что $gзамолвил:замолвила; за меня словечко, командир.',20574),
(36510,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(36511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(36512,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Auchindoun would have fallen to the demons if it weren\'t for you. Even the blood elves would not have been enough. I don\'t know how I could possibly ever repay you.$B$B<Tuulani\'s face lights up.>$B$BThat\'s it! We\'re kindred spirits, $n. I can feel it! How about I stick around with you?$B$BI\'ll still have to attend to my duties at Auchindoun, but I can handle it. What do you say, $n? It\'ll be great!',19342),
(36513,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(36514,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(36515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(36516,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, я смотрю, ты $gперемазан:перемазана; смолой с головы до ног, $n!$B$BЧто ж, как и было обещано, я помогу тебе починить твой плащ. У меня для тебя наверняка найдется и еще что-нибудь полезное.$B$BТак что заглядывай в гости, не стесняйся!',20886),
(36517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will do nicely, $n! Thank you!',0),
(36518,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow... I\'ve never seen anyone fight like that. That was... impressive.$B$BI\'m in no shape to join Lady Liadrin and the others at Auchindoun now. You have an entire fortress on this world, though. Could I go there and rest awhile? Maybe repair my armor?$B$BI\'ll stick around and join your forces as a token of my gratitude. Liadrin won\'t mind... we\'re all on the same team, right?',19342),
(36519,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have never seen anyone fight like that, $b.$B$BI am regrettably in no condition now to join the Auchenai in defending Auchindoun. I have heard stories of your fortress in Shadowmoon Valley. Could I go there and repair my armor?$B$BPerhaps... I could stay there a while longer than that? I feel there is much you could teach me.',19342),
(36522,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I may have fallen, but I will not be forgotten.$B$BI implore you to allow me to stay here and serve in your army. Bralok took my life, but my spirit stands strong before you.$B$BI need to stop the Iron Horde, $n, and I know you are the only one that can help me do that.',19342),
(36523,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is it still twitchin\'? I think I saw it still twitchin\'.',19342),
(36567,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now THAT\'S what I\'m talkin\' about! Look at this place!\n\nWe\'ve even got a pool out back. Little cold, sure, but ya can\'t always have a tropical paradise.',19342),
(36573,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, we dealt a terrible blow to the Iron Horde\'s forces.',19342),
(36574,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, we have dealt a great blow to the forces of the Iron Horde.',19342),
(36575,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have dealt a great blow to the Iron Horde, commander. We will defeat them yet.',19342),
(36576,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир, мы нанесли мощный удар Железной Орде. Мы еще ее разгромим.',20574),
(36589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think we could get into some serious trouble with this beauty!',0),
(36592,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'MUCH better!  A lot less bumping into walls to be sure.\n\nThere should be room to get in another building or two now. We can get the additional construction going whenever you\'re ready - just point me at anything you\'re interested in on the table here.',19342),
(36594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What did you think of my rapid disassembly tech? Pretty effective, yeah?',0),
(36595,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah perfect. I\'ll get this up an\' runnin\' in no time.',19342),
(36601,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир, хорошо, что ты снова здесь.\n\nВ Награнде что-то происходит. Сейчас расскажу все подробности.',20886),
(36602,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Boss, it\'s good to have you back.\n\nSomething\'s going on at the Awards. Let me give you the details.',19342),
(36606,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander. Good to have you back.\n\nWe\'ve got some movement in Nagrand. Let me fill you in on the details.',19342),
(36607,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Boss-mon. Good to have ya back.\n \nWe been seein\' some movement in Nagrand. Let me give ya the details.',19342),
(36608,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gпришел:пришла; из Дренора? Как такое вообще возможно?!',24015),
(36609,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Чтобы произвести на Пэгла впечатление, нам нужно поймать что-то очень-очень большое!',24015),
(36611,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s the fish, $n! All fish fish fish! You\'re doing great!',24015),
(36612,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s good... Such a fish will impress even those who are far from fishing, and Nata!',24015),
(36614,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think I could just fall over and die happy right now. It\'s a dream come true!\n\nI already ordered some even larger draft paper, boss. Don\'t you worry...',19342),
(36615,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... I think I like it. A little more blue paint, maybe some taller towers, but you can really call it home, you know?\n\nI already ordered some even larger draft paper, sir. Don\'t you worry...',19342),
(36616,1,1,4,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты и в самом деле $gвеликий рыбак:великая рыбачка;!\n\nЯ с радостью присоединюсь к тебе, и вместе мы наловим целую прорву рыб-гигантов. Но сперва нужно захватить с собой выпить.',24015),
(36617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s a small note in the gift that says: \"Happy holidays, $n!\".',19342),
(36623,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good sport, fighting foes larger than yourself. You\'re happy with your grunts\' conduct, Commander?',19342),
(36624,66,0,0,0,2000,0,0,0,'Just a second, pal. Can\'t you see I\'m busy here?$b$bCommander! I didn\'t think you were actually going to show... I mean... welcome, commander.',19342),
(36626,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Commander $n, I\'m so glad you could make it. It\'s a true honor, sir.',19342),
(36627,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmmm... sounds like it still needs a bit more punch. Let me get back to work on it, boss, I\'ll see what I can do!$B$BGood news is, we know a lot more about the Iron Horde tech now. I made a copy of my notes for ya.',0),
(36629,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you again for taking the time to visit, commander. You have no idea how much it means to us.',19342),
(36630,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look, I don\'t have time for any... Oh, it\'s you!',19342),
(36632,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Gorgrond, Commander. We only just arrived ourselves.',0),
(36633,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well it\'s about time ye showed up. I\'m done slumming around with these new recruits.$b$bMe blade is sharp, me armor is spit shined and I combed me beard this mornin\'.$b$bI\'ve been ready for battle since me grandpa Gygax first put an axe in me wee lil hand.$b$bSo whad\'ya say, commander?',19342),
(36641,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19342),
(36642,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$b$bI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',19342),
(36643,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19865),
(36644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),
(36645,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19342),
(36646,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19342),
(36647,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',20886),
(36648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),
(36649,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уже вернулись гонцы с вестями о ходе наступления – и с трофеями, конечно же.$B$BПоздравляю с успехом, командир.',19116),
(36650,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing teaches a bully better than a bloody nose! Good fight, Commander. It\'s an honor to stand with you.',0),
(36653,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is this what a peon feels like? Chopping down trees and pruning unruly hedges all day? And I thought their job was a bore. Hah!',19342),
(36655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know what\'s worse, the brutality of this Iron Horde or the tempered menace of our old foes. It doesn\'t matter. Neither measures against our strength, Commander.',0),
(36662,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You showed \'em, boss!',0),
(36667,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы получили хорошие вести с полей, босс. Уже и первые трофеи есть.$B$BПусть знают, с кем связались.',19342),
(36669,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',19342),
(36671,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Incredible! You\'ve got real moxy, kid.',0),
