(36806,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take any lunkers you like find like this off your hands. Come back and see me anytime you catch one and I will pay you top dollar!',0),
(36812,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re good people, commander.',19342),
(36813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Within this pouch I have placed three Everbloom seeds. You merely have to crush the seed to release the spores within. Inhale deeply and let the subversive infestation take hold.$B$BOnce empowered you will become an unstoppable force of nature; though be warned, I have modified these seeds to cause you minimal harm, thus their potency is somewhat reduced.$B$BYou must not undergo the transformation too frequently.$B$BShould you require more seeds I will offer them to you - for a small price.',0),
(36828,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Kick \'em while they\'re down!',19342),
(36830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re defeated! I\'m glad we came here, Commander. To Draenor. Fighting against demons reminds me why we fight for the Alliance.',0),
(36831,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уфф! Мы отбились от этих проклятых демонов, командир. Но моя кровь до сих пор словно кипит. Посмотри – у меня глаза не красные?',19342),
(36832,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If the perfume\'s not with Zach, Zach\'s not with it. But Zach likes you.',19342),
(36833,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты очень меня $Gвпечатлил:впечатлила;, $n. Если не возражаешь, я бы хотела присоединиться к твоему гарнизону.',20574),
(36843,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is Ahan alive? Bless us, Light, that\'s the good news!',20779),
(36848,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your efforts will be well rewarded, $n. The ancient waygates now serve you.',0),
(36861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, you\'re from that Alliance base right?$B$BGlad you made the trip because we really could use your help!',0),
(36862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, you\'re from that Horde base right?$b$bGlad you made the trip because we really could use your help!',19342),
(36864,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can honestly say I never thought I\'d see the premier Horde commander walking through an Alliance garrison.$B$BThen again, I never thought I\'d be caught while performing reconnaissance for the Dark Lady and stuffed in a hole in the ground left for dead.$B$BI\'m clearly not going anywhere without your help. If you help me out of this hellhole, I\'ll serve under your banner. My solo run has been decidedly less than pleasant.',19342),
(36870,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will do nicely... A fish like this would be hard for anyone to deny, especially Nat!',0),
(36874,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We may kill from sky break to sky fall and still our work will never be done. Yet at the end of days when we are measured for our accomplishments, only the bloody wake that we have left behind us will show our true strength. For this reason you must never stop the slaughter of those that would seek to harm us and our loved ones.$B$BPromise me, $n.$B$BNever. Stop.',0),
(36876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is a start, to be certain, but there is much work to be done if Draenor is to be saved. Show no mercy, for they will show none to you.$B$BThe only warlords left upon Draenor will be you and I.',19342),
(36881,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks to me like we ended up in the right place.',19342),
(36882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We should really catch some big one\'s when Nat\'s gets here!',0),
(36884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'М-М... КАКОЕ МЯГКОЕ. И ВСЕ ЕЩЕ ТЕПЛОЕ. ОТЛИЧНО.',20779),
(36889,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A last warning: once you have accepted this choice you cannot reverse it or make a new choice until you complete your mission$B$BIf your choice is certain, your aim will be true.$B$BStrike fear in the hearts and minds of the enemy! For the Horde. For Draenor.',0),
