(36941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is worse than I imagined.$b$bThe Iron Horde is proving to be a massive threat to our people... I don\'t want anymore bloodshed, but I fear we are out of options.$b$bWe need a plan before we strike.',19342),
