(37079,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I had never seen such a beast before coming here, but you have trained it. No small feat, to be certain. Take the reins, you have earned them.',0),
(37080,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The blood o\' our fallen foes has not yet sated my thirst, commander.$B$BI have a trick up me sleeve that ought ta help change that.',0),
(37081,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы слишком милосердны к врагам, командир.$B$BЕсли позволишь, то я применю одно заклинание – оно покажет им, что вставать у нас на пути не стоит.',19342),
(37082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A bold decision, gladiator. For most, death is the only thing they find at the Coliseum. Surviving here is more than a test of skill, it is a test of wills. Do you have the fortitude to become a champion?',0),
(37083,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Remarkable! You have proven yourself a true gladiator. And to a true gladiator goes more than honor and glory!',0),
(37084,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The shadows... they have taught me how to slip into the minds of our enemies.$B$BYes... turn them against their own. Our victory will be swift. Rawk!',0),
(37085,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наш клан сильный. Сильнейший. $B$BЯ питаю нашу страсть, делаю нас сильнее. Мы победим!',19342),
(37086,579,1,603,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s all? Well. don\'t feel too bad. Some days we find nothing and the next we hit the jackpot!$b$bHere, I have a fresh supply of items from our latest outing. Check them out.$b$bGood luck!',19342),
