(37110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, you have hunted the hunter. Many beasts will be pleased tonight.',0),
(37111,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A savage beast, yet you have tamed it. I should learn to never underestimate you. It awaits your command patiently, almost like it knows you wait for it. Here are the reins, may your companion be ever at your side.',0),
(37112,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наш девиз – покой и отдых для всех усталых и продрогших! Прошу, садись у огня, отдохни с дороги.$B$BХочешь – отведай, чем у нас кормят, да и выпить чего-нибудь тебе не помешает...',19342),
(37119,603,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ahh, I\'m glad you were able to find a good hire!\n\nI\'ll get back to looking for more candidates for you. Check back in every week to see my latest selections.',19342),
(37121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Like I said, the claw has a strange effect on the mounts we\'ve got here. If ye have it with ye when training a mount-in-training, your mount will be MUCH more vulnerable.$B$BShould ye find the training not rough enough, ye might want to challenge yourself.$B$BI\'d have a pretty hefty prize for anyone that could manage that!',0),
(37122,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve not seen the beasts go so wild in all of my years, as the day we brought this thing back to the stables.$B$BShould ye find the training still not hard enough, take it along with ye. Your mounts-in-training will be even MORE vulnerable.$B$BBe careful! I\'d give a prize to anyone that could best every beast with such an artifact, but I don\'t want to see you wind up dead!',0),
(37123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This claw has a strange effect on the mounts we have. If you have it with you when training a mount-in-training, your mount will be MUCH more vulnerable.$B$BShould you find the training not rough enough, you might want to challenge yourself further by carrying it with you.$B$BI think besting the beasts of Draenor with it would certainly be worthy of a reward.',0),
(37124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have not seen the beasts go so mad in all of my years as a sage, as the day we brought this necklace back to the stables.$B$BShould you find the training still not hard enough, take it along with you. Your mounts-in-training will be even MORE vulnerable.$B$BBe careful! I would gladly reward anyone that could best every beast with such an artifact, but I do not want to see you wind up dead!',0),
(37125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice find! This relic is going to be a welcome addition to someone\'s private collection!',19342),
(37126,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... this is it.$B$BCommander, I will cleave your foes like never before now that I have my sword.',0),
(37127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s so beautiful...$B$BOh, commander, thank you. A million times thank you!',0),
(37128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done. The Legion have suffered a mighty blow.',0),
(37129,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll be takin\' a close look at this... thing. We can\'t have a repeat o\' Northrend.',0),
(37131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. The Dark Lady will appreciate this greatly.',0),
(37137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... yes... this will do nicely. We can use this to do great things.$B$BThank you, commander.',0),
(37140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, master! Elements speak to Leorajh again.',0),
(37141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я выполнил свой долг как жрец Когтя, хоть Искар и Зеллек и сочтут меня еретиком за нарушение священных ритуалов.$B$BМне плевать на их одобрение, и я устал прятаться в тенях.$B$BПозволь мне сражаться с тобой. Я хочу сделать этот мир лучше, прежде чем исчезну из него.',20886),
(37142,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lunk know you kill many ogre for this, and Lunk very upset about this, but Lunk also still grateful.$B$BWait, dis not Lunk family club...',19342),
(37144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done much for us. What can I offer, but my blade?$B$BTalon King, let me fight for you.',0),
(37145,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh... this is... well that\'s very shiny isn\'t it? I think... I\'ll just sit here for a while.$B$B<Budd smiles contentedly.>',19342),
(37146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you have completed this menial task admirably, almost as if you were intended to experience such a thing. Ah fate, what do you have in store for me next?',0),
(37147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will take this to the Shado-pan right away. Fortune be with you, we will have need of your help again when the winds run quiet.',0),
(37148,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная мысль. Миг обожает этих огнежуков. Наловим их побольше и, возможно, сможем убедить его вернуться!$B$BДумаю... Пусть лучше это останется у тебя.',19865),
(37149,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Вот твоя награда.$B$BА мне теперь нужно идти спасать мир. Опять.',19865),
(37150,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Miluna gently kisses a bird. >> The peacock crawls on her shoulder and then disappears into the \"nest\" of her green hair. A second later, a beautiful fan of bright tail feathers appears above Miluna\'s head.$b$b<Miluna\'s blue eyes are filled with tears, and her mouth is opened with admiration. You\'ve made the diadem VERY happy. >',20886),
(37151,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, it does. The ammunition, of course, will end, but at least for a while I will have a goal in life.$B$BNow, you will need it more than me.',19865),
(37152,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Месть сладка, прямо как яблоко.$B$BВозьми это, $gдруг:подруга;. Пусть все твои фрукты ПРЕВРАЩАЮТСЯ В ПЮРЕ, КАК ТВОИ ВРАГИ.',19865),
(37153,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Щит, конечно, здорово запачкался, но это он! Вот, держи – это тебе. Спасибо.',19865),
(37154,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это... может пригодиться. Так, мне пора в Часовню Последней Надежды. Спасибо за помощь.$B$BЭти припасы мне больше не понадобятся, они твои.',19865),
(37155,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maybe that\'s exactly what we need. Here\'s your cut.',19865),
(37156,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, просто отлично.$B$BУ меня он быстро придет в негодность, ведь чинить его нельзя – такой он уникальный. Так что я к тебе еще обращусь.',19865),
(37157,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я чрезмерно благодарен за столь бескорыстный жест! Вероятно, сосудов, содержащих нужную жидкость, было больше одного, но я непременно добьюсь прекрасных результатов и со столь малым количеством раствора. Меня радует мысль о том, что командир слишком занят более насущными проблемами, проблемами мира сего... У него просто-напросто нет свободного времени, чтобы тратить его на уборку того бедлама, что имеет обыкновение окружать его доблестных соратников.',19865),
(37158,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я вижу солнце. Оно такое яркое.$B$BЯ... хочу побыть один. Возьми это – в знак моей благодарности.',19865),
(37159,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Авиана будет довольна. Вероятно, мы сможем тебе помочь.$B$BАвиана решила, что лучше всего будет одарить тебя этим. Используй с умом.',19865),
(37160,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне нравится этот топор. Он поможет мне рубить конечности врагу. Вот, держи – кое-что на память обо мне.',20886),
(37161,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты его $gнашел:нашла;! Я так о нем беспокоился! Вот, бери это, бери!',19865),
(37162,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это действительно жуткое доказательство! Я немедленно отправлюсь туда, чтобы убить не менее двадцати этих монстров.$B$BЗа Долорию!',19865),
(37163,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I\'ll take this to the Black Bulwark right away.$B$BBozumi this, I... got this... from an orc of the Phantom Moon Clan.',19865),
(37164,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этого... Не может быть.$B$BМне пора, вот твоя награда. Мне нелегко с ней расставаться...',19865),
(37165,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне это не нравится. Они хотят поглотить всю планету. С чего они так взбеленились? Кто их обидел? Нужно поскорее отнести это в Круг. Твоя помощь наверняка понадобится снова.$B$BОдин из этих листов чутка волшебный, не теряй его.',19865),
(37166,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Именно такая находка мне и нужна! Немедленно приступаю к исследованиям.$B$BА ты возьми эти прекрасные цветы. Они сорваны специально для тебя!',19865),
(37167,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that will do. Thanks. And here is your reward. Try not to die - maybe someday I will need your services again.',19865),
(37168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< A surprisingly calm sableron brings a massive paw to his chest. >$B$BI\'m Leorage. Not like the others. It was small, weak. He was banished from the tribe. No longer from Bloody Griva... $B$BLeoraj found the cave. He found a stone of sunlight. He learned a lot from the stone. Wants to know more. Wants a new tribe. $B$BYou\'re $gstrong:strong;. Are you from the tribe? $B$BCan Leorage live with you?',20574),
(37177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что $gоткликнулся:откликнулась; на зов.',19342),
(37179,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Знаешь, а ты очень $gнаходчивый:находчивая; и ужасно $gмогущественный:могущественная;. Может, я на время примкну к тебе?$B$BБерегись, Дренор, идет твоя ПОГИ-И-БЕЛЬ!',20886),
(37180,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... this is it.$B$BCommander, I will cleave your foes like never before now that I have my sword.',0),
(37181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, master! Elements speak to Leorajh again.',0),
(37182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... yes... this will do nicely. We can use this to do great things.$B$BThank you, commander.',0),
(37183,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не буду отнимать у тебя время, командир. Перейдем к обсуждению стратегии.',22810),
(37184,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They came at us... from... nowhere.$B$B<The lieutenant nearly passes out.>',19342),
(37191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lieutenant Thorn handles the weapon, her keen eyes taking note of every line, edge, and scratch. After several moments, she speaks.>$B$BMagnificent.$B$BThis blade was honed by a master craftsman, and imbued with ancient magic.$B$BJust imagine if such a powerful weapon were placed in the hands of a skilled warrior...',0),
(37192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Warmaster Zog lifts the blade into the air, admiring its balance and heft.>$B$BNever have I seen a weapon such as this. It was clearly made by a master, imbued with ancient magic, and tested in many a battle.$B$BCommander, I will leave the choice to you, but it would be an honor to see this blade placed in service of this garrison.',0),
(37201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for helping me test out these artifacts.',19243),
(37203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was fun.',20886),
(37204,2,0,0,0,400,0,0,0,'The flames, they burn within me!',19342),
(37205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have helped my pups train, and for that I give thanks.',0),
(37206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You lucky this time.',19342),
(37207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The feathers have fallen and shown us much.',19342),
(37208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have learned from each other. Thank you.',0),
(37209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, that\'s the stuff. I\'m going to run out of ammo, but at least I\'ve got something to live for, for a while.',0),
(37210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, $n! You\'ve made the swamp a safer place for archaeology and earned us a profit at the same time!',0),
(37211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого! Я знал, что рог Бергруу будет немаленьким, но и представить не мог, что он окажется таким огромным!$b$bНадо будет дополнительно выставить покупателю счет за доставку.',19342),
(37221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a find! Great work, $n!$b$bDekorhan\'s tusk will be the centerpiece of someone\'s collection!',19342),
(37222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не буду врать, $n... Я буду спать спокойней по ночам, зная, что Злобнорог больше не бродит по пустошам.$b$bА еще крепче я буду спать на подушке из золота, которое заработаю, продав эту шкуру какому-нибудь богатому коллекционеру!$b$bДзынь!',19342),
(37223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t believe my eyes... you actually took down Gagrog the Brutal? You\'re tougher than I thought!$b$bGreat work, $n!',19342),
(37224,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ого! Вы только посмотрите, какая громадная... должно быть, это самый большой бегемот, какого я только видел!$b$bМу\'гра была еще и одним злейших бегемотов, какие только мне попадались, но сейчас гляди, как она улыбается!$b$bПонятно? Зубы бегемота... улыбка... а?',19342),
(37225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так, что у тебя тут?$b$b<Газмольф внимательно изучает коготь>$b$bЭй! Похоже, что он принадлежал Тек\'когу, но даже если и нет, кто докажет? Отличная работа, вот, держи свою долю!',19342),
(37226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эй! Аккуратней там с этим жалом!$b$b<Газмольф внимательно осматривает жало Зелганага>$b$bНевероятно... Никогда не видел ничего подобного. Как для археолога высшего класса, для меня составит честь искусственно состарить это жало, а затем продать тому, кто заплатит больше.$b$bОтличная работа!',19342),
(37227,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, thank you $n! You\'ve made a lot of wee baby birds very happy.$B$B$B$B$B$BYou\'re my favorite $R!',0),
(37228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are one step closer to crushing the fruit vendor\'s grapes into muddy wine.',0),
(37229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By the light, that\'s her! You\'ve done it again, an\' I can\'t thank you enough! We\'ll try to be more careful next time.',0),
(37230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Again, though more barrels were likely available, one will staunchly make do with the single barrel provided, comforted in the knowledge that the commander must deal with the great pressing issues of this land, and does not have time to clean up the mud that that so dutifully follows the commander\'s heroic allies.',0),
(37231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s hope this is the real thing, every time I go through that portal I feel my fur stand on end.',0),
(37232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes this is perfect. It is time, little souls, to return to the twisting darkness.$B$B<Lilian cackles madly.>',0),
(37233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once again, though I will need to return to Light\'s Hope shortly, you have my most sincere thanks.',0),
(37234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The warmth comforts me. I thank you.',0),
(37235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We will continue to attempt to parlay with the arakkoa.$B$BAviana\'s blessing upon you.',0),
(37236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve saved it! A little nicked, but that can be fixed. Thanks!',0),
(37237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'By the light, they breed like great fiery rabbits! I shall head there presently, to slay no less than THIRTY of the great beasts.$B$BFor Doloria!',0),
(37238,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are greatful for your aid. I shall retire shortly.',0),
(37239,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another one? How curious.$B$BI may not be much closer to finding her, but these arrows bring some comfort to me, at least.',0),
(37240,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, mon. I\'m gonna bring this back to the Circle, just as soon as I can figure out how ta fly in da savage winds of dis place.',0),
(37241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another excellent find from our most illustrious hero! I will immediately begin transcribing your heroic deeds!',0),
(37242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Once again, you have proven yourself invaluable. Perhaps you would like a teaching job?',0),
(37243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A mighty blade, but I will wear it out quickly. Orc heads are harder than they look.',0),
(37244,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oi, that\'s a bright fly! Thank ye, we\'ll just keep on tryin\' until that two-timing ol\' Winky comes on home.',0),
(37245,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect, here\'s a prize for your efforts.$B$BI\'ve got to head out and save everyone now. Again.',0),
(37256,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Idri stares at the ugly head.>$b$bYes, that\'s him.',22522),
(37257,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our bones are all we have left of an existence we left behind a long time ago.$b$b<The prince stares intently into your eyes.>$b$bStay with me, $c. I will help you find your Tidestone.',22522),
(37259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. May the souls of Auchindoun remain at peace with the threat of Teron\'gor eliminated.',0),
(37260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. The families of the rescued miners will never be able to thank you enough for eliminating Gug\'rokk and his slavers.',0),
(37261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Eliminating Skylord Tovra\'s rylak escorts and disrupting the Grimrail will save an innumerable amount of lives.',0),
(37262,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Taking down one of Draenor\'s great giants is regrettable, but letting Skullok, Son of Gruul, remain a tool of the Iron Horde would have led to great distruction.',0),
(37263,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Putting an end to Ner\'zhul and his deathly rituals will allow many to sleep better at night.',0),
(37264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. If not for you, all of Draenor may have withered under High Sage Viryx\'s rule.',0),
(37265,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Your efforts to stop Yalnu may not only have saved our outpost but all of Azeroth as well.',0),
(37266,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Defeating the Ironmarch Vanguard at Upper Blackrockspire is a major blow to the Iron Horde and Azeroth can rest a bit more knowing Warlord Zaela\'s bid for revenge has been permanently dealt with.',0),
(37268,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nothing like a little righteous bloodshed, to shake the chill from these old bones.',0),
(37269,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were a blaze amongst our foes, Commander. It looks like we\'ll see another dawn in Draenor.',0),
(37270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been experimenting again today, and I\'ve come up with some potion formulations that might suit you, commander. Would you like to try one?',0),
(37271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. May the souls of Auchindoun remain at peace with the threat of Teron\'gor eliminated.',0),
(37272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. The families of the rescued miners will never be able to thank you enough for eliminating Gug\'rokk and his slavers.',0),
(37273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Eliminating Skylord Tovra\'s rylak escorts and disrupting the Grimrail will save an innumerable amount of lives.',0),
(37274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Taking down one of Draenor\'s great giants is regrettable, but letting Skullok, Son of Gruul, remain a tool of the Iron Horde would have led to great distruction.',0),
(37275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Putting an end to Ner\'zhul and his deathly rituals will allow many to sleep better at night.',0),
(37276,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Клан Изувеченной Длани и их союзники опасны, командир. Без обид, но мне кажется, что твои стражники запросто прозевают любого убийцу, который решит прокрасться внутрь незамеченным.$B$BЯ бы хотела присоединиться к твоим войскам, чтобы внимательно следить за перемещениями врага. Мы не можем позволить себе потерять тебя в такое время – на твоих плечах лежит слишком много ответственности.',20574),
(37277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. If not for you, all of Draenor may have withered under High Sage Viryx\'s rule.',0),
(37278,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'ve done a great service. Your efforts to stop Yalnu may not only have saved our outpost but all of Azeroth as well.',0),
(37279,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your help is invaluable. Winning the Iron March vanguard on the top of the Black Mountain is a blow to the Iron Horde. Azeroth can take a little break, knowing that Zela\'s desire for revenge will never be satisfied.',19243),
(37281,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I mean nae offense, commander, but I don\'t trust yer forces tae keep ya safe from a Shattered Hand assassination attempt on yer life.$B$BIf it\'s agreeable to ye, I\'d like tae join yer garrison and keep a watch on the scoundrels.',19342),
(37284,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, ты все для меня $gдостал:достала;! Зашибись. Держи деньжата.',20726),
(37285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Here ya go! Instant gratification\'s da best gratification!',0),
(37286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To the victor go the spoils! All hail $n!',0),
(37287,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think ye did the right thing, commander.',19342),
(37288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh you have some blueprint texts for me? That\'s great!$b$bLet\'s do some business!',19342),
(37289,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t think they were ready for that. The Shadowmoon will think twice before attacking us again.',19342),
(37290,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh YEAH buddy! We can work something out. I got plenty of stuff for you to buy!',19342),
(37291,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well fought, commander. Now to strike back before the Thunderlord can recover.',19342),
(37292,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Правильно $gсделал:сделала;, командир. Таким, как она, у нас не место.',19342),
(37293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! Heart! You $gbrought him:brought; ...',19342),
(37296,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps my rituals will be undisturbed for a few nights at least. Your offer is intriguing and I think we can come to an agreement.',19342),
(37305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With every victory, or claim here grows more strong.',0),
(37306,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The was a good fight, Commander. It might give me time to clean my sword.$B$BAnd honor our fallen.',0),
(37307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A complete victory! Draenor denizens will mewl for weeks as they lick their wounds, in whatever dark places they live.',0),
(37318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The boiling cauldron gasps and spurts boiling liquid with each skull that is plunged into the pot.>$b$b<As the last of the skulls is submerged within the bubbling cauldron, you feel the sharp nip of a ghostly breeze upon your skin.>',19342),
(37319,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are beautiful. The bride and groom will be well pleased.',0),
(37320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful. The client was just talking about how she couldn\'t wait to put it around her rival\'s neck. I\'m sure they won\'t be in conflict anymore after this gift.',0),
(37321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is beautiful.',0),
(37322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Святилище содержит десятки ниш, куда последователи пророка поместили свои собственные кристаллы памяти, скорбя о пожертвовавшем собой лидере. Поместите кристалл в пустое гнездо, и памятник оживет...',22810),
(37323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are perfect. I almost feel like my settings aren\'t worthy of such gems.',0),
(37324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you.',0),
(37325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We are back in business!',0),
(37326,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Значит, ты $gтот:та;, о ком так хорошо отзываются твои товарищи. Мы можем обсудить союз, но сначала...',20574),
(37327,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so you are the one your people spoke of so highly. We may discuss an alliance, but first...',19342),
(37328,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно. У нас полно неотложных дел, с которыми нужно разобраться до его прибытия.$B$BТемный следопыт Велонара просит безотлагательно принять ее, командир.',20574),
(37329,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. We have more immediate concerns to deal with until he visits.$B$BHulda Shadowblade requires your immediate attention, $Gsir:maam;.',19342),
(37330,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander.',19342),
(37331,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо сработано, командир.',19342),
(37332,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'На тебя напал тенеспоровый великан? Они очень опасны – ты очень $gсмелый:смелая;, если $gотважился:отважилась; с ним сразиться!$b$bЭтот нарост не похож на часть великана. Вероятно, это другой организм, живущий с ним в симбиозе. Нам понадобится тщательнее его изучить, чтобы понять, какие преимущества он обеспечивает хозяину.$b$bСпасибо, $n. Великолепная работа!',19865),
(37418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Can\'t wait to get this thing up and running for you, commander!$B$BCheck back in tomorrow, and be sure to wear your blast goggles!',0),
(37420,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Can\'t wait to get this thing up and running for you, commander!$B$BCheck back in tomorrow, and be sure to wear your blast goggles!',0),
(37433,2,1,405,0,0,0,0,0,'Поздравляю, командир. Ты $gсправился:справилась; с испытанием Ротуна и $gпоказал:показала;, на что $gспособен:способна;.$b$bВот, возьми это оружие. С ним ты и дальше будешь превосходить своих врагов в бою!',20886),
(37434,2,1,405,0,0,0,0,0,'Congratulations, commander. You have survived the trial of Trial Master Rotun and proven yourself powerful indeed. $b$bHere, take this weapon that you may futher dominate your foes in battle!',19342),
(37439,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done well today, $n.  Your willingness to learn shows that you may very well rise above the unyielding cravings you must endure as a blood elf.$B$BRest not on your laurels, young one, but instead seek to master what you have learned.  Only through diligence will we as a race survive.$B$BTake this - it may be of some use to you.  Go now, and bring glory once more to our people.',20779),
(37440,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Splendid - these will do nicely.  I\'ve been doing quite a bit of thinking on the current malaise Sunstrider Isle suffers under.  One possible course of action I had pondered was to collect these arcane slivers from the beasts on the isle.  In doing so, they could be experimented on; this would provide a potential source of culpability.$B$BAnyway, I will tend to the research.  Allow me to place this incantation on you.  I believe you\'ll make good use of it!',20779),
(37442,2,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n - thank you for sharing your experience at the Shrine of Dath\'Remar.  First off, you should be commended for your sense of duty and respect - it will serve you well not only here, but in all of Azeroth as well.$B$BAs for the odd sensation, it is no doubt a contributing part of the taint that has befallen Sunstrider Isle.  We shall keep an eye on it; thank you for alerting us to it!',20779),
(37443,21,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done - I knew you\'d be perfect for the task.  Once it\'s safe to make use of our outdoor facilities on the isle, I\'ll be putting these things to good use.$B$BLike I mentioned, please feel free to keep the satchel.  Also, you may find this piece of armor to be useful.  Consider it ample compensation for a simple task performed dutifully!',20779),
(37444,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With many of the owlkin now inoculated, we can focus on getting out of here and not have to worry about wiping out the owlkin population in the area.$B$BHere, choose from these.  You\'ve done good work, and you deserve to be rewarded!',19116),
(37445,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me take a look at those.$B$BYes, I think that these will do nicely; good job, $n. The emitter is rather complex so it may take some time to finish the repairs. I\'ll let you know when it\'s ready.$b$bIn the meantime, you might see if Vindicator Aldar has anything he could use you for.',19116),
(37446,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, good.  Maybe they\'ll think twice before slacking next time!  Thanks for the help!',20574),
(37447,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этой крови уж точно должно хватить. Посмотрим, получится ли связаться с духом Иллидана в Круговерти Пустоты.',23222),
(37448,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Значит, по рукам. Либо мы разоблачим Детеррока, либо он развяжет войну между Ордой и Альянсом, а Пылающий Легион уничтожит весь мир.',23420),
(37449,396,397,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grim news indeed. We cannot afford the loss of even one demon hunter, but you and Kor\'vas were right to put an end to Nightglaive.\n\nMore importantly, you have made a good friend in Stellagosa. The remnant of the Blue Dragonflight could prove to be a powerful ally.',22522),
(37450,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Beautiful creatures... pure, one with the world. I didn\'t think that I could hate the Legion more.\n\nThank you, $n.',22522),
(37452,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course you agree.',0),
(37453,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course you agree.',0),
(37454,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Простой обмен с очень непростыми результатами. В этом и заключается искусство вести дела.',19243),
(37455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A simple exchange with complex results. That\'s the art of doing business.',0),
(37456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Feeling safe, stranger?',0),
(37457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Feeling safe, stranger?',0),
(37458,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не слишком ли кровавая цена только за то, чтобы испытать удачу? Будем надеяться, что оно хотя бы того стоило.',20886),
(37459,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не слишком ли кровавая цена только за то, чтобы испытать удачу? Будем надеяться, что оно хотя бы того стоило.',20886),
(37467,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The prince appears emotionally drained.>$b$bThis is the end of the road for me, $n. I can\'t bear to look at them. Moreover, my mere presence puts you in danger.$b$bBeyond this point, you must walk alone.',22522),
(37468,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'New student?',22522),
(37469,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You notice the reflection of something sinister upon the core\'s surface...>',22522),
(37470,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You killed Athissa, $n.$b$bThat is to say, you and... and my people...$b$bMy people... they fought for us...$b$bBut, Warlord Parjesh has escaped through the portal with the Tidestone. You must pursue him and retrieve the Pillar of Creation.',22522),
(37486,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She spoke of the Tidestone? That sea witch must not realize how close she truly is to finding it.$b$bWe should move quickly. We are close to your prize, and the naga are circling in.',22522),
(37492,2,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t tell you how relieved I am that Elder Aldryth has returned.$b$bHonestly, life here in the palace hasn\'t been the same without him. Everything seemed to have... lost its color. Perhaps now we can get back to our normal lives.',22522),
(37494,1,273,6,0,0,0,0,0,'У нас получилось! Осталось только подняться наверх, прокрасться через весь город – который, хочу заметить, тщательно охраняется, а потом разоблачить и убить повелителя ужаса в главном штабе ШРУ, лучшей разведслужбы Азерота.\n\nПара пустяков. $gГотов:Готова; спасать мир, $n?',23420),
(37496,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did you get my bottle? Are you here to help us escape?',22522),
(37497,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps this was a mistake.',22522),
(37507,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That could have gone better. Sounds like you\'ve already made an enemy.\n\nStill, that\'ll work to our advantage. You versus Boss Whalebelly. The fight of the century... or at least, the day.\n\nNow to set everything up.',22522),
(37510,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, what can I do for you, little $r?\n\nAhahaha... it\'s you!  I like how you came in and immediately confronted Whalebelly. That little tuskarr\'s got it coming.\n\nI can tell you\'re going to win big for me in the arena.',22522),
(37511,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тс-с-с... потише. Я меньше всего хочу, чтобы меня ударил огр.',19342),
(37516,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, раскопки на Разбитом берегу вот-вот пойдут полным ходом.$b$bИ ко мне в карман залетит много прекрасного бабла.',19342),
(37517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It sounds like the excavation of Broken Precipice is going to be fully operational in no time.$B$BI can\'t wait to line my pockets with some of that sweet moolah.',0),
(37518,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the headmistress is in her study, but I can\'t have you bothering her right now. Classes are about to start.',22522),
(37520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n!$b$bВ такие моменты я горжусь тем, что я твой наставник. Когда-нибудь ты станешь отличным археологом!$b$bВот твоя доля!',19342),
(37528,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I couldn\'t have snuck passed him better. Now, to get these weapons into the right hands.',22522),
(37530,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What happened, Farondis?',22522),
(37536,53,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this\'ll do nicely... oh no! The last of my pit fighters have been defeated.\n\nIt\'s just you and me now, little $r.',22522),
(37538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This is where you expected to find Okuna. Instead, you only found the pack with the weapons.>',22522),
(37540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments and go in the Light.',0),
(37541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments and go in the Light.',0),
(37542,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made quick work of that monkey. Now there\'s an empty position on Sternfathom\'s team that you can fill.\n\nBut first, let\'s get me set up for what comes after your big match.',22522),
(37543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments and go in the Light.',0),
(37547,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments and go in the Light.',0),
