(37560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments, and may the Light protect you on your journey.',0),
(37561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments, and may the Light protect you on your journey.',0),
(37562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, your courage and dedication has made Draenor a safer place. Take these armaments, and may the Light protect you on your journey.',0),
(37563,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent choice. I will be sad to see them leave, but I know they will help strengthen our combined packs in the coming conflicts.$b$bI will see that they make their way to your garrison as soon as they have said farewell to their loved ones.$b$bThey should be ready the next time you need to send followers on a mission.',19342),
(37565,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now the captives are free. Thank you, $n.\n\nReady for the prince?',22522),
(37566,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Oceanus dead, the skrogs will start fighting amongst themselves. They\'ll certainly be too busy to provide any further assistance to the naga.\n\nI\'d say this was a job well done, despite my being captured. Good thing you came along.\n\nI\'ll see you around, $n.',22522),
(37568,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$b$bI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',19342),
(37569,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19243),
(37570,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$b$bI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',19342),
(37571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),
(37572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),
(37573,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),
(37574,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Минутку, сейчас распакую.$b$bСразу предупреждаю – этот заказ нам удалось выполнить сверхсрочно, но на все будущие будет уходить больше времени.',19243),
(37575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me unpack that for you.$B$BI should let you know - while we managed to expedite this one, future work orders will take longer.',0),
(37644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve earned this!',0),
(37645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve earned this!',0),
(37653,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes. Already, I can tell their souls are weaker than their flesh.',22522),
(37654,6,661,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you know what ship this is? It\'s the Queen\'s Reprisal. Queen... as in the Banshee Queen, Sylvanas Windrunner.\n\nIf the farmstead weren\'t sunk under the waves, I\'d be heading home to Gilneas right about now.',22522),
(37656,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve always had my doubts about Cyana. Something was never quite right there. Looks like she cracked and joined the Legion.\n\nStill, we are not going to let her, or this Cordana Felsong, get away with it.',22522),
(37657,5,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? A jailer demon you say? Oublion? What a ghastly name.\n\nNo wonder we couldn\'t become trade partners with them. Oh, if only I\'d known, there wouldn\'t have been any need for such slaughter!\n\nAh well. Live and learn.',22522),
(37658,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. That will give us the breathing room we need to launch our counter-offensive.',22522),
(37659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Amongst the moldering remains of the chest, you find the captain\'s log. Its pages are partially intact and it contains interesting information about the possible whereabouts of Queen Sylvanas Windrunner, the new warchief of the Horde.>',22522),
(37660,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wouldn\'t take what Arev\'naal said to heart. The inquisitor demons are masters of misinformation. You don\'t suspect betrayal within the ranks, do you?\n\n<The Souleater looks thoughtful and grim.>\n\nI fear we won\'t have all of our answers about Lord Illidan for a while.',22522),
(37666,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я в неоплатном долгу перед тобой, $n. Мастерство и смелость Некоронованных поражают воображение.\n\nНо это была самая легкая часть работы, теперь пора совершить невозможное.',23420),
(37669,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поздравляем!',19116),
(37678,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry about the scattered pages and spines - I will have my aides clean up.$b$bThank you. You may return to your studies.',22522),
(37687,1,6,0,0,0,1500,0,0,'Значит, здесь замешан Совет Теней? Любопытно...',20779),
(37688,1,6,0,0,0,1500,0,0,'Значит, здесь замешан Совет Теней? Любопытно...',20779),
(37689,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя получилось! Матиас Шоу снова во главе ШРУ, и ты не $gпозволил:позволила; Орде и Альянсу вцепиться друг другу в глотки.\n\nУ нас нет ни малейших сомнений в том, что ты будешь незаменимым членом Союза Теней и Некоронованных.\n\nПоздравляю, Теневой клинок $n!',23420),
(37690,333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who goes there?$b$bAre you an emissary from that bizarre floating city?',22522),
(37727,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Capital! A prodigious start.$B$BI implore you to create this marvelous mixture for yourself. I want to share the delight of alchemical spirits with the world!$B$BYou\'ll need to get more eggs for yourself, though.',22522),
(37728,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was going to present this to one of the ladies of the court. Doing so might increase my standing in certain social circles.\n\nBut, I just can\'t bring myself to do it. Who better to drink my latest masterpiece than, well... me?',22522),
(37729,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Exemplary work, young $n. With runes like these, you\'ll be graduating in no time.',22522),
(37730,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She... she gave you her key? My word!',22522),
(37733,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s him, behind me.',22522),
(37736,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your hat and robes don\'t match, but you still look better. I hardly recognize you.',22522),
(37756,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно, командир! Зараза Бурогриба не распространится по Дренору.',20886),
(37757,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ko\'ragh be defeated. You be as strong as dey say, commander. I be proud to be at your side.',0),
(37758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A brilliant victory, commander! Imperator Mar\'gok be defeated. You indeed be a champion of da Horde!',0),
(37762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander. With da Heart of da Mountain defeated, you have crippled the ability of da Blackrock clan to use their most powerful furnace.',0),
(37763,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander! Not since Garrosh Hellscream commanded our forces in Northrend have I seen such decisive action.',0),
(37764,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant work, commander. Without da mind of Admiral Gar\'an behind it, da Iron Horde\'s naval fleet be greatly diminished.',0),
(37765,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Один из самых беспощадных орков повержен. Прими мои поздравления и мою благодарность.',20886),
(37766,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! Brackenspore\'s infestation will not spread to the rest of Draenor. Thank you, commander.',0),
(37767,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work! Ko\'ragh is defeated. You truly are as powerful as they say.',0),
(37768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done! A great blow has been dealt this day.',0),
(37769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander! With the Heart of the Mountain defeated, the Blackrock will have nothing to wield but sticks and stones.',0),
(37770,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Kromog defeated, we won\'t seeing as many Iron Horde machines rolling out to the front lines. You\'ve saved a lot of lives today, commander.',0),
(37771,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work, commander! We\'ll wrest control of the seas yet!',0),
(37772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So it\'s done, then? The foundry is in shambles. We\'ve delivered a mighty blow today, commander. Great work!',0),
(37773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, this must be the crystal Eksos keeps talking about. We\'ll get top men studying this right away.',0),
(37774,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect, sir. I\'m glad we won\'t have to worry about saberon spirits on top of everything else that\'s trying to murder us.',0),
(37775,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word is already spreading of your epic fight, commander. This may improve relations with the ogres in the future.',0),
(37776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. We hope the intel we gather from the Tanaan Channel will prove very useful in the coming months.',0),
(37777,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. This meat ought to keep those pesky saberon busy.',0),
(37778,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. We will get to work on this right away!',0),
(37780,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another Gul\'dana messenger has fallen before your power, commander. Our victory today will make Gul\'dan tremble with fear.',20886),
(37781,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С Кровавым Молотом покончено, и шансы императора Мар\'гока заполучить реликвию из шлаковых шахт теперь ничтожны.$b$bОтличный день.',20886),
(37782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Derailing da Grimrail be a mighty blow to da Iron Horde. It will take dem a great deal of time to amass more troops thanks to you.',0),
(37783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without Skulloc and their precious docks, da Iron Horde be a wolf pack trapped within their own cave... unable to hunt.',0),
(37784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I already be feelin\' da relief of da ancestral spirits of Draenor with Ner\'zhul\'s fall. You have deprived Grommash of a powerful weapon, commander.',0),
(37785,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps the Ruhmar followers will now be more respectful of the \"inferior races\".',20886),
(37786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dese wizards\' deaths be punishment enough for their lack of foresight. We should be thankful dat we were able to stop da overgrowth before it reached our world.',0),
(37787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Warlord Zaela\'s fall we can be focusin\' our efforts on Draenor and da heart of da Iron Horde. They have nowhere to hide now.',0),
(37789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Warlord Zaela out of the picture we can focus our efforts on Draenor and the heart of the Iron Horde. They have nowhere to hide now.',0),
(37790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish we could have saved the mages\' lives, but sadly it was not to be. We should be thankful that we were able to stop the overgrowth before it reached our world.',0),
(37791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perhaps now the Adherents of Rukhmar will respect we \'lesser races\'.',0),
(37792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m no shaman, far from it, but even I can feel the relief of the ancestral spirits of Draenor with Ner\'zhul\'s fall. You have deprived Grommash of a powerful weapon, commander.',0),
(37793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Without Skulloc and their precious docks, the Iron Horde won\'t be launching any attacks for a good long time!',0),
(37794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Derailing the Grimrail is a mighty blow to the Iron Horde. It will take them a great deal of time to amass more troops thanks to you.',0),
(37795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Bloodmaul are finished, and with them Imperator Mar\'gok\'s chances of acquiring the relic within the slag mines.$B$BThis is as fine a day as I\'ve seen in some time.',0),
(37796,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, commander. Gul\'dan will surely tremble at the heels of our victory this day.',0),
(37811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This matches the description of what Dr. Jones was looking for. I\'ll make sure it makes it to him. $B$BHere is your reward, $C.',0),
(37813,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You always be savin\' da day, commander. Thank you.',0),
(37814,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Da spirits smile upon ya, commander. Thank you for all you do.',0),
(37815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word already be spreadin\' about your exploits. If da ogres did not fear your strength yet, dey should now.',0),
(37816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A thousand thank yous, commander. Dis spyin\' should prove valuable in da comin\' months.',0),
(37817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis be exactly what we need, commander. I\'ll send it to da chefs right away.',0),
(37818,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Dis be exactly what we lookin\' for!',0),
(37819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя получилось! Это были тренировочные гонки, так что время не имеет значения. Но похвалу ты $gзаслужил:заслужила;!$b$bТеперь можно перейти к Крутым гонкам!',19702),
(37834,6,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Give her here. Be careful. Do you feel I got goosebumps. She\'s watching us, $n.$B$bThe Shadow Council in my house ... Let\'s get this over with before anything bad happens.',20886),
(37835,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Замечательно, $n! Меня беспокоит, что Совет Теней занимает такие прочные позиции в этих удаленных районах Дренора. Гул\'дан не сидел сложа руки.',20886),
(37836,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Garon is still in shock, but she\'s with us now. She wants revenge on her former lord. I\'m going to forgive her for hitting me.',20886),
(37837,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re $goba:both; you did great! $b$bGul\'dan is an even slippier type than I thought. He\'s been secretly gathering troops, and now that we\'ve weakened his enemies, he intends to gain power over the rest of the Iron Horde.$b$bWe need to plan our next move carefully.',20886),
(37838,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$c, I know I didn\'t do much to earn your trust. Until you freed me, my life didn\'t belong to me. $b$b Your tenacity and the wisdom of your supreme wizard helped me become free. You believed:believed in me even when I didn\'t believe in myself. I will serve you here on the Drenor until my death.  $b$b Just show me your enemies, and I will kill them immediately... Commander.',20886),
(37839,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gзаслужил:заслужила; эту награду, |3-6($c). Ты $gисходил:исходила; мой мир вдоль и поперек. Ты $gвыстоял:выстояла;, когда все шансы были не на твоей стороне; ты $gвышел победителем:вышла победительницей; из противостояния с древними чудовищами, темной магией и ужасающими машинами. Не раз и не два ты $gвоодушевлял:воодушевляла; моих собратьев своей исключительной смелостью и целеустремленностью.$b$bСпасибо тебе за все, $n.',20490),
(37840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have earned this, $C. You\'ve traveled the length and breadth of this savage world. You\'ve surmounted unimaginable odds and stood toe-to-toe against ancient beasts, dark magics, and terrifying machines. Time and again you\'ve surprised me with your patience and bravery.$B$BThank you, $n. I am proud to call you my friend.',0),
(37841,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, мы снова встретились.$b$bПристань у тебя теперь есть, так что можно обсудить наши дальнейшие планы...',20886),
(37852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad to see this out of the claws of the Adherents of Rukhmar. $B$BI\'ll get this to Dr. Jones right away.',0),
(37853,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. Your efforts dull his pain.$b$b<She sighs.>',22522),
(37855,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t you worry, small one. I am still back in Azurewing Repose, resting in my pool.$b$bIt doesn\'t take much energy to throw a projection of myself here and there. I may be old and dying, but I AM still a blue dragon.',22522),
(37856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Twelve withered slain? Very good.$b$bThat should be enough to keep them away for a few months.',22522),
(37857,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re tapping into the ley lines?',22522),
(37858,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'...so many of them...',0),
(37859,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I owe you a great debt, $n.$b$bHelping a weakened old dragon like me is valorous enough. Saving my whelplings, and securing the future of our bloodline?$b$bI am now firmly committed to your cause.',22522),
(37860,457,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the pylons destroyed, Senegos\' pool should now be re-energized.',22522),
(37861,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He may not be slain, but at least he is gone.$b$bWithout their leader, the mindless withered should soon scatter and die.',22522),
(37862,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'No... we\'re too late!',22522),
(37868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, and nice time!',0),
(37885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll make sure this gets to Dr. Jones. $B$BTo be honest, I\'m eager to get it off my hands.',0),
(37889,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The landing went smoothly, but there\'s trouble ahead of us.',20779),
(37890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что дорога свободна – это хорошо, но есть другая проблема.',20779),
(37891,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С возвращением, командир. Как раз только что вернулись наши разведчики с рапортом об успехе операции.$B$BОтличная работа!',20779),
(37910,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, and nice time!',0),
(37911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job, and nice time!',0),
(37919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who would\'ve thought that such a normal looking spear would be able to take down a full-sized Gronn? $B$BI\'m sure Dr. Jones will appreciate this in his collection.',0),
(37934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All right, now we have a supply line. I managed to find a great place for the base.',20779),
(37935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Это была легкая часть – а трудная еще впереди.',20779),
(37940,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Разведчики уже доложили нам о твоих успехах. $B$BЛок\'тар!',20886),
(37945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This definitely looks like no Laughing Skull mask I\'ve seen before. I\'ll take it to Jones and see what he makes of it. $B$BHe left me with this payment for you.',0),
(37948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word is already spreading of your epic fight, commander. This may improve relations with the ogres in the future.',0),
(37949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word already be spreadin\' about your exploits. If da ogres did not fear your strength yet, dey should now.',0),
(37957,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep your distance from that one, $n.$b$bThose fallen elves are all the same. As two-faced as they come.',22522),
(37959,398,30,0,0,0,4000,0,0,'<Runas feverishly crushes the jewels and gets to work rubbing magical dust on his face, arms, and back.>$b$b<He is, for the moment, in bliss.>',22522),
(37960,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I do feel a bit stronger.$b$bThose siphons nearly did me in, $n.',22522),
(37961,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What great shape this stuff is in. Yeah, honest! I think I can work with this junk. Give me just a minute here...',0),
(37964,274,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здесь полно стражи. Не знаю, на чем основывается уверенность Гароны.$b$bДавай я введу тебя в курс дела...',20886),
(37968,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С возвращением, командир. Как раз только что вернулись наши разведчики с рапортом об успехе операции.$B$BОтличная работа!',20574),
(37979,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is incredible! I would never be able to tell that this crystal was once broken! $B$BI\'m sure Dr. Jones will be pleased to see this, as well as the draenei if the stories behind it are true.',0),
(37981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it. You really did it! Here\'s your winnings, champ.$B$BMan, the Highmaul ogres are not going to like this...',0),
(37991,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, $c. We could use your aid.',22522),
(37992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, mon! I be takin dis to Jones right away. $B$BHere be your reward.',0),
(37993,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good we got dis and not da arakkoa.$B$BJones will be wantin dis, I\'m sure.',0),
(37994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis book be a bad ting, mon. I\'m glad we got it before it came into da wrong hands. $B$BI\'ll get it ta Jones for ya.',0),
(37995,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jones will be happy when he sees dis. $B$BHere\'s da payment he promised.',0),
(37996,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis be an odd mask for a Laughing Skull, to be sure. $B$BJones left dis reward for ya.',0),
(37997,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Astoundin, mon! I\'d a never been able ta tell dis was eva broken. $B$BHere\'s da reward dat Jones left, I\'ll get dis to im.',0),
(38001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У нас тут идет полномасштабная война. Что ж – по крайней мере, нет недостатка в противниках!',20779),
(38014,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That will have to do for now.',22522),
(38015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. I saw the other drakes take to the skies.$b$bAnd look! You found Emmigosa!$b$bIt seems she\'s taken a shine to you, $n. I trust you\'ll keep her safe for now.',22522),
(38035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your cooperation.',22522),
(38036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just in time! I was about to start bandaging wounds with leaves.',22522),
(38044,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне уже доложили, что охотники из клана Кровавой Глазницы отступают в Зет\'Гол. Это даст нам немалое преимущество в грядущих битвах.',20886),
(38045,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно, командир! Из Кровавой Глазницы на оборону Зет\'Гола отправились их лучшие воины.$b$bЭто даст нам определенное преимущество, пусть и ненадолго.',20779),
(38046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m already hearing reports from The Iron Front that the tide of the battle has turned.$B$BSoon, The Iron Horde will have nowhere to run!',0),
(38047,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to you, we took the initiative on the Iron Front. Very soon the Gul\'dan and the Iron Horde will have nowhere to retreat.',20886),
(38052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry about the ship - it\'s just wood and metal.$B$BThe Skyfire lives on as long as we keep fighting.',22522),
(38053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'NUTS and BOLTS!$B$BPardon my language.$B$BThis thing is almost as dead as the guy you took it from. We need juice, and lots of it. I have an idea...',22522),
(38057,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Though his eyes are open, the solider does not respond to your presence. An electrical field buzzes around him.>',22522),
(38058,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Alright... I\'m reading full power on the transponder.$B$BNow for an antenna...',22522),
(38059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The transponder lights up. An uneasy voice comes over the line.>$B$BHello? Is this working? (By the Light, I hate these things.)$B$BThis is Mishka. Missing 7th Legion soldiers have returned to camp. All accounted for.$B$BUh.. over. Message over.$B$BOver and goodbye.$B$BEnd transm- <The radio cuts out sharply.>',22522),
(38060,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The distress signal got through. We\'ll be evacuated to Greywatch immediately.$B$BI\'m afraid that, for now, you will have to continue on your mission without us. Once we are settled, I will send out recon patrols to see if we can glean the location of the Aegis.$B$BYou must secure the Aegis of Aggramar if we are to drive back the Legion threat!',22522),
(38142,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The forest already whispers of Malfurion\'s return. There are few among us who have not heard of his deeds.$B$BThe trees said he also travels with a companion, one named $n. Are you $Ghe:she;?',22522),
(38143,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Archdruid\'s deep, shallow breaths rumble across the chamber.>',22522),
(38144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. The chambers are clear. Very impressive, $c.',22522),
(38145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, hero. With my brethren at my side, we will be ready to aid Malfurion.',22522),
(38146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Graw was the first to succumb to the madness, and the rest of the clan followed.$B$BWith these, I will take the reins as our clan\'s new chieftain.$B$BThank you, traveler. I will do my best to rebuild my clan.',22522),
(38147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In my dreams, I saw the satyr\'s leader. His face was familiar, though I could not see it clearly.$B$BI pray to Elune that it is not too late. I will go to Malfurion at once.',22522),
(38148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful. The Archdruids have already assembled.',0),
(38175,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Эй, командир. Мы сейчас охлаждаем горнила, но когда ты принесешь обломки. мы уже снова будем готовы к работе.',20490),
(38176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),
