(38203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21414),
(38206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you with us?',22522),
(38210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sure your head is filled with questions. Answers will come, in time.$B$BI am Havi, and my words are those of the Valarjar - the glorious keepers of the Halls of Valor. $B$BYou will need my help if it is the Aegis you seek. Oh yes, I know your goals outsider. As I know many things...',22522),
(38213,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это, судя по всему, один из фолиантов Искара. Но зачем он оставил его здесь?',20779),
(38223,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n.$b$bЭто было непростое дело, и я снова очень благодарен тебе за помощь. Искар окончательно обезумел, и его нужно остановить.$b$bЯ надеюсь, ты будешь $gготов:готова;, когда пробьет решающий час.',20779),
(38225,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May peace again fill our sacred grove.',22522),
(38232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mmmm. Olives. I love these things. They are the only reason worth to come to this filthy world.',22522),
(38235,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your arrival was a blessing, friend.$b$bAnde\'thoras-ethil.',22522),
(38237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great deal right? You got to kill a demon, your fancy weapon got more fancy, and I get to be the master now. Everybody wins!',22522),
(38241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So it\'s as I imagined, a battle-stone!$B$BI\'ve been able to collect similar stones here in Draenor, but never one this large! A rare find indeed.',0),
(38242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah sure, I be findin\' stones like this everywhere in Draenor, but never one dis big!',0),
(38243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С тобой всегда приятно иметь дело.',20886),
(38246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n! My nephew is returned to me.$B$BHe explains that the source of the madness comes from a powerful totem, deep in our village. $B$BIt makes sense, but who - or WHAT - gave us such a thing?$B$BI will share this knowledge with the druids at once.',22522),
(38250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, commander. Our scouts just returned with word of your success.$B$BWell done!',0),
(38252,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С возвращением, генерал. Как раз только что вернулись наши разведчики с рапортом об успехе операции.$B$BОтличная работа!',20886),
(38253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The King is studying maps of Tanaan Jungle and the surrounding area.>$b$b$n! The Alliance owes you a great debt for establishing this garrison. Thanks to your bravery and commanding leadership, we\'ve fought this war here on Draenor, instead of amongst our own homes and farmsteads.$b$bIt\'s time now to finish this. Are you ready for the final campaign?',22522),
(38254,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рырк совершенно точно находится в этом поезде, но сам выбраться не сможет. Нам придется... Ой, ты $gпринес:принесла; взрывчатку? Найель снова все продумала! Давай-ка вышибем дверь вагона и попробуем убедить этого инженера отправиться с нами...',20444),
(38255,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Убери свое оружие, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;. Чернорук мертв, а наш новый \"вождь\" только что подписал мне смертный приговор. Так что я готов податься к вам в наемники.$b$bВам нужна пристань? Значит, вам нужен я.',20444),
(38256,25,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Solologist Ryrk looks around the port for the last time. >$b$b All this was a waste of time, |3-6($c). Anything you do not destroy will go to Gul\'dan. $b$b Nothing, my next creations will last for centuries.',20444),
(38257,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир! Мы тебя ждали. У нас тут полный хаос.$b$bПосле штурма мои рангари постоянно вели наблюдение за этим местом. Буквально несколько недель назад наши враги активизировались. По приказу Гул\'дана остатки Железной Орды отступают в Танаан.$b$bМои разведчики раздобыли весьма интересные сведения...',20444),
(38258,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что, нашелся корабел? Да? Отлично! Некоторые твои соратники с нетерпением ждут, когда смогут выйти в море.',20444),
(38259,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Parts the horizon. >$b$bThis is a great place. A quiet bay is the right place. From the wreckage of this old warship, you can build your first transport.I see you already have all the materials you need. Well, shall we get started?',20444),
(38267,1,603,1,0,0,1000,2000,0,'Ah, $n, you\'re just in time. $b$bThe actor told me that the Council of Shadows had begun to teach the shadows their dark arts. Under the banners of the Council of Shadows rose even some of the higher Arakkoas!$b$bI still don\'t get it, what role does Iskar play in all this?',20779),
(38269,1,603,1,0,0,1000,2000,0,'Ah, $n, you\'re just in time. $b$bThe actor told me that the Council of Shadows had begun to teach the shadows their dark arts. Under the banners of the Council of Shadows rose even some of the higher Arakkoas!$b$bI still don\'t get it, what role does Iskar play in all this?',20779),
(38270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты... помнишь меня? Я прошел с тобой через портал. Меня когда-то звали... Ариок. До того, как я превратился... в это.',20886),
(38271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Старая земля... старая кровь. Я чую Килрогга. Он был здесь.',20886),
(38272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты ступаешь по священной земле, $gиноземец:чужестранка;. Здесь вожди клана Кровавой Глазницы проводили свои ритуалы, чтобы заглянуть в будущее.$b$bЗа это ты $gдолжен:должна; поплатиться жизнью – но слишком многое поставлено на карту...',20886),
(38273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'После того как множество духов было повержено, аура ненависти, излучаемая пещерой, ощутимо ослабла.',20886),
(38274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ха! Килрогга здесь нет... Только предостережения и дурные предзнаменования. Это твой путь, $n, а я должен убить Килрогга...',20886),
(38286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Golgannet\'s Tidal Stone is unharmed and unprotected. >',21384),
(38287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С тобой всегда приятно иметь дело.',20886),
(38290,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been a pleasure trading with you.',0),
(38293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been a pleasure trading with you.',0),
(38296,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s been a pleasure trading with you.',0),
(38299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad. Not bad at all. Stop by the next time I\'m in the neighborhood, and I might have some new pets to check out.',0),
(38300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not bad. Not bad at all. Stop by the next time I\'m in the neighborhood, and I might have some new pets to check out.',0),
(38306,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Estelle pages through the damaged tome and sighs wistfully.>$B$BOh dear, another paramour dead! Draenor has a terrible habit of eating my lovers alive.',0),
(38307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(38308,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You have a quick look at the report, which shows that other SHRU spies besides the Tihoswist were active in this area. >',21108),
(38312,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That looks like it\'ll do the job nicely. $B$BLet\'s get in there before we\'re spotted.',22522),
(38317,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наконец-то снова в бой!',21108),
(38318,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You should\'ve seen the look on those vrykuls\' faces when you came sailing over their wall! $B$BI could see that launcher coming in handy in a lot of places. You\'d best hold on to it.',22522),
(38322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful. The Archdruids have already assembled.',22522),
(38323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(38324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, these will do. $B$BNow lets see what we can make to fool old Guarm, eh?',22522),
(38331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah, you throw like a shieldmaiden!$B$BWhat? That\'s a good thing! $B$BTry the stew, young champion, and savor the taste of a task well done.',22522),
(38332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Natanos squinting at the wreckage of Silvana\'s ship. >$B$BShe\'s around here somewhere... She should be close by.',21108),
(38337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21414),
(38339,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait... ye killed how many kvaldir? Yer braver than I thought, outsider!$B$BI\'m sure Helya will see that neither ye nor I belong here once we get past that dog of hers.',22522),
(38342,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, there\'s no stopping you, is there?',22522),
(38344,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, it brings back memories. You didn’t look: you looked; by the numbers?$b$bIt belonged to old Nolan, may he rest in peace. He was not the best researcher, but he was strong in hops!',20574),
(38345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are in great condition. Nolan would be green with envy.',0),
(38346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. I knew you\'d be useful, sugarplum.$B$BThere\'s something very unusual about these coins...',0),
(38347,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a truly revolting, outsider. Even in death I\'ve never witnessed such a disgusting smell.',22522),
(38351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you found Varsha. Now, keep him supplied with waystones and we will be well on our way to defeating the iron horde.',0),
(38354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you found Apprentice Var\'nath. Now, keep him supplied with waystones and we will be well on our way to defeating the iron horde.',0),
(38356,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is the best Draenor has to offer? Lucky for you I went to engineering school. One Tune-O-Tron 5000 coming up!',0),
(38357,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Королевское фармацевтическое общество выступает исключительно за гуманность.',21108),
(38358,11,0,0,0,100,0,0,0,'Славно. Поставь контейнер куда-нибудь. Только смотри не расплескай!$B$B<Аптекарь мерзко хихикает.>',21108),
(38360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'То есть ей все-таки удалось скрыться...',21108),
(38361,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они только начали расплачиваться за свою дерзость.',21108),
(38362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Посмотри внимательно на эту голову, $p. И запомни, что так будет с каждым, кто осмелится противостоять Отрекшимся.',21108),
(38376,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I owe you my life, $n. We all do.',22522),
(38377,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Behold, Ysera, the Emerald Queen.',22522),
(38381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, traveler.',22522),
(38382,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cenarius will have my aid once my grove has been made safe.',22522),
(38384,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cenarius is in need? Lord of the Forest, we shall not fail you...',22522),
(38394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Y\'know, I think we might be on to somethin\' big here.',0),
(38395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That wasn\'t so hard now was it, peaches?$B$B<Estelle holds the coins you brought up the the light and practically purrs.>$B$BYes yes, these are so very strange...',0),
(38396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, good! I\'ve got some awful suspicious suspicions about these here suspicious coins.',0),
(38397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Honeybiscuit, when this is all over, you and I may be remembered as stumbling on a great paranormal discovery. Or I will at least.',0),
(38399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah yes, an eternium rose. I heard vendors suddenly stopped buying them... something about the resell value being too low.$B$BYou\'re in luck though, because I know a collector who still wants them. In fact, I can take this one off your hands, but you\'ll have to come back tomorrow if you have another one to sell.',0),
(38402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, I\'ve been talkin\' to the priests in the Mystic Ward and they confirmed my sucpicions. These \'misprinted\' coins are all demonic in origin.$B$BYeh done a good deed takin\' these out of circulation. Well done, $n!',0),
(38404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am most gracious for your services. So many coins! Such a foul energy within them - do you feel it? Somebody was trying to corrupt the draenei from within.$B$BWell, don\'t you worry your pretty head any. My colleagues and I will take VERY good care of these. Thank you, lovely!',0),
(38405,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. These should do well to protect you from the storm.',22522),
(38406,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This big fella must have been growing for years. To be honest, it\'s so cute I\'ll probably just let it go. Maybe you can catch it again one day!',0),
(38407,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You say you found this message in a bottle? How quaint.\n\nYes, I can point you in the right direction, but are you sure you want to take on the sea giant prince and his skrogs? Just to free a bunch of unwashed sailors?',22522),
(38408,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, ты найдешь что-нибудь себе по вкусу!',20886),
(38410,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! I bet they never saw that coming!$B$BSeems like we\'ve got no shortage of obstacles left, though.',22522),
(38412,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are here for the trial? I\'m afraid you might be too late.$B$BThis battle with these Felskorn has taken its toll. I am too weak to grant you the power you seek...$B$BBut perhaps you may be able to help...',22522),
(38413,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am truly indebted to you for this act. My siblings were not able to defend themselves against the Felskorn, and would have ended up their slaves. $B$BYou are a true friend of the Thorignir.',22522),
(38414,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am relieved to hear that our mother is safe. $B$BI am sure she will wish to thank you herself.',22522),
(38415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know the battle for Tanaan presses sorely on your forces commander. I am glad you came. The Sargerei and Gul\'dan have the same masters, so this new attack likely affects you as well.',0),
(38416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is unfortunate. We cannot allow Gorefiend to aid Gul\'dan\'s machinations. He must be slain once and for all.',0),
(38421,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что ты так скоро $gоткликнулся:откликнулась; на мой зов. В глубинах под этим священным местом происходит что-то ужасное.',20338),
(38428,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tentatively, the pup licks your hand. After receiving a good scratch behind the ears, the pup barks and wags its tail.>',0),
(38435,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The landing went smoothly, but there\'s trouble ahead of us.',20444),
(38436,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Силы врагов здесь невелики – мы с ними легко разделаемся. Однако появилась другая проблема.',20444),
(38440,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С возвращением, командир. Как раз только что вернулись наши разведчики с рапортом об успехе операции.$B$BОтличная работа!',20338),
(38441,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Разведчики уже доложили нам о твоих успехах. $B$BЛок\'тар!',20886),
(38443,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He is... he\'s dying! Senegos is possibly the oldest dragon alive. We cannot simply let him slip away.\n\nThere is something not quite right with the magic energy here, I can feel it.',22522),
(38444,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сюда уже направляется группа поддержки, они тут все зачистят. А нам надо двигаться вперед, пока их гонцы еще не успели вернуться к Гул\'дану.',20444),
(38445,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Это была легкая часть – а трудная еще впереди.',20444),
(38446,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эта кампания обещает быть нелегкой.',20574),
(38449,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С возвращением, генерал. Как раз только что вернулись наши разведчики с рапортом об успехе операции.$B$BОтличная работа!',20886),
(38453,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь у вас достаточно информации, чтобы вычислить убийцу. Вы составили карту.',20886),
(38455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The conflict against the furbolgs is abated, for now.',22522),
(38458,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was too late to give you the message. I am truly sorry. These poor shaman... if only I had known sooner!$B$BGul\'dan has prepared everything for his ritual. He will use the cipher and his own fel magic to corrupt an elemental lord and use it to sunder the elemental link to the land. This will cause a massive upheaval across Draenor!',0),
(38459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gполучил:получила; мое письмо!',21108),
(38460,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'At last! A minion of my very own!',22522),
(38462,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not a moment too soon. He has summoned something, I fear the ritual is close to complete.',0),
(38463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have saved us all. The Cipher has become fragmented with Cyrukh\'s death. This means its guardians can hide the shards all over Draenor so the chances of piecing it together will be impossible.$B$BThis victory will echo through the halls of your warriors and spur them to greater deeds. Gul\'dan can continue plotting... he will fail...',0),
(38473,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you, $n. Greymane sent me away to scout this village for more information on the Aegis. $B$BI haven\'t gleaned much so far, other than that the locals here don\'t seem so friendly. Of course, when are they ever?$B$BI hope your search fares better.',22522),
(38499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе...',23420),
(38500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно! Возможно, новый плавень пригодится и для работы с другими материалами.',23420),
(38501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну конечно же! Они обошли проблему сварки, изготавливая свои доспехи из цельного куска металла.$b$bНасчет наплечий мне нужно было догадаться самому, но вот их кираса – это что-то удивительное.$b$bСейчас я сделаю пару набросков, чтобы у тебя тоже была возможность сделать эти доспехи.',23420),
(38502,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If my guess is right, the solution to the welding problem is in this unit.',23420),
(38505,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, the memory block? Just a minute.',23420),
(38506,5,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,'...I would say if we weren\'t right over their homeland. Do you have to translate that?',23420),
(38507,1,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто бы мог подумать, что это нужно еще и переводить. Ты $gпринял:приняла, правильное решение.$b$bВот поэтому я и дружу с такими искателями приключений, как ты.',23420),
(38513,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И ты думаешь, что $gдостоин:достойна, приобщиться к нашей мудрости, $gиноземец:чужестранка,?',23420),
(38514,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Навыки неплохие, но качество никуда не годится.$b$b<Барм ломает рукавицы пополам и бросает на пол>$b$bПравда, тебе удалось доказать, что ты $gдостоин:достойна, стать моим учеником.',23420),
(38515,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s great. Let\'s make a fusion out of it right away.',23420),
(38518,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ясно, качество их работы связано с техникой обработки молотом. Как интересно...',23420),
(38519,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n.$b$bСпасибо.',23420),
(38522,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я возьму эти бруски, кое-что подправлю, и...$b$bТа-да! Накопытники для твоего верхового животного!',23420),
(38523,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда Мей подогнала накопытники под размер твоего животного, ты $gсам:сама, сможешь его подковывать.$b$bАх да, чтобы не забыть: вот выкройка. Удачи!',23420),
(38524,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gпришел:пришла, нам помочь?',23420),
(38525,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сойдет.',23420),
(38526,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Неплохо, |3-6($c). У тебя хороший замах.',23420),
(38527,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Что ж, за работу!',23420),
(38528,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично.$b$bСиловой камень – капризный материал. Наручи улучшает сера, а вот что может оптимизировать процесс изготовления наплечья? Волшебная пыльца. А шлемам требуются необработанные самоцветы. И так далее.',23420),
(38530,1,6,25,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, ты $gвернулся:вернулась,, $n. $gРешил:Решила, продолжить свое обучение?$b$bЧто? Камень Поднебесья?$b$b<У нескольких учеников невольно вырывается возглас изумления.>$b$bЭто совсем другой разговор.',23420),
(38531,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Frowning, the Taurian is looking at your work. >$b$bYou\'re something $gI\'ve learned:Learned... $b$bOkay, great. Trial you $gPassed:Passed',23420),
(38532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Barm looks closely at the hammer, twisting it in his hand >$b$bThat\'s the real hammer!',23420),
(38533,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One could hardly expect the Taurians to agree to part with their recipes. We are not as hardheaded as these... but we don\'t give out our recipes for nothing either. However, you managed to access the Stone of Celestial Empire and find out where another great anvil is in case I or Urael need it. So you deserve this recipe as a token of our gratitude.',23420),
(38534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The armguards you\'ve made are impressive, but you can provide the same level of protection without wasting so much raw material.$B$BHere, let me show you.',0),
(38536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent smithing.$B$BNow, allow me to show you a trick I use to conserve resources.',0),
(38537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your anvilwork is to be commended, but the recipe you\'re using is unnecessarily wasteful.$B$BTry this instead.',0),
(38538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We don\'t tend to smith many boots up here, but even I can tell that you\'re using too much metal for the sole.$B$BHere\'s a way to cut back on your resource costs.',0),
(38539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Illidari certainly do like to waste ore, don\'t they?$B$BYou should craft them this way instead. You\'ll thank me later.',0),
(38540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t tell Thala and Barm, but I do keep a few helm patterns around, mainly for amusement and decoration.$B$BTake a look at this one. You\'ll get similar results with much less need for raw material.',0),
(38541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that you\'ve done it the easy way, try this.$B$BIt\'s more difficult, but it will save you loads of materials.',0),
(38542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The amount of ore you\'re wasting on that pattern is simply unacceptable. We should conserve wherever possible: it\'s better for the land and easier on the pocket.$B$BPlease, use this plan instead.',0),
(38558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Overspark examines the crystal carefully.>$B$BYep, still shiny.',22522),
(38559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Новичок? Сюда уже много лет никто не приходил...$b$bВот это Камень Поднебесья. Запомни его линии. Выясни все его свойства. Если ты действительно хочешь перейти на новый уровень мастерства, то, думаю, часто буду тебя видеть здесь, рядом с ним.',23420),
(38561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I was too late to give you the message. I am truly sorry. These poor shamans... if only I had known sooner!$B$BGul\'dan has prepared everything for his ritual. He will use the cipher and his own fel magic to corrupt an elemental lord and use it to sunder the elemental link to the land. This will cause a massive upheaval across Draenor!',0),
(38562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кровожад продолжает пожирать души моих предков! Этому нужно положить конец раз и навсегда. Кровожада необходимо уничтожить!',20338),
(38563,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда мы со всем разобрались, можно заняться совершенствованием наших рецептов.',23420),
(38564,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n. Теперь пришла пора испытать это изделие!',23420),
(38565,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve eliminated many sargers, and now the payers can finally banish them from Aukindon.',20338),
(38566,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve done it, Highlord $n.$B$BThe Order of the Silver Hand is reborn!',22522),
(38567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Warchief studies a map of Tanaan Jungle and its surroundings, his brow creased with worry.>$B$BAh, Commander $n! Voice of da Horde in Draenor. Ya done well here, bringin\' da fight ta our enemies. Thrall tells me ya exceed his every expectation.$B$BIt be time ta finish dis. Are ya ready?',0),
(38568,5,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Командир! Ну наконец-то. Тут у нас полный бардак. Железная Орда оставила литейную и теперь по приказу Гул\'дана отходит в Танаан, используя эту пристань как перевалочный пункт.$b$bМы тут нашли кое-что интересное, только действовать надо быстро...',20779),
(38570,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Информация подтвердилась. Солога Рырка действительно держат в этом поезде, и к нему не подобраться. А что это у тебя? Взрывчатка? Хм... Я смотрю, твои дружки-гоблины в который раз все предусмотрели.$b$bНу что, тогда взрываем дверь – и потолкуем с этим типом...',20779),
(38571,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Убери свое оружие, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;. Чернорук мертв, а наш новый \"вождь\" только что подписал мне смертный приговор. Так что я готов податься к вам в наемники.$b$bВам нужна пристань? Значит, вам нужен я.',20779),
(38572,25,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Solologist Ryrk looks around the port for the last time. >$b$b All this was a waste of time, |3-6($c). Anything you do not destroy will go to Gul\'dan. $b$b Nothing, my next creations will last for centuries.',20779),
(38573,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что, нашелся корабел? Да? Отлично! Твои соратники ждут не дождутся, когда смогут выйти в море.',20779),
(38574,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Солог Рырк окидывает взглядом горизонт.>$b$bПодходящее место. Хорошая глубокая бухта. Этот старый корабль мы разберем и построим из него твой первый транспорт. Конечно, таскать стройматериалы вверх-вниз будет тяжело, но, если что, скалы обеспечат нам прикрытие.$b$bВ общем, думаю, все получится. Ну что, начинаем строить?',20779),
(38576,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is fitting that you are here.$b$bTime and again, you have fought to save our world. Now, I fear I must ask you to undertake an even greater act of service.',22522),
(38577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь ты видишь, с чем мы тут столкнулись. Мы постараемся максимально отвлечь на себя силы противника, чтобы дать твоей базе больше свободы.',20779),
(38578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поговорим об этом позже. Спасибо.',20574),
(38581,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь ты видишь, с чем мы тут столкнулись. Мы постараемся максимально отвлечь на себя силы противника, чтобы дать твоей базе больше свободы.',20574),
(38582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Know this, $n. You did the only thing you could.$b$bWhen a mortal has become corrupted by the nightmare, there is no return. Only death will set them free.',22522),
(38585,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, commander. Our scouts just returned with word of your success.$B$BWell done!',0),
(38586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of your success has already been passed on by our scouts. $B$BLok\'tar!',0),
(38595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, $n...$b$bWhat is becoming of this precious land?',22522),
(38599,603,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'С возвращением! Уровень сигнала просто отличный, так что все готово к вылету!$B$BКогда соберешься подняться на гору – садись в ракету и лети с ветерком! Она стоит возле Гаргаша.',20779),
(38603,603,1,0,0,0,500,0,0,'С возвращением!$b$bУровень сигнала от маячков очень хороший! Мы перепрограммировали систему навигации, так что теперь все должно быть в порядке!$b$bКорабль готов к вылету и находится рядом со Стражем Небес Танном.',20574),
(38611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти врайкулы такие унылые! Почему Натанос всегда посылает меня на самые скучные и бестолковые задания? $B$BНадеюсь, с твоим прибытием хоть немного повеселее станет.',21108),
(38612,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that’s just what you need.',21108),
(38613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти врайкулы аж остолбенели, когда ты $gпролетел:пролетела; у них над головами, так что на меня никто и внимания не обратил. $B$BНадеюсь, они не доставили тебе особых хлопот.',21108),
(38614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну, размер для тебя, конечно, великоват, но ничего, сгодится. $B$BЭта горная тропа наверняка таит немало опасностей, так что лучше как следует подготовиться заранее.',21108),
(38615,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Одной проблемой меньше – уже хорошо! $B$BОднако, похоже, в нашем плане появился изъян. Наверх можно было попасть только через этот мост.',21108),
(38616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная мысль. Если уж врайкулы научились делать доспехи из драконьей чешуи, то мы-то чем хуже? $B$BДумаю, у нас все получится еще лучше, чем у них.',21108),
(38617,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Славная была драка! А я еще жаловалась, что здесь мне слишком скучно.',21108),
(38618,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты хочешь пройти испытания? Боюсь, что ты $gопоздал:опоздала;.$B$BЭта битва с дрекирьярами окончательно нас вымотала. Я слишком слаб, чтобы дать тебе ту силу, которую ты ищешь...$B$BВпрочем, ты еще можешь нам помочь...',21108),
(38624,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The raven squawks, and Havi\'s voice fills your head>$B$BYou are indeed mighty, as the trial shows. $B$BBut valor is a different animal - one you think to tame?',22522),
(38641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You - you bear the mark of The Dreamer. Elune be praised!$b$bYou\'ve arrived just in time, visitor. Shaladrassil\'s roots are at our doorstep...',22522),
(38643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We don\'t need any help, and we don\'t like strangers wanderin\' around on our land.',22522),
(38644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m sorry for my suspicion earlier. We\'re all on edge with the recent attacks.$B$BI couldn\'t be more grateful to you and your friend.$B$BThanks to you, our situation is under control now. We\'ve got a lot of rebuilding to do, but we\'ll survive.',22522),
(38645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good. These innocent villagers have done nothing to deserve these attacks. You have done well to help them.',22522),
(38646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well love, we sure did take care of them! Thank you, $c. Glad ta see I \'aven\'t lost my touch.',22522),
(38647,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'All right, I\'ll get those barrels loaded up and delivered to the village in no time.$B$BThank you, $n. There\'ll be a lot of full bellies because of you.',22522),
(38649,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что-то не так. Я это нутром чую.',22996),
(38655,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is as I feared, $r. This corruption is... irreversable.$b$bOur only course of action is to somehow find a way to fight it at its source.',22522),
(38656,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(38662,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Xavius has stolen our sacred artifact?$b$bElune, forgive me. I have failed you.',22522),
(38663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is dire news indeed, $n.$b$bDraw upon your courage now, friend, for Azeroth needs her heroes more than ever before.',22522),
(38669,274,0,0,0,1000,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Несмотря на то, что ты много лет $gпровел:провела; в стазисе, твои чувства не притупились.\n\n<Майев с осторожностью смотрит на ваше оружие.>\n\nТолько попробуй поднять руку на меня, $gохотник:охотница; на демонов, и ты узнаешь, почему именно я была стражницей, охранявшей твоего хозяина.',20994),
(38671,2,0,0,0,200,0,0,0,'It is not much, but it is better than I could have hoped for. You have our gratitude.',22522),
(38672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Pull the lever. >',20994),
(38675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(38684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The waking world is slipping further and further from my mind. But on the vestiges of this corruption consuming my mind, I sense Malfurion!',22522),
(38687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This cannot be!',22522),
(38688,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда древнее семя проросло, я смогу воспользоваться своим даром друида, чтобы поддерживать с тобой связь через этот росток.',21249),
(38689,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твое лицо вновь заиграло красками, $n.',20994),
(38690,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы всегда знали, что помощь иллидари потребуется, чтобы защитить этот мир. Именно поэтому мы стали теми, кем.... ЧЕМ мы стали.  ',20994),
(38691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What does the Legion want with Ravencrest? He was dead and buried ten millennia ago.',22522),
(38692,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто-то должен был это сделать.',22996),
(38694,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Окулет все предусмотрел. Хорошо, одной заботой меньше.',22996),
(38695,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Apparently, someone informed the Grand Master about Vantir\'s participation in the rebellion. Such cruelty is... Alicanda... How could you?',22996),
(38710,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for helping us gather together, $n. We must stand united.',22522),
(38711,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Jerod\'s looking at the ring a minute before he picks it up. Then he puts it in his pocket. >$B$BIt\'s a Mayan ring. There\'s no way she\'d break up with him willingly.$B$BSo she\'s being held in the Black Rook Fortress!',22810),
(38714,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good work, $n. There is no doubt that they have already moved Maiev into the prison cells beneath the tower.',22522),
(38715,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. May their spirits be at peace.',22522),
(38717,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good, these keys should open any of the cells within the prison.',22522),
(38718,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The attacking spirits spoke of their lord and master. I fear the Legion has raised Lord Ravencrest to do their bidding. What price was paid for such a sinister revival, I do not know.',22522),
(38719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The other Illidari did not make it, but I owe you my life. There is one thing I learned during my time in the prisons: the demons within Black Rook Hold must die.',22522),
(38720,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you\'ve managed to find some survivors. Great, I\'ve had a mountain falling off my shoulders.',22996),
(38721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Stareye came from a noble house, but in war, he never came close to Ravencrest or my brother.$B$BNow that he is defeated, we can turn our attention to his commander.$B$BHowever, that will be no easy task. We must gather our strength before facing Lord Ravencrest himself.',22522),
(38723,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Превосходно. Впитай в себя эту мощь, и ты почувствуешь, как твоя сила растет!',20994),
(38724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Maiev\'s face is bruised, her lips cracked, and her body covered in scars. She looks thin and ragged, but she moves with purpose.>$B$BFor weeks they tried to break me. Amateurs!$B$BI kept my silence. I counted the minutes, measured their steps, and listened to the voices beyond my cell.$B$BI have been waiting for my chance to escape, and to strike back at my captors.$B$BNow, you bring my armor AND my blade. My salvation will be followed by bloodshed.$B$B<Maiev smiles.>',22522),
(38725,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n. I found her.',20994),
(38727,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не каждому дано быть лидером. А еще сложнее командовать на передовой.\n\nМы практически готовы напасть на флагман королевы стаи Тиранны.',20994),
(38728,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда ключ у нас, осталось сделать только одну вещь...',20994),
(38729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Since you\'re the only one using a sargerite key, the Square portal is filled with supernatural energy.\n\nIt\'s time for a triumphant return to the Black Temple, where you will help the Illidan lord throw away the invaders from Azeroth and Shattrat.',20994),
(38743,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This shall be remembered as one of the darkest days in the history of our world. But hope remains. Elune\'s light has strengthened our resolve.',22522),
(38753,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My husband, Malfurion, what has become of him?!$b$bAnswer me!',22522),
(38759,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The jailer demons sucked out their souls?\r\n\r\nIn these parts, the Burning Legion is many times stronger and more fierce than anywhere else.',20994),
(38765,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Cruel necessity, but demon hunters don\'t get used to the victims. We ourselves sacrificed everything to become who we are.\r\n\r\nThe Legion will be defeated. We are waiting for your orders, $n.',20994),
(38766,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Already, the flow of demons from below has slowed to a trickle.\n\nI can sense the doom guard\'s energy. You have become more powerful.',20994),
(38777,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s so light. So pretty, too! Reminds me of elementium, a bit.$b$bIf you see any more ore like this, try and strike it with the grain. You\'ll waste much less of it.',22522),
(38778,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So it was your footsteps I felt upon my woods as the runestones released their grip? $B$BYou have my thanks, outsider.',22522),
(38784,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at that! She\'s a lovely one, isn\'t she?$b$bTreat this type of ore with care, $glad:lass;. No fat-muscle shoulder swings necessary - just a gentle tap on the right spot and you\'ll extract much more ore than a beginner.',22522),
(38785,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now isn\'t that somethin\'? You got this offa one of those rocky creatures down there?$b$bLooks like ye only brought me a bit o\' the torso, though. Next time, make sure to get the arms and head too. Lots o\' good meat in there.',22522),
(38786,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve learned much, $n.$b$bStay a while. I have a story for you.',22522),
(38787,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Echoes of Rethu\'s time in this land still remain, $n. Be on the lookout for his influence when you are out in the field.',22522),
(38789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... this cannot be! A piece of Rethu\'s own mining log!$B$BLook here, miner... it details a leystone mining technique he was working on...',0),
(38790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Rethu\'s own mining pick...$B$BWell, one of them, anyhow. Stories say he went through them almost weekly.$B$BStill, I\'ve never seen one with my own eyes. Look at the wear on the blade, miner. The angles he used... the strength with which he struck: we could learn much from studying this artifact.',0),
(38791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This... this could not be...$B$BThis is from a member my tribe, $n. Where did you find this?$B$BOne of the first stories we ever learn about Rethu involves the day he lost his horn in battle. There is no way of knowing if this belonged to him but... but...',0),
(38792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You saw a spirit while out mining in the wilds?$B$BNo, I do not believe you. One mustn\'t spend too long out mining, it fatigues the mind. You must be seeing things.$B$BStill, something seems... different about you. You\'ve learned something. Perhaps there\'s some truth to your tale after all...',0),
(38793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The tauren listens as you describe your encounter with the spirit of Rethu Ironhorn.>$B$BI would not normally believe you, but... I can sense truth in your tale. You are a lucky miner.$B$BI am pleased to know that our ancestors look upon us with pride. We have chosen an admirable path.$B$BThank you, $n.',0),
(38794,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirit of Rethu Ironhorn? Tell me everything he said.$B$BHe said he... dug too deep? I see. The Earthmother took him.$B$BThank you for coming to me, miner. This is a tale that the rest of the tribe must hear. We are all the wiser for it.',0),
(38795,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is no natural stone, miner. It stinks of demon\'s blood. Where\'d you find this?$b$bReminds me a bit of old fel iron. Come \'ere, lemme teach you a trick or two on how to properly gather this stuff.',22522),
(38796,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This came out of a cliffside seam? Remember, ye can\'t mine seams like ye mine deposits. Totally different thing. I\'ll show ye my trick.',22522),
(38797,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This came from a blasted infernal? Look out, we\'ve got $gmister:little miss; COMBAT miner, here!$b$bSome o\' this ore seems to \'ave lost its shine on the trip back, however. Next time, make sure to cut out the sword and spell wounds before ye mine it.',22522),
(38798,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done.$B$BStretch it out a bit.$B$BYou may experience some stray urges to burn worlds and sow chaos for the next week or so. Do your best to resist them.',0),
(38799,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, this is my sister\'s ring.$B$BThe fact that you found it on a demon\'s corpse suggests that she has either fallen in battle or, like my other sisters, thrown in her hat with the demons themselves.$B$BThank you for bringing this to me. We don\'t have many spare materials here on the front lines... but I can do without these.',0),
(38800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is. This eye once belonged to my sister, Rin\'thissa.$B$BPoor fool, she cut out her own eye and replaced it with a hunk of ore. That was the tipping point... she\'s completely fel-maddened now.$B$BLearn from her mistake, $n.',0),
(38801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This was my sister\'s. Lyrelle\'s.$B$BHer fate is clear now. She no longer needed that signet ring... the girl must have traded in her own mining arm for one carved out of felslate itself.$B$BAren\'t you glad we only used three small shards?$B$BTake this to heart, $n: you can lose everything to greed if you don\'t exercise restraint. Poor Lyrelle paid that price for all of us.',0),
(38802,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My sister Ondri was the first among us to mine, and the first among us to fall. Some Nathrezim dreadlord convinced her to replace her own heart - her heart! - with a chunk of felslate.$B$BI slew the dreadlord myself, but couldn\'t find the heart. This must be it.$B$BBig sister... I am sorry. Your loss will not be forgotten. We will learn from your missteps.',0),
(38803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My sister\'s soul rests now. I have you to thank for that.$B$BRin\'thissa was always a charmer. You did well to avoid her invitations, and even better to slay her and end her demonic possession. You\'ve learned much since we first met, $n.',0),
(38804,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Poor Lyrelle.$B$BI do not blame you for putting her down, $n. I thank you. I hope that you would do the same to me, if I were to slip and fall down that same path.$B$BJust... try to learn something from your ordeal. Reflect on your experience. I would hate to see her sacrifice be for nothing.',0),
(38805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My sister\'s villainy is finally at an end.$B$BShe was always the wisest among us. Sad that she had to go out the way she did. I\'m certain there was much she could have taught us.',0),
(38806,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот вонючий кусочек... это ведь инфернальная сера, да?$b$bПотрясающе.$b$bМне о ней рассказывали, но я никогда еще ее не видела.$b$bЯ должна ее изучить. А пока – вот все, что я знаю об этой редкой, редкой руде.',24015),
(38807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fascinating...',0),
(38808,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These hearts are fat and bloody. $B$BThe slumbering rulers will not refuse an offering of Bjornharta.',22522),
(38810,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, these Soulcaps should be adequate for your ritual. $B$BSpeak with me once you are ready to proceed and I will guide you further.',22522),
(38811,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ashildir\'s grave has been disturbed, outsider. $B$BDo you know something of this?',22522),
(38813,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наши войска вступили в бой с Легионом.\n\nВскоре мы сами сможем сообщить об этой победе владыке Иллидану в Черном храме.',20994),
(38815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where... where am I now? $B$BI... know you...',22522),
(38816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your glorious battle honors the Valkyra queen.',22522),
(38817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The treachery of the Bonespeakers knows no limit. $B$BTheir rituals seek to sunder the very essence of our queen, but we will use their own magic to return her to us!',22522),
(38818,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A cannot believe this fate... $B$BI am sorry, outsider, for I had underestimated Faljar\'s power.$B$BThat he could banish us here... is unthinkable.',22522),
(38819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Je suis tout à fait d\'accord. Qu\'en penses-tu ? Sommes-nous prêts à monter dans ce centre de commandement et à prendre la clé Sargerite ?',22522),
(38823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These mystics have gone to great lengths to weaken Ashildir. $B$BWe must hope that her spirit is strong enough for the wakening.',22522),
(38833,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There she is... demon steel. Congratulations, $n, you\'ve moved on to a new level of skill.',23420),
(38834,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The two of you are a welcome sight. We pushed the demons out of these ruins, but they are stronger than any we have encountered before.\n\nYour help is appreciated. If we do not crush this Legion invasion now, they will overrun Azsuna and then the rest of the Broken Isles.',22522),
(38857,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent, my good $g sir:lady;. I cannot thank you enough for the freedom of my people. Rosh is especially appreciative.\n\n<Gentle Rosh grunts.>\n\nPerhaps you and I can do some more business together.',22522),
(38862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пока я не выясню, что стряслось с племенем Листа Чертополоха, нужно будет присматривать за яйцами лунокрылов. Хорошо, что хоть им уже ничто не угрожает.',21021),
(38872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21215),
(38873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ха! Посмотрим, что Седогрив станет делать со своими пушками, когда останется без команды!',21384),
(38878,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, ты несешь мне добрые вести, |3-6($c).$B$BРади нашего общего блага.',21384),
(38882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like we underestimated Greymane\'s tenacity - a mistake that cost the Forsaken dearly. $B$BThis Eyir cannot hide for long, however. If I must I will hunt her through the Halls of Valor! $B$BGo now, $c. I will call upon you when you are needed.',21384),
(38888,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are indeed a miner. You have the look of it. There is ore in your blood.',22522),
(38889,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You kneel down and hold out a hand. The baby bear sniffs at your fingers, looking up at you trustingly.$b$bThis bear cub is too little to fend for itself. Will you take it with you on your travels?',22522),
(38901,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You want to mine felslate?$b$bDo you really think you have what it takes?$b$bAre you willing to make sacrifices?$b$bGood.',22522),
(38904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Halls of Valor, hero. Normally one must die to gain entrance, but times have changed.',21021),
(38907,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I know you seek the Pillar of Creation but I am sad to say it was one of many things we lost today.',22522),
(38909,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Riverbend was... destroyed? That disgusting beast Dargrul! I will not stop until I see him dead.$b$bBut we cannot do that with the army we have.$b$bWe need help from the other tribes.',22522),
(38910,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your bravery has returned to us some of our fine feathered friends. Well done.$b$bNow how do you feel about a frontal assault?',22522),
(38911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Mayla was still able to send help? I could hug that child.$b$bWelcome, outsider. I am Jale Rivermane, Chieftain of the Rivermane tribe. And we could really use your help.',22522),
(38912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Outsider, you are one of few from beyond Highmountain who has made it into these woods alive. With me vouching for you, the Bloodtotem have been given a no-kill order by Torok.',22522),
(38913,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! And what are you, tiny creature? Have you come to battle us or join us in battle?',22522),
(38915,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That... is a lot of drogbar.',22522),
(38916,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, thank you for coming. Mayla is as stubborn as her father if not more so.',22522),
(38922,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Uncle?',22522),
(38923,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ОТЛИЧНАЯ РАБОТА. ПЛОХО ТОЛЬКО, ЧТО АЛЬЯНС СНОВА СТУЧИТСЯ В НАШУ ДВЕРЬ! В БОЙ!',20779),
(38924,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'ОТЛИЧНАЯ РАБОТА. ПЛОХО ТОЛЬКО, ЧТО АЛЬЯНС СНОВА СТУЧИТСЯ В НАШУ ДВЕРЬ! В БОЙ!',20779),
(38925,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Теперь Орда всерьез задумается над тем, стоит ли испытывать здесь в Ашране наше терпение.',20490),
(38926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. That will give the Horde something to think about next time they decide to test us here in Ashran.',0),
(38932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a blueprint for some high tech naval equipment. I should be able to reverse engineer the plans and have this equipment available for you shortly!',0),
(38933,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now is the time to strike back against the Legion.',22522),
(38935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ha ha! You were sent by Bolo? The \"Keg Mender,\" right? From the Drunken Hozen?$B$BHow is his eye healing? Is his friend still hung over?$B$BAhh... that was an enjoyable evening.',0),
(38936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, you are a friend of Cho\'s? Welcome! Welcome!$B$BI would serve you a banquet, but as you can see, we are in dire straights at the moment.$B$BSay, would you be willing to lend us a hand?',0),
(38944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now this... this I can work with!$B$BReminds me of some old night elven festival cloth I\'ve seen.',0),
(38945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a shame. Without the ability to do any stitching, we can hardly do anything with this fabric.$B$B<Tanithria pouts.>$B$BStill, there ARE patterns we know that don\'t require stitching. Shoulderpads are easy, and belts should be a cinch.',0),
(38946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My my, look at you! Such an attractive young $C, and all bedecked in magical finery and weaponry. To what do I owe the pleasure?$B$BAha! Tailoring! It\'s your lucky day, er...$B$BI\'m sorry, what was your name? $n?$B$BIt\'s your lucky day, $n! I happen to be one of the best tailors in Suramar...',0),
(38947,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect. Marvelous!',0),
(38948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You, $n, are a person of great skill. I send you out for patterns, and you do so without question. Remarkable!',0),
(38949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it!$B$BNo, no, don\'t thank me. I\'m just happy to have been of service.',0),
(38950,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your friend certainly has an... interesting appearance.$B$BHe taught you to sew this silk? Hmm. Maybe we should keep him around for a while.',0),
(38951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... he may have a point.$B$BThese needles ARE quite strong, and they have a nice bounce to them. Still, I do take issue with their shape and feel. I have an idea.',0),
(38952,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at these! Strong, light, flexible, sharp, with a refined curve and a smooth edge. You\'ve certainly put your Dalaran touch on it. It\'s the best of both worlds!$B$BEnough fussing over our tools, now. Shall we sew?',0),
(38953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now isn\'t that just lovely. Go on, try it out yourself!',0),
(38954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sorry about that, $n. You caught me snooping around. I suppose my curiosity got the better of me.$B$BAllow me to make it up to you.',0),
(38955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it. Not the best bag in the world, but it\'s better than most.$B$BI want to apologize again for running off, $n. My hunger... err, curiosity... occasionally gets the better of me. I promise it will not happen again.',0),
(38956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My most sincere apologies, $n. Not only did I make a spectacle of myself, I fear I may have also put the good name of your tailoring shop at risk.$B$BYou have every right to be upset with me.',0),
(38957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aha! This will be much simpler than I\'d first thought.$B$B<Lyndras takes a moment to jot some instructions down on a scrap of vellum.>$B$BHere, $n. You should have it.',0),
(38958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Marvelous!',0),
(38959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent! It\'s always nice to have familiar things.$B$BThis will make instructing you much easier for me.',0),
(38960,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will be plenty.',0),
(38961,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lyndras ran off again before you could return, $n. He left a note and a pattern for you.$B$BThe note reads,$B$B\"I\'m sorry, $n, but I\'m afraid I may become a threat to the fellow tailors of this shop. I\'m off to find somewhere to try and control my urges, or fall into depravity. It has been an honor training you.$B$BSincerely,$B$BLyndras\"$B$BHow sad...',0),
(38962,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that you can move safely around the city, it\'s time to find some new masters.',0),
(38963,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Before long you may be the one teaching me a thing or two.',0),
(38965,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tanithria listens to your account of Lyndras\' fate.>$B$BI... I see. That\'s a shame.$B$BI had grown to enjoy his company, you know. If you\'ll excuse me, I need a moment to think about him.',0),
(38966,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The good news is that we can now craft more efficient patterns out of silkweave.$B$BThe bad news is that we\'ve expended the remainder of Lyndras\' knowledge. Where should we turn next?',0),
(38967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, a fellow tailor. Pleasure to make your acquaintance, uh... $n, was it?$B$BI trust you\'d like to come into the fold of our guild? Where did you receive your prior training?',0),
(38968,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm.$B$BVery well. We may continue.',0),
(38969,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your stitching is still a little rough, but you\'ve already mastered all of the basics.$B$BWell done.$B$BI don\'t say that very often. Savor it.',0),
(38970,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t look at us that way, $n. Selling our services to the demons may have been morally dubious, but our skills have grown exponentially since Azayna made the deal.$B$BContinue your training with us, or don\'t. If you want to leave now, nobody\'s stopping you. If you want to learn more... we are the only game in town.',0),
(38971,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work. I will get to studying this fabric right away. As promised, I will teach you what I know. Are you acquainted with our patterns for gloves?',0),
(38974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tellumi takes the loincloth from you and gives you a sly smile.>$B$BI trust you now see looking at a situation from a functional angle than a reactionary one will earn you far more knowledge.',0),
(38975,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not quite what I\'d expected, but it was an interesting history lesson, at least. You can keep the robes, I\'ve learned all I need just by watching you work.$B$BNow, as promised, I shall show you what I know.',0),
(38989,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar General. Your forces await your orders.',0),
(38990,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Король-лич сделал мудрый выбор, доверив эти клинки тебе, $n. Ты уже не раз $gдоказал, что достоин:доказала, что достойна;, владеть ими.$b$bИ, должен признаться, в глубине души я рад, что он выбрал не меня. Я больше не хочу вверять свою судьбу магическому оружию.',21287),
(38992,1,66,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Слишком долго я просидел без дела в стенах Акеруса, и Вечный голод гложет мою душу. Давно пора отправиться на поле боя и сполна утолить его.$b$bДля меня будет честью сражаться с тобой плечом к плечу, Владыка Смерти.',21287),
(38996,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings General. Your forces await your orders on the Planning Table.',0),
(39000,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kadgar is carefully examining the books you\'ve obtained without hiding your disgust. >$b$bIt\'s disgusting, isn\'t it? The encyclopedia of a psychotic maniac is harmless compared to a coloring book.',20490),
(39003,274,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'<Cadgar changes face when you hear the story of what happened in the tower. >$b$bKordana...? Oh, no... Yes, she\'s been a little distant lately... But I would never... I thought it was just the specifics of her work. It never occurred to me...$b$bYeah, $n! Do you understand now? That\'s what Gul\'Dan is all about. He finds our weaknesses and skillfully uses them against us. So from now on, think properly who you should trust. Oh, Kordana!$b$b<Kadgar turns to the sea. >$b$b >Kordana...',20490),
(39004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Khadgar\'s face is ashen.>$B$BDraenor is saved, $n. But the Legion is more powerful than even I had imagined. And Gul\'dan, that snake - he\'s still alive. Somewhere.$B$BStay here and celebrate with the others, $n. You\'ve earned it. But I will soon return to Azeroth to deal with this, and I hope you will join me there when the time comes.',0),
(39015,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22019),
(39018,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Archmage looks damp and uncomfortable.>$B$BI apologize for the conditions here, $n. I had no choice. I summoned this tower at the optimal confluence of arcane energies. My hope is to finish my work here before all my books get musty.$B$BSo then! Let\'s get to it.',0),
(39019,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, my friend. We have much work to do.',0),
(39020,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, $n, ты $gвернулся:вернулась;. Тебя до сих пор окружает потусторонняя аура.',20490),
(39021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, $n, ты $gвернулся:вернулась;. Тебя до сих пор окружает потусторонняя аура.',20886),
(39022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, my friend. We have much work to do.',0),
(39025,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It has been an age or more since the drogbar last walked the surface in such numbers.$b$bThey became the dark stories we tell children.',22522),
(39026,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your battle skills are impressive.',22522),
(39027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oro and the others? Did they make it out as well?$b$bSuch destruction. So many good warbraves have fallen today.$b$bIt is clear now, we will need the full might of the Highmountain tribes if we are to recover the hammer.',22522),
(39032,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя Элисандрия послала? Она славная. Хорошая подруга и настоящая защитница природы.',20994),
(39033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n. Опытный предсказатель с помощью апекситовых кристаллов может отыскивать месторождения нефти, спрятанные глубоко под землей. К сожалению, обучить этому искусству тебя не получится, но ты все равно сможешь получить свою выгоду.',20886),
(39034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your new allies left this here, as a tribute for your efforts on their behalf.',0),
(39040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I trust your battles went well?',0),
(39041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The wind whispers your name, $n, and tales of your conquest.',0),
(39043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for clearing us a path. We should have a straight shot at Dargrul now.',22522),
(39047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(39049,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An inquisitor\'s essence... perfect. Allari was right.\n\nNow to complete my ritual and spy on the Legion\'s leadership.',20994),
(39050,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это что-то новенькое. Она выглядит как демоническая паучиха. Вот только пауков еще в Легионе не хватало...',20994),
(39051,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Suramar is not far from here.',20994),
(39054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хех! Мы еще сделаем из тебя настоящего морского волка! Пора приступать к постройке первого корабля!',20444),
(39055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Первый корабль готов! Отличная работа, $n. Я займусь подготовкой к отплытию в Танаан.',20444),
(39056,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты отлично справляешься, командир! Из тебя выйдет замечательный капитан.',20574),
(39057,1,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно, $n. В доках кипит работа.$b$b<Кадгар прихлопывает в ладоши и потирает их друг о друга. В его бледно-голубых глазах мерцает что-то зловещее.>$b$bМы им покажем.',20886),
(39059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good you arrived when you did, $n.',22522),
(39060,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The deed is done. $B$BYou have done a great service to the worgen of Greywatch, $n.',22522),
(39061,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. The puzzle is finally coming together. $B$BWe may not know why Sylvanas\' forces are here, but I think we know where they are.',22522),
(39062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the cavalry has arrived? $B$BGood, we must make haste if we wish to uncover Sylvanas\' plot before it comes to bear.',22522),
(39063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Val\'kyr, you say? This is worse that I had imagined. If Sylvanas is able to create more Val\'kyr, there will be no limit to her armies!$B$BIt seems the vault is her goal. We must stop her!',22522),
(39067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great work! We will get to work right away on the upgrade.',0),
(39068,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Controlling the seas of Draenor is in our grasp!',0),
(39082,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Обожаю запах свежеспиленных деревьев и смолы! Ну что, начинаем строить?',20444),
(39090,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! К сожалению, наши противники настолько упрямы, что продолжают атаку.',20886),
(39092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you, $n. $B$BThe assault on Dreadwake\'s Landing fared poorly, and I had thought our cause lost until Crowley informed me of your success.$B$BNow, let\'s finish this!',22522),
(39096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done Commander! But there are still a lot of Horde out there wreaking havoc.',0),
(39107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хе-хе! Похоже, это действительно все! Это очень удачно – для нас обоих. Так, тебе я могу выделить вот столько...',20574),
(39117,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. Grisly, eh? I think I\'ll mount it over the door.$B$BI want you to have this, too. Fresh-caught mossgill was Papa\'s favorite.',22522),
(39122,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re awake! We nearly lost you there... $B$BIt\'s a good thing we managed to get you and Greymane out of there in time, otherwise we wouldn\'t have been able to reverse Sylvanas\'s poison. It\'s a shame she got away, but her plans in Skold-Ashil failed and we have you to thank for it. $B$BI\'m sure Greymane will order a commendation for you once he is fully recovered. You did a great thing here, $n. $B$BGilneas is in your debt.',22522),
(39123,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Not a scratch on ya that I can see. I bet those lions never saw ya comin\'!',22522),
(39124,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve hunted the Highmountain Elderhorn and lived to tell about it. That\'s not a feat that most can say they\'ve accomplished. Color me impressed.',22522),
(39127,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Townlong Steppes. If you insist on wandering in to the darkest places of Pandaria then far be it from me to not put you to good use.',0),
(39133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It has been a long time since the earth itself has moved against us like this.',22522),
(39134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I suspect this is not the last of Dargrul\'s assaults. He is still learning the powers of the Hammer like a child with a new toy.',22522),
(39142,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Подопытный не выжил? Весьма неожиданный поворот.$B$BНу что ж, ты в любом случае $gвыполнил:выполнила; свою часть уговора. Пришла пора и мне выполнить свою.',22996),
(39149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We don\'t need any help, and we don\'t like strangers wanderin\' around on our land.',0),
(39153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня вороны отведают воргенской плоти, |3-6($c).$B$BОтличная работа.',21384),
(39154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не $gожидал:ожидала; меня здесь встретить? Для меня тоже оказалось полной неожиданностью, что мои силы до сих пор не могут проникнуть в город этих проклятых врайкулов! $B$BПришло время сменить тактику, и твое появление здесь как раз очень кстати.',21384),
(39155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$gHero: Warrior; returns, and the barrier no longer blocks our way. You have a worthy reward waiting for you. $B$But first we must penetrate the crypt!',21384),
(39175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),
(39176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The construct lies amidst rubble, in disrepair.>$B$B<Judging by the tools on its manipulator arms, this construct does appear to be designed for gemwork.>',0),
(39177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you responsible for the return of this construct, $n? It came barrelling through our camp like it was on a mission. It took three of the warders to tackle and subdue it, but for the time being, it appears content to stay here.',0),
(39178,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These antlers are going to look quite impressive hanging from the walls of the hunters\' lodge.',22522),
(39179,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты просто умница. Я теперь понимаю, почему Ритцун так любит давать тебе всякие поручения.',22996),
(39180,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Cenarion Refuge, $n. I hope you\'ve come to aid us in our mission. We\'ve much work ahead of us.',0),
(39181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Cenarion Refuge, $n. I hope you\'ve come to aid us in our mission. We\'ve much work ahead of us.',0),
(39182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad that Stonebreaker Hold sent you. The druids of the thicket have been slain! Only myself and one other have survived, and he\'s insane.$B$BI don\'t know what happened, but I intend to get to the bottom of it. Whatever it was, it happened quickly and feels unnatural.$B$BWill you help me?',0),
(39188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad that Stonebreaker Hold sent you. The druids of the thicket have been slain! Only myself and one other have survived, and he\'s insane.$B$BI don\'t know what happened, but I intend to get to the bottom of it. Whatever it was, it happened quickly and feels unnatural.$B$BWill you help me?',0),
(39191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21154),
(39192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your weapon has untold potential! You will need to get more acquainted with it first and we can work on it some more.',21108),
(39195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),
(39196,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Even though he endeavors to hide it, a look of relief spreads over Kroghan\'s face.>$B$BIt\'s about time you got here! Granted, you\'re not an army, but any able-bodied $R than can wield a weapon or chant a spell is welcome here. The people of Garadar are kin to all the Horde and we are proud to shed our blood in their defense.',0),
(39197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your people have done a great service for my good friend, Ikuti. For this, you are welcome here in Telaar.',0),
(39198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Denjai seeks help? I\'d send him reinforcements, but we\'re spread thin here as it is. We\'ve got trouble of our own with the ogres up here.$B$BWhen I can, I\'ll give him what information we have on the local ogre tribes and their tactics. Perhaps if he can survive long enough, we\'ll be able to launch a two-pronged assault on the vile scum.',0),
(39199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, good. We could use more able bodies.',0),
(39201,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey there. Looking for work? Perfect!',0),
(39202,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey there. Looking for work? Perfect!',0),
(39203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What took you so long? Time waits only for Aspects, $R.$B$BWe have much work to do, you and I.',0),
(39204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been expecting you, $C. We have much work to do, you and I.',0),
(39206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who are you?$B$BTell me why I shouldn\'t split you in two where you stand!',0),
(39207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You were almost shot down, eh? Savage monsters - those Horde.$B$BPayback will come for what they\'ve done. You can count on at least that much, $C.$B$BNow, it\'s time to put you to work.',0),
(39208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Stefan reads the missive, then crumples it up and tosses it into the fire.>$B$BOld news. The Argent Crusade is - once again - late to the party. We\'ve been tracking Drakuru since Grizzly Hills. He is slated for eradication.',0),
(39209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, Hemet\'s here. He\'s at the camp, just go northwest toward the river and you\'ll soon see it. And for the love of the Light, lad, have him send someone to cut me down!',0),
(39210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Dalaran.',0),
(39212,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, Hemet\'s here. He\'s at the camp, just go northwest toward the river and you\'ll soon see it. And for the love of the Light, lad, have him send someone to cut me down!',0),
(39214,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It has been a while since I\'ve talked to the living. I hope you don\'t mind if I assist you. Being slain in combat has given me a calmer outlook in this emergency than other warriors.',21108),
(39217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n! Ситуация там сейчас у нас весьма непростая.',20886),
(39221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wonder if dat magnaron fel into da pool. Get it, mon?',0),
(39225,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wouldn\'t know dat monster started off as an orc if Saurfang hadn\'t told me.',0),
(39228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Anotha follower of da darkness falls before ya.',0),
(39231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dat bag of bones be gone again.',0),
(39232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya saved Draenor from one of da strongest demons in all creation, Commander. Dey will sing songs of your victory.',0),
(39233,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n! Наверняка ты $gвидел:видела;, что за бардак там устроил Альянс!',20779),
(39236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Обожаю запах свежеспиленных деревьев и смолы! Ну что, начинаем строить?',20779),
(39241,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хех! Мы еще сделаем из тебя настоящего морского волка! Пора приступать к постройке первого корабля!',20779),
(39242,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s done. Handsome, not a ship! You owe me an army, and he\'ll take it wherever you want. I\'ll get him ready to go to Tanahan.',20779),
(39243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты отлично справляешься, командир! Из тебя выйдет замечательный капитан.',20779),
(39245,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа! Мы сразу приступим к расширению пристани.',20779),
(39246,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это будет самый мощный флот на Дреноре!',20886),
(39247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What of the others? Did they...?$B$BI see. They gave their lives for a worthy cause - the Twinblades will change the tide of this war, mark my words.',20994),
(39250,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We can\'t handle too many more of those fel-corrupted beasts.',0),
(39253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was some kind of monster, wasn\'t it?',0),
(39256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How does a vindicator fall so far from the light?',0),
(39259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s hope Mannoroth stays down longer this time.',0),
(39260,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have saved Draenor from one of the strongest demons in all creation, Commander. They will sing songs of your victory.',0),
(39261,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, что Кор\'вас быстро нашла тебя, $gповелитель:повелительница;.',20994),
(39262,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я так и знал, что в пещере кто-то есть!',20994),
(39272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $r. Some of the crops still live. I believe with hard work and some of Jale\'s magical waters, we will not lose the entire harvest.',22522),
(39276,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Интересуешься кораблестроением, как я погляжу? Я сделаю все, что смогу, чтобы помочь тебе, командир.',20444),
(39277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That worked quite well. I will hold on to this Bug Sprayer; it might be useful in the battles to come.',22522),
(39278,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis... is important! Where you find dis? We been lookin for dis stuff a while.$B$BYou got a dock now? Dat is VERY interesting. Maybe it time we became good friends? Da big fort you have is hard to sneak a spy-- er, forget I said dat.$B$BI gots an idea.',0),
(39283,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow, look at this thing.$B$BI think maybe I\'ll... actually, I\'m not sure what to do with this. Is it really a fish?',0),
(39299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am pleased to make your acquaintance, commander. If you ever wish to see the latest wonders that Madame Goya offers, please do not hesitate to speak with me. She sends this as a token of appreciation for your work in retrieving the manifest.$B$BRemember, Madame Goya only accepts bids in person. You must travel to meet her, if you wish to acquire any of her wares.',0),
(39305,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21414),
(39313,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Если вдруг передумаешь – я всегда здесь!',20574),
(39315,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Artillery for all tastes! Just like in a fairy tale. $B$BYes, keep in mind - if you change your mind, I\'m always here!',20779),
(39316,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They have returned relatively unharmed. Thank you, $n.',22522),
(39318,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Julan is dead? He was a good shaman and full of life. Not as morbid as some of these spiritwalkers.$b$bI will miss his laughter tonight.',22522),
(39321,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. Now to cut the head off the snake, as it were.',22522),
(39322,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have our respect and honor, $p. I name you Skyfriend, and grant you free passage through our lands at your discretion.',22522),
(39323,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Moozy squeals in delight at your presence.>',22522),
(39325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I trust you were successful in making the potions? This will be the first step in building trust between us.',0),
(39326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them! I had the utmost faith, of course. What\'s a few demons or naga to one so dedicated to advancing our craft?',0),
(39327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems that twerp of a scribe has his uses after all! Let\'s see what he came up with...',0),
(39328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My poor table!$B$BAll the implements we needed to mix the new potions were on that table. Without them, the new recipes are useless!$B$BFinding replacements will be no small task, but I\'m confident you\'re up to it. If you need guidance, I can suggest places to look for the items we need.$B$BNow, off with you!',0),
(39329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, this burner is exactly what we need for the alchemy table!$B$BWait just a moment... No, no, this will never do!',0),
(39330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You imbued the burner with ley energy, eh? Let\'s have a look.$B$B<Deucus examines the leyflame burner.>$B$BYes, this will do nicely! A crucial step in rebuilding the alchemy table.',0),
(39331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this? The spoils from another of your adventures, eh? Let\'s have a look.',0),
(39332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These potions have the corks we need for the alchemy table. Another successful endeavor!',0),
(39333,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh yes, these are fine. Fine indeed. Unfortunately they need to be calibrated in order to for us to get any accurate readings off of them.',0),
(39334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Barm did his work, then? I hoped that tauren would come through!$B$BThis is a very useful addition to my alchemy table.',0),
(39335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You... you found some? I\'m impressed, and that doesn\'t happen easily I\'ll have you know.$B$BNow let\'s see what exactly it was that you found...',0),
(39336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ghost of Svena appeared again? Seems she doesn\'t take kindly to our attempts to learn these vrykul recipes...$B$BThankfully, the satchel you recovered has all the precipitating powder we require for the alchemy table. Another victory for us!',0),
(39337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This Shaldorei Silk appears to be torn into strips. The elves have apparently been using it as bandages for their fallen warriors.',0),
(39338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This Shaldorei Silk will make an excellent filter for the alchemy table. Nice work getting that nightborne to help us, $n!',0),
(39339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve found something quite intriguing here! Others have brought me fragments of such implements, but never so complete a sample.$B$BThis is going to require a lot of work...',0),
(39340,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It looks like you acquired everything we need. Give me a few moments to apply them to the interior.$B$B<Deucus works on the crucible, restoring its lining.>$B$BPerfect! The crucible is almost ready for use.$B$BJust one more tiny detail...',0),
(39341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! I must say, I was a bit concerned for your well-being, but once again you\'ve proven resourceful.$B$BNow that the crucible\'s lining is restored and it has been bathed in demon\'s bile, it\'s ready for use on the alchemy table.$B$BWell done!',0),
(39342,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You got the hair?!$B$B<Ms. Xiulan laughs audibly.>$B$BOh, I wish I could have been there to see the look on his face. Nevertheless, a deal\'s a deal.',0),
(39343,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this you have for me, $n? Say, these are some wondrous tubes! I bet I know a way to make them even better.$B$BI\'ll need you to temper these glass tubes in the fire of a dragon\'s breath under the light of a full moon on the equinox, then travel into the Emerald Dream and--$B$BOh, hold on. These tubes are perfect just as they are. Nevermind!$B$BSometimes I get a bit caught up in this whole adventuring business...',0),
(39344,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, now that we understand one another let\'s see what sort of arrangement we can come to.',0),
(39345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I\'d say these burettes look well-calibrated.$B$BI knew those three would be meticulous. Never underestimate the value of someone who obsesses over tiny details, $n!',0),
(39346,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s quite an armload of potions you made! I think it\'s safe to say that these burettes are working as intended.$B$BI\'ll add them to the alchemy table.',0),
(39347,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this then?$B$B<Alard takes the list and looks it over. His eyes widen as he reaches the bottom>$B$BI take it you don\'t fully grasp what it is that you need, do you? If this is truly what\'s required then we better get started.',0),
(39348,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. Once we have everything together, I\'ll get started right away.',0),
(39349,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alard takes the bag from you and peers inside.>$B$BSo this is the stuff? It\'s definitely true what I\'ve heard. It is quite heavy.',0),
(39350,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was there? You found some?$B$B<Alard takes the crate and opens it. He reels back from the smell.>$B$BYep, that\'s the stuff alright. By the light, does that reek.',0),
(39351,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You hand the heart over to Alard. He places it within his forge and it begins to burn white hot.>$B$BPerhaps I should refer to you as Dragonslayer $n from now on.$B$BJoking aside, I\'ll begin my forging.',0),
(39354,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $gстранник:странница;! Сегодня ты очень $gпомог:помогла; лесу.',21916),
(39355,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a blueprint for some high tech naval equipment. I should be able to reverse engineer the plans and have this equipment available for you shortly!',0),
(39356,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20574),
(39358,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20886),
(39359,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20886),
(39360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20886),
(39363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20886),
(39364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20779),
(39365,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a blueprint for some high tech naval equipment. I should be able to reverse engineer the plans and have this equipment available for you shortly!',0),
(39366,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это чертеж какого-то высокотехнологичного корабельного оборудования. Думаю, я смогу разобраться в нем, и уже скоро это оборудование станет тебе доступно!',20886),
(39368,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a blueprint for some high tech naval equipment. I should be able to reverse engineer the plans and have this equipment available for you shortly!',0),
(39372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Bloodtotem don\'t often allow outsiders into their midst. Even asking them to give you an audience is a danger.',22522),
(39373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could hear them screeching from here. With this victory and the defeat of the Witch of the Wood, Torok will surely be willing to see you.',22522),
(39374,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Strange that he would be in the cavern at this time... perhaps this is a good sign?',22522),
(39381,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have little reason to trust me, but we have a common enemy in the Bloodtotem and I could use your help.',22522),
(39383,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Xandris has finally paid for his crimes, but his blood will not bring back the innocents he has slain.',22522),
(39384,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my thanks, $c.$b$bIf not for your arrival I would have surely perished here.',22522),
(39385,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Клянусь милостью Темной Госпожи, ты это $gсделал:сделала;! У Седогрива не было ни единого шанса выжить при таком чудовищном взрыве! $B$BТы сегодня $gоказал:оказала; Отрекшимся огромную услугу. Мы не забудем об этом, не сомневайся.',21384),
(39386,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A gnome hunter, huh? Is that a joke?$b$bFine, fine. What the boss wants, the boss gets. I\'ll start working on a prototype as soon as I finish up my latest project.',22522),
(39387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Skyhorn are with us? This day just got much better.',22522),
(39389,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кровавый камень выглядит сытым. Отлично! Теперь можно приступать к экспериментам...',22996),
(39390,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well now, this is intriguing! This book is... well, you see, it\'s obviously... uh...',0),
(39391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Frag has fallen? The youngest of my pets was perhaps my most dear... curse the Bloodtotem and their cruelty!',22522),
(39392,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These pelts are even sharper than I imagined. Well done, $n.',22522),
(39394,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have saved us all. The Cipher has become fragmented with Cyrukh\'s death. This means its guardians can hide the shards all over Draenor so the chances of piecing it together will be impossible.$B$BThis great victory will give us more time to stop Gul\'dan but I shudder to think of what his next plan may be...',0),
(39395,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you trusted me, $n. I feel like a great weight has been lifted from me.$B$BI still owe Draenor a great debt for the part I played in Gul\'dan\'s plot. My sons will aid the shamans in rebuilding and hiding the shards. Also, if you will allow it, I want to help you remove Gul\'dan from this world.$B$BI will serve you... Commander.',0),
(39401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они заманили нас в ловушку, командир. Я жажду мести!',20779),
(39404,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они заманили нас в ловушку, командир. Я жажду мести!',20574),
(39405,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The verses of the poem unfold the tale of Ashildir founding the shieldmaidens and bringing them to Skold-Ashil.$B$BIf these shieldmaidens revere the Valkyra queen as this would suggest, your dealings with her in Helheim may prove advantageous.',22522),
(39417,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здорово, что у Разика хорошо идут дела с его гаджетами.$b$bНадо подкинуть ему идейку изобрести ружье, которое само наводится на цель, – может, тогда эти горе-охотники смогут добыть хоть какую-то дичь.',22566),
(39419,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gоказал:оказала; огромную услугу племени Небесного Рога, $n.',21108),
(39422,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We have been waiting for you, Commander.',0),
(39423,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы ждали тебя, командир.',20779),
(39425,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will help me repair my broken body.',22522),
(39426,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have earned my trust. The Stonedark are not yet safe from our brothers led by Dargrul the Underking. We would willingly join Mayla Highmountain and her tauren against them.',22522),
(39427,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We saved the Eagle Spirit and received her blessing. I feel even more confident we will get Talonclaw now!',0),
(39429,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Haha! You are covered in the feathers of your enemies.',22522),
(39430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your gift is a noble gesture, $R. Smithing can be a surprisingly perilous profession.$B$BNow let\'s see that flask.$B$B$B$BEh, that\'s not so bad. Give me a moment to fix it.',0),
(39431,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You dare request such a menial task from me? Surely you must be joking.',0),
(39432,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Этот ваш верховный маг сказал мне, что сила, осквернившая эти кристаллы, берет начало из другого, очень далекого мира. Боюсь, без твоей помощи я не смогу понять, как искоренить тьму, поселившуюся в сердцах моих сородичей.',20574),
(39433,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твоя помощь потребуется мне до тех пор, пока этот мир полностью не избавится от присутствия темной силы, которую Гул\'дан призвал сюда, чтобы уничтожить нас.',20886),
(39437,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could hear their murlurulurls echoing in the cavern. Maybe they\'ll think twice before taking our stuff next time.',22522),
(39438,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That ought to send some of the murlocs packing.',22522),
(39439,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found them! Not sure how you carried them all at one time...',22522),
(39440,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stronger than you look, little one.',22522),
(39455,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They said an outsider would wield the Hammer of Khaz\'goroth. I doubt you could even lift it.',22522),
(39456,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Torok is dead? By... your hand? He must have truly given in to his thirst for blood if that came to pass.\n\nThe Stonedark on our side, though... That is an advantage I had not expected. Navarrogg has always been much more agreeable than Dargrul and his brood. Thank you for striking this rare alliance, $n.',22522),
(39472,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To think that the Forsaken were brash enough to brew their blight in our own backyard. With the loss of their apothecary, their invasion force is left without teeth. $B$BYou have done well, $n.',22522),
(39487,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have never seen a drogbar transform like that. The Hammer of Khaz\'goroth is indeed powerful.',22522),
(39488,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the magic now spreading back into the cave, the balance of elements will be restored and the drogbar will not last long here.',22522),
(39489,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The cave is nearly restored...',22522),
(39490,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With fewer of those insects out there, I can tend to some of the crops.',22522),
(39491,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now we have what they used to spray our fields. I wonder what use we could put this to...',22522),
(39495,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22522),
(39496,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you arrived when you did. The drogbar are increasing their aggression as we speak.',22522),
(39498,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would seem we beat the Underking here.',22522),
(39499,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A-ha! Soul Remnants!$B$B<Khadgar cradles the Remnants briefly and focuses intently upon them.>$B$BThere, now you and your companions may access the upper level of the Citadel directly.',0),
(39500,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A-ha! Soul Remnants!$B$B<Khadgar cradles the Remnants briefly and focuses intently upon them.>$B$BThere, now you and your companions may access the upper level of the Citadel directly.',0),
(39501,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A-ha! Soul Remnants!$B$B<Khadgar cradles the Remnants briefly and focuses intently upon them.>$B$BThere, now you and your companions may access the upper level of the Citadel directly.',0),
(39502,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it!$B$BStrange, these Fel Essences bear the unique signature of the pit lord Mannoroth.... How in the world did you manage to... It\'s almost like you\'ve been here before!$B$B<Khadgar peers at you curiously.>$B$BNo matter! With this power, I can send you and your companions straight to the top of the Citadel!',0),
(39504,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it!$B$BStrange, these Fel Essences bear the unique signature of the pit lord Mannoroth.... How in the world did you manage to... It\'s almost like you\'ve been here before!$B$B<Khadgar peers at you curiously.>$B$BNo matter! With this power, I can send you and your companions straight to the top of the Citadel!',0),
(39505,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it!$B$BStrange, these Fel Essences bear the unique signature of the pit lord Mannoroth.... How in the world did you manage to... It\'s almost like you\'ve been here before!$B$B<Khadgar peers at you curiously.>$B$BNo matter! With this power, I can send you and your companions straight to the top of the Citadel!',0),
(39509,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Danjay tries with his finger one of the blades on the sharpness. There\'s a sinister grin running through his elongated face. >$b$bVery good, commander. That\'s exactly what it is.',20886),
(39510,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, командир. То, что надо.$b$bЯ отправлю их со своим гонцом на твою пристань. Не бойся – мои охотники в джунглях чувствуют себя как дома. Доставят все в один миг.',20886),
(39511,273,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я немедленно доставлю их леди Лиадрин.$b$bА ты $gсам:сама; правда думаешь, что для этих монстров еще не все потеряно? Я-то в это не верю, честно говоря.',20886),
(39512,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Как раз то, что нам нужно! Я сейчас же прикажу приступить к расшифровке, командир.',20886),
(39513,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It doesn\'t look like much, does it, Commander?$b$bI\'ll hide them in a safe place for now. The blood elves probably know what to do with them next.',20886),
(39514,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это ты такую здоровенную штуку на себе $gдопер:доперла;? Не иначе, в твоих жилах тоже течет гроннская кровь!$b$bЭту упряжь мы срочно отправим гоблинам в Оргриммар – пускай разберутся, как она устроена.',20886),
(39515,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это моя вина, $n. Маннетрель и до этого был на грани. В этой бесконечной битве нам всем нужно научиться управлять потоками Скверны, которая нас пропитала.\n\nМожет быть, тебе пока не стоит раскрывать это новое знание остальным. Мы не можем потерять еще одного бойца.',21287),
(39516,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это моя вина, $n. Маннетрель и до этого был на грани. В этой бесконечной битве нам всем нужно научиться управлять потоками Скверны, которая нас пропитала.\n\nМожет быть, тебе пока не стоит раскрывать это новое знание остальным. Мы не можем потерять еще одного бойца.',20994),
(39519,6,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что, $n, каково это? Посмотреть демону Пылающего Легиона в его налитые кровью глаза и сказать: \"Не сегодня\".$b$b<Ними запрокидывает голову, встряхивая копну рыжих волос, и звонко хохочет.>',20886),
(39526,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты молодчина, командир! Вот так вот, день за днем мы будем постепенно отвоевывать джунгли.',20886),
(39529,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, я смотрю, у тебя тут неплохая коллекция зубов. Многим ли из них удалось отведать твоей плоти? Правда, ничто не может сравниться с азартом охоты?',20886),
(39530,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That artifact is amazing, I can already see the potential we can unlock.',21108),
(39532,6,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Они жаждали славной смерти – ты $gдаровал:даровала; им ее, $n. Совсем скоро у Гул\'дана не останется слуг, которые будут делать за него его грязную работу.',20886),
(39565,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты молодчина. Нельзя ослаблять давления на тех, кто может бросить нам вызов.',20779),
(39566,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A sodden, aged tome lies partially buried in the muck.',0),
(39567,274,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну и ужасные же инструменты, доложу я тебе! Нужно будет уничтожить их, как только мы узнаем все, что сможем.',20779),
(39568,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful, wonderful. I\'ll send a messenger to your shipyard with the information we learned. Thank you, commander.',0),
(39569,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, commander. Our scholars will study these samples at once!$B$BWe mustn\'t give up hope. Our eredar brothers are seemingly lost forever, but orcs from the world of Azeroth managed to break free from the Burning Legion....',0),
(39570,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes, so many papers... Ah, some of this is in code. It\'s all very crude, though. Our scholars will learn much from this. Well done commander!',0),
(39571,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very good, $n. Our scholars will be able to use these crystals to protect and empower our people.',0),
(39572,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Moozy! Thank the spirits you are okay! Oh thank you for returning him to me. Thank you!',22522),
(39573,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Невероятно! какая громадная штуковина! Спасибо, что $gпринес:принесла; это.$b$bМоему народу еще столько предстоит узнать об этом мире!',20779),
(39574,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличные новости, командир! Совсем скоро мы полностью окружим мерзкую цитадель Гул\'дана!',20779),
(39575,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Quite a drop. Mind yourself in here, this is not a safe place.',22522),
(39577,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That day, the hammer freed me of the corruption of the Black Dragonflight.$b$bIn gratitude, I have faithfully served the Highmountain family since Huln rescued me from this pit.$b$bIt has been my honor and my pleasure to watch each of his descendants earn the title of High Chieftain.',22522),
(39578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And so Huln cast out Deathwing into the land of Deepholm and claimed the Hammer of Khaz\'goroth as his charge.$b$bBut there was one last bit of business for him to attend to...',22522),
(39579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I always thought it odd that Ebonhorn never seemed to age. Or at least, he always looked old, but he never got older.',22522),
(39580,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even without the hammer, I know what to do next. When our forces are rallied, we can take the fight to the Underking.',22522),
(39581,6,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! А ты в бою не промах, $n. Дай пять! Только руку держи пониже.',20779),
(39582,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Parvink is covered in bleeding scratches and shredded leaves.>$B$BHey, not bad! We\'ll call it a tie. This jungle don\'t scare me for nothin\'.$B$BMaybe we can hunt some more tomorrow?',0),
(39586,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You and Parvink compare stories of your battles throughout the jungle. Finally, she hollers:>$B$BGLORY TO THE ALLIANCE!!$B$B<...Loud enough to frighten birds from the trees.>',0),
(39588,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Their numbers are fewer, but still they threaten our safety.',22522),
(39590,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is a shame to see the first worthy challenger for the Aegis treating the trials with such disrespect. Such hubris cannot win the Aegis, for the gods will surely strike him down for his arrogance.\n\nYou, however, seem different. You have shown that you are a worthy challenger. $B$BI will allow you to begin the trials.',22522),
(39591,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have learned of the obstacles you must face. $B$BDo you still wish to continue?',22522),
(39592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The knowledge you\'ve gained is a powerful tool to use against your foes. $B$BDo not forget this.',22522),
(39593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wonderful! $B$BIt is good to be whole again!',22522),
(39594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The trial is done, and you emerge victorious! $B$BIt is a great feat you have done here, but you are not through yet. Many great challenges await you on your path to the Aegis.',22522),
(39595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I appreciate your gifts, outsider. You show great respect to the trials. $B$BYou do well to honor our ways.',22522),
(39597,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The trial is done and you yet live. This land is full of wonders, yes?$B$BBut it looks like the God-King intends to give you trials on top of trials. Still you must hurry, for even now, the next awaits!',22522),
(39601,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне не терпится увидеть твой впечатляющий флот, состоящий из линкоров, командир.',20574),
(39604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне не терпится увидеть твой впечатляющий флот, состоящий из линкоров, командир.',20779),
(39605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The trail ended at Linzy\'s ley flame burner, lying in pieces upon the ground.$B$BThere are too many guards around for this to have gone unnoticed. Perhaps they have some information about Lyndras.',0),
(39614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. You saved enough fish that they can breed a new population.',22522),
(39645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I\'d say these burettes look well-calibrated.$B$BI knew those three would be meticulous. Never underestimate the value of someone who obsesses over tiny details, $n!',0),
(39648,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for all the help! Their families will be so happy to see them.',0),
(39649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well that was fast! Grumpus is gonna have a hard time continuing his work without his minions.$B$BTake these. I had them specially crafted for ya.$B$BYou never know what you\'ll run into out here in Draenor!',0),
(39651,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks, $n. I couldn\'t have done it without you.$B$BTake these as a token of my appreciation.$B$BHappy holidays!',0),
(39652,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are truly a hero to my brood.  $B$BYou have gained a powerful ally today, outsider. The God-King has reason to fear you.',22522),
(39654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now all here know who you are. It is time for armaments befitting my champion.',21021),
(39655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, командир!',20574),
(39656,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it back without any scratches. It looks like the backfire issue from the last prototype worked itself out.$b$bA few more tweaks and I\'d say this hand cannon is ready for mass production. Thanks for the help, $n.',22522),
(39657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Candy buckets like this are located in inns throughout the realms. Go ahead... take some!',0),
(39658,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This present looks like it has been shaken a few times. The tag on it reads:$B$BTo a very special $R $C.',0),
(39659,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A small tag on this present reads:$B$BHappy holidays, $n!',0),
(39661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you ready? We are about to enter a cave... and the drogbar are at home in such dark places.',22522),
(39663,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чувствуешь ее мощь? Чтобы одолеть королеву, нам придется атаковать ее всеми силами.\n\nИ все же... Думаю, я лучше расчищу нам путь к отступлению.',20994),
(39665,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Оборудование играет большую роль!',20574),
(39666,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, equipment plays a big role. Let\'s see how I can help you.',20574),
(39667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You looking for that crazed elf? Sorry to say he\'s been locked up.$B$BWe found him hunched in the corner making all sorts of noise and when we approached him, he attacked one of our guards.$B$BWe also found him with an item that was reported stolen. We had no choice but to lock him up in Violet Hold.',0),
(39668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow. Those were some nasty presents. You might want to, uh... wash up. Who knows what was inside some of those packages.',0),
(39670,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hrm, these rabbits are a bit bigger than I thought, but we should still be able to stuff a few of them into the hand cannon.',22522),
(39674,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, командир!',20779),
(39675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, equipment plays a big role. Let\'s see how I can help you.',20779),
(39676,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Оборудование играет большую роль!',20779),
(39680,1,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Я даже не могу выразить словами, как я тебе благодарен.$b$bА теперь, как и обещал, я передам тебе свои знания.',23420),
(39681,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты в порядке? Мой товар вроде не пострадал. Как хорошо, что это была не портняжная мастерская.$b$bКажется, взрыв произошел, когда я добавил плавень.$b$bА без плавня никакой сварки. Какая жалость. Без сварки изготовить можно только пояса и наручи.',23420),
(39682,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кайн и Алтруис сказали, что ты скоро прибудешь. Как раз вовремя, $n.',20994),
(39683,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes ... you just look ... how much strength and knowledge is in it. $B$BTake it, $n.',20994),
(39684,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я не сомневалась – ты поймешь, что нужно сделать.',20994),
(39685,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсправился:справилась;, кто бы сомневался. Нельзя было допустить, чтобы это существо вырвалось на волю.',20994),
(39686,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это уже не шутки. Они упорствут в своих убеждениях, и их противоречия неразрешимы.$B$BБоюсь, все это окончится как минимум одной смертью.',20994),
(39687,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord Illidan has shown us the way, but everyone must go his own way.',20994),
(39688,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нам удалось выбраться из Казематов, но наше дело еще не окончено.$B$BНашествие Легиона на наш мир только начинается.$B$BЕсли мы хотим спасти Азерот, придется сотрудничать с этим... верховным магом Кадгаром.',21287),
(39689,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gготов:готова; отправиться в Даларан?$B$BДай мне знать, и я перенесу тебя туда.',21287),
(39690,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gготов:готова; отправиться в Даларан?$B$BДай мне знать, и я перенесу тебя туда.',20994),
(39691,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dark times have fallen upon Stormwind, $n.$B$BWith King Varian Wrynn slain on the Broken Shore, uncertainty and tension grip the Alliance leaders.$B$BThe timing of this tragedy is no accident. The Burning Legion seeks to sow disorder amongst its enemies, weakening its prey from within.$B$BWe must act.',0),
(39694,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нам удалось выбраться из Казематов, но наше дело еще не окончено.$B$BНашествие Легиона на наш мир только начинается.$B$BЕсли мы хотим спасти Азерот, придется сотрудничать с этим... верховным магом Кадгаром.',20994),
(39696,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highlord, so long as the Order of the Silver Hand stands, we will do everything in our power to destroy the Legion\'s foothold on Azeroth.$B$BTo succeed, we will need to enlist the best of our order.$B$BLet me be the first to serve, $n. I will act as your eyes and blade where you are not; I will carry out your will until my dying breath.',22522),
(39697,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes yes, this is it. This map is invaluable. By triangulating these oceanic junction points we can graph out Draenor\'s key ley lines. Hmmm... there\'s where I built my tower, of course. Energy also seems to converge near Karabor. And here, by the throne of elements.$B$BOh very good, we\'ll be able to put this to use very soon.',0),
(39698,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты понимаешь, насколько важна наша миссия? Если мы перестанем сражаться за будущее, у нас его и не будет.',21108),
(39699,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(39702,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you again for your salvation. I see you want to talk about the blacksmith business.',23420),
(39716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I bet it felt great to smash those things! Smash, squish, squash!',0),
(39718,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Perfect. Up for a little trip down to Azsuna?',22522),
(39719,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Finally, he\'s returned to the briny deep. I\'m sure we\'ll see him again, but for now let\'s celebrate!',0),
(39720,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thinking what goes into normal fertilizer, I don\'t even want to know what was in THAT stuff.',0),
(39721,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re lucky you were around to take care of those bony brutes!',0),
(39722,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I will continue beseeching the Light to bolster the power of your weapon.$B$BFor now, its newfound strength should be more than enough.',22522),
(39726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти экземпляры тоже подойдут. Сейчас объясню, как я их делал...',23420),
(39729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это... Это потрясающе! О таких технологиях я даже не догадывался! Отлично сработано, $n!',23420),
(39731,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Archmage Khadgar smiles.>$B$BI rarely get to say this, but I have good news for you, $n.',22522),
(39733,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings champion. I am Warbrave Oro of the Highmountain tauren. I come on the winds of war to find you.',22522),
(39735,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s an honor, $n.',22522),
(39741,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Up until now, the Illidari have been a fairly exclusive club. Demon hunters only. But, as you have so clearly demonstrated, my dear, if we are to move forward trusting one-another, then bringing Akama in is an important step.$B$BIt gives one hope.$B$BAnd, of course, making Kor\'vas one of your champions is the obvious choice. No one fights as well as she does.$B$BWhat\'s that?',0),
(39746,1,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n! Ты $gспас:спасла; меня! Ты $gспас:спасла; нас всех.$b$bСилы были неравны. Стихии безмолвствовали. Молот Рока превратился в мертвый груз. Словно я более не достоин держать его в руках. Он молчит с того самого дня, когда я убил им Гарроша.$b$bЯ не могу ставить под угрозу спасение этого мира из-за собственных сомнений. Я найду способ восстановить к себе доверие. Ты же, $n, $gдолжен:должна; вести Служителей Земли ',21287),
(39756,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good luck out there! We\'re all in this together.',22522),
(39757,1,603,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Оно просто поражает воображение! Видишь, как проклятые души танцуют на клинке? О, какие же муки они должны испытывать, тщетно ожидая освобождения!$b$bДа... в их очертаниях я теперь вижу, каким должен стать твой клинок.',21287),
(39761,1,603,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'О да... это как раз то, что надо!$b$bВозвращайся, когда устроишь своему клинку очередное незабываемое пиршество душ, и тогда мы сделаем из него самое могучее оружие за всю историю!',21287),
(39763,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Matthew lets out a gleeful howl>$B$BImpressive.',0),
(39764,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is this all you could find?$b$bWhile I\'m grateful to have these gems in my possession once again, it seems that there are still a few missing. I fear they\'ve been broken, which means the demons within have escaped.',22522),
(39765,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will work perfectly, I believe.',22522),
(39768,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Some of them seem to be digging less enthusiastically, at the very least.',22522),
(39769,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What you want, stinky?',22522),
(39771,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты и правда $gизбранный:избранная;, $n. Я с радостью отдам жизнь за тебя.$b$bКуда ты ни поведешь Служителей Земли, я последую за тобой!',21287),
(39772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank the spirits! These kobolds do not honor their ancestors in the way we do. I can rest peacefully now.',22522),
(39773,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Uriah would not want me to waste time with tears. My mourning can wait until the escaped demons are trapped once again.',22522),
(39774,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for you help, $n. I will honor Uriah\'s memory by completing our journey to Azsuna and delivering the demon prisoners to Allari as planned.',22522),
(39775,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This looks like one of the grapple launchers the local vrykul use to scale the steep ridges in Stormheim.$B$BThis could come in handy.',22522),
(39776,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That should slow these invaders down.',22522),
(39777,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. Thank you, Champion.$b$bWe have managed to get the children and the wounded to safety thanks to your efforts.',22522),
(39780,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dargrul is just postponing the inevitable.',22522),
(39781,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The battle was hard, but we did what we had to do. $p, on behalf of the tribes of River Griva, Heavenly Horn and Dark Stone, I thank you for all that you have done$b$bHowever, when one battle ends, a new one begins immediately. Know that when the hour of your battle with the Blazing Legion comes, the tribes of Krutigorye will be with you.',21414),
(39786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, well. I half expected to find your statue on the riverbank. You\'re gonna get a nice payout once those tauren get back...$B$BYou haven\'t seen them around, have you?',21287),
(39787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you took him out, eh? Those tauren are gonna be so jealous when they get back!  \n\nNaturally, you\'ll have to wait till the tauren get back and pay their wager before I can give you your cut. But in the mean time, I\'ve got another target for you.',21287),
(39788,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Runewood will know peace once more with these Bonespeakers removed from the land. $B$BIt is a good beginning.',22522),
(39789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s hope that the death of these poor beasts is not in vain, and we will find a cure for this disease.',21287),
(39790,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Sniff sniff> I smell something...fel.',0),
(39791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you carry a branch of the Runewood. Then it was you who laid the spirits to rest? $B$BThough I do not know your purpose, outsider, I appreciate what you have done for our people.',22522),
(39792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh hey, it\'s... you again! Of course you didn\'t have any trouble with those musken. You\'re a big, tough hero after all!$B$BThe tauren still aren\'t back, though. I\'m a bit worried that they may have gone off and hunted a bit more that they can chew.$B$BOh, I\'ll take those ribs, though. What do you want for em?',21287),
(39793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re back? $B$BI mean... hey, you\'re back!$B$BWell, the tauren haven\'t come back yet, but no worries, I\'ll take that stuff off your hands! Let me show you some of my prime trade goods.',21287),
(39796,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Bound... twisted... $B$BThe Bonespeakers...',22522),
(39799,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасный выбор, $ct.',21287),
(39800,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems you were spared the brunt of the explosion. If only Greymane were so lucky...$B$BOn your feet! We had better get a move on before the Forsaken are on top of us!',22522),
(39801,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21963),
(39803,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, the hero of the hour! We must waste no time! $B$BOur business at hand is most important if you wish to succeed in your trials!',22522),
(39804,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A fine cut, I must say. $B$BYes, you will do well against the Bonespeakers, I think.',22522),
(39816,1,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы с тобой через многое прошли, $n. И вот ты стоишь передо мной как $gВладыка смерти:Владычица смерти; и $gпредводитель:предводительница; нашего ордена. И я так горжусь тобой!$b$bГрядущая битва с Пылающим Легионом обещает быть тяжелой и опасной. И мы не должны вступать в нее в одиночку.$b$bЯ пойду туда, куда прикажешь, убью тех, кого ты велишь.',23420),
(39817,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see. Well that\'s at least a little helpful.$B$BWith that information in mind, I believe we can move forward with our investigation into this resource.',0),
(39818,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Stupid teachers of class skills talk to me as if my hands never held my axes! But they have nothing to teach me. The dark power of non-life flows through my veins. It craves blood and battle! Let\'s not waste time in this dusty necropolis! Send me to the front line! I want to spill the blood of my enemies!',23420),
(39830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You actually found something?!$B$B<Mama Diggs thumbs through the codex, a stern look on her face as she reads each page.>$B$BAye, here it is. All the answers are within these pages...',0),
(39832,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lord of Death, I\'ve prepared a brief report on what we\'ve learned about this new land. I think you\'ll find it quite interesting.',21287),
(39837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Free at last! $B$BThe kvaldir caught me while I was tryin\' to put together a plan to sneak past that foul dog, Guarm, and have had me locked up ever since! $B$BI thought surely my fate was sealed.',22522),
(39838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21491),
(39839,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21491),
(39840,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I like the way you think, $R. I\'ve long tried to convince the council that winning this war against the Legion means occasionally stooping to their level.$B$BThe Kirin Tor could use more mavericks like you.',0),
(39841,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The archmage sent you? Hmph.$B$BWas he afraid to come down and visit me personally? Or is he worried that the sewer water might touch the hem of his robe?',0),
(39842,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hope these weren\'t too much trouble to obtain.',0),
(39843,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s not make a big deal out of this. You wanted a forge... I\'m making one for you. The ends will justify the means.',0),
(39845,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at the horns on that thing. And glowing eyes?$B$BThose demon hunters sure do have a flair for the dramatic, don\'t they?',0),
(39847,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, look at that, you know how to spell your name correctly.$B$BGood job, now we can begin!',0),
(39848,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Helya\'s voice fills the air as you stand>$B$BNobody leaves Helheim without my approval! Entertain me, and I may let you pass.',22522),
(39849,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This appears to be what we need. $B$BNow, we can prepare for the battle ahead.',22522),
(39850,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I can feel your power returned. $B$BHelya will regret the day she challenged one such as you.',22522),
(39851,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to have my shieldmaidens returned to my side. $B$BYou have gained allies today, but know you have also gained my gratitude.',22522),
(39853,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The day is won. Now, we must collect our reward. $B$BLet us hope that Helya keeps her side of the bargain.',22522),
(39855,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the dead return from Helheim and back? An impressive feat. $B$BYour worth has been judged and the trial passed. $B$BNow, to your destiny. To the Halls of Valor!',22522),
(39857,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You do not look good. $B$BI take it Helya did not prove lenient?',22522),
(39859,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve been eager to get my hands on this manuscript! I was startin\' to think the gnome had writer\'s block.',22522),
(39860,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for saving me. I hope now we can trust each other. We must if we are to defeat these Feltotem.',22522),
(39861,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elune-Adore, $n.',22522),
(39862,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'\"Siegebrul.\" Bah!$b$bBefore this war we had no need for such titles.$b$BOlgrul was always just a brute who takes pleasure in the pain of others.',22522),
(39863,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have the bracers? Very good, now stand back...',0),
(39864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(39867,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So I was right! The lion with the amber eyes did exist.$b$bHere\'s the gold as promised. This is worth every copper. You can\'t put a price on proving that you\'re right!$b$bI\'ll keep this eye, but I wouldn\'t want the rest of our prize to go to waste. Let\'s eat!',22522),
(39873,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The cage is empty. Navarrogg is gone.>',22522),
(39874,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень здорово, что ты $gпришел:пришла;, $n. Сейчас такое время, что еще один зачаровыватель в лавке точно не помешает.',22566),
(39875,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You give Ildina parchments. >$b$bYes, now the order is complete. Thank you, $n!',22566),
(39876,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Jace takes your drawer and looks inside. >$b$bParchments! Well, finally.',22566),
(39877,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь мы сможем сдерживать этих демонов намного эффективнее. Мы в долгу перед тобой, $n.',22566),
(39878,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О твоем приходе мне нашептали духи, $gиноземец:чужестранка;. Посмотрим, $gтот ли ты герой, в коем:та ли ты героиня, в коей; так отчаянно нуждается наша земля.$b$b<Таурен прокашливается.>$b$bИзвини. Я понимаю, что мои слова звучат высокопарно. Просто... все это действительно имеет для меня немалое значение.',22566),
(39879,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22747),
(39880,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22747),
(39881,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22747),
(39882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found it? I trust Glaidalis fell in the process?$B$BWhile I feel relieved such a powerful foe has been defeated, I can\'t help but feel sad for what could have been...$B$BRegardless, you\'ve proven yourself an ally. As a reward, I will teach you one of my enchantments.',0),
(39883,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22747),
(39884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Nalamya takes the dust from you.>$B$BWell done, $R.',0),
(39891,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, a fellow enchanter. Come to earn the marks of my subordinates, have you?$B$BIf that\'s the case, then you may speak with my sentinel and druid. Earn their trust and they\'ll grant you their marks.$B$BI, however, have a different task for you...',0),
(39903,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, |3-6($r), ты $gнашел:нашла; мой дом... и то, что осталось от меня.$b$bА во мне уже нет сил поддерживать даже самые слабые из моих чар...',22996),
(39904,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвернул:вернула; мне мое самое ценное сокровище. За это я поделюсь с тобой частью своих знаний.$b$bЕсли захочешь узнать больше, тебе нужно будет только принести мне несколько компонентов.',22996),
(39905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re back. Excellent work down in Azsuna. Jace gave you high praises for your help with his troops and against the Legion.$B$BBefore you go, I wanted to share with you the other new formulas we have for ring enchantments. It would do our side good in this war if you were to share these with your fellow adventurers.',0),
(39906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alynblaze takes the vellums from you and applies them to his gear.>$B$BYes! I feel like I can take on the entire Legion now!$B$BWell, that may be a bit of an exaggeration, but I certainly feel up for some battle.',0),
(39907,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You tell Nalthanis of your time with the cursed elves and the enchantments you learned.>$B$BThat\'s fascinating! You managed, through enchantments, to create a bond with those elves and now they may come to your aid?$B$BThose are some truly powerful enchantments you were gifted, $n. Don\'t let them go to waste.',0),
(39910,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Merrus takes the idols from you and clutches them closely to his chest.>$B$BYou\'ve no idea how long it\'s been since I\'ve held these. Thank you, $n.$B$BYou have earned my respect and as promised, you shall have my marks.',0),
(39914,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fought bravely, $n. I see that you truly are worthy of my marks and I hereby grant them to you.$B$BPerhaps one day we shall stand again side by side in battle.',0),
(39916,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After watching these demons helplessly for so long, you have given me a chance to strike back at them!$B$BNow the real work begins.',0),
(39918,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have returned my love to me and for that I am forever grateful.$B$BAs she is with me now, she shall be at your beck and call should you need her. I grant to you her marks.',0),
(39920,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sense the power of enchantments about you, $n. Yes, I think I will enjoy working with you!',0),
(39921,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh yes, that seems to be everything.$B$B<Kharmeera takes the components from you and assembles the rod.>$B$BNow, let\'s see what I can share with you.',0),
(39923,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m truly amazed at what you\'re able to accomplish for such a young creature.$B$BShall we get to work then on learning from these cores?',0),
(39931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, these pigments look like they will do the trick. Well done, student.$B$BIn fact... I\'ve been researching a new glyph that these pigments would work splendidly with. Why don\'t you give it a shot?',0),
(39932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Holy mackerel! This stuff really puts the \"ink\" in \"stink\", doesn\'t it?',0),
(39933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And there we have it. Just as good as those witless Darkmoon cretins.$B$BWhile we owe this success almost exclusively to my genius, I feel you ought to be rewarded for doing the legwork. Here\'s the recipe for my newest masterpiece.',0),
(39934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you here to reinforce us, $C? We could always use your strength.',0),
(39935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Some may condemn our methods. We simply do what we must to destroy the Burning Legion.',0),
(39936,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Allari sent you? I am about to start a ritual. I could use you, stranger.$B$BYou seem more ally than enemy. In this time, allies are more important than ever.',0),
(39937,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you can believe it, that was the easy part. The next part will be a bit more challenging$B$B...at least, for me it will.',0),
(39938,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done. I fear that if I had waited any longer to improve my wards, the demon in me may have taken over.$B$BThank you again, $n.',0),
(39939,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Allari has sent you to learn from me? In that case, I have much to tell.',0),
(39940,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As I\'m sure you sensed, these runes hold quite a bit of energy.$B$BGreater knowledge of the Legion is your best weapon against it.',0),
(39941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I commend you, scribe. You would make an excellent demon hunter.$B$BTake this ink as payment for your efforts. I have no need of it.',0),
(39942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A crystal... inside the flower? That gives me an idea.$B$BI dabbled in jewelcrafting in my younger years. Take a look at this technique...',0),
(39943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Professor Pallin looks over the demon hunter glyphs you\'ve designed.>$B$BHuh! Apparently I don\'t have to hold your hand as much as I thought.$B$BLook at this glyph you\'ve made right here. If you flip this symbol around, and adjust the stroke width here...',0),
(39944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Seriously? Pallin wants me to do what now?!$B$BThat old bag of wind thinks he\'s so great, but he\'s always making me do all his work. It\'s a surprise I\'m not running that shop.$B$BBut fine, I\'ll help you. As long as you help me too.',0),
(39945,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I believe these have enough information for us to finish the codex. Excellent work, $n.$B$BIf you don\'t mind me saying, it\'s nice to finally not be the one running errands.',0),
(39946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wow. It\'s much... bigger than I had expected.$B$BThen again, vrykul are very large and I\'m... well, I am not.$B$BStill though, I believe I can work with this.',0),
(39947,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне очень повезло, что ты $gоказался:оказалась; рядом.$b$bЭти духи меня бы просто в клочья разорвали!',23420),
(39948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These all seem to be in order.$B$BIf you have a moment, scribe, I have a proposition for you that you may be interested in...',0),
(39949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You, $n, are a godsend. I thought I\'d never be rid of that nuisance.$B$BAs promised, here is the bounty for the contract.',0),
(39950,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I... I know this work. My old apprentice, what\'s-his-name, was trying to prove he could create something as great as I could.$B$BImpressively, he seemed to have succeeded in this one case.$B$BWe should learn from what he created and make our own, less putrid version.',0),
(39951,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How did you get an extract so pure? Show me exactly what you did, step by step.$B$BFascinating. Do you mind if I write this down, so I can show my other students?',0),
(39952,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve ventured into undiscovered territory, $n. There isn\'t anyone out there in ANY academic circles I\'m aware of that is milling felwort this effectively.$B$BWell done, student. Or, should I say... well done, junior deputy assistant scribe?$B$BNah... I still prefer \"student\".',0),
(39953,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My stars... these are very nice indeed! In fact, this gives me an idea...',0),
(39954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s it! Hmm... let\'s see...$B$B<Pallin looks quickly through the pages of the old book.>$B$BNot much in here that will help you with our Broken Isles herbs.$B$BWait, hold that thought. Look at this here...',0),
(39955,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello! Ye must be one of me many fans here for an autograph.$B$BOh, yer here about the romance novels, are ye? I see ye\'ve discovered my little secret.$B$BYe know, I\'ve grown tired of writing those. I\'ve moved on, ye see. Wrote me last one yesterday.$B$BBut perhaps ye\'d like to carry on the tradition...?',0),
(39956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... yes, ye seem to have gotten the hang of it. I particularly like that line: \"Oh, Lord Gravesbane!\" That would make a nice catchphrase...$B$BHere, take this list o\' story prompts. I certainly don\'t need them anymore.',0),
(39957,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is more than enough. Excellent work!$B$B<Professor Pallin produces a small quill, dips it in the ink and begins scribbling on a small card.>$B$BJust as I thought, easy enough to make.$B$BAs is usually the case with tarot cards, you\'ll have to make a complete set in order for them to yield their full potential.',0),
(39958,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These materials have my mind racing. I can\'t wait to see what we can make with them!$B$BI\'m just going to keep some to study. You can have the rest back.',0),
(39959,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Come for an autograph, have you? Very well, you may present your chest to me.$B$BOh, you\'re here about the romance novels? I see you\'ve discovered my little secret.$B$BYou know, I\'ve grown tired of writing those. I\'ve moved on, you see. Wrote the last one yesterday.$B$BBut perhaps you\'d like to carry on the tradition...?',0),
(39960,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... yes, you seem to have gotten the hang of it. I particularly like that line: \"Oh, Lord Gravesbane!\" That would make a nice catchphrase...$B$BHere, take this list of story prompts. I certainly don\'t need them anymore.',0),
(39961,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Get your hands off of... err, I mean... that\'s not my...$B$BWhere did you...$B$B<The professor makes a sputtering sound.>$B$BSomeone must be playing a trick on me!',0),
(39983,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'[In broken Common] Feathered one said you come. Unng Ak not hope for you come. Tauren have thanks.',22522),
(39984,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чуешь этот запах, $n? Здесь пахнет смертью!',21108),
(39985,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $p.',21531),
(39986,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A magical message in a bottle, slipped right beneath the Legion\'s nose... Clever.',21531),
(39987,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An outlander...$B$BYou received my message?',21531),
(39988,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You bring with you Eche\'ro, and... what is this? The blessing of Cenarius?!',22522),
(39990,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ritual is complete. Reinforcements will be able to push through the portal and assist against the demonic hoard.',22522),
(39992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You see now, that Huln was mighty? He united the tribes and defeated terribly powerful foes.',22522),
(40000,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s how a real hunter does it.',22522),
(40001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is this... I see? $B$BA friendly face... in a sea of foes?',22522),
(40002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You still manage to surprise me, outsider. Your trials are complete, and yet you still have challenges to face. $B$BThe God-King\'s forces are many, but in your weapon you possess the powers of Stormheim herself! Approach the gates, and these powers will lay low the enemies of this land!$B$BNow, let us take the fight to the God-King, and cleanse the Gates of Valor of his fel taint!',22522),
(40003,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I do not understand, the portals are closed and yet Skovald\'s demonic forces still assault the gates! $B$BWe must find where they are coming from!',22522),
(40004,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With their fel leaders slain, the God-King\'s forces will scatter. $B$BStill, we are not finished here. So long as the demons continue to assault the gates, Stormheim will not be safe.',22522),
(40005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s unfortunate that the God-King escaped, but his defeat has stemmed the flow of the Legion into Stormheim.$B$BNow, the Halls of Valor await you.',22522),
(40008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You fight well.$B$BPerhaps it is time for a proper introduction.',21531),
(40009,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Thalyssra takes the crystals with a trembling hand.>',21531),
(40010,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Who the hell are you?',21737),
(40011,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Когда моя работа здесь завершится, ты можешь проводить меня к Талисре.',21531),
(40012,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Somebody\'s been here just recently. The scroll is dotted with strange symbols emitting soft light; it\'s as if it\'s asking for your hand.',21531),
(40013,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Судя по внешнему виду, можно подумать, что эта трава довольно нежная, но... она очень крепкая.$b$bО, только посмотрите на это!',22810),
(40014,273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Your mentor, obviously impressed, is looking at a stamen and pistil. >$b$bBy creating aytril, Mother Earth has clearly split. $b$bKeep doing these parts of the flower, $n.',22124),
(40015,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рядом с цветущим айтрилом ты $gнашел:нашла; инструменты иссохших?$b$bХм... уже третий случай за сегодня.',22996),
(40016,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Your tutor studies the stems, grows the bite marks. >$b$bYou\'ve chewed it, you\'ve chewed it! I\'m sorry to be rude, but this is awesome!$b$bBut take a closer look. See, mostly they were extracting energy from the central stem vein...',22996),
(40017,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kuhuine listens to your story about the aethril.>$B$BWhat you\'re saying rings true, $n. I have heard tales of herbalists that could coax flowers into quickly reproducing, but I was never able to master the technique myself.$B$BWell done, herbalist. I feel great pride.',0),
(40018,603,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эта трава мне знакома. Я видела ее однажды – в Пандарии, в Долине Четырех Ветров.$b$bЭто грезолист.',21916),
(40019,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я так и предполагала. Зараженная трава погибает... но, возможно, мы извлечем из этого пользу.$b$bСмотри, $gтравник:травница;. В умирающем грезолисте накопился травяной экстракт. Из зараженных растений грезолиста, в отличие от здоровых, можно извлечь огромное количество этого вещества.',22101),
(40020,18,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Another dead plant... <Droid is trying to hide his tears, but in vain. >Whoa, Koshmar! DAMN YOU!',22996),
(40021,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я чувствую, как порча отступает. Отлично.$b$bОтдыхать нам долго не придется, но смотри... грезолист даже сейчас снова поделился с нами своими сокровищами.',22996),
(40022,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Osme looks at the herb.>$B$B<He is silent for a moment.>$B$BNOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!!!',0),
(40023,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for your bravery, $n.$B$BThe next time you approach a sprig of dreamleaf, you may just find that the land thanks you, too.',0),
(40024,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21953),
(40025,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s right, $n. This plant was chewed up by someone.',22996),
(40026,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Лисы.$b$bХм...$b$bЭто... логично. Наверное, мне следовало об этом догадаться.$b$bНу что же, раз моя недальновидность вполне очевидна, давай посмотрим на эти кусочки. Что же они нам поведают...',22996),
(40028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kuhuine sniffs the small gland.>$B$BThat\'s certainly a scent gland, alright. It seems to be mostly inert from an alchemical point of view... but I\'d guess that this is what is attracting those foxes.$B$BExpress this gland when you can, and you may find yourself attracting a friend or two.',0),
(40029,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s a find, $n. It must be the famous herb of the vraiculars - Fjarnskaggle. I\'ve only read about it in books! I\'ll tell you everything I know about it...',22045),
(40030,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gнашел:нашла; это рядом с зарослями фьярнскаггла?',22996),
(40031,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эта книга – \"Древнее учение о травничестве\" – выглядит многообещающе, но в ней не хватает страниц. Жаль.$b$bИ все же в других книгах тоже много сведений.$b$b<Кухюне раскрывает книгу наугад, перелистывает несколько страниц и...>$b$bСмотри, какой метод!',22996),
(40032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What good fortune! This page matches perfectly with the book you retrieved for me. We just need to piece them together, and...',0),
(40034,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Растение превратилось в пыль у тебя в руках?$b$bПотрясающе...',22045),
(40035,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Успехи есть? Никаких?$b$bНо твои навыки все равно повышаются. Не сдавайся, $gтравник:травница;.',22996),
(40036,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You say she was lying next to a starry rose? You adventurers always find such interesting things...',22996),
(40037,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Лезвие зачаровано – ну разумеется. Мы наверняка сможем воспроизвести эти чары здесь, в Даларане.$b$bЖаль, что травник оказался несговорчивым. Возможно, мы могли узнать у него что-нибудь еще. По крайней мере, он по-прежнему где-то здесь...',22996),
(40038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My word. This person really hates you.$B$BSay - do you think this is written by that nightborne herbalist you... encountered?',0),
(40039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic work, $n! With this knowledge, we may never have to suffer a handful of starlight rosedust again!',0),
(40040,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ой! Эта трава мне совсем не нравится. Она меня завораживает, и это совсем нехорошо.$b$b<Кухюне внимательно всматривается в растение.>$b$bСмотри, какие семена, $n. Они нам пригодятся. В следующий раз собирай их аккуратнее.',22996),
(40041,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сведения по большей части понятны только специалистом, однако часть можно уже сейчас применить на практике.$b$bВот, смотри...',22996),
(40042,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kuhne gently takes the seed from your hands and listens to your story about Kenaria\'s purification >$b$bAmazing! If that\'s the case, we can collect St. John\'s Wort in the same way. Now listen...',23171),
(40043,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Curse Helya, she\'s corrupted the blades! Still, her champion defeated, her helarjar skulking back to Helheim, and my weapons in the hands of my chosen champion! She even made them more powerful than before. Wield them well, $n, smite the enemies of this world!',21108),
(40044,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If Helia wants these souls, let her get out of her Helheim and come for them herself.',21108),
(40045,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Murky\'s gained quite the following, hasn\'t he? Perhaps they can help him out.',22522),
(40046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ха! Мне казалось, что Брандт не так-то легко расстанется со своим бесценным Хратниром.',21108),
(40047,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The pufferfish will be a perfect resource for Murky! I\'ll just whip up a spell to make them grow more quickly.\n\nAll he\'ll have to do is throw, then boom!',22522),
(40048,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that\'s her. $B$b<Jace twists the rune in his hands, carefully examining the ornate ligature on its surface.>$b$bGreat job, $n. I will certainly inform Naltanis about your contribution to our common cause.',22566),
(40049,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Murky seems to have gotten a very strong slime ability due to this slimeweed. Fantastic!',22522),
(40051,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это и правда удивительно. Мне нравится твой выбор, $n.\n\nА теперь передай эти знания остальным.',20994),
(40052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, Nicholo was able to complete the codex? And the tablets are deciphered!$B$BHmm... that\'s interesting. These tablets have some interesting spells that we could use to our benefit... although I find working with stone to be a bit archaic. I\'ll just put these down on parchment and let you test for any side effects.',0),
(40056,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, good to see you again. We could certainly use your strength.',0),
(40057,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I wish I had more like you, $n. You fight with a great passion.$B$BAnd I see you also learned a bit more about how to augment our abilities. I\'m sure your master in Dalaran will be pleased.',0),
(40058,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve come to help me with my ritual? I thank you, $n.$B$BIn this time, allies are more important than ever.',0),
(40059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you can believe it, that was the easy part.$B$BThe next part will be a bit more challenging, at least for me it will.',0),
(40060,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done. If I hesitated and did not strengthen my amulets, the demon in me could prevail. Once again, thank you, $n.',23420),
(40061,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you again, $n. Kayn has sent you to see what I have learned?$B$BIn that case, I have much to tell.',0),
(40062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pods like this contain tremendous amounts of energy. Milling one incorrectly can be catastrophic to the front of one\'s robes.$B$BLearn to mill them correctly, though, and you can dramatically increase your milling speed. Watch and learn, student!',0),
(40063,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I commend you, scribe. You are an excellent hunter.$B$BTake this ink as payment for your efforts. I have no need of it.',0),
(40064,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This came from a foxflower? Fascinating.$B$BYou know, we can use these woody cores to our advantage. If you mill a woody flower along with several softer flowers, you can speed up your process dramatically! Watch this...',0),
(40065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Professor dips his finger into the fluid and tastes it.>$B$BOh! I know what this is. The herbalists were talking about this. It\'s called fjarnsk.$B$BYou know, stranglekelp often contains pockets of fluid not unlike this. Let\'s see if we can carry an old milling technique forward...',0),
(40069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21414),
(40070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21414),
(40071,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21414),
(40072,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Король-бог побежден, и ты имеешь полное право обладать Эгидой Агграмара.',22566),
(40077,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это заставит их считаться с нами.\n\nА теперь нужно призвать остальные наши войска.',20994),
(40078,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is clear that your cooking prowess is only matched by your might in combat. $B$BNow, on full bellies, we ride to Valhallas!',22522),
(40102,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This cave will make a great base for the young tadpoles!',22522),
(40112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Eche\'ro looks up briefly, then lowers its head before you. This creature is thankful for your aid.>',22522),
(40120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'По крайней мере, мне отрадно сознавать, что наши павшие воины достойно отправились в последний путь.$B$BТеперь они уже пируют и празднуют свои победы в чертогах Валхаллы.',21491),
(40122,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This corruption - I\'ve never seen it before.$b$bAnd yet, it seems somehow familiar...',22522),
(40123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must find a way to reclaim Suramar City.',21531),
(40125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The chamber falls silent as the ancient banshee fades away.>',21531),
(40130,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The demon that I\'ve been all these years is gone. I think now I\'m ready to return.',23222),
(40131,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22747),
(40132,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хм... Что ж, уже лучше.$b$bИ помни мой совет, когда в очередной раз возьмешь в руки свой нож для снятия шкур.',24015),
(40133,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gнашел:нашла; мои запасные штаны!',24015),
(40134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Y\'got these fer me, laddie? I... I don\'t know what ta say!$B$BHere, take this. It\'s the least I can do.$B$B<Hemet buries his nose deep into the bear hide.>',0),
(40135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are marvelous, $n. Well done.$B$BI can show ye how t\'get better results from yer skinnin\'. Take a look at this wolf hide, here...',0),
(40136,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you return. What can I do for you today?',0),
(40137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ey dere. You be a skinna\'?',0),
(40138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya gone and outdid y\'self. Look at dese hides, bruddah!',0),
(40139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I seen wolf hides before, but dis be sometin\' else.',0),
(40140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve returned, and with Ske\'rit\'s book, I see.$B$BLet\'s look through this together, $n...',0),
(40141,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',22578),
(40142,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень хорошо, $n. Более глубокое понимание природы штормовой чешуи поможет тебе эффективнее снимать шкуры с этих чешуйчатых созданий и не убивать зря больше животных, чем требуется для работы.',24015),
(40143,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Condahl, frowning eyebrows, looking through the manual. >$b$bI only know two people who could write something like that, $n. If you\'re interested in chatting with them, I\'ll tell you where to find them.',24015),
(40144,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What? No, that scroll isn\'t mine. I don\'t do much writing these days.',0),
(40145,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Looks like you\'ve got the hang of it. Well done.',0),
(40146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes, that\'s my manuscript, but there\'s no time for that.$B$BLook what they\'ve done to my MOTHER!',0),
(40147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is it - look, you can still see some of me on it.',0),
(40148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. I don\'t know why, but your murder spree helps me feel a little bit better.',0),
(40149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Seymour places the scale lovingly upon his mother\'s chest. Even in death, she seems to disapprove.>$B$BThank you, $n. Here, you take her skinning knife. It\'s not much, but she won\'t be needing it anymore.',0),
(40151,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do we have here, $n?',0),
(40152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What do we got here?',0),
(40153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dese\'ll do, skinnah.$B$BDese\'ll do.',0),
(40154,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Very nice. You got a good knife hand, $n.',0),
(40155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve been working together with Ske\'rit? I should\'ve known. You two are cut from the same hide.$B$BLet\'s see what he has written here.',0),
(40156,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я мало что знаю о шкурах демонических созданий, $n. Предпочитаю с ними не связываться.$b$bНо я расскажу тебе все, что мне о них известно...',24015),
(40157,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну, чего надо-то?',24015),
(40158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ske\'rit takes the hide from you and looks it over.>$B$BYou definitely got da hang of it, bruddah.',0),
(40159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done it, $n. You\'ve earned the last of my knowledge.$B$BNow get out there, and get skinning!',0),
(40167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have seen only a taste of what Huln Highmountain accomplished during his lifetime. Let us delve deeper into the past...',22522),
(40168,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Как интересно!$b$b<Купри быстро хватает фиал и увлеченно изучает его.>$b$bВозможно, Зеф был прав, что настаивал на проведении расследований здесь. Этот фиал определенно принадлежит еще не изученному нами временному отрезку. Очень любопытно! Ты уже $gприносил:приносила; мне такой?',23877),
(40169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The satyr takes the journal you offer and sobs.>$B$BYou bore the book of someone lost long ago, stranger. Better that you leave me in my misery than linger in this fel-cursed place.',0),
(40170,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ya seem to have a gift when it comes to dealin\' with amateurs. Maybe ya can help my ghostwriter, Addie?$b$bI\'ve promised to teach her how to hunt, but I don\'t have time to show her the basics.',22522),
(40173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me see that. $B$B<Auzin ponders the prism for a while, before turning back to you.>$B$BHmm... Cupri could run tests on this for an eternity. This certainly qualifies as further evidence of meddling by a third party... or is it a sixth party...$B$BDo you mind if I keep it?',0),
(40176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m still amazed at how easily this leather takes shape. It\'s so flexible, yet keeps its strength.$B$BI think from here you can take my pattern and make it your own.',0),
(40177,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, so this means Namha has told us so much about you. It\'s very nice to meet you.$b$bHopefully, together we\'ll create a lot more cutouts besides that new helmet of yours.',23222),
(40178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Diane examines the chest piece thoroughly.>$B$BThis has some very interesting design. I think we can easily copy what they\'ve achieved with this piece.$B$BHere, try this pattern out.',0),
(40179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well now, this is a good variety of equipment you\'ve brought me. Let\'s see what we have here...$B$B<Diane studies the armor pieces very carefully for a while.>$B$BLook here, $n. See how they\'ve strengthened the leather by over-stitching the seams...',0),
(40180,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здорово! Рад знакомству! Это хорошо, что ты здесь! Нам нужно сделать одно важное дельце.$b$bГлавное – не слушай моего братца. Он уже несколько лет инструмента в руки не брал, а все считает себя мастером лучше меня.$b$bА это полная чушь, $gдружище:дорогуша;.',23222),
(40181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew ye had it in ye! Good work, lad.$B$B<Thanid looks the pieces over with a careful eye.>$B$BVery clever. The elves certainly know their trade.$B$BWe should be able to copy this method with little to no problem.',0),
(40182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, this is a beauty. Just look at that craftsmanship.$B$B<Thanid looks the piece over very carefully.>$B$BAnd looking at how it\'s pieced together, this should be a snap to replicate.$B$BHere, lad, give this pattern a try and see how that works for ye.',0),
(40183,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличная работа, $n. Вот, возьми себе копию выкройки.$b$bЗнаешь, лично я предпочитаю работать с мягкой кожей, но если тебе понадобится кольчужный шлем, тогда обратись к Раниду... хотя он наверняка заломит сумасшедшую цену.',23222),
(40184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can smell the leather on you, stranger.$B$BIt\'s in your skin, your bones, your spirit. It\'s also clear to these eyes that you wish to know about the leather of these lands.$B$BIf that\'s the case... then I must test your grain.',0),
(40185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. As promised, let me teach you one of our crafts.',0),
(40186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you can take down the drogbar, then perhaps you are worthy of my knowledge.$B$BI\'ll start you with a couple simple patterns to start.',0),
(40187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, $C? You seek to know the techniques of crafting elven mail?$B$BI see. Perhaps a bargain can be struck to benefit us both.',0),
(40188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are a man of your word, $n. I thank you for your service to us.$B$BAnd as we agreed, I shall pass on some of my wisdom to you.',0),
(40189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are good pieces. Look here...$B$B<Celea begins to explain the armor\'s construction to you.>$B$B...and with that, I trust you can create something of equal quality.',0),
(40190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Come for more lessons, $n?$B$BVery well. Let us begin.',0),
(40191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see hope in your eyes, $n. I take it our lessons of the past will aid you with your future?',0),
(40192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve gathered enough here to last me for many moons.$B$B<Hrul begins to work with the claws. It\'s clear that he\'s using very little of each, but still able to make an excellent armor piece.>$B$BI hope you were able to learn something from this, $n.',0),
(40193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Back so soon, $n?$B$BAhh... you wish to master your existing patterns. That\'s the characteristic of a true leatherworker.$B$BYes, I can help you.',0),
(40194,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They\'re a bit rusty, but at least they\'re intact. Let me explain how these were made...$B$B<Celea begins to describe the method in which the armor was constructed.>$B$BTedious, yet efficient.',0),
(40195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Wait, Celea sent you? I thought she had been lost ages ago.',0),
(40196,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Понятно.$b$bДумаю, это будет несложно...',23222),
(40197,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У меня все готово. Ты $gпринес:принесла; кожу?',23222),
(40198,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Nice work stitching these back together. Too bad you couldn\'t get all the rat saliva off of them.$B$BLet\'s read them together, shall we?',0),
(40199,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well wouldn\'t ye know it, $n. While ye were out, I found me crowbar! Isn\'t that great news?$B$BOh, ye were able to acquire one too? Ha ha!$B$BWell why don\'t ye hold onto that fer yerself and have a look at these armor pieces with me.',0),
(40200,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, those are good ideas! Let\'s get started.',0),
(40201,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мм-м... Мои питомцы на такой постели будут смотреться еще милее. Ну, может быть, не все, но большинство точно.',23222),
(40202,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This will be the last of what I have to teach.$B$BAre you ready for the trials that await you?',0),
(40203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You never cease to disappoint me, $n.$B$BAnd now I impart to you sacred knowledge which was once passed unto me.',0),
(40204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See this, $n? What was once a soft, simple scale...$B$B$B$B...has evolved into a jagged weapon that can kill!$B$B<He then indicates to the spined scales at the base of the creature\'s neck.$B$BI trust you now understand the purpose of change.',0),
(40205,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You look wiser, $n. The ancestors clearly deemed you worthy of their lessons...$B$B...as do I.',0),
(40206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for coming, $n. I wish to impart to you the remainder of my wisdom.',0),
(40207,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, these are perfect, $n. As is fair, I will return this grand favor and impart more of my leatherworking knowledge to you.',0),
(40208,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve taken down a mighty adversary, $n. The naga no doubt will be on the hunt for you.$B$BBefore they get to you though, allow me to show you a few things...',0),
(40209,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The basilisk scale is thick. Even a thinned version of this is enough to repel any sword or spear attack.$B$BThat strength is what makes these scales so valuable to our craft.',0),
(40210,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Namha listens to your tales with wide eyes and an eager ear>$B$BThat\'s it, $n. You\'ve inspired me. I\'ve been stuck in this floating city for far too long. It\'s time to get out there and see the world again.',0),
(40211,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I says to him, I go, \"The world is on the cutting edge of the knife, and we, we\'re just the shavings!\"$B$BAnd he says to me, he says, \"But then who\'ll feed the sabers?!\"$B$BWait... who are you? Leatherworking? Oh... right. I, I was once a great leatherworker...',0),
(40212,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Green is good. Green is good. Green is good? No way!$B$BOh, it\'s you $n. Right, you needed something?$B$BWait, they\'re dead? And you slew them? Fantastic!',0),
(40213,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey $n! Come here and listen. You hear it don\'t you? Come on, I know you hear it!$B$BWhat are those infernal things you\'re dragging behind you? Fel hounds? For me?$B$BYou have a strange taste in gifts for your friends, $n.',0),
(40214,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, you\'ve done it, $n. Good work.$B$BNow go, before I do or say something I\'d regret, but probably won\'t remember.',0),
(40215,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь этот зверь, на котором можно кататься. Вот образец для этой упряжи, если вы хотите один для себя.',0),
(40216,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You haven\'t got any holes in ya, I guess that means Addie\'s aim isn\'t as bad as I thought!',22522),
(40217,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We gave up usin\' that kind of ammo long ago! Don\'t worry though, we won\'t let the gift go to waste. I\'m sure we can use the arrows for kindling.',22522),
(40218,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, Кира тебя опередила. Она появилась здесь буквально минуту назад, хотя и избегала встретиться со мной взглядом.$B$BВидать, ты каким-то образом $gзавоевал:завоевала; ее доверие – мне это так и не удалось. Но с ее помощью мы точно призовем врата.',22996),
(40219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And so it was that Huln Highmountain came to this mountain, freeing the drogbar slaves of Deathwing, and came into possession of the Hammer of Khaz\'goroth.',22522),
(40220,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, это послужит зарвавшимся духам уроком.',20994),
(40221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'От имени всех лунокрылов я благодарю тебя.',20994),
(40222,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Can you feel the power emanating from the book? I cannot wait to learn its secrets.',20994),
(40224,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У орков существует пророчество о Молоте Рока. В нем говорится, что чужестранец поднимет молот, ознаменовав торжество правосудия. Может... может быть, чужестранец – это ты?$b$bИдем, $n. Ты $gнужен:нужна; Служителям Земли. А мы нужны Азероту.',21287),
(40225,1,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Служители Земли снова готовы спасти Азерот. Ты станешь $gнашим предсказателем:нашей предсказательницей;, $n, а мы – твоими верными помощниками. Только вместе мы сумеем защитить этот мир.$b$bМы в твоем полном распоряжении, $gпредсказатель:предсказательница;.',21287),
(40227,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твои слова как мед, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;. Они могут утешить, но моей решимости им не поколебать. Идем, не то я превращусь в иссохшего еще до того, как мы закончим.',22566),
(40228,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That was a kill I won\'t soon forget!$b$bAddie will write the tale of our adventures here today, but not many will believe that a gnome hunter took down a beast ten times her size.',22522),
(40229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to our humble home. You are free to move about here from now on.',22522),
(40230,4,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Murky will make a great leader for the next generation of the murlocs here.\n\nI can\'t help but feel sad over losing my little buddy, but you\'ve got to let them go sometime.',22522),
(40235,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну наконец-то! Сегодня я смогу выбраться отсюда!$b$bА если нет, мне понадобится еще больше кристаллов для следующей попытки.',20886),
(40236,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прими поздравления, великий мастер $n!',21491),
(40237,1,1,5,0,0,0,0,0,'Я бы сказал \"спасибо\", но уверен, что если все выльется в закрытие Литейной, то тебе это принесет даже больше пользы, чем нам. Так что, пожалуйста.',20574),
(40238,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Мы решили проблему лишь на время, но пока что преимущество на нашей стороне.',25549),
(40241,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличные идеи! Давай приступать к работе.',23222),
(40244,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, adventurer! Here to help me and Murky out?',22522),
(40247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see you again. If there\'s anything I can do to help you take the fight to the Legion, just let me know.',0),
(40249,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What of the others? Did they...?$B$BI see. They gave their lives for a worthy cause - the Warblades will change the tide of this war, mark my words.',0),
(40253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. You have absorbed the powers of these brutes. Look how strong you have grown!',0),
(40254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... just look you... surging with new power and knowledge!',0),
(40255,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We escaped the Vault, but our work is far from over.$B$BThe Legion\'s assault on this world is just beginning.$B$BIf Azeroth is to survive, we may have to work with this... Archmage Khadgar.',0),
(40256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We escaped the Vault, but our work is far from over.$B$BThe Legion\'s assault on this world is just beginning.$B$BIf Azeroth is to survive, we may have to work with this... Archmage Khadgar.',0),
(40265,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я так рада, что ты снова $gвдохнул:вдохнула; жизнь в мои чары...$b$bА ведь когда-то я могла творить настоящую магию, а не дешевые фокусы... пока у меня не похитили источник моей силы.',22996),
(40266,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<When you approach, Taedris returns from his dreams to reality >$b$bYes, |3-6($r), this will be quite enough. $b$b Scaling is a pretty strong poison; for my purposes, it is just what I need.',22566),
(40267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40270,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40276,6,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И это лишь начало твоего пути на этом поприще. Когда узнаешь об артефакте больше, сможешь сделать его еще мощнее.$b$bИ знай – множество глаз пристально следит за тобой. Ты $gстал:стала; символом надежды в нашей борьбе с Легионом!',21287),
(40297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Меня зовут Лиана. А тебя, |3-6($c)?\n\nСпасибо за то, что $gосвободил:освободила; меня.\n\nНе знаю, сколько времени я пробыла в таком состоянии... но я чувствую поблизости присутствие множества демонов.\n\nУ нас с тобой много работы.',24015),
(40300,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a clear indication that our conservation methods are unparalleled. And I\'ve almost given up all hope that after robbers and so many years, something will survive. My ancestors will be happy with my offering.',24015),
(40306,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хм... Думаю, раз уж ты помогаешь в моем деле, мне следует хотя бы узнать твое имя.$b$b<Таэдрис открывает книгу и достает из нее какое-то незнакомое вам высушенное растение.>$b$bСпасибо, что $gпомог:помогла; мне раздобыть еще один из необходимых ингредиентов. Я очень... ценю твою помощь, $n.',24015),
(40307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you. Now that my battle blades have returned to me, I will make a hell of a stronghold of the Defiled Soul.$b$bMy anger knows no bounds, and my revenge will be quick and fierce.',24015),
(40308,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эти реликвии – память о прошлых жизнях тех, кто здесь похоронен. Им приятно, что о них до сих пор помнят, и эти подношения умиротворяют их.$b$bТеперь духи павших смогут покоиться с миром. Спасибо тебе.',24015),
(40310,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll get better. I have all eternity to train!',0),
(40315,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s common sense in your words, $n, but I remain adamant in my decision.',24015),
(40319,18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gвидел:видела; Латару? Что произошло?$b$b... Понятно. Прости, что подвел тебя, любовь моя. Мне очень жаль...',24015),
(40320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С ними все в порядке. Отлично. Ну что – пора убивать змей!',24015),
(40321,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, $n. Ты $gоткрыл:открыла; мне глаза и $gуказал:указала; цель, ради которой действительно стоит жить дальше. Вместе мы спасем Сурамар и искупим грехи моего народа.',24015),
(40324,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Теперь давай посмотрим, что он нам поведает.',22810),
(40325,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Иссохшие... Как они страдают! Их мучает не только жажда живительной маны Ночного Колодца, но и собственные воспоминания.$B$BВоистину, вот судьба, что хуже смерти...',22810),
(40326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<This bag has a lot of technical records. When you go through them, you find the last entry in Kel\'danat\'s diary.',21531),
(40327,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'He made it out safely? Praise Elune, and you, $n.$B$BYour heroics continue to earn my trust and my tutelage, $n. Here are some more efficient ways of crafting your armor.',0),
(40328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уничтожение души – судьба куда более страшная, чем просто смерть. Сегодня ты $gоказал всем, кого спас:оказала всем, кого спасла;, огромную услугу.',24015),
(40329,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your dominance of the pet battlers of Draenor are unmatched. You are now better prepared to challenge other heroes like yourself.',0),
(40331,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я буду носить это ожерелье в память о Трондире!',24015),
(40332,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Славься, ярл Трондир. Да вознесется твоя душа в Чертоги Доблести.',24015),
(40334,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brandolph mixes the ingredients of the infusion.>$B$BIt tastes horrible, and it smells... Hold your nose and drink it in a volley.',24015),
(40336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсделал:сделала; это, $n. Ты $gубил Повелительницу приливов и спас:убила Повелительницу приливов и спасла; Яндвик от садж\'тарских наг.',24015),
(40339,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What you doing back so soon?',22522),
(40341,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так значит, легенды о скипетре приливов оказались правдивы!$b$bТеперь этот мощный артефакт в руках Служителей Земли, и это так воодушевляет!',21287),
(40345,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What that?! You have Candleking\'s Special Candle!',22522),
(40348,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда с порчей покончено, водяные элементали снова будут процветать.',22908),
(40364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пойти на обед чудовищу – не самая достойная смерть.',24015),
(40368,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это то, что надо.',22566),
(40370,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is done. I can already feel how the influence of corruption is weakening. Thank you, $n. You have provided; This land is a huge service.',24015),
(40373,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Значит, так? Впрочем, я поддерживаю любой твой выбор. Теперь мы возродим иллидари.',20994),
(40378,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я видела их в деле. Конечно, не самый элитный отряд, но в прошлом Пеплоусты неплохо себя проявляли в бою.',20994),
(40379,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это тяжело принять, но мы пожертвовали всем, чтобы стать теми, кто мы есть.\n\nМы ни перед чем не остановимся, чтобы разгромить Пылающий Легион. Ни перед чем...',20994),
(40384,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твоя слава опережает тебя, $n.$b$bУ меня к тебе важный разговор.',21287),
(40385,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21154),
(40388,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am happy to see you, great ally.',22522),
(40391,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello again, champion. I see we are all here now.',0),
(40392,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Странники допрашивали пленных демонов.$b$bОдно из этих отродий сказало, будто знает, где скрывается некто... чрезвычайно важный для нашего дела.',21287),
(40400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The time to make our move is now.',0),
(40401,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень надеюсь, что за тобой не было хвоста. Мы должны действовать быстро. Я уже почти у цели, и я ее достигну.',24461),
(40402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The time to make our move is now.',0),
(40403,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пришло время действовать.',21287),
(40408,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent choice! There\'s no time to waste.',22522),
(40412,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Смерть Азорана – серьезный удар по Легиону, от которого он еще не скоро оправится.$b$bТы $gзаслужил:заслужила; уважение и благодарность, $n.',24015),
(40415,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'To think that leatherworking has been that ingrained in the highmountain tauren heritage for that long is absolutely amazing.$B$BI suddenly wish I knew more about my own people\'s past as well as they do.',0),
(40417,6,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The chief is carefully examining the map of the Tanaan jungle and its adjacent areas, sticking his eyebrows. >$b$bAh, commander $n! The voice of the Horde on Drenor. The right decision was to give the enemy a fight on his land. I\'ve been talking to Trall-- he\'s very pleased with you. $b$bWell, it\'s time to get this whole thing over with. You\'re like, $gready:ready;?',20779),
(40418,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The King is studying maps of Tanaan Jungle and the surrounding area.>$B$B$n! The Alliance owes you a great debt for establishing this garrison. Thanks to your bravery and commanding leadership, we\'ve fought this war here on Draenor, instead of amongst our own homes and farmsteads.$B$BIt\'s time now to finish this. Are you ready for the final campaign?',0),
(40419,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We didn\'t recover Alleria, but at least we have proof she was there. She will be found... I know it!$b$bThas\'dorah has long been symbolic of the Windrunner family, but until Alleria\'s return, it belongs in your hands.$b$bUse it to rally the greatest hunters of Azeroth and drive the Burning Legion back to the abyss!',21287),
(40424,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно. Дело сделано.$b$bТы $gоказал:оказала; мне огромную услугу.$b$bВот, возьми. Это в знак моей благодарности за помощь.',21737),
(40469,7,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это манавино? Для меня?$b$b<Иадрет залпом выпивает всю бутылку.>$b$bБольшое спасибо тебе и этому... Асторилу. А то я бы здесь точно иссохла.',24461),
(40470,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a most troubling tale. $B$BYou have done a good thing, $n. Now he will no longer torment our people.',0),
(40495,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am left with little choice. I cannot face another Dark Rider ambush alone, and you are obviously formidable.$B$BI will help you find the weapon you seek, but only if you will allow me to return the others in their possession to their rightful place.$B$BDo we have a deal, warlock?',21287),
(40515,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made Mayla smile. That is the first time I have seen her smile in... ever?',22522),
(40517,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Anduin sighs and reads the letter from his father. Tears well in his eyes. He is silent for several moments.>$b$bThank you for bringing this to me, $n, it means... more than I can say. I wish Greymane felt he could present it himself, but his mind is fixed on revenge.$b$bI cannot blame him... or Jaina, for that matter, but we must find a better way.$b$bEnough of such talk. It is good you are here. We will need heroes like you in the many battles to come.',22522),
(40518,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Glad to see you back on your feet, $n. Many good soldiers who sailed for the Broken Shore were not so fortunate.',21737),
(40519,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, $n. I\'ve got your ship assignment right here.$b$bBut first, a bit of readiness is in order!',22522),
(40520,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, these will be perfect for what is in store.',22522),
(40522,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have served the Horde well in the past, $n.$b$bMore will be asked of you... much more.',21737),
(40523,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я – хозяйка этого заведения. Если у тебя есть какие-то вопросы по поводу этого магазина, задавай их мне.$b$bА теперь к делу.',22900),
(40524,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Так значит, кольцо похитили мурлоки? Похоже, наша совместная работа только начинается!$b$bМы с тобой теперь крепко повязаны!',23420),
(40525,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40526,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40527,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40528,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40529,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40530,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что там такое?$b$b<Тиффани запускает руку в сумку и извлекает из нее самоцвет. Она внимательно осматривает его, затем в гневе швыряет сумку на землю.>$b$bЭти камни... их должен был доставить...$b$bУИНСТОН! Гнусный ворюга! Как он осмелился подменить мои камни на эти... тусклые стекляшки!',23420),
(40531,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tiffany takes your bag and takes the stones out of it. > She carefully inspects each of them.$b$bOkay, great. Everything\'s in place. Apparently, those are the real rocks.$b$bAnd what about you... whatever. I don\'t care about that.',23420),
(40532,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40533,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40534,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40535,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jabrul thanks you, $n.',23420),
(40536,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наконец-то мы убрались из этого проклятого места. Теперь Джабрул, как и обещал, поделится с тобой своими знаниями.$b$bЧто тебя интересует больше всего?',23420),
(40538,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tiffany takes a close look at the stone and nods satisfactorily. >$b$bBeautiful job, $n. You can tell at once that you\'ve been a lot of $gI\'ve learned:I\'ve learned.  since we last met.$b$bI hope you like this sketch. It\'s my pride.',23420),
(40539,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Clive looks closely at the pickups.>$b$bNot bad, not bad at all. $b$bYou\'re $gI did:did me a huge favor. Since you still have the sketch, I now know who to contact if I need another set.$b$b< Clive is conspiring to wink at you. >',23420),
(40540,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jabrul is glad to see you, $n. Jabrul wanted to know if you want to learn new sketches.',23420),
(40541,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jabrul had never seen anything brighter in his entire life.',23420),
(40542,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, $gтакой малыш, как ты, не слишком надорвался, пока тащил:такая малышка, как ты, не слишком надорвалась, пока тащила, их сюда.$b$bСейчас я покажу тебе, что настоящий мастер может сделать с такими прекрасными камнями.$b$b<Джабрул начинает гранить один из камней, который у вас на глазах превращается в самоцвет дивной красоты, попутно объясняя, что и как надо делать.>',23420),
(40543,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40544,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',23420),
(40545,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now that\'s quite the haul of guns! I suppose these fell off the back of a gryphon, right?$b$b<Filgo gives you a sly wink.>',22522),
(40546,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасный кристалл. Теперь смотри и запоминай...$b$b<Джабрул начинает вырезать из куска хрусталя замысловатую конструкцию, попутно объясняя, как форма самоцвета влияет на его свойства.>',23420),
(40547,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jabrul thought the trip would be much nicer. But the main thing is that Jabrul got where he wanted to. Jabrul is eager to work together with the local craftsmen!',23420),
(40556,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, it\'s always nice to see you! Listen, um...',23420),
(40558,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tiffany shows you the repaired box and explains how she fixed it. >$b$bNow you\'ll have no trouble making one of these and $gitself:by myself; if you need to.',23420),
(40559,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Timothy flips pages quickly. >$b$bA rare and very valuable find, $n. You\'re just good. $b$bAs promised, here\'s your new sketch. You\'ve fully earned it. You\'ve earned it.',23420),
(40560,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gнашел:нашла; его! И $gвернулся целым и невредимым:вернулась целой и невредимой;!$b$bНевероятно! $n, я вот только что как раз по этому случаю сочинил стих в твою честь!$b$b$gСмерти он не боится, а боль презирает, смело в бой он идет и всегда побеждает:Смерть ее не страшит, боль она презирает, в бой идет она смело и вновь побеждает;!',23420),
(40561,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a ring! All the rings are a ring! I wonder what kind of jewellers in the heavens have created such a miracle. Well, for such a trophy and a reward there must be a corresponding one. Here\'s one of my last sketches of the rings. Use it for your health, $n. I hope you can use it.',23420),
(40562,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The elves always make the best quality items. I\'ll hang onto these gems, if you don\'t mind.$B$BThis jewelry design, on the other hand... it\'d be perfect for a jewelcrafting $C like you!',0),
(40567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хвала Элуне! Хоть мы и окружены со всех сторон ужасами, хоть наши земли и лежат в руинах, а на оплакивание всех тех, кого мы потеряли, нам не хватит и многих лет... но Элуна все же дала нам надежду, и мы должны продолжать нашу борьбу.',21414),
(40568,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Felskorn have witnessed true strength today. $B$BThey will think twice before raising their blades to you again.',22522),
(40569,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do you think that\'s true? I\'m sure you can handle the power of these blades!',21287),
(40570,1,603,0,0,0,200,0,0,'Это было фантастическое путешествие, $n! Надо будет как-нибудь повторить!$b$bС этими клинками тебя теперь наверняка ждет много приключений!$b$bЧто ж, пожалуй, я здесь немного задержусь.',21287),
(40573,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thaon Moonclaw was a great druid and a true protector of this land.$b$bHow can we hope to defeat the Nightmare Lord without him fighting beside us?',22522),
(40578,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It hurts to see them suffer. In time it will all go back to normal, but at least for a while they have found peace again.',24015),
(40579,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I knew you would pick that one. Let us be about it.',21021),
(40585,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An excellent choice, $ct. As more opportunities arise, I will bring them to your attention. Good luck in battle!',21108),
(40588,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Странно, что Темные всадники не стали нас преследовать. Но хорошо, что нам повезло.$B$BПолагаю, что здесь и кроется разгадка – где же всадники. Что ж, давай искать.',21287),
(40593,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This attack... even the battle on the Broken Shore... it\'s only the beginning of the Legion\'s campaign.$b$bIf we don\'t find a way to stop them, we\'re going to lose everything my father and the other leaders built.$b$bWe need the strength of the Illidari behind us.',22522),
(40594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. We will make a Skyhorn out of you yet.',22522),
(40603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Speak not. I know what you seek.$B$BDo you believe yourself ready to face the trials ahead?',0),
(40604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Эта тетрадь похожа на обычный дневник, но вы чувствуете, как от нее исходит темная энергия.$B$BВскоре вы понимаете, что это дневник Аридена, где описано его пребывание на Перевале Мертвого Ветра. К концу дневника тон повествования заметно меняется и становится более мрачным. Там все чаще говорится о \"проклятии\" и о неодолимом желании обладать предметами, наделенными великой силой.$B$BПри беглом просмотре дневн',21287),
(40605,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, so you\'re the vaunted $c I\'ve heard about. Good.$b$bWe shall see if your reputation holds true.',21737),
(40606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Совершенно очевидно, что с этим компасом что-то не так. $B$BСтрелка будто бы хочет повернуться во все стороны сразу.',21287),
(40607,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would seem the demon hunters\' concerns were well-founded. To think the demons would dare worm their way into our city during this period of mourning!$b$bThis does not bode well for the rest of my kingdom.',21737),
(40608,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Ashildir nods knowingly.>$B$BYou are ready for the next step.',0),
(40611,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, компас работает. Стрелка указывает в сторону реки. $B$BМожет, это...',21287),
(40613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is one last task before you journey to the Halls, $n.',0),
(40614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My guards will prepare the feast. We must discuss your journey to the Halls.',0),
(40615,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can feel Odyn\'s power from here - the Legion\'s magic will no longer stop you.',0),
(40617,603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, |3-6($r). Я позабочусь о ранах Ночноглаза. Рассказывай, что там случилось!',22908),
(40618,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пора сделать первый шаг, чтобы получить артефакт. Раздобыть оружие такой силы – задача не из легких. Впрочем, по-другому и быть не может.$b$bКогда справишься, возвращайся сюда, нам будет о чем потолковать. Еще столько предстоит сделать!',21287),
(40623,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня Темным всадникам был нанесен сокрушительный удар. Жители Сумеречного леса могут праздновать победу. $B$BОни в большом долгу перед тобой – и я тоже.',21287),
(40625,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This was all you could find? I suppose it will have to do, although it is a primitive instrument.',0),
(40632,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'И снова здравствуй, $gгерой:защитница;. Вижу, теперь все в сборе.',23171),
(40633,1,603,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Привет, $n. Ты чего так долго?$b$bПока ты $gпропадал:пропадала; неизвестно где, я сама кое-что разузнала. Король Фаорис предложил помочь нам, если мы решим какую-то его проблему.$b$bНе знаю, в чем там дело, но уверена, ты справишься.',21287),
(40634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, you found this stone upon his body?$b$bInteresting... Let me take a closer look.',21287),
(40636,1,2,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'Как тебе будет угодно, великий мастер.',21491),
(40642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kyrtos greedily consumes the essence.>$B$BAhh, much better. My senses are focused and ready for research!',0),
(40643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40647,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40649,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Miluna\'s eyes are full of tears; instead of the usual smile, there\'s a nasty grimace on your face. >$B$BY-yes?',21267),
(40650,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I ben tinkin\' for a while, $n. I set aside my walking staff a long time ago for a life of peace, seekin\' to teach da druidic arts in my twilight years.$B$BBut now, war has come to tear my home to shreds, and I can\'t watch that happen.$B$BMy staff and I are ready for another journey with you, $n.',21249),
(40651,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно!$b$bКогда твое оружие наберет достаточно силы, ты сможешь вернуться сюда и раскрыть его истинный потенциал.',21267),
(40652,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую, $ct.$b$bМы имеем дело с множеством угроз. Нужно действовать быстро.',21267),
(40653,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отличный выбор! Здесь мы и начнем.$b$bЕсли возникнут новые угрозы, я немедленно поставлю тебя в известность. Да озарит свет Элуны твой путь, $ct.',21267),
(40654,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасно. Очень скоро наши ряды пополнят друиды-медведи.',22996),
(40657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. By studying these materials I can better understand how they imbue magic into their machinery and architecture.',0),
(40661,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! You\'ve broken an invasion!$b$bIf only that had ended our campaign. But the Legion will never relent until they are destroyed... or have destroyed us.$b$bDon\'t let up! Fight off more of these wretched invasions, $n. The wyrmtongue we\'re holding captive here will reward your efforts.',22522),
(40668,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It will not be easy to properly tame and channel the destructive energy of the heart. But I believe in your success.',22810),
(40672,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These will make a worthy vessel indeed.',0),
(40673,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Thalrenus reads over the scroll carefully.>',0),
(40675,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done. The Eon Winder will help us control the delicate magics at play within the Heart.',0),
(40678,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Now, let\'s see what happens if we use the Heart to drain the power from them.',0),
(40683,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fel magic is... strange. Almost slippery like an oil, and it burns long and hot. Maybe there\'s a connection...',0),
(40684,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, the choice is worth considering!',21287),
(40694,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes...$B$BThis power is... different. Brutal, blunt, powerful.$B$BI can control it. I can master it!',0),
(40698,603,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это поразительное оружие, и ведь не весь его потенциал еще раскрыт!$b$bЕсли мы хотим устранить угрозу Пылающего Легиона раз и навсегда, нам потребуется вся сила этого оружия.',21287),
(40704,1,66,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Знаешь, я как раз вспоминала былые деньки, когда мы вместе так славно проводили время. С тобой не соскучишься, ну и к тому же я уверена, что дядя Чэнь не станет возражать, если я останусь с тобой – ты же ведь Великий мастер.$b$bК чему я клоню – я с радостью стану твоей разведчицей, исследовательницей и помощницей, если ты не против. Ну, что скажешь?',23171),
(40705,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Как я понимаю, ты $gсогласен:согласна;? Если ты $gготов:готова; действовать, предлагаю не терять зря времени. Я не сомневаюсь в твоих талантах, но в нашей ситуации мы не можем себе позволить полагаться на волю случая!',21287),
(40706,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Worthy choice. My brothers and I are ready to help you with everything you have to do, $n.',21287),
(40710,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Твои навыки действительно впечатляют. И это замечательно, поскольку для нашей победы они понадобятся еще не раз.',21287),
(40712,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$gFriend got it: Friend got it; weapon? $B$BYeah, Calid can feel his power!',21287),
(40713,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes... Within these pages lies the secret to true mastery of this power.',0),
(40714,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У тебя, наверное, полно вопросов, но с ответами на них придется подождать. Идет война!$b$bМедлить нельзя ни минуты, но я постараюсь вкратце обрисовать тебе ситуацию.',21287),
(40715,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a great choice.',21287),
(40716,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gпринял:приняла; правильное решение. $B$BНадеюсь, ты действительно так же $gхорош:хороша; в деле, как о тебе рассказывают.',21287),
(40717,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Jaina\'s reaction was unfortunate, but not unexpected. She has endured so much...$b$bThough it was Garrosh Hellscream who ordered the obliteration of Theramore, she blames all the Horde for her loss. I hope one day she can overcome that hatred.$b$bEnough ruminating. We must prepare the Kirin Tor for war.',22522),
(40727,1,66,0,0,0,700,0,0,'Thanks to you, Delina was able to successfully deliver the goods.',24015),
(40729,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Калиду жаль, что так вышло с твоими друзьями, но если мы поторопимся, они еще могут выжить. $B$BДа, Джагганот будет их пытать, но убивать своих пленников он не спешит.',21287),
(40730,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я прослежу, чтобы наш общий друг получил вино в целости и сохранности. Спасибо.',24015),
(40731,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40740,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even when I think about this ax, goosebumps, $ n. His power is undeniable, but he himself is the embodiment of eternal hunger. $B$bWe are forced to use it because we need to win this war at all costs. And still in your place, I would be extremely careful with him.',21287),
(40744,657,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, that should be enough. However, the powder from the claws quickly loses its properties, so we need to hurry.',22566),
(40745,18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я думала... они меня... *всхлипывает*',24015),
(40746,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень рад тебя видеть. Твоя помощь придется очень кстати.',24015),
(40747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Конечно, эти детали не в лучшем состоянии, но сгодятся и такие.',21531),
(40748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы... мы добрались?',21531),
(40753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я запрограммирован на раздачу подарков, а ты, согласно моим данным, $gзапрограммирован:запрограммирована; на их получение.$b$bПредлагаю осуществить взаимовыгодную сделку!',23360),
(40755,396,396,0,0,0,500,0,0,'Not long after you left, the first wave of demons struck. We\'re holding them at bay... for now.$b$bI\'ll keep this tome safe until we have a chance to study it.$b$bGood work in there. I should like to delve into the libraries of Karazhan myself one day. At least... I think I would.',22522),
(40760,396,396,0,0,0,1000,0,0,'<Allari furrows her brow as she speaks.>$B$BYou didn\'t think the leadership of the Horde could gather in one location and go unnoticed by the Burning Legion, did you?',21737),
(40761,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что-то здесь явно не так...',25549),
(40762,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And I wondered why she wasn\'t suddenly visible or audible. It\'s a small comfort to my heart, but a great blow to the rest of the power of the nocturnal. You\'re doing great, $n.',24015),
(40783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рад встрече, $gвоитель:воительница;.$B$BТы $gготов:готова; взвалить на себя это бремя?',21287),
(40784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Valorne... It\'s... it was the Dark Rider! But how could they strike us here, in the heart of the grove?',21287),
(40785,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Значит, я был прав и ты охотишься за косой. Но знай – чтобы вернуть ее, нам придется сделать то, что не удалось еще ни одному обитателю Сумеречного леса.$B$BМы должны выследить Темных всадников.$B$BВпервые я столкнулся с ними еще во времена Культа Волка, и с тех самых пор слежу за ними. Это настоящая чума этого края, не говоря уже о том, что у них нет никакого права владеть артефактами, которые они украли.$B$BТак что е',21287),
(40786,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, another one of these pesky artifacts. The meddling in the timestreams has grown worse of late... or is it that it will grow worse?$B$B<She sighs heavily.>',0),
(40787,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, another one of these pesky artifacts. The meddling in the timestreams has grown worse of late... or is it that it will grow worse?$B$B<She sighs heavily.>',0),
(40792,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n, you have returned. An otherworldly air hangs heavy about you.',0),
(40793,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21491),
(40794,1,0,0,0,1000,0,0,0,'<The officer looks down at what you\'re offering him and his eyes light up.>\n\nDo you know what you have here? You might have just delivered some of the most significant intel of the campaign.\n\nI will see to it personally that this gets into Lord Greymane\'s hands.',22522),
(40795,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An excellent choice, Grandmaster.',0),
(40796,7,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Absolon greedily swallows ancient mana and seems to be speechless for some time. >',22566),
(40798,18,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Absolon... ...is alive?',24015),
(40814,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well chosen. There isn\'t a moment to spare.',20994),
(40815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, $n, it\'s you. Good, we\'ve got a little problem here .$B$BAltruis didn\'t think that Cyana and I could handle this on our own? He might have been right this time.',0),
(40816,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(40819,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hold little love for these mages and their ilk, but they are necessary allies.',20994),
(40821,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40823,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(40830,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе, что $gотыскал:отыскала; Окулета. Он нам очень нужен.',21531),
(40832,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Apologies for the secrecy - we simply could not risk the wrong person finding us here.',21021),
(40834,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Странно, что Темные всадники не стали нас преследовать. Но хорошо, что нам повезло.$B$BПолагаю, что здесь и кроется разгадка – где же всадники. Что ж, давай искать.',21287),
(40835,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The diary radiates dark energy. Apparently, Ariden made notes in him about what happened during his stay at Deadwind Pass. One of the notes stands out from the rest: “The Nightbane Pack has recently intensified. There are rumors that Scythe of Elune has left Darnassus. Obviously, she is already nearby because she draws the worgen to her. Here they are take me to her. These',21287),
(40837,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vorgena seems to be attracted to something in the catacombs under Karazhan. Maybe it\'s...',21287),
(40838,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня Темным всадникам был нанесен сокрушительный удар. Жители Сумеречного леса могут праздновать победу. $B$BОни в большом долгу перед тобой – и я тоже.',21287),
(40839,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the Uncrowned, Shadow $n.',21021),
(40840,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent choice. That blade will serve you well.',21021),
(40847,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aha! I knew you\'d come!',21021),
(40849,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did fine work today, $Glad:lass;.',21021),
(40854,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'How did you get your hands on this?!$b$b<Didi begins inspecting the husk.>$b$bDo you realize what we could do with something like this? Our own personal fel reaver?!$b$bWe could lay waste to our enemies!$b$bWe could advance our knowledge of science and technology!$b$bWe could make it serve us drinks!',22522),
(40855,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shush-it, $c! This \'ere place is crawlin\' with demony things.$b$bAye, Didi sent ye, did she? How is tha wee lass?$b$bIf yer lookin\' for demon parts, I can certainly help yeh with that!',22522),
(40856,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Just wat are ye and Didi puttin\' together exactly?$b$bIs it big? Dangerous? Rer-diculous?$b$bI want in!',22522),
(40857,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh good, another pair of hands. I\'m on ta somethin\', $n. I jes\' know it!',0),
(40858,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You give Didi a slap on the back.>$b$bUgh! I take it Flintlocke says hello?$b$bLet\'s see what you brought me! Oh good, these will work perfectly.$b$bI\'ll get started on the repairs using a new invention of mine, the Auto-Hammer.$b$bHere\'s a copy of the blueprints for it if you\'re interested in making one for yourself.',22522),
(40859,11,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'d I tell ya? Now THAT\'s usin\' yer HEAD!$b$bYeh see what I did there?$b$bSeeing as \'ow yeh tested them out fer me, I\'ll let yeh \'ave a copy of the blueprint fer \'em.',22522),
(40860,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О, да! Это как раз то, что надо! Я уже собирался ружья всяким хламом заряжать.',22566),
(40861,5,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, my poor machine guns! What happened to you...$b$bBut at least they met their end by putting bullets in the enemy. I\'d like that, too.$b$bHere you go, by the way, an assembly diagram in case you need it. You assemble it and just put it next to something that annoys you!',22566),
(40862,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что, классный я придумал способ прополки, правда? Ха-ха!$b$bЯ знал, что тебе захочется запастись этими зарядами, так что специально набросал схемку.$b$bИ не давай спуску этим обнаглевшим растениям.',22566),
(40863,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We did it! That\'s one fully functional, killer-lookin\' fel reaver.$b$bShould it ever run out of power, here\'s the schematic for that battery I came up with.$b$bJust pop a new one in it and you should be good to go.$b$bBy the way, whatcha think we should name it? I was thinking somethin\' deadly, like \"Reaves.\"',22522),
(40864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Everything appears to be running as expected. Although to be honest, I half expected an explosion to go along with it.$B$BHere\'s the other schematic I made for Reaves. It\'s based off the auto-hammer design I gave you earlier.',0),
(40865,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, what\'re ya doin \'ere? Hobart sent ye, didn\'e?$B$BListen, I dunnae need yer help, but seein\' as how yeh made yer way down \'ere, maybe we can stir up some trouble ta\'gether.',0),
(40866,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, yer finished! I swear I was jes\' about ta join yeh, too.$B$BWell, what\'s done is done. I s\'pose I can share me design with yeh since yeh got all the shells fer me.',0),
(40867,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well lookie there! You managed to talk \'em outta their trinkets! Ye\'ll have to teach me their language someday.',0),
(40868,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The pieces! Well it\'s about time.$B$B<Hobart moves over to a machine and begins inserting the items you gave him.>$B$BI take it Flintlocke made you deliver these? Well since you did the legwork, you can have a copy of my design.$B$BIt\'s a new type of wormhole generator. Specifically designed for getting around Dalaran in the blink of an eye!',0),
(40869,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good job on calibrating the power. Shame about those first few though...$B$BI\'ve adjusted the numbers on the schematic to the new specifications so you should be able to make the safe version.',0),
(40870,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Didi takes fireworks from you and leans over his workbench again. >$b$bWell, there you go. We\'re all set!$b$bAttach this to the bad boy and you can start fireworks whenever you want! You can admire ANY explosion... ...but fireworks are something special.',23420),
(40871,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh aye, there yeh are lad. I was kinda hopin\' ta see yeh again.',0),
(40872,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah terrific! Nice work gettin\' them parts back. I thought I was gonna have ta drain the bay by blowin\' up Warden\'s Isle over there.$B$BThem boots seemed ta suit yeh - here\'s the schematic fer \'em if yeh need another pair.',0),
(40873,1,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Шикарно, $gдружище:подруга;. Этого точно должно хватить. Я тут немного доработал схему этого оружейного ранца.$b$bСтранно, что сам Хобарт до этого не додумался. Вечно у него все взрывается.',23420),
(40874,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh I wish I coulda been there ta see tha look on their fishy faces!$B$BEh, come ta think of it, fish always look kinda ser-prised.',0),
(40875,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh aye, yeh get me schematic! Here, keep a copy fer yerself, in case yer lookin\' for somethin\' to tattoo somewheres.$B$BIt\'s a damn shame about Lowping. Yeh know, come ta think of it, maybe we shoulda rescued him. Ah! Multi-tasking were never my thing.',0),
(40876,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So the gunshoes and pack were a success? I guess all these guns I made weren\'t such a waste after all.$B$BWhich reminds me, I saw the plans for those goggles Flintlocke made and I\'ve got to say, they were rather crude in their design. \"Dwarven Engineering\" is a bit of an oxymoron.$B$BI\'ve updated the schematic to not require so many materials.',0),
(40877,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Keep your fingers crossed, $n, and let\'s hope this works.$B$B$B$BYes! YES! It\'s alive, ALIVE!$B$BNow I can mass-market these gun parts as toys for children!',0),
(40878,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Didi takes the pylons and begins tinkering with them and starts writing some notes.>$B$BYea, that should do the trick!$B$BOne new and improved Reaves module schematic for you, $n.',0),
(40879,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s time I showed you my ultimate plans for Reaves! Allow me to present... piloted combat mode! Sure, the ingredients are ridiculously hard to find, and nobody even knows if it works, but hey - that\'s engineering for you!$B$BEnjoy the schematics!',0),
(40880,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An old schematic, still intact, is floating amongst the papers.$B$BAs you examine the schematic you realize that it\'s the circuit design for Blingtron!',0),
(40881,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That circuit design was exactly what I needed to finish the Blingtron module for Reaves.$B$BNow to reap the rewards, $n!',0),
(40882,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Hobart takes the mechanism from you and begins tinkering with his design.>$B$BYes, I believe that\'s it. Good work, $n.$B$BAs per usual I\'ll let you have a copy of my schematic for your personal gain.',0),
(40883,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне казалось, Лунные стражи могут выдержать все что угодно...',22810),
(40890,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Archmage Khadgar has set aside a space here for the Tears of Elune, as well as the rest of the Pillars of Creation.>',22522),
(40898,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я вижу, ты $gпринес:принесла; свежее мясо василисков Скверны.$b$bПослушай меня, и я расскажу тебе, зачем они нам понадобились...',24015),
(40900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Коса Элуны!$b$bНикогда бы не подумал, что найдется тот, кто сможет владеть этим оружием и не превратится в дикого зверя, но тебе удалось привести в равновесие его необузданную природу.$b$bНаверняка сама Элуна направляла твою руку, $n. Ты $gсделал:сделала; то, что до тебя не удавалось ни одному друиду!',21287),
(40901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мрачнокрыл был грозным демоном... Надо признать, твои навыки меня впечатляют, $n.$b$bНо предстоит убить еще гораздо больше демонов. Очень хорошо, что теперь со мной есть кто-то, на кого можно положиться.',24015),
(40904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where... where did you find this?',0),
(40907,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда у меня не осталось соперников, я наконец-то смогу занять место ярла Яндвика.',24015),
(40908,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Trondyr breathes often and intermittently; you can see that it\'s hard for him to talk. >$B$BThe poison... ...has penetrated deeply... ...into my body.',24015),
(40919,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can no longer hear their shrieking. Finally, peace and quiet!',0),
(40927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не знаю, кто ты $gтакой:такая;, но я перед тобой в большом долгу.',24015),
(40929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я вижу, ты $gвернулся:вернулась; с эмблемами. Прекрасно.$b$bПосмотрим, как отреагирует этот змееуст, увидев, что сталось с его товарищами.',24015),
(40930,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t have much of a choice. I will not survive another attack by the Dark Riders, and you are undoubtedly strong;...I will help you find your artifact, but on condition that you allow me to return the others they now have to their rightful place. Agreed, knight of death?',21287),
(40931,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не скажу, что мне приятно находиться в твоей компании, но ты, бесспорно, $gсильный союзник:сильная союзница;. $B$BМне кажется, ключ к тайне местонахождения Темных всадников должен быть где-то здесь. Странно, что никто не пошел по нашему следу, но в любом случае нам не стоит терять времени – они в любой момент могут и передумать.',21287),
(40932,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The diary radiates dark energy. Apparently, Ariden made notes in him about what happened during his stay at Deadwind Pass. One of the entries is different from the others: “I hear a whisper. They call me from the damp land of shallow graves, urging me to recall my heritage. But what kind of heritage are we talking about? The merchant I was once had no great ancestors ... And yet I am drawn to him. To this terrible blade ... the destroyer of the world ... Apocalypse ... \"',21287),
(40933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Меня аж морозом до костей пробрало – видать, у тебя все прошло успешно.$B$BЧто ты $gузнал:узнала;?',21287),
(40934,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сегодня Темным всадникам был нанесен сокрушительный удар. Жители Сумеречного леса могут праздновать победу. $B$BОни в большом долгу перед тобой – и я тоже.',21287),
(40935,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$gThe King-Lynch Warrior is back;The King-Lynch Warrior is back; with a mighty weapon that will crush demons! $B$BLet the Burning Legion now tremble as soon as it sees us!',21287),
(40938,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С возвращением, кардинал. Пока тебя не было, мы тут все для тебя подготовили – надеюсь, ты останешься $gдоволен:довольна;. Предлагаю сразу же перейти к делу.',21287),
(40941,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),
(40942,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),
(40943,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'News about da assault beat ya back, boss-mon. And some spoils of the fightin\'.$B$BYa be a force to be reckonin\' with.',0),
(40944,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Word of the assault has already made it back, as have some spoils from the fight.$B$BWell done sir, if you don\'t mind me saying.',0),
(40947,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Brilliant work. I\'ll read those letters.',24015),
(40949,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо тебе. Мне легче от того, что они больше не жертвуют собой ради нас.',22810),
(40950,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems you\'ve struck a nerve.',21108),
(40952,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У нас впереди много дел, $gохотник:охотница;. Но сначала, полагаю, тебе захочется узнать немного больше о том, кто я такая и зачем тебя разыскивала.',21287),
(40953,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я хотела узнать, на что ты $gспособен:способна;, $n, поэтому некоторое время наблюдала за тобой со стороны.$b$b<Эммарель хмурится.>$b$bПо-моему, я что-то не то сказала. Извини, искусство вести беседу – не мой конек. Итак, начну снова.$b$bНаш орден давно ищет охотников, которые помогут Незримому пути вступить в новую эру. Но никто не справится с этой задачей лучше тебя.',21287),
(40954,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда нам снова угрожает Легион, Незримому пути нужны новые последователи... и новый предводитель.$b$bТвое оружие – лучшее свидетельство того, что это под силу именно тебе.$b$bПримешь ли ты на себя эту ответственность? Выполнишь ли ты клятву, данную орденом много лет назад?',21287),
(40955,603,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The spirit of the eagle has not appeared to us since the foundation of the order! It is surely a sign that now that you are in charge; the invisible way, the Legion will be crushed!',21287),
(40956,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< Seems like a good place for a teleport. >',21737),
(40957,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, hunters are always ready to help, but a war with the Legion will take you too much time and energy. You can\'t do it alone. $B$bI once served Namuria Song of Glade, the founder of our order. I reported to her about everything that was happening around her when she was busy with more important things. It will be an honor for me to serve you too, $n.',22996),
(40958,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здравствуй, следопыт! Это честь для меня – помочь тебе в борьбе против Легиона.',21287),
(40959,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s a great choice. So, we\'re up against the Legion! On your team, the spirit of the eagle can take you back to Shooter\'s Shelter. I\'ll teach you how to summon him.',21287),
(40960,6,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A magic pearl, you say? Let\'s see...',24015),
(40961,5,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну разве не ПРЕЛЕСТЬ?! Никогда не видела ничего даже близко похожего!$b$bДа, бросай ее в фонтан, не стесняйся. Все равно народ туда уже и так накидал кучу монеток и всякой всячины.$b$b<Жемчужина начинает светиться еще ярче и взмывает над поверхностью воды.>',24015),
(40962,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Malfurion departed in a great hurry, but he bade me give you this before you left. Thank you for all you have done for Azeroth, and for all that you will do in time to come.',0),
(40963,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я слышала крики, и рада, что это – крики ночнорожденных. Отличная работа.',22810),
(40964,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Тебя прислала Серена? Хорошо... значит, она еще жива.',22810),
(40965,1,574,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нам всем стоит усвоить этот урок. Никогда не думай, что твой враг погиб, пока своими глазами не увидишь труп. <Лотрий мрачно усмехается.>',24015),
(40967,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Слава Матери-Луне... Они уцелели!',24015),
(40969,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Стало быть, Лотрий и Талрен живы. Что ж, значит, у нас еще есть надежда. Спасибо тебе, что $gотважился:отважилась; перебраться через мост, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;.',24015),
(40970,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Такая сила не должна попасть в руки врага. Спасибо тебе.',24015),
(40971,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to you, we got here, barely hurt.',24015),
(40972,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Он пришли сюда на мой зов. Я позабочусь о том, чтобы им помогли после всего, что им пришлось пережить по вине моего народа.',24015),
(40976,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Vol\'jin\'s death was part of a larger plan. The Legion thrives on weakening its enemies from within. The demons will strike when their enemy is at its most vulnerable.$b$bWhatever grief the Horde\'s people are feelilng, they can no longer afford to ignore us.$b$bOur time is now, Illidari!',22594),
(40982,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Of course the Legion would try to infiltrate this funeral. With the leaders of the Horde gathered in one place at one time, it was too tasty of a target for the demons to resist.',22594),
(40983,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your warning just saved us from what might have been a catastrophic loss. Now we can unleash our vengeance upon this Legion filth.$b$bYou now have my attention, demon hunter... and perhaps a bit of appreciation as well.',22594),
(40986,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Though I\'ll admit I may not have been able to do this alone, I will not forget the transgressions that happened today.$B$BYou have what you came for, $C. I think it is time you were on your way.',0),
(40987,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The champion of the Lich King returns, and with a mighty weapon to bear against our demon foes!$B$BMay the Burning Legion tremble at the sight of our forces!',0),
(40988,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$C! I was hoping you\'d come back.$b$bHere, take a sample of some of the recipes and dishes I\'ve been working on.',22522),
(40989,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Master $n!! I knew you\'d come.$B$BHere, take a sample of some of the recipes and dishes I\'ve been working on.',0),
(40990,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are truly amazing, Master $n.$b$bNow, let\'s get to work, shall we?',22522),
(40991,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Класс! При помощи той новой техники мы сможем готовить нарезку из сушеной скумбрии куда с меньшими трудозатратами.$b$bИ это только начало – наверняка мы еще столькому можем научиться! Неси мне ингредиенты, и я готов хоть с утра до ночи стоять у плиты!',24015),
(40992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your skills are... impressive. If it matters at all, I would have taken no pleasure in killing you.$B$BLook, I\'m no fool - noone in their right mind would willingly choose death. I\'ve yet to see what the others clearly see in you, but hey -$B$BAt least I know you can fight.',21108),
(40994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, what can I do for you today $GMr.:Ms.; $n?',21021),
(40995,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hey, don\'t even mention it, pal. I\'m here for ya any time you need anything!$B$BSeriously though, don\'t mention it. There are some folks that would do anything to get their hands on this stuff.',21021),
(40996,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know nothin\' about nobody.$B$BOh, who I am I kidding, I know everything about everybody! How\'s it goin\', Shadow $n?',21021),
(40997,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ll make sure Vanessa gets to work right away while you\'re gone - she can be a bit... fiesty.',21021),
(41001,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надеюсь, что с этой победой в нашем противостоянии с нагами наконец наступил переломный момент.',24015),
(41002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have proven our worth to the new Warchief. Excellent work.$b$bTo vanquish the Legion, we will need the Horde\'s strength at our backs.',22594),
(41003,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Невероятно. С помощью этого самого посоха много веков назад император окутал Пандарию туманами!$b$bОбращайся с ним бережно, $n. Он не раз спасет тебе жизнь. А может, и не только тебе...',21287),
(41009,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У нас впереди много дел, $gохотник:охотница;. Но сначала, полагаю, тебе захочется узнать немного больше о том, кто я такая и зачем тебя разыскивала.',21287),
(41010,5,378,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что это ты мне $gпринес:принесла;? Нат сказал, чтобы ты $gпопросил:попросила; меня сделать удочку из этого?$b$b<Марсия забирает у вас отрезанную приманку. Когда она подносит ее к жемчужине, приманка и жемчужина начинают резонировать.>$b$bИнтересно. Кажется, эта штука как-то связана с жемчужиной. Может, если сделать из нее удочку, получится что-то удивительное...',24015),
(41015,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, there you are. Well, show me your priceless artifact you\'re waving like a cane from a souvenir shop!',21287),
(41017,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну разве не красота? Только тебе нужно сначала приспособиться использовать новые возможности своего оружия. А то от него будет толку не больше, чем от пылящихся в музее предметов старины.',21287),
(41018,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я рада снова видеть тебя! Алонсий решил перевести меня под твое начало. Теперь, когда нам больше не нужно таиться во тьме, я смогу восстановить связи с давними знакомыми. Надеюсь, я тебя не разочарую. Я умею сражаться и знаю толк в исцелении. И зови меня просто Калия – Лордерона-то больше нет.$b$bЖду не дождусь, когда мы вместе начнем спасать этот мир, кардинал!',21287),
(41019,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прекрасный выбор! Если что, я всегда окажу содействие в твоих персональных заданиях и на Расколотых островах. Не забудь поручить мне какое-нибудь дело!',21287),
(41028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надо признать, это впечатляет. Пожалуй, от тебя нам и правда будет какой-то толк.',21737),
(41030,273,0,0,0,1500,0,0,0,'Thank you, |3-6($c). It\'s a good thing they didn\'t fall into enemy hands. I think you can be trusted.',22810),
(41032,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! I feel their magic fade before my eyes. Soon I will be able to reunite with Talren!',24015),
(41033,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(41034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gобнаружил:обнаружила; в заливе морских великанов?!$B$BЭто ужасные новости! Нужно срочно сообщить Торил!',24015),
(41035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Каким же я был глупцом. Я возомнил, что смогу изгнать Катра\'натира раз и навсегда – а вместо этого повелитель ужаса вырвался на волю...$B$BЗа те годы, которые он провел в плену моего тела, он наверняка успел приобщиться и к моим знаниям – секретам Совета Тирисфаля. Мне страшно думать, что будет, если он воспользуется ими во зло.$B$BЕго нужно остановить.',21267),
(41036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'In former times, the Council of Tirisphalus summoned the Guards of Tirisphalus - the elite guardian magicians of Dalaran, if there was a need to fight back a powerful enemy in the absence of a Guardian. It is now clear that the Order of the Sentinels of Tirisphalus must be reborn to fight this new threat. And I will need your help in this. The first thing you\'ll need to do is figure out how to get into this room. I\'ll show you now.',21267),
(41037,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Fel Hammer is fully operational, Master $n.',20994),
(41038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Моя наставница пользовалась большим уважением. Свои знания она передала мне.$B$BВот только рецепта штормового меда у меня нет. Хоть она и хранила его как зеницу ока, он был украден до того, как она успела поделиться со мной этим секретом.',23360),
(41039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Помню, я видела эти записи в глубоком детстве, но тогда, естественно, ничего в них разобрать не могла.$B$BТеперь мне все более-менее понятно.$B$BДостать необходимое непросто, $n, но, думаю, мы справимся.',23360),
(41040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую тебя, $gвоитель:воительница;.$B$BЯ наблюдала за тобой.',23360),
(41047,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чудесно! Сила артефакта растет, это посеет настоящую панику в рядах демонов!',21287),
(41052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have come to save Azeroth, a goal I heartily approve. I am a simple traveler that has learned much over the years. Let us speak of the power of proving your valor.',21021),
(41053,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую тебя, $n. Для меня честь – помочь тебе усилить артефакт.',21287),
(41054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41056,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I pray it is not too late, friend.',22522),
(41059,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Чертоги Доблести и правда такие удивительные, как говорится в легендах? Впрочем, ладно. Самое главное – котел у нас. Теперь мы можем приступить к варке меда.',23360),
(41060,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(41062,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is my honor to serve, Master.',20994),
(41064,11,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Such power! The Legion\'s armies will fall before you in droves.',20994),
(41066,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We must not underestimate the Legion - I fear they are even more powerful than we realize.',20994),
(41067,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Kayn sighs.>$B$BI know that look, Master. I, too, gazed into the crucible and saw the horrors of the tomb.$B$BWe must act quickly.',20994),
(41069,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Agreed. You are as skilled a tactician as myself.',20994),
(41070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(41085,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мудрый выбор. $B$BЭтот артефакт очень поможет тебе в нашей охоте на Катра\'натира.',21267),
(41086,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Поразительно, Великий мастер! Вести о твоем успехе уже разлетелись повсюду. Если бы не ты, многие наши аванпосты на Расколотых островах пали бы.',23420),
(41087,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не знаю, как ты, Великий мастер, а я считаю, что все мы заслужили хороший отдых.',23420),
(41094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Aviana blesses you, and warmth spills over your body again. You have earned the respect of this ancient creature.',24015),
(41096,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(41097,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The Vorgos shard takes its place in the nest near the portal. Energy of Skvrna begins to flow around the fragment, and the air in the room seems to condense and heavy.',24015),
(41098,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< The Kozzak\'s shard stands in its place in the nest near the portal. You feel the vibrations of the dark energy of Square, which begins to concentrate around the portal.',24015),
(41099,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21287),
(41102,1,1,66,0,0,0,0,0,'With each day that passes I see more of Lord Illidan in you, Master $n. You have sacrificed more than any... and the war is far from over.$B$BWe may not see eye to eye at times, but I trust your capability to lead us to finish our mission - no matter the cost.$B$BNo Illidari in your command is as capable as I; if you ever require my skills just say the word and consider it done.',20994),
(41105,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Могучий клинок! Он был выкован врайкулами, зачарован эльфами и обагрен кровью К\'Траккси. Он хорошо послужит тебе, $p. С ним ты победишь нашего врага!',21287),
(41106,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41107,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent. This will be enough for my purposes.',0),
(41112,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41114,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41115,1,66,0,0,0,500,0,0,'It was an honor to fight with you at the peak of Serenity, $n. Your leadership qualities will greatly help us in the upcoming fight against the Legion. I would gladly fight for you further if you took; me as my protector. I think that my hopping skills would also be useful to the order.',23171),
(41119,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What of the others? Did they...?$B$BI see. They gave their lives for a worthy cause - the Twinblades will change the tide of this war, mark my words.',0),
(41120,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s get this done with. These bureaucrats already test my patience.',0),
(41121,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Suramar? That is only a short flight from here.',0),
(41123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21531),
(41124,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41138,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I guess I\'ll call you again.',21737),
(41139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ye found the key! Quickly, see if it fits...$B$BAye, that\'s the one! Ye did it!',0),
(41140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to finally be free from this dreadful cage. As thanks, I will keep my word to you and your grotesquely hairy friend.',0),
(41141,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21232),
(41143,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мрлгр рмлгрлмл! Мглргр гмгрлмрг, грмлгрмлр лрлгрмлр млргл. Мрлгр гмгрлмрг, Мргрглилгрл…',24015),
(41146,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21531),
(41148,1,0,0,0,100,0,0,0,'Теперь ты начинаешь понимать, что происходит. Я вижу это по твоему лицу. Это хорошо.',24015),
(41149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Saving comes alive and it\'s as if it\'s electrocuted you; but it\'s not strong. Kel\'danat must have put a lot of effort into creating a spell that would only scare away the dried ones, but wouldn\'t hurt them.',21531),
(41155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Though I\'ll admit I may not have been able to do this alone, I will not forget the transgressions that happened today.$B$BYou have what you came for, $C. I think it is time you were on your way.',0),
(41156,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Friend has the weapon? $B$BYes, Calydus can feel its power!',0),
(41157,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brann takes the fragments and begins reassembling them.>$B$BWell, ye definitely found more o\' the Titan Disc, but ye found something else too.$B$BHere, take a look at that!',0),
(41158,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m gettin\' closer to finding another piece of the titan relic, an\' I need yer keen eyes.',0),
(41159,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did ye run into any imps while ye were out diggen? Those blasted demons kept poppin\' up on me!$B$BAlright, if ye dinnae find the disc at any o\' those places, then there\'s but one place left ta look.',0),
(41160,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It would appear the earth trembled at YOUR power instead. Well done, champion.$B$BAs we agreed, here are your prizes in exchange for the cores.',0),
(41161,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m close, $n. I can feel it in me bones!',0),
(41162,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, that\'s all of \'em, lad. I\'ll just fix this up and we\'ll see what happens...',0),
(41163,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well that was a bit... eh... underwhelming. But hey, at least we got a piece o\' tha titan disc!',0),
(41164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There\'s demon stink all over this place. But there\'s also a lot of clues as to where a piece of the titan disc is!',0),
(41165,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m startin\' ta think you may be as good an archaeologist as I am. But don\'t let that go ta yer head, lad.$B$B<Brann lets out a chuckle and begins to study the artifacts you brought him.>$B$BAye, that\'s it! I know where the chamber is. And once I\'ve reassembled tha key, we\'re in business.',0),
(41166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A piece of the titan disc and a jar of blood. Well it\'s no wonder the elves locked this place up nice\'n tight.$B$BI\'ll take me disc piece and you can do whatever ye want with that blood.',0),
(41167,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Me equipment? Thanks, $n!$B$BYe know, it\'s a good thing ye\'re here. This place gives me tha willies!',0),
(41168,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Brann skims over the book you\'ve compiled.>$B$BSo where\'s the last chapter?',0),
(41169,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh ho! Ye found the missing chapter AND a piece of me titan disc?!$B$BThis truly is a day of celebration. I\'ll let ye have the book, and ye can tell me what \'appened at tha end of it.',0),
(41170,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After all that time, and we\'re still missing one piece!$B$BI swear the gods are workin\' against me on me quest, $n.$B$BOh well, back ta work! And here\'s a little somethin\' for all the hard work ye\'ve done fer me.',0),
(41171,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I ask for an archaeologist and they send an adventurer. Or perhaps you are both.$B$BEither way, let\'s get to work.',0),
(41172,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tae\'thelan listens to your recount of what you learned.>$B$BVery interesting. If what you\'ve said is true, then I believe I know where the location of the artifact is.',0),
(41173,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see what you\'ve found.$B$B<Tae\'thelan studies the artifact for some time and lets out a sigh.>$B$BUseless. It\'s nothing more than a star field generator. Probably from some academy before the war.$B$BYou can have it back, $n. I have no use for it.',0),
(41174,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, good to see you.$B$BI was hoping that the elves here would be a bit more... willing to let us inspect their artifacts, but such is not the case.$B$BAnd that\'s where you come in.',0),
(41175,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You found it?$B$B<Tae\'thelan listens as you explain about the missing jewels.>$B$BI see. So the crown was just a vessel and the jewels are the true source of power.',0),
(41176,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tae\'thelan takes the jewels from you and looks them over closely.>$B$BThere may have been power in them once, but it\'s been all but drained. These are just pretty jewels now.$B$BHere, take them. Consider them payment for your services here.',0),
(41177,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re really on time. I just want to test a new method I\'ve been working on lately.',22908),
(41178,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ну что, все прошло успешно? Это просто прекрасные новости!$b$bТеперь наш прогресс ускорится десятикратно!',22908),
(41179,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'< In a small chest you found a box with a raven\'s head engraved on it. >',22908),
(41180,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is an exciting time, $n. And you\'re going to get a front row seat to the show.',0),
(41181,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve found the location? Then we must make haste.$B$BLet\'s go, $n.',0),
(41182,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'NO! How did we fail? We were so close.$B$BThe explosives were too powerful. Those damned goblins ruined everything!$B$BNow only a handful of shards of what was once an object of unimaginable power remain.$B$BTake whichever one you want, $n. I\'d like to keep the rest to study.',0),
(41183,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hello, $n. I\'m glad you came.$B$BI\'ve found something that may serve both of our interests.',0),
(41184,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I believe that\'s all of them.$B$B<Tae\'thelan carefully reconstructs the mold.>$B$BAnd now we just need to forge a new set of keys.',0),
(41185,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is not a true key, but rather a device to provide access to the Nar\'thalas Academy.$B$BThe academy was once a great location of knowledge for night elves to learn the arcane magics, but has long since long been destroyed.$B$BThe key is useless junk. You can keep it.',0),
(41186,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Good to see you, $n. I hope you\'re as interested about the tauren here as I am.',0),
(41187,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, $n. Now perhaps you can help me with my research.',0),
(41188,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это... не оружие Хална. Это больше похоже на копье Рету, древнего таурена-шахтера.$b$bЭтот артефакт мне ни к чему, $n. Можешь взять его себе.',22624),
(41189,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, it was a lot more complicated than I thought it would be. Look, uh...',22124),
(41190,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lessah listens to your recounting of the stories you discovered.>$B$BIf what you\'ve said is true then that means that the piece I\'m looking for is the necklace that Huln once wore.',0),
(41191,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Lessah examines the necklace.>$B$BHow can this be?! All my research suggested that this belonged to Huln.$B$BI\'m sorry, $n, but this necklace is a creation of the drogbar. I\'ll give it back to you to do with it what you want.',0),
(41192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, I\'ve found an actual piece of something very close to Huln$B$BI believe that this is the very bone of Eche\'ro, Huln Highmountain\'s animal companion!',0),
(41193,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What an honor, $n. To think that Eche\'ro\'s spirit will come to your aid should you need it... that is a great reward indeed.$B$BAnd for me, to witness the majesty of Huln himself! I shall continue to study him, and the glorious legacy he left behind.',0),
(41197,273,0,0,0,50,0,0,0,'Они так рады оказаться дома. Великолепно.',22810),
(41206,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, miner. This leystone shall not be wasted.',0),
(41207,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you very much, |3-6($c). I will find a worthy use for this force stone.',22260),
(41214,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Angus wipes away a tear as he speaks.>$B$BBrambley, lad... I promise ye\'ll have tha\' best burial money can buy! An\' all the ale ye can drink...',0),
(41215,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That\'s great. If they don\'t treat the art of hunting with due respect, let them know their place.',22908),
(41216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I could hear their cries and see the carnage from here! That will teach the Nightborne to enslave creatures. Have they fallen so far during all those years under the shield?',0),
(41217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'For a $R who has spent so much time inside Gnomeregan, you look positively fit and healthy, $n. That\'s good. Before we can complete what Operation: Gnomeregan began, we\'re going to need more hunters like you.',0),
(41218,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to meet you, $n. You\'ve probably heard others speaking of Operation: Gnomeregan. Let me tell you a bit about what happened and why we left the dwarven city of Ironforge.',0),
(41220,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As I suspected, the Illidari are holding the line against the Burning Legion, but just barely.\n\nWe must come to their aid, $n.',22522),
(41221,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This citadel was one of the Legion\'s most valuable assets - it will serve us well.',20994),
(41222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It canna\' be true!$B$BBrambley... my dear ol\' friend! Why did ye have to go an\' die?',0),
(41223,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you very much, herbalist. This flower will not be wasted.',0),
(41224,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, $C. This foxflower shall not be wasted.',0),
(41230,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Какие интересные устройства. Они похожи на капканы наших охотников, но при этом могут сами приманивать к себе зверей, которые проходят неподалеку.',22908),
(41231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I saw everything from out here. That was... messy.',0),
(41235,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Many thanks, skinner. This leather shall not be wasted.',0),
(41237,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you very much, |3-6($c). I will find a decent use for this skin.',24015),
(41240,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you very much, fisherman. That salmon doesn\'t go to waste.',21287),
(41255,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Времени у нас в обрез.',21267),
(41256,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Manatrout was completely fished out of our harbors. Since the shield was raised all we have had of the liquor is memories on our palates.',0),
(41258,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Victory tastes sweeter than any dish, even one of mine.',0),
(41267,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for assisting us, fisherman. We needed this queenfish badly.',0),
(41272,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, fisherman. I can take these perch off of your hands. Your gift will be put to good use.',0),
(41277,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты как нельзя более кстати, |3-6($r)-$gрыбак:рыбачка;! Валарьяры благодарны тебе за этих штормовых скатов.',23222),
(41282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You couldn\'t have arrived at a better time, fisherman. Our people were running short on supplies.',0),
(41287,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for assisting us, herbalist. We needed this aethril badly.',0),
(41288,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, |3-6($c). We really needed that aytril.',23911),
(41292,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, herbalist. I can take this dreamleaf off of your hands. Your gift will be put to good use.',0),
(41293,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',24015),
(41297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R herbalist. The Valarjar thank you for bringing this fjarnskaggl.',0),
(41298,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R $C. The Valarjar thank you for bringing this fjarnskaggl.',0),
(41302,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You couldn\'t have arrived at a better time, herbalist. Our people were running short on supplies.',0),
(41303,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты как нельзя более кстати, |3-6($c). У нас почти кончились припасы.',23911),
(41307,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21531),
(41309,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It\'s good to see a friendly face, I don\'t know how much longer I could have held out on my own!',0),
(41311,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for assisting us, miner. We needed this leystone badly.',0),
(41312,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, miner. I can take this leystone off of your hands. Your gift will be put to good use.',0),
(41313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well met, $R miner. The Valarjar thank you for bringing this leystone.',0),
(41314,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты как нельзя более кстати, шахтер. У нас почти кончились припасы.',24015),
(41315,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',24015),
(41316,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надо же, |3-6($r)-|3-6($c), какая приятная встреча. Валарьяры благодарны тебе за этот силовой камень.',23420),
(41317,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надо же, |3-6($r)-|3-6($c), какая приятная встреча. Валарьяры благодарны тебе за этот силовой камень.',23420),
(41318,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Надо же, |3-6($r)-|3-6($c), какая приятная встреча. Валарьяры благодарны тебе за этот Сланец Скверны .',23420),
(41320,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',21531),
(41326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for assisting us, skinner. We needed these stormscales badly.',0),
(41327,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help, |3-6($c). We really needed that storm scale.',24015),
(41332,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Прими мои поздравления, $ct $n.$b$bМы очень рассчитываем на твою помощь в самом ближайшем будущем.',21267),
(41335,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Worthy choice. Let\'s not waste time, let\'s start the search now!',21287),
(41338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hail, skinner. I can take this leather off of your hands. Your gift will be put to good use.',0),
