(44156,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы должны найти решение. Время на исходе.',24015),
(44159,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Come on, $n, choose.',23420),
(44161,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, at least we\'re going to have some fresh faces around here. If a broken\'s face can ever be called fresh, that is.$B$B<Kor\'vas smirks.>',0),
(44164,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n, you $gCame back, came back! You\'re still surrounded by an otherworldly aura.',23877),
(44166,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n, you have returned. An otherworldly air hangs heavy about you.',0),
