(47129,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to overcome the Tomb of Sargeras?',0),
(47134,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you\'ve done all you can, $n, but in this round, victory is for the demons. Ralgar will soon gather his strength to attack us. But while you were away, I managed to find out what the secret of his immortality lies in!',25549),
(47137,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь у нас есть еще один сильный союзник.$b$bТебе в очередной раз удалось повысить наши шансы в борьбе с Легионом, $n.',24015),
(47139,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even the most powerful demons from Cerberax fell before you. $B$bExcellent. The Legion will be expelled from our world, no matter what it costs us.',23937),
(47148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Even I didn\'t see that coming.',0),
(47180,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я чувствую, что влияние Бездны отступает. Возможно, теперь мы узнаем, что здесь случилось.',25549),
(47182,603,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25549),
(47183,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мне следовало это предвидеть.',25549),
(47184,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeah, you can’t expect good from the Abyss. We need to move on.',25549),
(47202,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Velen listens carefully when you talk about King Andrew\'s plans. >\r\n\r\nA cleaved shore is a dangerous place... Too dangerous to go there alone. But perhaps it\'s the only way the Anduin can find peace in his soul.\r\n\r\nWhen the time comes, I will inform King Sedogriv of the departure of the Andoine. And you go to the Cracked Shore with him and take care of his safety.',23877),
(47203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Alleria seems to have lost its voice for a moment. >',25549),
(47217,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы выигрываем время – но не более того.',25549),
(47218,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отрадно сознавать, что мы с тобой преследуем общие цели. Возможно, твои сородичи смогут быть мне полезны.',25549),
(47219,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Allergy takes the heart in hand. >$b$bThis is our next move, $n. Thank you for $gHelping: Helping; I\'ve had it all this time.',25549),
(47220,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что это у тебя, $n?$b$b<Велен всматривается в холодный плотный предмет.>$b$bИнтересно...',25549),
(47221,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо, что ты тоже отправляешься на Аргус. Впереди нас ждет немало сражений.',26365),
(47222,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the Light keep us all this day.',26365),
(47223,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хвала Свету, ты здесь.',25549),
(47224,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It took me a long time to wait for this glorious day. $B$BBefore you \"Vindicar\", the greatest achievement of drainage!',25549),
(47238,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ужасные новости. Что ж, значит, будем действовать по плану Аллерии.',25549),
(47251,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re here. You must have received my letter.',0),
(47252,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you\'re here. You must have received my letter.',0),
(47253,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us use this moment to reflect upon the past, lest we forget the lessons it teaches us, and doom ourselves to repeat it once more.',0),
(47254,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let us use this moment to reflect upon the past, lest we forget the lessons it teaches us, and doom ourselves to repeat it once more.',0),
(47287,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь ты в любое время можешь воспользоваться коммуникатором, чтобы обрушить на своих врагов мощь \"Правосудия Света\". $b$bВозможно, в твоих странствиях тебе попадутся и другие объекты, которые мы сможем подключить к матрице. Я выделил для этой части ядра достаточно энергии для любого подключаемого модуля. $b$bДа не оставит тебя удача!',25549),
(47330,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This warning is an ill omen indeed, $n. It seems the fate of Azeroth is tied to that of Argus, the homeworld of the Legion.$B$BWe must uncover the Dark Titan\'s plan! I believe the Speaker\'s connection to the world soul will prove crucial to our efforts.$B$BStay vigilant, Huntmaster. We must trust in Magni\'s guidance... and Azeroth\'s as well.',0),
(47416,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я очень беспокоился за Л\'уру, но это... это просто немыслимо.$b$bСколько же ей пришлось пережить...',25549),
(47430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Macau is pleased that you have learned a lot. >',28153),
(47431,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Нам удалось закрепиться. Очень хорошо.$b$bТеперь пора переходить в контратаку!',25549),
(47473,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Turalion, frowning, listens to you. >',25549),
(47508,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Просто так мы им небо не отдадим!',25549),
(47523,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this, $n?$B$B$B$B$B$BThese are the plans for the raid on Mardum, were we too late?$B$BWhat\'s strange, is the new plan seems better than the original! It\'s unlikely this is the Legion\'s doing, Illidan surely would have detected any fel manipulation. So if not the Legion, who is behind this?',0),
(47526,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The panel shimmers with a soft golden light. According to Romulus, after its activation, the gun will be teleported to Vindicar.>',25549),
(47541,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gсражался:сражалась; достойно. Благодаря тебе Свет засиял ярче.',25549),
(47543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That didn\'t go so great, did it? Maybe next time.',0),
(47545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I guess we have plenty of leads to follow up on.$B$BWow, whoever wants to kill me really thought this through!',0),
(47550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fifteen minutes isn\'t a whole lot of time. We\'re going to have to move quickly.',0),
(47554,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Скара и Брей отдали свои жизни ради того, чтобы эта информация и дешифратор оказались у нас. Их жертва не будет забыта.$b$bА теперь давай прочтем эти приказы и узнаем, что затевает Легион...',25549),
(47557,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yeeeeeowch! It\'s hot! What could it possibly... oh, yeah, that makes sense.',0),
(47558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A chronoshard, you say? I know what to do with those.',0),
(47559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hand over that chronoshard, $n. If you don\'t mind.',0),
(47560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I hate when they get all chilly like this.',0),
(47589,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We may still have a chance.',25549),
(47591,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'See, I told ya it be a great idea!',0),
(47592,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ooh, ooh, lemme see!',0),
(47594,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dis be da best day. I\'m going ta fleece dat Baron so hard his eyes be covered in more wool than a flock of sheep.',0),
(47595,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Be you sure ya wanna do dis? I got other wares that be much more interestin\' and next week I be needin\' more of these.',0),
(47603,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You really don\'t see it? I can sense the magic in their pockets!',0),
(47604,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic, simply fantastic. This will be a profitable partnership, my puny associate.',0),
(47605,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I entrust you with my lamp. May our partnership be fruitful.',0),
(47606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes, yes, YES! Do you see the power radiating from the lamp? I can sense objects of great power that were concealed even from my mighty eyes.',0),
(47607,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve done it! My lamp has never shone brighter. I shall continue to grant you coins, but I shall have to find new uses for the magic you provide.',0),
(47627,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кажется, мы недооценили коварство Легиона.',25549),
(47641,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Похоже, это то, что нам нужно.',25549),
(47642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I think this is the spot.',0),
(47643,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Based on the clues the ancients gave us, this must be the spot. It HAS to be!$B$BLet\'s do this, $n!',0),
(47644,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m not a big fan of dreadlords, but I think you and I can handle one if we stick together. You ready, $n?',0),
(47645,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I sense something... bad.',0),
(47652,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хвала Свету! Нынче был темный день, и мы потеряли очень многих. $b$bНо Армия все еще жива, и пророчество Матери Света будет исполнено.$b$bВсе идет, как должно.',25549),
(47653,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The army has survived. The prophecy of the Mother of Light will be fulfilled.$b$bEverything is going as it should.',25549),
(47654,2,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Свершилось. Мое сердце скорбит по Л\'уре, но, по крайней мере, она обрела покой.$b$bКак только корона будет на месте, \"Виндикар\" начнет контрнаступление. Анторус должен пасть!',25549),
(47663,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, is it time?',0),
(47685,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О! У тебя получилось.$b$bУдивительно.',25549),
(47686,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это место таит немало секретов. По счастью, мне ведомы многие из них, так что нам не придется действовать вслепую.',25549),
(47687,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I have to admit, I\'m impressed.',25549),
(47688,274,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Не думала, что эта субстанция окажется настолько... липкой.$b$b<И\'мера вытирает руки об одежду.>$b$bСгодится.',25549),
(47689,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you can hold out long enough, perhaps you\'re really worthy; learn the secrets of the Conservatory.',25549),
(47690,273,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Никогда еще мне не доводилось ощущать такую силу...$b$b<И\'мера осторожно вертит осколок в руках.>$b$bНужно как можно скорее показать Печать Велену.',25549),
(47691,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты $gзастал:застала; меня в час раздумий.$b$b<Велен смотрит на вас усталыми глазами.>$b$bНо сейчас не время для сантиментов. Нужно двигаться дальше.',25549),
(47709,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'One small step for $n, one giant leap for gnomekind!',0),
(47725,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the remnants of this seal, we can dispel the wards and enter my sanctum.',0),
(47726,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the remnants of this seal, we can dispel the wards and enter my sanctum.',0),
(47727,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With the remnants of this seal, we can dispel the wards and enter my sanctum.',0),
(47743,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кто бы мог подумать, что Зе\'ра сделает подобное... И реакция Иллидана была неожиданной.$b$bМы должны позаботиться о том, чтобы это не сломило боевой дух наших союзников.',25549),
(47744,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The smoke and the meat are for me. The flowers, on the other hand, are for the kids at the orphanage down the street.',0),
(47745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are from Emery, I assume?$B$B<Meliana blushes.>$B$BThat dummy. Gotta admire his persistence, though...',0),
(47746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t know how long we\'ll need to stay holed up in the orphanage, but there\'s no way I\'m letting the kids out while our prince walks the streets like some sort of madman.',0),
(47747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This\'ll do, $C.$B$BTake this key. You\'ve earned it.',0),
(47750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'From the kids, you say?$B$B<Emery struggles to conceal a smile as he pockets the jerky.>',0),
(47754,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично. Путь расчищен.',25549),
(47771,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мы здесь как между молотом и наковальней.',25549),
(47772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Now hurry along... if I remember this correctly, you don\'t have much time left!',0),
(47773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You did it! Now hurry along... if I remember this correctly, you don\'t have much time left!',0),
(47790,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',24742),
(47791,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Maddening! I am no closer to a breakthrough on this matter. Such a failure is unacceptable!$B$B<Vridiel breathes deeply and composes himself.>$B$BThank you, $n. I must not let this setback deter me from further attempts. Please, take this. You will no doubt find a use for it.',0),
(47793,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',24742),
(47807,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It was a dreadlord? That\'s... unusual. I mean, I know we\'re in Northrend and everything, so risen skeletons aren\'t all that rare, but demons?$B$BOh well! Thanks for taking the time to calm my worries.',0),
(47808,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have my thanks, $R.$B$BI know that you are here today in service to the Bronze Dragonflight. Perhaps this gift will aid you in your journeys.',0),
(47809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your assistance is appreciated.',0),
(47810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With your assistance, the ancients have fallen back into their restful slumber. Thank you, $R.',0),
(47835,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Мои предчувствия меня не подвели – тебя тоже призвали на эту битву. Для меня будет честью сражаться рядом с тобой.',25549),
(47851,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A simple exchange with complex results. That\'s the art of doing business.',0),
(47853,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Velen is silently staring at the broken statue. >',25549),
(47854,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я уже давно усвоил: Легион никогда не отступается от своего. У нас нет другого выбора, кроме как сражаться до последнего.$b$bДля меня было честью биться с тобой плечом к плечу.',25549),
(47855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Prophet Valen is looking at you seriously. >$b$bThank you.',25549),
(47856,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Итак, свершилось. Хотя бы одну ошибку моего прошлого нам удалось исправить.',25549),
(47864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A simple exchange with complex results. That\'s the art of doing business.',0),
(47865,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A simple exchange with complex results. That\'s the art of doing business.',0),
(47867,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May the Light keep us all this day.',25549),
(47882,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Очень хорошо. Проводники снова работают в штатном режиме.$b$bА вот пробудить голема оказалось сложнее, чем я предполагала.',25549),
(47883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приготовься, $gнезнакомец:незнакомка;.',25549),
(47889,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что $gпришел, дружище:пришла, подруга;. Я хочу тебе кое-что показать.',25549),
(47890,661,661,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Уж не знаю, как Саргерас умудрился воскресить Агграмара, но это не сулит нам ничего хорошего, уж поверь мне.',25549),
(47891,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Что тебе показал Магни?',25549),
(47892,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If we delay, the demons based here will easily defeat us.',25549),
(47895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m going to have to go back to the drawing board!',0),
(47904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve stopped all four attacks from the dragonshrines - but the timelines are still incorrect. I\'m still being assassinated, elsewhere, at the same time.$B$BLooks like our work isn\'t done yet, $n!',0),
(47906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'ve done it! The timelines are exactly as they\'re supposed to be again. With me, alive.',0),
(47967,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'С этими скакунами у наших бойцов будет хоть какой-то шанс.',25549),
(47986,113,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Спасибо тебе, $n.',25549),
(47987,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, $n. Ты $gлишил:лишила; Легион дополнительного источника силы и $gдаровал:даровала; мертвым заслуженный покой.',25549),
(47988,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Теперь, когда их силы в смятении, можно двигаться дальше.',25549),
(47989,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Impressive. Now that we\'ve gotten rid of the shivars, our chances are much better.',25549),
(47990,71,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yes! What you need!',25549),
(47991,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Конечно, это не решающая победа, но без шпилей их крепость рано или поздно падет.',25549),
(47992,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично! Теперь осталось только покончить с командиром.',25549),
(47993,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Свет милостивый...',25549),
(47994,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Испытания прошли успешно. Теперь я прикажу нашим механологам наполнить экзоскелет энергией, и тогда ты сможешь вызывать его на поле боя при необходимости. Только не забудь выбрать его в ядре матрицы.',25549),
(47995,396,273,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Pharaoh\'s fighters are the best in the entire Army of Light. If they fight with us, our chances of success will be greatly improved.',25549),
(48002,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve found some! These will certainly be enough to get us by for a good while longer.$B$BAs promised, here is a recipe for one of the potions I brew to help in our fight against the Legion.',0),
(48013,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re an honorable ally, $n. Thank you for helping us.$B$BAs promised, here is the recipe for the potion.',0),
(48016,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'And there you have it! I believe this will be far more useful for you in your fight against the Legion.$B$BAllow me to explain how it\'s done...',0),
(48021,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Despite her troubles, this has been a welcome reminder that, although our battle with the Legion remains at the forefront of our concerns, the rest of the world does not simply wait for us.',0),
(48027,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you were trying to gather astral glory I see. Yes, there is a method to doing it correctly.$B$BThe flower has a power to it, allowing it to protect itself from anything it thinks may seek to destroy it. If it feels truly threatened, it extinguishes itself.$B$BYou mustn\'t try to pick it with intent to harm, but to protect. It\'s an unfortunate irony as we eventually destroy it in the process of making items with it.$B$BHowever, this deception is necessary for it to yield itself to you.',0),
(48028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Indeed, the newer blooms are particularly stubborn and would rather give up their life than live in servitude to those who pick them.$B$BTo handle the herb in this form, one must coax the herb into submitting, as it can\'t quite fully read the intentions of those who wish to gather it.',0),
(48029,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see the glory has come to trust you fully. It is now exposing its heart to you.$B$BFocus your intentions here and you will gather it in its entirety.',0),
(48034,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Залог продуктивной добычи эмпиреитовой руды – высокая точность при ударе киркой. Целься в самые яркие куски – они же обычно самые мелкие.$b$bЕсли несколько раз попадешь удачно, сможешь расколоть камень быстрее, а значит, добудешь больше руды.',25549),
(48035,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As I mentioned before, precision is key with mining empyrium. You\'ve learned to strike at the correct spots, now you must learn to strike at the correct angle.$B$BTake out your pick and I\'ll show you what I mean...',0),
(48036,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve learned where to strike and at what angle to strike, but should you wish to leave the core intact to mine, you must finally learn how hard to strike.$B$BThe fractures you found in this core are the result of striking the ore too hard. As I\'m sure you no doubt know by now, mining empyrium is not just a task, but an art.$B$BCome, let us practice your swing until it\'s just right.',0),
(48037,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Empyrium is quite a sight to behold once it\'s been mined. And while the deposits of this ore require precision, the seams require exposure.$B$BIf you spend some time picking away the surrounding rock, you\'ll find much more ore to harvest.',0),
(48038,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Empyrium seams can be tricky in that regard. The ore is very good at interweaving itself into the surrounding elements.$B$BI\'ve found that striking those areas with the shaft of the pick loosens the empyrium\'s grip on it, so that when you pick at it, the rock should just fall away.',0),
(48039,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Much like the deposit, empyrium requires a balanced extraction. Its core is its most fragile section.$B$BIf you swing too hard, it breaks, too soft and you\'ll be there forever. The same is true for loosening it from its surrounding rock.$B$BHere, let me show you a method which balances both.',0),
(48040,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If you haven\'t already guessed, the key to skinning these creatures properly is speed. They\'re born of foul energies and those spill out once you begin to cut into the corpse.$B$BI would suggest training your hand to become faster at removing the hide.',0),
(48041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you\'ve become faster, but you\'re still thinking in your old ways.$B$BInstead of cutting away small pieces at a time, try making one large cut and removing as much of the hide in as few cuts as possible. Move away from the corpse and begin cutting the large pieces into smaller, usable pieces.',0),
(48042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So it\'s just more teeth and claws you\'re after? This should be simple to explain then.$B$BThe teeth receive the greatest exposure to the creature\'s foul insides, so removing them first will still give you time to dissect the rest of the beast. Next, remove the hide. And lastly the claws, as those take the longest to take on any corruption.',0),
(48053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Whaddya got for me?$B$BMore felslate, fantastic! This stuff weighs a ton, and is perfect for anchors.$B$BI see you have the arms of a blacksmith. Perhaps you\'d like ta have a hand at making a few anchors as well, eh?',0),
(48054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'More felslate, fantastic! This stuff weighs a ton, and is perfect for anchors.$B$BI see you have the arms of a blacksmith. Perhaps you\'d like to have a hand at making a few anchors as well, eh?',0),
(48055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is quality work. It appears you even solved an issue I was having with the spacing between the front and back chest plates.$B$BYou wouldn\'t mind if I kept this, would you? A fair trade for the recipe, yes?',0),
(48056,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'That last jump looked about what I had in mind for how the gravity was gonna be.$B$B<Hobart scribbles some notes on the schematic.>$B$BAnd there ya have it. They\'ll only last ya a few minutes before they\'re spent, so use \'em wisely.',0),
(48065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, this is great stuff. That\'s some landscape up there! Let me just get this information written down...$B$B<Didi begins to scribble some notes on some blueprint paper.>$B$BThat should do it. As with all generators, you\'ll need to use local materials for it, so whatever you can find on that planet should work.',0),
(48066,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome, $n.$b$bMila referred to you as $ga reliable ally:a reliable ally... Your presence will surely convince her that Krutogoryu will be profitable to unite with the Horde.',26654),
(48067,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The ancient gods usually try to act surreptitiously; their main weapon is cunning and duplicity. And then there\'s this desperate attack... $b$bApparently, they really need something, and they want it at any cost.',26654),
(48069,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'$n, you came at the perfect time. I just finished creating this Ionized Geographical Recorder.$B$BNow, here\'s how you\'re gonna use it...',0),
(48074,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have no idea the time you\'ve just saved me, $n. You have my utmost gratitude.$B$BAnd as promised, here is my most coveted design.',0),
(48075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My book! And it doesn\'t appear to be damaged either, thank the Light.$B$BLook here, $n.$B$B$B$BHere are the designs for turning those gems into accessories of power.',0),
(48076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. Now, onto the different combinations...',0),
(48078,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'An interesting balance, but necessary. You may keep the oil, I have plenty.$B$BOh, and now that you know how to purify the leather, let me show you how to use it. Here are some shoulder patterns my allies ask for regularly.',0),
(48079,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Смоляной Рог говорил о древних идолах в Крутогорье, за которыми нужен постоянный присмотр. Эти идолы сдерживают великую тьму.$b$bВозможно, это как-то связано с той злой силой, которая терзает его сейчас.$b$bБудем надеяться, что духостранник Серое Небо знает об этом больше.',26654),
(48081,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Velena\'s gaze is chained to the ruins that lie before him. >$b$bI\'m home.',25549),
(48107,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Подумать только, мы уже почти у цели! Скоро мы восстановим корону Триумвирата.',25549),
(48185,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Следующий идол где-то совсем рядом. Я это чувствую.',26654),
(48190,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты чувствуешь это, $n? Какая сила... какая доблесть.$b$bДух Хална Крутогора до сих пор с нами, и он повсюду.',26654),
(48199,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я и представить не мог масштабы разрушения... Какая ужасная трагедия...',25549),
(48200,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошо. Отсюда мы сможем оперативно отправлять подкрепление в любой из наших лагерей.',25549),
(48201,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'У нас есть плацдарм. По крайней мере, пока.$b$bНе знаю, долго ли он продержится под атакой.',25549),
(48202,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Столько демонов. Столько работы.',25549),
(48203,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'After so many years... so many sacrifices... victory is finally within our grasp.',0),
(48230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Pharia studies the crystal fragment. >\r\n\r\nIt\'s old... Very old. It\'s part of a complex key - one of those that my people lock up everything of great value.\r\n\r\nIt\'s interesting...',0),
(48231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The armor of the Triumvirate! I never thought I\'d see him again. It is a reminder of our glorious past that cannot be overshadowed by the Legion\'s vile acts.\r\n\r\nGaal has told me what a great help you are giving us, Righrash. You deserve the honor of wearing this armor. Let it illuminate your path in these dark times.',0),
(48261,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да. Этого дендрита мне вполне хватит, чтобы восстановить ключ.',0),
(48271,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Супер, |3-6(Повелительница Пустоты). У этих эфириалов не было против тебя ни единого шанса.\r\n\r\nТеперь, когда у нас есть все фрагменты, я могу приступить к делу.',0),
(48272,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Пантеон мертв много тысяч лет... Боюсь, что этот план разрабатывается уже очень давно...',25549),
(48273,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что $gпришел, дружище:пришла, подруга;. Тебе непременно нужно это увидеть.',25549),
(48277,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты очень вовремя.',25549),
(48280,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сеть порталов Легиона в сердце Анторуса даст ответы на все наши вопросы.',25549),
(48288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Did you triumph in Antorus?',0),
