(48639,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Army of the Light thanks you.',0),
(48641,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Armies of Legionfall thank you, mate.',0),
(48642,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Argussian Reach thank you.',0),
(48654,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(48668,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This beacon will be added to the Navigation Console.$B$BA contingent of the Army of the Light will remain to hold this location for future use.',0),
(48799,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Хорошее начало, $gгерой:воительница;. Наверняка там его много.',25549),
(48803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Получилось! Руки-то – они помнят!\r\n\r\nДержи, $n. Как новенький.',0),
(48864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рад, что у Фарии все хорошо.\r\n\r\nСовершенно верно... Это фрагмент ключа от арсенала, который я выковал для нее в ту давнюю пору.',0),
(48910,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25549),
(48911,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(48912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25996),
(48929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Turalyon listens in grim silence.>',0),
(48954,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Champion, you have returned... and not a moment too soon.$B$BThe object you hold in your hands is but one of many mysteries unfolding before us.',0),
(48962,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Former elves of blood want to help the Alliance. It exceeds my wildest expectations.',26822),
(48973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $n.$B$BLong have we awaited this day. Argus was all but lost, its true denizens forced to remain hidden lest we perish. Your efforts on our behalf have allowed us to once again live free from fear. Please accept these trophies as a symbol of our gratitude.',0),
(48974,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Krona ki cristorr, champion!$B$BYour presence among the Army of the Light has been a singular boon to our cause. Gratitude is not all that we may offer. Please accept these trophies as a tribute to your unwavering support.$B$BTogether we will bring about the Legion\'s end.',0),
(48976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Highlord, thanks to your efforts, our forces have been able to secure additional resources from the battlefield.$B$BThe more you continue to dominate the battlefield the more resources our forces can spare.',0),
(48977,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Archenon poros, champion.$B$BThe Army of the Light wishes to thank you for your aid against the Legion\'s forces on Argus.$B$BPlease accept these supplies with our gratitude. Your continued support brings us ever closer to our ultimate goal of eradicating the Legion once and for all.',0),
(49014,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'После стольких лет... стольких жертв... наконец-то мы в шаге от победы.',25549),
(49015,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(49032,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magnificent work!$B$BOnce these runes are integrated into our shielding matrix, the Vindicaar will be able to bypass the Burning Throne\'s defenses and strike directly at the felworks.',0),
(49075,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magnificent work!$B$BOnce these runes are integrated into our shielding matrix, the Vindicaar will be able to bypass the Burning Throne\'s defenses and strike directly at the felworks.',0),
(49076,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Magnificent work!$B$BOnce these runes are integrated into our shielding matrix, the Vindicaar will be able to bypass the Burning Throne\'s defenses and strike directly at the felworks.',0),
(49077,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(49133,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With these sigils, the Vindicaar can bypass the Burning Throne\'s defenses.$B$BThe time has come to press our advantage and end this war.',0),
(49134,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With these sigils, the Vindicaar can bypass the Burning Throne\'s defenses.$B$BThe time has come to press our advantage and end this war.',0),
(49135,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With these sigils, the Vindicaar can bypass the Burning Throne\'s defenses.$B$BThe time has come to press our advantage and end this war.',0),
(49143,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О да, я чувствую силу Света в этих крупицах. Не теряй надежду, $n!',25549),
(49224,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'По мере того как твое оружие набирает силу, мы сможем наделить его еще большей мощью, но пока и этого более чем достаточно.',25549),
(49266,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Т\'паартос... полон рвения. Он жаждет творить добро, а ярости, с которой пылает огонь в его сердце, могут позавидовать многие даже среди озаренных. Спасибо, что $gуберег:уберегла:r; его, |3-6($r).',26822),
(49293,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наша победа над Легионом уже близка.',25549),
(49354,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это было несколько неожиданно.',26654),
(49445,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты ведь знаешь, что изначальный саргерит – невероятно ценный материал, который придает огромную силу предметам. В войне с Легионом нам понадобится любое преимущество.$b$bПринеси столько изначального саргерита, сколько сможешь, и я буду рад его у тебя купить.',25549),
(49472,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25549),
(49473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Take this. May it aid your efforts to stop the Legion... and to save our world.',0),
(49474,396,396,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25549),
(49532,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to the battlefield, grunt!',0),
(49533,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n, you have arrived!$B$BLet\'s get to work.',0),
(49534,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Death and acts of sacrilege pervert this land.$B$B<Lantinga lets out a drawn-out sigh.>$B$BThankfully, we\'re here to stop it.',0),
(49535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you\'re here, $R. Hemet has not been heard from for quite some time, and I could really use your help finding him.',0),
(49536,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yo! Do I have an explosive proposition for you, pal....',0),
(49537,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Warsong Offensive is ready to strike at the heart of the Scourge, $C. Are you up to the challenge?',0),
(49538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar ogar, $n. You\'ve arrived not a moment too soon....',0),
(49539,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You seem like someone who needs some excitement in their life. Excitement... and beer!',0),
(49540,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What the dook is going on here, $R?!$B$BWhy are pandaren so sad?!',0),
(49541,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Traveling to Kun-Lai? Right this way, wanderer, right this way!',0),
(49542,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Townlong Steppes, outsider.$B$BIf you insist on wandering in to the darkest places of Pandaria then far be it from me to not put you to good use.',0),
(49543,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),
(49545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad to see you are well after Tanaan Jungle.$B$BWe have much to do.',0),
(49546,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Gorgrond is no place for armies. We are now stepping into the domain of legends.',0),
(49547,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you, Commander $n. I require your advisement.',0),
(49548,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Azik looks you up and down.>$B$BAzik is betting you are someone of importance to your people.$B$BCome closer, friend. Azik could use your help.',0),
(49549,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They came at us... from... nowhere.$B$B<The stone guard nearly passes out.>',0),
(49550,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re gettin\' hammered out here, lad.$B$BI hope you\'re here to help.',0),
(49551,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is it?!$B$BCan\'t you see I\'m already busy trying to get this port ready, $R?',0),
(49552,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Death and acts of sacrilege pervert this land.$B$B<Lantinga lets out a drawn-out sigh.>$B$BThankfully, we\'re here to stop it.',0),
(49553,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am glad you\'re here, $R. Hemet has not been heard from for quite some time, and I could really use your help finding him.',0),
(49554,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yo! Do I have an explosive proposition for you, pal....',0),
(49555,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Valiance Expedition is ready to strike at the heart of the Scourge, $C. Are you up to the challenge?',0),
(49556,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our role is of utmost importance, $n.$B$BAdmiral Taylor and his flagship have gone missing.... More importantly, the young Prince was with him, and it is our primary objective to bring him back home safely.',0),
(49557,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You seem like someone who needs some excitement in their life. Excitement... and beer!',0),
(49558,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What the dook is going on here, $R?!$B$BWhy are pandaren so sad?!',0),
(49559,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Traveling to Kun-Lai? Right this way, wanderer, right this way!',0),
(49560,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Townlong Steppes, outsider.$B$BIf you insist on wandering in to the darkest places of Pandaria then far be it from me to not put you to good use.',0),
(49561,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'A volunteer for Dread Wastes duty? I think you might be the first.$B$BPleased to meet you.',0),
(49564,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Gorgrond, commander.$B$BWe have just arrived ourselves.',0),
(49565,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you, Commander $n. I require your advisement.',0),
(49566,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Azik looks you up and down.>$B$BAzik is betting you are someone of importance to your people.$B$BCome closer, friend. Azik could use your help.',0),
(49567,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'They came at us... from... nowhere.$B$B<The lieutenant nearly passes out.>',0),
(49613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, все в сборе. Скоро должны прибыть и наши гости.',26654),
(49614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you\'re back; with good news, $n.',26654),
(49698,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую, $n. Скоро ты станешь $gсвидетелем:свидетельницей; ритуала, ранее не виданного никем, кроме солдат Армии Света.',26822),
(49756,1,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Это была славная битва, $n. Об остальном мы позаботимся.',26654),
(49772,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What have we here? One of the famed Lightforged draenei! Welcome, welcome.$B$BThank you for your service against the Legion, $n. Truly an inspiration!',0),
(49773,6,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you the new one? I\'m supposed to welcome you. Here, take this letter.\n\n<Blackguard lets out an exasperated sigh.>',26972),
(49782,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Duty. Honor. Sacrifice. The Lightforged strive to embody these qualities. You have done so with aplomb.$B$BIt is my pleasure to award you with a symbol of your service, $n.',0),
(49783,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have brought great honor to our tribes, $n. It is fitting that we give you a symbol of our thanks.$B$BHighmountain stands... because you have the courage to fight for it.',0),
(49784,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'When we were liberated from the Legion, some among the shal\'dorei believed we should remain isolated. Alone.$B$BYour accomplishments in Azeroth have shown that we made the right decision in reclaiming our place in this world. It pleases me to honor you with this symbol of Suramar\'s gratitude.',0),
(49787,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Умбрий чересчур беспечен, но, похоже, знает свое дело. Мы должны найти его, прежде чем он зайдет слишком далеко.',26822),
(49788,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, there you are, $n! We\'ve been inspecting--err--expecting you!',26972),
(49812,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Goddess be praised that you are here, $n. I\'m hoping that you can aid me.',0),
(49851,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n. Thank you for responding to my request.',0),
(49852,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Lok\'tar, $n.',0),
(49855,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We knew the Horde would send help and not a moment too soon!',0),
(49864,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Having made your decision, you can now set off in search of bigger adventures in far-off lands.>',26124),
(49865,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n. Thank you for responding to my request.',0),
(49866,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $n.',0),
(49928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Though some continue to doubt us, your deeds have proven that the ren\'dorei serve the Alliance with honor.$B$BYour will is strong, $n. Accept this gift as a symbol of the powers you command.',0),
(49929,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приветствую, $n. Отрадно видеть, что ты $gоткликнулся:откликнулась; на зов.',26755),
(49930,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n, there you are. Now we\'re good to go.',26654),
(49933,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Are you the new one? I\'m supposed to welcome you. Here, take this letter.$B$B<Blackguard lets out an exasperated sigh.>',0),
(49973,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Сурамар – очень красивый город. Надеюсь, Луносвет их не разочарует.',26654),
(49976,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If this strange material really has the strength we think it has, we cannot let it fall into the wrong hands. You should go to Seilitus.',25961),
(49977,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(49981,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Здравствуй, $n. Хорошо, что в Силитус прислали $gтакого опытного воителя:такую опытную воительницу;, как ты.',25961),
(49982,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Отлично, $n! Теперь, когда крошшеры выведены из строя, картелю Трюмных Вод придется сделать перерыв!',25961),
(50047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Никогда не видел ничего подобного... Я тут же приступлю к изучению!',25961),
(50048,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You made it back alive. That\'s good news, indeed! I trust the expedition went well?',0),
(50049,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Спасибо, что $gдонес:донесла; до меня письмо Кадгара. Мне понадобится время, чтобы обдумать его слова. Если он прав, то, может быть, у нас есть шанс спасти Азерот... но за это придется дорого заплатить.',25961),
(50052,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50054,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m pleased to see that you made it back alive. I\'m sure you fought with honor!',0),
(50055,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50071,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Об озаренных в Штормграде говорят на каждом углу. Элитные солдаты, посвятившие всю свою жизнь борьбе с Легионом... они станут одними из наших сильнейших союзников.',26822),
(50130,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for helping the people of Sporeggar, $R. You are always welcomed here.',0),
(50131,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n! Thank you.',0),
(50226,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'О! Ты только посмотри на эти большие, прекрасные мозги! Мне уже не терпится в них покопаться... Спасибо за помощь, $n! Можешь остаться и посмотреть, если не брезгуешь!',25961),
(50227,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you\'re larval specimens! That\'s great. Do you want to stay and watch me dissect them thoroughly and catalogue all the details of their anatomy?',25961),
(50228,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see you brought it; Michael Skitaltz\'s head is the Abyss. The task is unpleasant, but necessary. The Alliance thanks you for your service, $n.',25961),
(50229,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50231,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50232,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50239,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я ценю твою мудрость, $n. Выбор, сделанный тобой сегодня, укрепит силу Альянса.',26755),
(50242,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Я ценю твою мудрость, $n. Выбор, сделанный тобой сегодня, сделает Орду сильнее.',26654),
(50247,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',26124),
(50248,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Приступай, $n. Штомград благодарит тебя за службу.',26822),
(50303,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So this is Orgrimmar. The orcs have made some... interesting aesthetic choices. Be careful of the spikes, $n.$B$BAnd the smells. So many smells.',0),
(50305,1,2,0,0,0,5000,0,0,'Welcome to Stormwind. Though it is no Silvermoon, the city does have its charms.\n\nIf you came here expecting a warm welcome, I cannot say I have received one myself. But most folk are polite enough.\n\nNo matter. I am off to seek adventure! And perhaps a stiff drink.',26972),
(50313,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to this beautiful city, $n. I am sure you will feel as welcome by the other members of the Alliance as I do.$B$BI have met a number of the city guards. Good people, though there are a few things they could learn from us.',0),
(50318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We\'re behind schedule - let\'s get moving.',0),
(50319,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So many tauren! I think I\'ve seen more tauren since I got here than in my entire life in Highmountain.\n\nThey all ask to touch my antlers. It\'s weird at first, but now I kind of like it.',26972),
(50335,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The uprising quelled, the elements calmed, and Hogger slain... I cannot thank you enough, $n. My people have been avenged.$B$BThank you.',0),
(50336,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'d love for you to come aboard as a full G-Team Commando, but our bylaws specifically prohibit Horde team members; however, I CAN enroll you in the G-Team Fan Club!$B$BHere\'s something for your trouble.',0),
(50337,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Took you long enough. Get behind the pillar before you blow our cover!',0),
(50338,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The mission is far from over!',0),
(50341,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50358,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50364,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'',25961),
(50371,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Наконец-то ты $gприбыл:прибыла;, $n. От того, что я тебе расскажу, может зависеть будущее Альянса...',25961),
(50372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ты здесь, чтобы помочь мне с образцами? Давай же начнем!',25961),
(50373,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Рад тебя видеть, $n. Жаль, мы не встретились при более благоприятных обстоятельствах...',25961),
(50374,1,1,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Кровь Азерот? Я позабочусь о том, чтобы донести эту весть до Штормграда, но операцию нужно продолжать до получения других приказов.',25961),
(50432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Потрясающе! Невероятно! Наконец-то я все понимаю и со мной говорят сами титаны! Они научили меня с помощью пробуждающей сущности создавать лучшие доспехи в мире... Хотя, думаю, результаты могут быть слегка непредсказуемыми.\r\n\r\n<Вридиэль сияет от гордости.>\r\n\r\nНу, чего ты ждешь? Принеси мне столько пробуждающей сущности, сколько сможешь найти!',0);
